  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_99", "* You bid a quiet farewell&  to the \\[I].");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_100", "* You put the \\[I]&  on the ground and gave it a&  little pat.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_102", "* You threw the \\[I]&  on the ground like the piece&  of trash it is.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_103", "* You abandoned the &  \\[I].");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_104", "* The \\[I] was&  thrown away.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_111", "   * I'm outta here.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_112", "   * I've got better to do.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_113", "   * Escaped...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_114", "   * Don't slow me down.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_121", "   * Ran away with \\[1] EXP&     and \\[2] GOLD.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_127", "* (The shadow of the ruins&  looms above^1, filling you with&  determination.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_128", "* (HP fully restored.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_129", "* (Playfully crinkling through&  the leaves fills you with&  determination.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_130", "* (HP fully restored.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_131", "* (Knowing the mouse might one&  day leave its hole and&  get the cheese...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_132", "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_133", "* (Seeing such a cute^1, tidy&  house in the RUINS gives&  you determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_134", "* Determination./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_135", "* (The cold atmosphere of a&  new land... it fills you&  with determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_136", "* (The convenience of that&  lamp still fills you&  with determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_137", "* (Knowing the mouse might one&  day find a way to heat&  up the spaghetti...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_138", "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_140", "* (Knowing that dog will&  never give up trying to&  make the perfect snowdog...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_141", "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_142", "* (Snow can always be broken&  down and rebuilt into&  something more useful.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_143", "* (This simple fact fills&  you with determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_144", "* (The sight of such a friendly&  town fills you with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_145", "* (The sound of rushing water&  fills you with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_146", "* (A feeling of dread hangs&  over you...^1)&* (But you stay determined.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_147", "* (Knowing the mouse might one&  day extract the cheese from&  the mystical crystal...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_148", "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_150", "* (The sound of muffled rain&  on the cavetop...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_151", "* (The serene sound of a&  distant music box...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_152", "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_153", "* (The feeling of your socks&  squishing as you step&  gives you determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_156", "* (The waterfall here seems&  to flow from the&  ceiling of the cavern...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_157", "* (Occasionally^1, a piece of&  trash will flow&  through...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_158", "* (... and fall into the&  bottomless abyss below.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_159", "* (Viewing this endless&  cycle of worthless&  garbage...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_160", "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_161", "* (Partaking in worthless&  garbage fills you&  with determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_164", "* (You feel a calming&  tranquility^1. You're filled&  with determination...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_165", "* (You feel..^1. something.)&* (You're filled with&  detemmienation.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_168", "* (The wind is howling^1.&* You're filled with&  determination...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_169", "* (The howling wind is&  now a breeze^1. This gives&  you determination...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_170", "* (The wind has stopped^1.&* You're filled with&  determination...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_174", "* (Seeing such a strange&  laboratory in a place like&  this...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_175", "* (You're filled with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_180", "* (The wooshing sound of steam&  and cogs..^1. it fills you&  with determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_184", "* (An ominous structure looms&  in the distance...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_185", "* (You're filled with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_187", "* (Knowing the mouse might one&  day hack the computerized&  safe and get the cheese...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_188", "* (It fills you with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_191", "* (A huge structure lies north.^1)&* (You're filled with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_195", "* (The relaxing atmosphere&  of this hotel..^1. it fills&  you with determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_199", "* (The air is filled with&  the smell of ozone..^1. it fills&  you with determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_203", "* (Behind this door must be&  the elevator to the King's&  castle.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_204", "* (You're filled with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_208", "* (The smell of cobwebs fills&  the air...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_209", "* (You're filled with&  determination.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_242", "* You leave the Quiche on the&  ground and tell it you'll&  be right back./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_246", "* Use the box?& &         Yes         No      \\C ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_247", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_248", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_270", "  %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_275", "* You have no items^1.&* You put a little time into&  the box./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_276", "* You have no items^1.&* You put a little effort&  into the box./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_277", "* You have no items^1.&* You put a little feeling&  into the box./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_282", "  %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_291", "\\W* Howdy^2!&* I'm\\Y FLOWEY\\W.^2 &* \\YFLOWEY\\W the \\YFLOWER\\W!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_292", "* Hmmm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_293", "* You're new to the&  UNDERGROUND^2, aren'tcha?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_294", "* Golly^1, you must be&  so confused./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_295", "* Someone ought to teach&  you how things work&  around here!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_296", "* I guess little old me&  will have to do./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_297", "* Ready^2?&* Here we go!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_301", "\\E2* This way./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_302", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_306", "\\E2* Welcome to your new&  home^1, innocent one./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_307", "* Allow me to educate you&  in the operation of the&  RUINS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_311", "\\E2* The RUINS are full of&  puzzles./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_312", "* Ancient fusions between &  diversions and doorkeys./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_313", "* One must solve them&  to move from room to&  room./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_314", "* Please adjust yourself    to the sight of them./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_318", "\\E2* To make progress here,^1 &  you will need to trigger&  several switches./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_319", "* Do not worry,^1 I have &  labelled the ones that&  you need to flip./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_322", "* Do not worry,^1 I have &  labelled the ones that&  you need to flip./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_323", "* ... eh^1?&* It seems that the&  labelling has worn away./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_324", "* Oh dear./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_325", "* This might be far more&  challenging than I&  anticipated.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_330", "\\E2* The first switch is over&  on the wall./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_334", "\\E1* Do you need some help..^1?&* Press the switch on the   wall./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_335", "\\E0* Come on^1, you can do it!/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_339", "\\E2* Go on^1, press the switch&  on the left./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_342", "\\E2* I believe it was&  the switch on the&  left./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_347", "\\E1* You do know which way&  left is^1, do you not?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_348", "\\E0* Press the switch that I&  labelled for you./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_352", "\\E1* You do know which way&  left is^1, do you not?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_357", "\\E1* You are very curious,^1 &  are you not?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_358", "\\E1* Please understand.^2 & \\E0I only want the best&  for you./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_362", "\\E0* Splendid!^2 &* I am proud of you,^1 &  little one./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_363", "* Let us move to the&  next room./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_367", "\\E1* As a human living in&  the UNDERGROUND,^1 &  monsters may attack you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_368", "\\E2* You will need to be&  prepared for this&  situation./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_369", "\\E0* However, worry not!^2 &* The process is simple./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_370", "\\E2* When you encounter a &  monster,^1 you will enter&  a FIGHT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_371", "* While you are in a&  FIGHT^1, strike up a&  friendly conversation./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_372", "\\E2* Stall for time.&  I will come to resolve&  the conflict./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_373", "\\E2* Practice talking to&  the dummy./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_379", "\\E1* Ahh,^1 the dummies are&  not for fighting!^2 &* They are for talking!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_380", "* We do not want to hurt&  anybody, do we...?^2 \\E0 &* Come now./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_384", "\\E0* Ah,^1 very good!^2 &* You are very good./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_388", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_389", "\\E1* ... you ran away.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_390", "\\E0* Truthfully^1, that was&  not a poor choice./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_391", "\\E0* It is better to&  avoid conflict&  whenever possible./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_392", "\\E1* That..^1. however^1, is&  only a dummy^2.&* It cannot harm you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_393", "\\E1* It is made of cotton^1.&* It has no desire&  for revenge.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_394", "\\E0* Nevermind^2.&* Stay close to me and&  I will keep you safe./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_398", "\\E3* ^1.^1.^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_399", "\\E4* ^1.^1.^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_400", "\\E0* The next room awaits./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_405", "\\E2* Practice talking to&  the dummy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_406", "\\E1* You can say anything..^2.\\E2 &* I do not think the dummy&  will be bothered./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_411", "\\E0* Do you need some&  ideas for conversation&  topics?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_412", "* Well^1, I often start with&  a simple 'how do you&  do...'/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_413", "* You could ask them about&  their favorite books.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_414", "* Jokes can be useful for&  'breaking the ice.'/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_415", "* Listen to this one.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_416", "* What did the skeleton&  tile his roof with?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_417", "* ... SHIN-gles!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_418", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_419", "\\E0* Well^1, I thought it&  was amusing./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_423", "\\E2* Practice talking to&  the dummy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_424", "\\E1* You can say anything..^2.\\E0 &* The dummy will not&  be bothered./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_428", "\\E1* There is another puzzle&  in this room.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_429", "\\E0* I wonder if you can&  solve it?/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_433", "\\E1* This is the puzzle^1,&  but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_434", "\\E0* Here^1, take my hand&  for a moment./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_438", "\\E1* Puzzles seem a little&  too dangerous for&  now./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_442", ".../%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_446", "\\E2* Greetings,^1 my child^2.&* Do not worry^1, I did&  not leave you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_447", "\\E0* I was merely behind this&  pillar the whole time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_448", "* Thank you for trusting&  me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_449", "\\E2* However^1, there was an&  important reason for&  this exercise./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_450", "* ... to test your&  independence./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_451", "\\E1* I must attend to some&  business^1, and you must&  stay alone for a while./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_452", "\\E0* Please remain here^2.&*\\E1 It's dangerous to&  explore by yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_453", "\\E0* I have an idea^2.&* I will give you a&  CELL PHONE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_454", "* If you have a need for&  anything^1, just call./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_455", "\\E1* Be good^1, alright?/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_459", "\\E0* You have done&  excellently thus&  far^1, my child./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_460", "\\E2* However... I have a&  difficult request to ask&  of you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_461", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_462", "* I would like you to walk&  to the end of the room&  by yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_463", "\\E1* Forgive me for this./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_467", "* Ring..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_468", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_469", "* Hello?&* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_470", "* For no reason in&  particular...&* Which do you prefer?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_471", "* Cinnamon or&  butterscotch?&  Cinnamon    Bscotch \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_472", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_490", "* Oh^1, I see.&* Thank you very much!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_491", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_492", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_493", "* /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_497", "* It's a fishing rod affixed&  to the ground.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_498", "* Reel it in?& &         Yes         No      \\C ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_499", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_511", "* All that's attached to&  the end is a photo of a&  weird-looking monster.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_512", "* (Call Me!&  Here's my number!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_513", "* You decide not to call./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_516", "* All that's attached to&  the end is a note./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_517", "* (Nevermind^1, guys!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_522", "* You leave it alone./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_529", "* I shouldn't have given myself&  away so easily.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_533", "* Did you just...&* Consume the part of me&  I had given you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_534", "* In front of my very eyes!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_535", "* I have no words for you..^1.&* Begone!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_540", "* Thank you for taking care&  of me.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_545", "* Huh^1? Again...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_546", "* I'm sorry..^1. if I give you&  any more^1, there will be&  nothing left of me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_547", "* I suppose it is true^1.&* Travelling beyond our limits&  is but a fantasy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_548", "* It's no different for&  anyone else./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_549", "* All of monsterkind&  are doomed to stay&  underground^1, forever.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_554", "* How am I doing^1?&* By \"I\" I mean the piece&  of me I gave you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_559", "* Huh^1? You lost it...^1?&* ... I suppose I can give&  you another piece.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_563", "* You don't have any room^1?&* OK..^1. I understand I am not&  a priority for you^1, then./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_567", "* Please be careful this&  time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_568", "* (You got the Snowman&  Piece.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_576", "* Hello^1.&* I am a snowman./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_577", "* I want to see the world..^1.&* But I cannot move./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_578", "* If you would be so kind^1,&  traveller^1, please.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_579", "* Take a piece of me and&  bring it very far away.&         Yes         No      \\C ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_580", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_590", "* It seems you do not&  have enough room for me./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_593", "* Thank you... good luck!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_594", "* (You got the Snowman&  Piece.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_600", "* I see^1.&* Good journey^1, then./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_605", "SANS!!^1!&THAT DIDN'T DO&ANYTHING!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_606", "SANS!!^1!&THEY DIDN'T EVEN&LOOK AT IT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_608", "* whoops./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_609", "* i knew i should have&  used today's crossword&  instead./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_611", "WHAT!^1?&CROSSWORD!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_612", "I CAN'T BELIEVE&YOU SAID THAT!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_613", "IN MY OPINION.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_614", "\\E3JUNIOR JUMBLE&IS EASILY THE&HARDEST./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_616", "* what^1? really^1, dude^1?&* that easy-peasy word&  scramble?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_617", "\\E1* that's for baby bones./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_619", "UN^1. BELIEVABLE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_620", "\\E0HUMAN!!^1!&SOLVE THIS DISPUTE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_621", "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_622", "* (Which is harder?)& &         Jumble      Crossword \\C ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_623", "   ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_631", "HA^1! HA^1! YES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_632", "HUMANS MUST BE&VERY INTELLIGENT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_633", "IF THEY ALSO FIND&JUNIOR JUMBLE&SO DIFFICULT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_634", "NYEH^1! HEH^1! HEH HEH!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_639", "YOU TWO ARE WEIRD!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_640", "\\E3CROSSWORDS ARE SO&EASY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_641", "IT'S THE SAME&SOLUTION EVERY&TIME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_642", "\\E0I JUST FILL ALL&THE BOXES IN WITH&THE LETTER \"Z\".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_643", "BECAUSE EVERY TIME&I LOOK AT A&CROSSWORD.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_644", "ALL I CAN DO IS&SNORE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_645", "NYEH HEH HEH!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_654", "* Hello^1!&* Would you like some&  Nice Cream?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_655", "* It's the frozen treat&  that warms your heart!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_656", "* Now just 15G!& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_657", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_661", " %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_662", "* Nice Cream^1!&* It's the frozen treat&  that warms your heart!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_663", "* Now just 15G!& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_664", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_682", "* Here you go^1!&* Have a super-duper day^1!&* (You got the Nice Cream.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_684", "* Huh^1?&* You don't have enough&  money.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_685", "* I wish I could make&  Nice Cream for free.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_688", "* It looks like you're&  holding too much stuff^1!&* Oh well!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_691", "* Well then..^1.&* Tell your friends.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_692", "* There's ice cream..^1.&* Out in the middle of&  the woods.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_704", "* Hello^1!&* Would you like some&  Nice Cream?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_705", "* It's the frozen treat&  that warms your heart!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_706", "* Now just 25G!& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_707", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_711", " %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_712", "* Nice Cream^1!&* It's the frozen treat&  that warms your heart!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_713", "* Now just 25G!& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_714", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_721", "* Hey^1, you have an umbrella^1,&  just like my cart.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_722", "* Such solidarity^1!&* I have no choice but to&  give you a deal!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_723", "* Discount Ice Cream! 15G!& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_724", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_728", " %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_729", "* Umbrella solidarity!^1?&* I guess I have to give&  you a deal.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_730", "* Discount Ice Cream! 15G!& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_731", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_736", "* Hey^1!&* You have 3 Punch Cards!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_737", "* How about redeeming them&  for some Nice Cream!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_738", "* It's free!& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_739", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_777", "* Super^1! Here you go^1!&* Your Card's in the box!&* (You got the Nice Cream.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_779", "* Huh^1? No money^1?&* Sorry^1, I can't give it to&  you for free./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_781", "* Huh^1? You can't afford it&  even with the discount^1?&* I.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_784", "* It looks like you're&  holding too much stuff^1!&* Oh well!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_803", "* Here^1! A free Nice Cream^1!&* (You lost 3 cards and got&  a Nice Cream.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_809", "* Well then..^1.&* Tell your friends.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_810", "* There's ice cream..^1.&* Hidden in the depths of a&  watery cavern.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_815", "* i've been thinking&  about selling treats&  too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_816", "* want some fried snow^1?&* it's just 5G.&  Buy         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_817", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_823", "* did i say 5G^1?&* i meant 50G^1.&  Buy         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_824", "  ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_828", "* you're right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_829", "* i should charge way&  more than that./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_836", "* really^1?&* how about 5000G?&  Buy         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_837", "  ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_841", "* you're right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_842", "* that's still too low./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_849", "* 50000G^1.&* that's my final offer.&  Buy         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_850", "  ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_854", "* i have to pay for&  the raw materials&  somehow./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_861", "* what^1?&* you don't have the&  money?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_862", "* hey^1, that's okay./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_863", "\\E1* i don't have any snow./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_867", "* wow^1, that's a lot&  of cash./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_868", "\\E3* that's why i'm sorry&  to say.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_869", "\\E3* i can't sell you&  this fried snow./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_870", "\\E2* it's got too much&  sentimental value./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_875", "* don't you know a&  good deal when you&  hear one?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_880", "WHAT!^1?&HOW DID YOU&AVOID MY TRAP?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_881", "\\E3AND^1, MORE&IMPORTANTLY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_882", "\\E0IS THERE ANY&LEFT FOR ME???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_883", "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_884", "* (What do you tell Papyrus&  about his spaghetti?)&         Ate it      Left it   \\C ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_885", "   ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_890", "REALLY!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_893", "\\E2WOWIE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_894", "NO ONE'S EVER&ENJOYED MY&COOKING BEFORE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_895", "\\E0WELL THEN!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_900", "\\E2WOWIE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_901", "YOU RESISTED THE&FLAVOR OF MY&HOMECOOKED PASTA.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_902", "JUST SO YOU&COULD SHARE&IT WITH ME???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_905", "\\E0FRET NOT HUMAN^1!&I^1, MASTER CHEF&PAPYRUS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_906", "WILL MAKE YOU ALL&THE PASTA YOU&COULD EVER WANT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_907", "HEH HEH HEH HEH&HEH HEH NYEH!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_911", "HEY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_912", "IT'S THE HUMAN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_913", "\\E0YOU'RE GONNA&LOVE THIS&PUZZLE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_914", "IT WAS MADE&BY THE GREAT&DR. ALPHYS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_915", "YOU SEE&THESE TILES&!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_916", "ONCE I THROW&THIS SWITCH.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_917", "THEY WILL&BEGIN TO&CHANGE COLOR!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_918", "EACH COLOR HAS&A DIFFERENT&FUNCTION!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_919", "RED TILES ARE&IMPASSABLE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_920", "YOU CANNOT&WALK ON THEM!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_921", "YELLOW TILES&ARE ELECTRIC!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_922", "THEY WILL&ELECTROCUTE&YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_923", "GREEN TILES&ARE ALARM&TILES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_924", "IF YOU STEP&ON THEM.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_925", "YOU WILL HAVE&TO FIGHT A&MONSTER!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_926", "ORANGE TILES&ARE ORANGE-&SCENTED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_927", "THEY WILL MAKE&YOU SMELL&DELICIOUS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_928", "BLUE TILES ARE&WATER TILES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_929", "SWIM THROUGH&IF YOU LIKE^1,&BUT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_930", "IF YOU SMELL&LIKE ORANGES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_931", "THE PIRANHAS&WILL BITE&YOU./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_932", "ALSO^1, IF A&BLUE TILE IS&NEXT TO A,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_933", "YELLOW TILE^1,&THE WATER WILL&ALSO ZAP YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_934", "PURPLE TILES&ARE SLIPPERY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_935", "YOU WILL SLIDE&TO THE NEXT&TILE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_936", "HOWEVER^1, THE&SLIPPERY&SOAP.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_937", "SMELLS LIKE&LEMONS!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_938", "WHICH PIRANHAS&DO NOT LIKE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_939", "PURPLE AND&BLUE ARE OK!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_940", "FINALLY^1,&PINK TILES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_941", "THEY DON'T DO&ANYTHING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_942", "STEP ON THEM&ALL YOU LIKE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_943", "HOW WAS THAT!^1?&UNDERSTAND???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_944", "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_945", "* (Understand the explanation?)& &         Of course   No        \\C ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_946", "   ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_953", "GREAT!^1!&THEN THERE'S ONE&LAST THING.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_954", "THIS PUZZLE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_955", "IS ENTIRELY RANDOM&!!!!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_956", "WHEN I PULL THIS&SWITCH^1, IT WILL&MAKE A PUZZLE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_957", "THAT HAS NEVER&BEEN SEEN BEFORE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_958", "NOT EVEN I WILL&KNOW THE SOLUTION!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_959", "NYEH HEH HEH^1!&GET READY...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_965", "OKAY..^1.&I GUESS I'LL&REPEAT MYSELF.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_966", "\\E0RED TILES ARE&IMPASSABLE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_967", "YELLOW TILES ARE&ELECTRIC AND&DANGEROUS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_968", "BLUE TILES MAKE&YOU FIGHT A&MONSTER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_969", "GREEN TILES ARE&WATER TILES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_970", "ORANGE TILES ARE&ORANGE SCENTED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_971", "IF YOU STEP ON&ORANGE^1, DON'T STEP&ON GREEN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_972", "\\E3BROWN TILES ARE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_973", "\\E1WAIT!!^1!&THERE ARE NO&BROWN TILES.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_974", "\\E0PURPLE TILES&SMELL LIKE&LEMONS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_975", "\\E3WHY DON'T THE&YELLOW ONES&SMELL LEMONY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_976", "\\E3UMM.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_977", "\\E1WAIT!^1!&DID I MIX UP&GREEN AND BLUE!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_978", "THE BLUE ONES&ARE WATER ONES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_979", "\\E3PINK TILES.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_980", "I DON'T..^1.&REMEMBER???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_981", "\\E1WAIT!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_982", "\\E3THOSE ONES DON'T&DO ANYTHING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_983", "\\E0OKAY^1!&DO YOU UNDERSTAND&BETTER NOW!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_984", "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_985", "* (Understand the explanation?)& &         Yes         Even less \\C ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_986", "   ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_994", "GREAT!^1!&THEN THERE'S ONE&LAST THING.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_995", "THIS PUZZLE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_996", "IS ENTIRELY RANDOM&!!!!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_997", "WHEN I PULL THIS&SWITCH^1, IT WILL&MAKE A PUZZLE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_998", "THAT HAS NEVER&BEEN SEEN BEFORE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_999", "NOT EVEN I WILL&KNOW THE SOLUTION!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1000", "NYEH HEH HEH^1!&GET READY...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1006", "........../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1007", "OK^1, YOU KNOW&WHAT???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1008", "HOW ABOUT..^1.&YOU JUST.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1009", "DO THIS PUZZLE..^1.&ON YOUR OWN.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1010", "I'LL LEAVE THE&INSTRUCTIONS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1011", "JUST READ THEM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1012", "THEN WHEN YOU&UNDERSTAND IT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1013", "YOU CAN THROW&THE SWITCH./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1014", "AND DO IT AT&YOUR OWN PACE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1015", "GOOD LUCK./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1016", "NYEH..^1.&HEH..^1.&HEH!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_1024", "* (There's a lone quiche&  sitting underneath&  this bench.)/");
