  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2917", "* %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2924", "* (This CD is labelled&  \"Ghouliday Music.\")/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2925", "* (Play it?)& &         Play it     No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2926", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2929", "* (This CD is labelled&  \"Ghouliday Music.\")/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2930", "* (This CD is playing.)&* (Turn it off?)&         Stop it     No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2931", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2940", "* (You play the CD.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2946", "* %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2954", "* (The CD stops moving.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2960", "* %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2968", "* (Look inside the fridge?)& &         Open it     No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2969", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2977", "* (There's a lonely sandwich&  inside.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2983", "* (It's empty.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2988", "%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2993", "* this is a ghost sandwich.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2994", "* do you want to try it...& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2995", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3001", "* (You attempt to bite&  into the ghost sandwich.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3002", "* (You phase right through&  it...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3003", "* oh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3004", "* nevermind.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3008", "* oh.....................&  ....................&  ................./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3014", "* after a great meal i like&  to lie on the ground and&  feel like garbage.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3015", "* it's a family tradition.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3016", "* do you want..^1.&* ... to join me...&         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3017", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3023", "* okay..^1.&* follow my lead.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3028", "* oh.....................&  ....................&  ................./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3034", "* do you want to play a game^1?&* it's called thundersnail./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3035", "* the snails will race^1, and if&  the yellow snail wins^1, you&  win./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3036", "* it's 10G to play.& &         Play        No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3037", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3045", "* um..^1.&* you don't have any money?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3046", "* n-no^1, you can still play^1,&  don't worry about it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3047", "* okay..^1.&* press \\*Z repeatedly to&  encourage your snail./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3048", "* ready?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3052", "* um..^1. that's less than 10G./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3053", "* but since you're my only&  real customer^1, i guess i'll&  just take what you have.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3054", "* okay..^1.&* press \\*Z repeatedly to&  encourage your snail./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3055", "* ready?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3061", "* okay..^1.&* press \\*Z repeatedly to&  encourage your snail./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3062", "* ready?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3068", "* oh.........../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3073", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3074", "* Seven./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3075", "* Seven human souls./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3076", "* With the power of seven&  human souls^1, our king.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3077", "\\W* \\YKing \\RASGORE \\YDreemurr\\W.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3078", "* ... will become a god./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3079", "\\W* With that power^1, \\RASGORE\\W &  can finally shatter the&  barrier./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3080", "* He will finally take the&  surface back from humanity.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3081", "* And give them back the&  suffering and pain that&  we have endured./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3082", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3083", "* Understand^1, human?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3084", "* This is your only chance&  at redemption./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3085", "* Give up your soul.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3086", "* Or I'll tear it from&  your body./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3104", "* Yo^1, I know I'm not supposed&  to be here^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3105", "* I wanna ask you something./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3106", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3107", "* Man^1, I've never had to ask&  anyone this before.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3108", "* Umm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3109", "* Yo..^1. You're human^1, right?&* Haha./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3110", "* Man^1! I knew it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3111", "* ... well^1, I know it now^1,&  I mean.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3112", "* Undyne told me^1, um^1, \"stay&  away from that human.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3113", "* So^1, like^1, ummm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3114", "* I guess that makes us enemies&  or something./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3115", "* But I kinda stink at that^1,&  haha./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3116", "* Yo^1, say something mean so&  I can hate you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3117", "* Please? & &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3118", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3124", "* Huh...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3125", "* Yo^1, that's your idea of&  something mean?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3126", "* My sister says that to me&  ALL THE TIME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3127", "* Guess I have to do it^1, haha./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3128", "* Yo^1, I..^1. I hate your guts./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3129", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3130", "* Man^1, I..^1. I'm such a turd./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3131", "* I'm..^1. I'm gonna go home&  now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3135", "* Yo^1, what^1?&* So I have to do it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3136", "* Here goes nothing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3137", "* Yo^1, I..^1. I hate your guts./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3138", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3139", "* Man^1, I..^1. I'm such a turd./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3140", "* I'm..^1. I'm gonna go home&  now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3148", "* (It's a water cooler.)&* (Take a cup of water?)&         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3149", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3153", "* (There's no more water left&  in the cooler.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3155", "* (Sadistically^1, you've poured&  out all the water right in&  front of Undyne's eyes.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3163", "* (You take a cup of water.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3171", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3177", "* (Get rid of the water?)& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3178", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3184", "* (You pour the water on&  the ground next to the&  water cooler.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3196", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3201", "* A rousing error./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3205", "* (Give Undyne the water?)& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3206", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3210", "* (She looks dry...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3215", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3238", "* Ring..\\E0./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3240", "HELLO^1!&THIS IS PAPYRUS!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3241", "REMEMBER WHEN&I ASKED YOU&ABOUT CLOTHES?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3242", "\\E3WELL^1, THE FRIEND&WHO WANTED TO&KNOW.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3243", "\\E0HER OPINION OF&YOU IS VERY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3244", "\\E3MURDERY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3245", "\\E0ERROR!!^1!&SEE YOU LATER!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3250", "\\E0BUT I BET YOU&KNEW THAT&ALREADY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3251", "\\E3AND BECAUSE YOU&KNEW THAT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3252", "\\E0I TOLD HER WHAT&YOU TOLD ME&YOU WERE WEARING!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3253", "A \\[1]!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3254", "BECAUSE I KNEW^1,&OF COURSE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3255", "\\E3AFTER SUCH A&SUSPICIOUS&QUESTION.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3256", "\\E0YOU WOULD&OBVIOUSLY CHANGE&YOUR CLOTHES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3257", "YOU'RE SUCH A&SMART COOKIE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3258", "THIS WAY YOU'RE&SAFE AND I&DIDN'T LIE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3259", "NO BETRAYAL&ANYWHERE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3260", "BEING FRIENDS&WITH EVERYONE&IS EASY!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3261", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3262", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3268", "\\E0WELL^1, WORRY&NOT DEAR HUMAN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3269", "PAPYRUS WOULD&NEVER BETRAY YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3270", "\\E3I AM NOT A&CRUEL PERSON./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3271", "\\E0I STRIVE TO BE&COMFORTING AND&PLEASANT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3272", "PAPYRUS!&HE SMELLS LIKE&THE MOON./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3273", "SO, BECAUSE OF&MY INHERENT&GOODNESS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3274", "I TOLD HER YOU&WERE NOT WEARING&A \\[1]!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3275", "\\E3EVEN THOUGH YOU&TOLD ME YOU&WERE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3276", "INSTEAD^1, I MADE&SOMETHING UP!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3277", "I TOLD HER YOU&WERE WEARING.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3278", "\\E0A \\[2]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3279", "\\E3IT PAINED ME TO&TELL SUCH A&BOLDFACED LIE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3280", "I KNOW YOU WOULD&NEVER EVER WEAR&A \\[2]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3281", "\\E0BUT YOUR SAFETY&IS MORE IMPORTANT&THAN FASHION./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3282", "\\E3DANG!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3283", "I JUST WANT TO&BE FRIENDS WITH&EVERYONE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3284", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3285", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3291", "\\E0WELL^1, WORRY&NOT DEAR HUMAN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3292", "\\E3PAPYRUS WOULD&NEVER BETRAY YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3293", "\\WY\\E0OU SAID YOU WERE\\Y &NOT WEARING A&\\[1]\\W./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3294", "\\E3SO OF COURSE&I ACTUALLY&TOLD HER.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3295", "\\E0YOU WERE&INDEED WEARING&A \\[1]!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3296", "\\E3IT PAINED ME TO&TELL SUCH A&BOLDFACED LIE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3297", "BUT SINCE YOU&AREN'T WEARING&A \\[1]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3298", "\\E0SHE SURELY&WON'T ATTACK&YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3299", "NOW YOU ARE&SAFE AND SOUND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3300", "\\E2WOWIE..^1.&THIS IS HARD./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3301", "I JUST WANT TO&BE EVERYBODY'S&FRIEND!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3302", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3303", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3309", "\\E0BUT I BET YOU&KNEW THAT&ALREADY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3310", "\\E3AND BECAUSE YOU&KNEW THAT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3311", "\\E0I KNEW WHEN&YOU SAID:/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3312", "\\E3\"I AM NOT&WEARING A&\\[1].\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3313", "\\E0IT WAS REALLY&A SECRET CODE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3314", "\\E3YOU REALLY&MEANT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3315", "\\E0\"I ACTUALLY AM&WEARING&A \\[1]!\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3316", "YOU WERE TRYING&TO PROTECT&YOURSELF.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3317", "WHILE MAKING IT&SO I DIDN'T&HAVE TO LIE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3318", "I PICKED UP ON&THIS, AND FOLLOWED&YOUR PLAN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3319", "I TOLD HER YOU&WERE NOT WEARING&A \\[1]!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3320", "IN FACT I TOOK&IT ONE STEP&FURTHER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3321", "\\E3I TOLD HER YOU&WERE PROBABLY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3322", "\\E0WEARING A&\\[2]!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3323", "\\E3OF COURSE, YOU&WOULD NEVER&WEAR THAT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3324", "\\E0BUT THAT'S THE&POINT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3325", "SHE WON'T&RECOGNIZE YOU&NOW!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3326", "AND I DIDN'T&HAVE TO BETRAY&EITHER OF YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3327", "SINCE I JUST&TOLD HER WHAT&YOU SAID!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3328", "WOWIE^1!&YOU'RE SUCH A&SMART COOKIE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3329", "I REALLY CAN&BE FRIENDS WITH&EVERYONE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3330", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3331", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3337", "* Ring..\\E0./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3339", "HEY^1!&WHAT'S UP!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3340", "I WAS JUST&THINKING.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3341", "YOU^1, ME^1, AND&UNDYNE SHOULD ALL&HANG OUT SOMETIME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3342", "I THINK YOU&WOULD MAKE&GREAT PALS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3343", "LET'S MEET UP&AT HER HOUSE&LATER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3344", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3345", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3348", "AFTER YOU HANG&OUT WITH ME.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3349", "LET'S MEET UP&AT HER HOUSE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3350", "I THINK YOU&WOULD MAKE&GREAT PALS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3351", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3352", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3393", "* (It's a book labelled&  Monster History Part 7.)&         Read it     Do not\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3394", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3398", "* When a human dies^1, its&  soul remains stable&  outside the body./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3399", "* Meanwhile^1, a monster's soul&  disappears near-instantly&  upon death./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3400", "* This allows monsters to&  absorb the souls of&  humans.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3401", "* While it is extremely&  difficult for humans to&  absorb a monster's soul./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3402", "* This is why they feared us./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3403", "* Though monsters are weak^1,&  with enough human souls.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3404", "* They could easily destroy&  all of mankind./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3407", "* (You decide not to read it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3413", "* (It's a book labelled&  Monster History Part 8.)&         Read it     Do not\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3414", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3418", "* There is one exception&  to the aforementioned&  rules:/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3419", "* A certain type of monster^1,&  the \"boss\" monster./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3420", "* Due to its life cycle^1, it&  possesses an incredibly&  strong soul for a monster./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3421", "* This soul can remain&  stable after death^1, if&  only for a few moments./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3424", "* (You decide not to read it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3429", "* (All these books are labelled&  Human History.)&         Read one    Do not\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3430", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3434", "* (You look inside a book.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3435", "* (It's a comic of a giant&  robot fighting a beautiful&  alien princess.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3436", "* (This doesn't strike you&  as very accurate...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3441", "* (You decide not to.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3446", "* (All these books are labelled&  Human History.)&         Read one    Do not\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3447", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3451", "* (You look inside a book.)&* (It's a comic book.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3452", "* (Two scantily-clad chefs are&  flinging energy pancakes&  at each other.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3453", "* (This doesn't strike you&  as very accurate...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3458", "* (You decide not to.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3463", "* (All these books are labelled&  Human History.)&         Read one    Do not\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3464", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3469", "* (You look inside a book.)&* (It's a comic book.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3470", "* (A hideous android is running&  to school with toast in&  its mouth.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3471", "* (Seems like it's late.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3472", "* (This doesn't strike you&  as very accurate...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3477", "* (You decide not to.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3482", "* (There's a piano here.^1)&* (Play it?)&         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3483", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3487", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3488", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3495", "See that heart^1? &That is your SOUL^1,&the very culmination&of your being!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3496", "Your SOUL starts off&weak^1, but can grow&strong if you gain&a lot of LV./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3497", "What's LV stand for^1?&Why^1, LOVE^1, of course!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3498", "You want some&LOVE, don't you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3499", "Don't worry,&I'll share some&with you!/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3503", "Down here^1, LOVE is&shared through..^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3504", "Little white..^2.\\E1 &\"friendliness&pellets.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3505", "\\E2Are you ready\\E0?/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3509", "Move around^1!&Get as many as&you can^2!%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3510", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3514", "You idiot./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3515", "In this world^1, it's&kill or BE killed./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3516", "Why would ANYONE pass&up an opportunity&like this!?/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3520", "Die./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3524", "Hey buddy^1,&you missed them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3525", "Let's try again^1,&okay?/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3528", "Is this a joke^2?&Are you braindead^2?&RUN^2. INTO^2. THE^2.&BULLETS!!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3531", "You know what's&going on here^1,&don't you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3532", "You just wanted to&see me suffer./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3535", "\\E1What a terrible&creature^1, torturing&such a poor^1,&innocent youth.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3536", "\\E2Ah, do not be&afraid^1, my child./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3537", "\\XI am \\BTORIEL\\X,&caretaker of&the \\RRUINS\\X./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3538", "I pass through this&place every day to&see if anyone has&fallen down./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3539", "You are the first&human to come here&in a long time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3540", "I will do my best&to ensure your&protection during&your time here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3541", "\\E2Come^2!&I will guide you&through the&catacombs./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3542", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3548", "* Three gold for the ferry.& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3549", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3553", "* Later^1, then./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3554", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3559", "* Hop on!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3564", "* (It's a switch.)& &         Press it    Don't\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3565", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3571", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3584", "* (The lasers were deactivated.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3591", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3604", "* (The lasers were reactivated.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3612", "* Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3613", "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3614", "\\E1* Um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3615", "\\E0* I noticed you've been&  kind of quiet.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3616", "\\W*\\E8 Are you w-worried&  about meeting \\RASGORE\\W...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3617", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3618", "\\E0* W-well^1, don't worry^1,&  okay?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3619", "\\E7* Th-the king is a&  really nice guy.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3620", "\\E0* I'm sure you can&  talk to him^1, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3621", "* W-with your human&  soul^1, you can pass&  through the barrier!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3622", "* S-so no worrying^1, OK^1?&* J-just forget about it&  and smile./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3623", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3624", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3630", "* hey buddy^1, what's up^1?&* wanna buy a hot dog?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3631", "* it's only 30G.& &  Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3632", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3638", "* here^1.&* have fun./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3641", "* here's another hot&  dog./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3642", "* it's on the house^1.&* well^1, no^1.&* it's on you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3653", "* sorry^1, thirty is&  the limit on&  head-dogs./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3656", "\\TS*^1 \\Tsi'll be 'frank' with&  you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3657", "* as much as i like&  putting hot dogs&  on your head.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3658", "* thirty is just&  an excessive number./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3659", "* twenty-nine^1, now&  that's fine^1, but&  thirty.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3660", "* does it look like&  my arms can reach&  that high?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3687", "* thanks, kid^1.&* here's your hot dog./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3690", "* thanks, kid^1.&* here's your 'dog./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3691", "* yeah^1. 'dog^1.&* apostrophe-dog^1.&* it's short for hot-dog./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3695", "* another h'dog^1?&* here you go.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3696", "* whoops^1, i'm actually&  out of hot dogs./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3697", "* here^1, you can have&  a hot cat instead./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3701", "* another dog^1, coming&  right up.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3702", "* ... you really like&  hot animals^1, don't&  you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3703", "* hey^1, i'm not judging./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3704", "* i'd be out of a job&  without folks like you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3708", "* cool^1.&* here's that ''dog./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3709", "* apostrophe-apostrophe&  dog./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3710", "* it's short for&  apostrophe-dog./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3711", "* which is^1, in turn^1,&  short for.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3715", "* another one^1?&* okay./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3716", "* careful^1.&* if you eat&  too many hot dogs.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3717", "* you'll probably get&  huge like me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3718", "* huge as in super-&  popular^1, i mean./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3719", "* i'm practically&  a hot-dog tycoon now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3725", "* whoops^1, you don't have&  enough cash./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3726", "* you should get a job^1.&* i've heard being a&  sentry pays well./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3729", "* you're holding too much^1.&* ... guess i'll just put&  it on your head./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3738", "* yeah^1, you've gotta&  save your money for&  college and spiders./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3743", "* Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3744", "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3745", "* L-looks like you&  beat him!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3746", "\\E0* Y-you did a really&  great job out there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3747", " &  All thanks&  to you      ... \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3748", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3754", "\\E3* What^1?&* Oh no^1, I mean.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3755", "\\E4* You were the one&  doing everything cool!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3756", "\\E0* I just wrote some&  silly programs for&  your phone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3760", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3761", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3762", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3765", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3766", "\\E4* ... umm^1, h-hey^1, this&  might sound strange^1,&  but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3767", "\\E6* ... c-can I tell&  you something?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3768", "\\E9* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3769", "\\E4* B-before I met you^1,&  I d-didn't really.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3770", "\\E9* I didn't really&  like myself very&  much./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3771", "* For a long time^1,&  I f-felt like a&   total screw-up./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3772", "\\E9* L-like I couldn't&  do a-anything&  w-without.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3773", "\\E9* W-without ending up&  letting everyone&  down./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3774", "\\E3* B-but...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3775", "\\E4* Guiding you has&  made me feel.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3776", "\\E9* A lot better about&  myself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3777", "\\E0* So... thanks for&  letting me help&  you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3778", "\\E9* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3779", "\\E4* Uhhh^1, anyway^1, we're&  almost to the CORE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3780", "\\E0* It's just past&  MTT Resort./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3781", "\\E6* Come on^1!&* Let's finish this!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3782", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3783", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3787", "\\E0EUREKA!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3788", "I'VE FIGURED OUT&THE PUZZLE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3789", "\\E3YOU SEEM LIKE&YOU'RE HAVING&FUN^1, THOUGH.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3790", "\\E0DO YOU ABSOLUTELY^1,&DAPSOLUTELY WANT&THE SOLUTION???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3791", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3792", "* (Do you absolutely^1,&  dapsolutely want the answer?)&         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3793", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3800", "THE^1!&SOLUTION^1!&IS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3801", "(PLEASE IMAGINE&A DRUMROLL IN&YOUR HEAD)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3802", "... THAT TREE&OVER THERE HAS&A SWITCH ON IT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3803", "CHECK IT&OUTIE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3807", "WOW..^1.&YOU'RE TRULY A&PUZZLE PASSIONEER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3808", "I'M SO ENTHUSED&BY YOUR&ENTHUSIASM!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3809", "YOU CAN DO IT^1,&HUMAN!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3814", "I'VE FIGURED OUT&THE PUZZLE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3815", "\\E0DO YOU ABSOLUTELY^1,&DAPSOLUTELY WANT&THE SOLUTION???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3816", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3817", "* (Do you absolutely^1,&  dapsolutely want the answer?)&         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3818", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3825", "THE^1!&SOLUTION^1!&IS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3826", "(PLEASE IMAGINE&A DRUMROLL IN&YOUR HEAD)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3827", "... THAT TREE&OVER THERE HAS&A SWITCH ON IT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3828", "CHECK IT&OUTIE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3832", "WOW..^1.&YOU'RE TRULY A&PUZZLE PASSIONEER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3833", "I'M SO ENTHUSED&BY YOUR&ENTHUSIASM!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3834", "YOU CAN DO IT^1,&HUMAN!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3839", "* (There's a switch on the&  trunk of this tree.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3840", "* (Press it?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3841", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3845", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3859", "OHO^1!&THE HUMAN ARRIVES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3860", "ARE YOU READY TO&HANG OUT WITH&UNDYNE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3861", "I HAVE A PLAN&TO MAKE YOU TWO&GREAT FRIENDS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3862", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3863", "* (Will you hang out?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3864", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3872", "OKAY^1!&STAND BEHIND ME!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3878", "HMMM..^1.&STILL GETTING&READY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3879", "\\E0TAKE YOUR TIME!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3884", "OKAY^1!&ALL READIED-UP&TO HANG OUT!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3885", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3886", "* (Will you hang out?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3887", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3895", "OKAY^1!&STAND BEHIND ME!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3901", "TAKE YOUR TIME!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3910", "OKAY^1!&STAND BEHIND ME!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3916", "TAKE YOUR TIME!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3921", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3922", "\\E5* So why are YOU&  here?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3923", "\\E4* To rub your victory&  in my face?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3924", "\\E4* To humiliate me&  even further?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3925", "\\E1* IS THAT IT? & &  Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3926", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3932", "\\E2* Oh-ho-ho-ho./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3933", "\\E1* Well^1, I've got news&  for you^1, BRAT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3934", "\\E2* You're on MY&  battlefield now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3935", "\\E3* And you AREN'T&  going to&  humiliate me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3936", "\\E3* I'll TELL you&  what's going to&  happen./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3937", "\\E0* We're going to&  hang out./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3938", "\\E2* We're going to&  have a good&  time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3939", "\\M1* We're going to&  become \"friends.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3940", "\\E3* You'll become so&  enamored with me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3941", "\\E1* YOU'LL be the one&  feeling humiliated&  for your actions!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3942", "\\E6* Fuhuhuhuhu!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3943", "\\M2* It's the perfect&  revenge!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3944", "\\E1* Err.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3945", "\\E9* Why don't you&  have a seat?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3951", "\\E4* Then why are you&  here?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3952", "\\E1* ...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3953", "\\E2* Wait^1, I get it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3954", "\\E3* You think that I'm&  gonna be friends&  with you^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3955", "* Right???&              NEVER &  Yes         with you\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3956", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3963", "\\E6* Really^1?&* How delightful!^1!&* I accept!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3964", "* Let's all frolick&  in the fields&  of friendship!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3965", "\\E2* ...NOT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3966", "\\E2* Why would I EVER&  be friends with&  YOU!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3967", "\\E3* If you weren't my&  houseguest^1, I'd beat&  you up right now!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3968", "\\E0* You're the enemy&  of everyone's hopes&  and dreams!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3969", "\\E1* I WILL NEVER&  BE YOUR FRIEND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3970", "\\E3* Now get out of&  my house!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3976", "\\E1* WHAT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3977", "\\E4* First you parade&  into my house^1,&  then you INSULT me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3978", "\\E2* You little BRAT^1!&* I have half a&  mind to.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3979", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3980", "\\E3* Wait./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3981", "\\E2* I'll prove you&  WRONG./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3982", "\\E3* We ARE going to&  be friends./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3983", "\\E1* In fact.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3984", "\\E3* We./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3985", "\\M1* Are going to be&  BESTIES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3986", "* I'll make you like&  me so much.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3987", "\\E1* Your WHOLE LIFE&  will revolve around&  me!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3988", "\\M2* It's the perfect&  revenge!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3989", "\\E6* FUHUHUHUHU!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3990", "\\E1* Err.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3991", "\\E9* Now^1, why don't&  you have a seat?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3998", "* (Sit down and progress?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3999", " ");
