  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4010", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4011", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4016", "* That sugar's for&  the tea./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4017", "\\E2* I'm not gonna give&  you a cup of&  sugar!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4018", "\\E6* What do I look&  like^1, the ice-cream&  woman?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4019", "\\E2* Do human ice-cream&  women TERRORIZE HUMANITY&  with ENERGY SPEARS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4020", "\\E3* Are their ice-cream&  songs a PRELUDE TO&  DESTRUCTION?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4021", "\\E1* IS THAT IT? & &  Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4022", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4028", "\\E1* ... what^1?&* REALLY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4029", "\\E6* That rules!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4033", "\\E3* That's what I&  thought./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4038", "* Envision these&  vegetables as your&  greatest enemy!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4039", "\\E2* Now!^1!&* Pound them to dust&  with your fists!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4041", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4042", "* (How will you pound?)& &         Strong      Wimpy\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4043", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4050", "* (You punch the vegetables&  at full force^1.&* You knock over a tomato.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4052", "* YEAH^1!&* YEAH!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4053", "\\E1* Our hearts are&  uniting against these&  healthy ingredients!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4054", "\\M2* NOW IT'S MY TURN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4055", "* NGAHHH!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4060", "* (You pet the vegetables&  in an affectionate&  manner.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4062", "* OH MY GOD!!^1!&* STOP PETTING THE&  ENEMY!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4063", "\\M2* I'll show you&  how it's done!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4064", "* NGAHHH!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4071", "* ... we add the&  noodles!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4072", "\\E0* Homemade noodles&  are the best!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4073", "\\E6* BUT I JUST BUY&  STORE-BRAND!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4074", "\\M2* THEY'RE THE&  CHEAPEST!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4075", "\\E1* NGAHHHHHHHHH&  HHHHHHHHHH!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4076", "\\E9* Uhh^1, just put them&  in the pot./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4077", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4078", "\\M0* (How will you put them in?)& &         Fiercely    Careful\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4079", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4086", "* (You throw everything into&  the pot as hard as you can^1,&  including the box.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4087", "* (It clanks against the&  empty bottom.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4089", "\\M2* YEAH!!^1!&* I'M INTO IT!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4094", "* (You place the noodles&  in one at a time.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4095", "* (They clank against the&  empty bottom.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4097", "* Nice???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4103", "\\E0* Humans suck^1, but&  their history..^1.&* Kinda rules./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4104", "\\E2* Case in point^1:&* This giant sword!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4105", "\\E0* Historically^1, humans&  wielded swords up&  to 10x their size./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4106", "\\E1* RIGHT?& &  True        False\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4107", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4113", "\\E6* Heh^1, I knew it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4114", "\\E2* When I first heard&  that^1, I immediately&  wanted one!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4115", "\\E0* So me and Alphys&  built a giant&  sword together./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4116", "\\E0* She figured out all&  the specs herself.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4117", "\\E6* She's smart^1, huh!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4121", "\\E2* Pfft^1!&* You liar!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4122", "\\E3* I've READ Alphys's&  human history book&  collection!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4123", "\\E3* I know all about&  your giant swords.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4124", "\\E3* Your colossal^1,&  alien-fighting&  robots.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4125", "* Your supernatural&  princesses.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4126", "\\E6* Heh^1! There's no&  way you're gonna&  fool me!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4131", "* (Look inside the bone drawer?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4132", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4136", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4147", "\\M5* WHAT A SENSATIONAL OPPORTUNITY&  FOR A STORY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4148", "\\M3* I CAN SEE THE HEADLINE NOW:/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4149", "\\M4* \"A DOG EXISTS SOMEWHERE.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4150", "\\M2* FRANKLY^1, I'M BLOWN AWAY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4151", "* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4152", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4159", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4165", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4170", "\\M5* THIS DOG..^1.&* STILL EXISTS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4171", "* THIS STORY..^1.&* JUST KEEPS GETTING&  BETTER AND BETTER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4172", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4173", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4179", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4185", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4191", "\\M5* OH MY!!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4192", "\\M2* ... IT'S A COMPLETELY&  NONDESCRIPT GLASS OF WATER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4193", "\\M4* BUT ANYTHING CAN MAKE&  A GREAT STORY WITH ENOUGH&  SPIN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4194", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4195", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4201", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4207", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4214", "\\M3* I'M HONORED TO BE IN THE&  PRESENCE OF SUCH A HUGE&  LUKEWARM WATER FAN^1, FOLKS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4215", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4216", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4222", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4228", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4234", "\\M5* OH NO!!^1!&* THAT MOVIE SCRIPT!!^1!&* HOW'D??^1? THAT GET THERE???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4235", "\\M4* IT'S A SUPER-JUICY SNEAK&  PREVIEW OF MY LATEST&  GUARANTEED-NOT-TO-BOMB FILM:/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4236", "\\M6* METTATON THE MOVIE XXVIII..^1.&  STARRING METTATON!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4237", "\\M1* I'VE HEARD THAT LIKE THE&  OTHER FILMS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4238", "\\M1* IT CONSISTS MOSTLY OF A SINGLE&  FOUR-HOUR SHOT OF ROSE PETALS&  SHOWERING ON MY RECLINING BODY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4239", "\\M5* OOH!!^1!&* BUT THAT'S!!^1!&* NOT CONFIRMED!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4240", "\\M5* YOU WOULDN'T (COUGH) SPOIL MY&  MOVIE FOR EVERYONE WITH A&  PROMOTIONAL STORY^1, WOULD YOU?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4241", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4242", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4248", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4254", "\\M5* PHEW!!^1! THAT WAS CLOSE!^1!&* YOU ALMOST GAVE ME A BUNCH&  OF FREE ADVERTISEMENT!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4255", "\\M2 %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4260", "\\M3* OH^1!&* YOU'RE BACK!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4261", "\\M6* THAT'S RIGHT^1, FOLKS^1!&* IT SEEMS NO ONE CAN RESIST&  THE ALLURE OF MY NEW FILM!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4262", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4263", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4270", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4276", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4282", "\\M4* BASKETBALL'S A BLAST^1, ISN'T IT^1,&  DARLING?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4283", "\\M1* TOO BAD YOU CAN'T PLAY WITH&  THESE BALLS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4284", "\\M4* THEY'RE MTT-BRAND FASHION&  BASKETBALLS^1.&* FOR WEARING^1, NOT PLAYING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4285", "\\M6* YOU CAN'T GET RICH AND FAMOUS&  LIKE MOI WITHOUT BEAUTIFYING&  A FEW ORBS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4286", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4287", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4293", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4299", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4304", "* IT SEEMS OUR REPORTER IS DRAWN&  TO SPORTS LIKE MOTHS TO A&  FLAMING BASKETBALL HOOP./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4305", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4306", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4312", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4318", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4326", "\\M5* OH MY^1! IT'S A PRESENT^1!&* AND IT'S ADDRESSED TO YOU^1,&  DARLING!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4327", "\\M6* AREN'T YOU JUST BURSTING&  WITH EXCITEMENT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4328", "\\M5* WHAT COULD BE INSIDE^1?&* WELL^1, NO TIME LIKE THE&  \"PRESENT\" TO FIND OUT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4329", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4330", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4336", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4342", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4347", "\\M4* READY FOR YOUR..^1.&* PRESENTATION?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4348", "\\M4* (... LET'S CUT THAT ONE IN&  POST.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4349", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4350", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4356", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4362", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4369", "\\M5* OOH LA LA^1!&* THIS VIDEO GAME YOU FOUND..^1.&* IS DYNAMITE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4370", "\\M4* THOUGH I DON'T MAKE AN&  APPEARANCE IN IT UNTIL&  THREE-FOURTHS IN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4371", "\\M3* BUT I LIKE THAT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4372", "\\M6* APPEARING FROM THE HEAVENS LIKE&  MANNA^1, SLAKING THE AUDIENCE'S&  HUNGER FOR GORGEOUS ROBOTS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4373", "\\M5* OOH^1!&* THAT'S METTATON!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4374", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4375", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4381", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4387", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4392", "* AH^1, YOU UNDERSTAND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4393", "* THIS IS A GAME WHERE YOU&  SHOULD CHECK EVERYTHING&  TWICE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4394", "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4395", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4401", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4407", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4415", "* Buy a Spider Cider for 9999G?& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4416", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4433", "* Some spiders crawled down&  and gave you a jug./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4434", "* You didn't have enough&  gold./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4436", "* You are carrying too&  many items./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4439", "*%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4447", "* Buy a Spider Donut for 9999G?& &         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4448", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4465", "* Some spiders crawled down&  and gave you a donut./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4466", "* You didn't have enough&  gold./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4468", "* You are carrying too&  many items./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4471", "*%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4477", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit.&* (I have heard you are quite&  merciful^1, for a human...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4478", "\\W* (Surely you know by now a&  monster wears a \\YYELLOW\\W name&  when you can \\YSPARE\\W it.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4479", "* (What do you think of that?)&         Very        It's&         Helpful     Bad\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4480", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4486", "* (It is rather helpful.^1)&* (Remember^1, sparing is just&  saying you won't fight.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4487", "* (Maybe one day^1, you'll&  have to do it even if&  their name isn't yellow.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4491", "* (Really^1? Then^1, I'll tell all&  of my friends to tell&  their friends' friends...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4492", "* (Never use yellow names.)&* (How about that?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4493", "         Keep        No more&         Yellow      Yellow&         Names       Names\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4494", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4501", "* (OK^1, they will still&  use yellow names.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4505", "* (OK^1, I will let them&  know not to use yellow&  names.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4511", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (How are you doing without&  yellow names?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4512", "                     Bring &         It's        Them&         great       Back\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4513", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4519", "* (Glad to hear it.^1)&* (Though^1, I do not know why&  you dislike yellow.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4520", "* (You had better hope you do&  not encounter a banana-themed&  monster.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4524", "* (Huh^1? It's rather inconvenient&  that you changed your mind&  like this.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4525", "* (Since I told everyone&  not to use yellow names^1,&  everyone threw theirs out.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4526", "* (This is really troubling...^1)&* (Hmmm...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4527", "\\W* (Well^1, last year it was&  fashionable to have \\ppink\\W &  names.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4528", "* (I think everyone still&  has those in their closets&  somewhere...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4529", "* (I'll ask everyone to look.^1)&* (But this is the last time!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4535", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit...&* (I hope you're satisfied.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4540", "* \\YNAPSTABLOOK22 has sent you&  a friend request.\\W /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4541", "* Accept the request?& &         Accept      Reject\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4542", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4547", "* (It seems to have already&  rejected itself...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4588", "* hey^1.&* i heard you're going&  to the core./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4589", "\\E0* how about grabbing some&  dinner with me first?&  Yeah        I'm busy \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4590", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4591", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4597", "* great^1, thanks for&  treating me./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4602", "* well^1, have fun in&  there./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4609", "* This is the barrier./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4610", "* This is what keeps&  us all trapped&  underground./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4611", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4612", "* If.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4613", "* If by chance you&  have any unfinished&  business.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4614", "* Please do what you&  must./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4615", " & &         Continue    Go Back\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4616", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4623", "* ..^2.&* ... I see.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4624", "* This is it^1, then./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4630", "* I see./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4631", "* Anything you want to&  do is important&  enough./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4632", "* Even something as small&  as reading a book^1,&  or taking a walk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4633", "* Please take your time./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4639", "* Oh..^1.&* Back so soon?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4640", "* How are you feeling?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4641", " & &         Ready       Go Back\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4642", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4649", "* ..^2.&* ... I see.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4650", "* This is it^1, then./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4655", "* I see./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4656", "* Do what you have to./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4662", "* Tra la la^1.&* I am the riverman./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4663", "* Or am I the riverwoman...^1?&* It doesn't really matter./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4664", "* I love to ride in my boat^1.&* Would you care to join me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4665", "* (Ride in the boat?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4666", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4669", "* Tra la la^1.&* Care for a ride?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4670", "* (Ride in the boat?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4671", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4678", "* Where will we go today?& &         Error       Error\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4680", "* Where will we go today?& &         Snowdin     Waterfall\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4682", "* Where will we go today?& &         Snowdin     Hotland\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4684", "* Where will we go today?& &         Waterfall   Hotland\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4686", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4691", "* Then perhaps another time^1.&* Or perhaps not^1.&* It doesn't really matter./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4713", "* Then we're off.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4720", "* (There's a switch on the&  wall.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4721", "* (Press it?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4722", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4725", "* (The switch doesn't do&  anything.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4729", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4743", "* (Seems like a comfortable&  bed.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4744", "* (Lie on it?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4745", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4749", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4763", "* (It's just a regular suspicious&  bed now.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4767", "* (It's a yellow key.^1)&* (You put it on your&  keychain.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4772", "* (There's something under&  the sheets.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4773", "* (Check it out?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4774", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4779", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4791", "* (The power has been turned&  on.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4794", "* (It seems like this controls&  the elevator's power.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4795", "* (Turn it on?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4796", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4801", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4816", "\\E7* I always was a crybaby^1,&  wasn't I^1, \\[C]?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4817", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4818", "\\E2* ... I know./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4819", "\\E0* You're not actually&  \\[C], are you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4820", "\\E7* \\[C]'s been gone for&  a long time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4821", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4822", "\\E9* Um..^1. what.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4823", "\\E0* What IS your name?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4824", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4825", "\\E5* \"Frisk?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4826", "\\E7* That's.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4827", "\\E5* A nice name./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4828", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4829", "\\E7* Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4830", "\\E0* I haven't felt like&  this for a long time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4831", "\\E2* As a flower^1, I was&  soulless./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4832", "\\E1* I lacked the power to&  love other people./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4833", "\\E2* However^1, with everyone's&  souls inside me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4834", "\\E7* I not only have my own&  compassion back.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4835", "\\E5* But I can feel every&  other monster's as&  well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4836", "\\E7* They all care about&  each other so much./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4837", "\\E0* And..^1. they care about&  you too^1, Frisk./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4838", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4839", "\\E7* I wish I could tell&  you how everyone&  feels about you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4840", "* Papyrus..^1. Sans..^1.&* Undyne..^1. Alphys.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4841", "\\E0* ... Toriel./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4842", "\\E7* Monsters are weird./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4843", "\\E5* Even though they barely&  know you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4844", "\\E6* It feels like they&  all really love&  you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4845", "\\E8* Haha./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4846", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4847", "\\E1* Frisk..^1. I..^1.&* I understand if you&  can't forgive me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4848", "* I understand if you&  hate me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4849", "* I acted so strange and&  horrible./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4850", "\\E3* I hurt you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4851", "* I hurt so many people./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4852", "\\E1* Friends^1, family^1,&  bystanders.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4853", "\\E3* There's no excuse for&  what I've done./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4855", " & &  Forgive     Do not\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4856", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4862", "\\E3* Wh..^1. what?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4863", "\\E7* ... Frisk^1, come on./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4864", "\\E0* You're..^1.&* You're gonna make me&  cry again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4865", "\\E7* ... besides^1, even if&  you do forgive me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4869", "\\E2* ... right^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4870", "* I understand./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4871", "\\E1* I just hope that.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4872", "* I can make up for&  it a little right&  now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4875", "\\E1* I can't keep these&  souls inside of me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4876", "\\E0* The least I can do&  is return them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4877", "\\E2* But first.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4878", "\\E4* There's something I&  have to do./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4879", "* Right now^1, I can feel&  everyone's hearts&  beating as one./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4880", "* They're all burning&  with the same&  desire./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4881", "* With everyone's power..^1.&* With everyone's&  determination.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4882", "* It's time for&  monsters.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4883", "* To finally go free./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4887", "\\E7* Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4888", "\\E0* I have to go now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4889", "\\E7* Without the power of&  everyone's souls.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4890", "\\E1* I can't keep&  maintaining this&  form./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4891", "* In a little while.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4892", "* I'll turn back into&  a flower./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4893", "\\E3* I'll stop being&  \"myself.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4894", "* I'll stop being able&  to feel love again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4895", "\\E1* So..^1. Frisk./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4896", "\\E7* It's best if you&  just forget about&  me^1, OK?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4897", "\\E0* Just go be with&  the people who&  love you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4898", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4899", " &         Comfort&         him         Do not\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4900", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4919", "\\E0* So^1, Alphys.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4920", "\\E9* What do you want&  to do now that&  we're all free?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4921", "\\E0* We have the whole&  world to explore&  now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4923", "\\E3* W-well^1, of course&  I'm going to go&  out and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4924", "\\E4* Um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4925", "\\E3* No^1, I should be&  honest!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4926", "\\E1* I'm gonna stay inside&  and watch anime like&  a total loser!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4928", "\\E0THAT'S THE SPIRIT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4929", "EVERYONE!!^1!&A CELEBRATION!!!&TO BEING LOSERS!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4931", "\\E9* Heh^1.&* Papyrus has the&  right idea./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4932", "\\E0* Losing to Frisk is&  the best thing to&  ever happen to me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4933", "\\E0* So I'm glad that&  we.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4934", "\\E9* Huh^1?&* What is it^1, Asgore?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4936", "\\E2* Um..^1. what's an.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4937", "\\E0* ... anime?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4939", "\\E1* (Oh My God?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4940", "\\E3* (Frisk^1. Please.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4941", "\\E2* (Help me explain what&  anime is to Asgore.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4942", "\\E0* Y-you see^1, it's&  like a cartoon^1,&  but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4943", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4944", " &         With        With&         Sword's     Gun's\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4945", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4950", "\\E2* So it's like a&  cartoon..^1.&* But with swords?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4952", "\\E2* So it's like a&  cartoon..^1.&* But with guns?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4953", "\\E0* Golly^1!&* That sounds neato!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4954", "\\E3* Where is this^1?&* Where can I see the&  Anime./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4956", "\\E3* H-hold on^1, uh..^1.&* I think I have&  some on my phone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4957", "\\E0* Here^1, l-look at&  this!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4958", "\\E0* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4959", "\\E3*...Oh^1, uh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4960", "\\E4* Um..^1. that's the..^1.&* That's the wrong.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4961", "\\E5* Uh^1, nevermind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4963", "* Golly^1.&* Were those two robots.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4965", "\\E9* ... kissing?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4967", "\\E0* Boy^1!&* Technology sure is&  something^1, isn't it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4969", "\\E5* Eheheh..^1. yeah^1!&* It sure is!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4973", "\\E0* Psst..^1.&* F-Frisk./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4974", "\\E3* Um^1, you've gotta&  tell me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4975", "\\E6* D..^1. do you think&  Asgore and Toriel&  are...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4976", "\\E3* Uh^1, ever gonna get&  back together?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4977", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4978", "& &         Yeah        Nope\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4979", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4983", "* Error.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4987", "\\E7* Y-yeah!!^1!&* Yeah^1, that's what&  I hope^1, too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4988", "\\E7* Just think about how&  cute they must have&  been together./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4989", "\\E0* It's quickly becoming&  my number one ship&  of all time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4990", "\\E7* Tori and Gorey.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4991", "\\E5* My..^1.&* My old boss and&  his ex-wife./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4992", "\\E8* ... uh^1, that sounds&  a lot less cool&  all of a sudden./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4998", "\\E8* ... yeah^1, that's what&  I thought./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4999", "\\E7* A woman can dream&  though^1, right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5000", "\\E2* And write fanfiction./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5001", "\\E1* A LOT of fanfiction./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5007", "\\E0* Frisk^1!&* I just realized!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5008", "\\E3* Now that we aren't&  fighting each&  other.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5009", "\\E2* I can finally ask&  you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5010", "\\E0* \"Would you like a&  cup of tea?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5011", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5012", "\\E0* Would you like a&  cup of tea?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5013", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5014", "& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5015", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5019", "* Error.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5023", "* Oh^1!&* Well!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5024", "\\E3* Actually^1, the cup I&  had is cold now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5025", "* So you shouldn't&  have it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5026", "\\E0* But^1, I am so&  happy you said&  yes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5027", "\\E0* As soon as I can^1,&  I will make some&  more for you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5028", "\\E0* Then we can be&  great pals./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5034", "\\E3* Oh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5035", "\\E3* Okay./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5037", "\\E2* Frisk^1! Stop^1!&* You're breaking his&  big burly heart!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5039", "\\E2* Um^1, it's OK^1, Undyne./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5040", "\\E0* My heart's already&  broken./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5042", "\\E6* ASGORE^1! STOP^1!&* YOU'RE BREAKING MY&  BIG BURLY HEART!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5044", "\\E9* Y-yeah^1, Asgore^1.&* Don't break Undyne's&  heart./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5045", "\\E2* That's my job./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5047", "\\E2* OH MY GOD!&* YOU'RE GOING BACK&  IN THE TRASH!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5049", "\\E0CAN I GO IN THE&TRASH TOO?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5051", "\\E9* Sure^1, Papyrus./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5053", "\\E1* guess i have to&  go in the trash&  too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5055", "\\E0* Oh^1, may I enter&  the trash as well?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5057", "\\E1* Uh^1, okay?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5059", "\\E0* Am I invited to&  the trash?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5061", "\\E6* SURE!!!&* WHY NOT!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5063", "\\E1* On second thought^1,&  do not put me&  in the trash./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5065", "\\E5* Oh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5067", "\\E1* OH MY GOD!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5073", "* (If you leave here^1, your&  adventure will really&  be over.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5074", "* (Your friends will follow&  you out of the underground.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5075", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5076", " &         Don't       I'm&         leave       ready\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5077", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5081", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5095", "\\E0* Oh my.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5097", "\\E0* Isn't it beautiful^1,&  everyone?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5099", "\\E3* Wow..^1. it's e-even&  better than on TV./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5100", "\\E7* WAY better^1!&* Better than I ever&  imagined!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5102", "\\E1* Frisk^1, you LIVE with&  this!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5103", "\\E9* The sunlight is so&  nice..^1. and the air&  is so fresh!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5104", "* I really feel alive!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5106", "\\E0HEY SANS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5107", "\\E3WHAT'S THAT GIANT&BALL?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5109", "\\E1* we call that&  \"the sun^1,\" my friend./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5111", "\\E0THAT'S THE SUN!^1?&WOWIE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5112", "I CAN'T BELIEVE&I'M FINALLY MEETING&THE SUN!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5114", "\\E0* I could stand here&  and watch this for&  hours.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5116", "\\E0* Yes^1, it is beautiful^1,&  is it not?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5117", "\\E1* But we should really&  think about what comes&  next./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5119", "\\E3* Oh^1, right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5120", "\\E0* Everyone.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5121", "* This is the beginning&  of a bright new&  future./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5122", "* An era of peace between&  humans and monsters./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5123", "\\E2* Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5124", "* I have something to&  ask of you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5125", "\\E0* Will you act as our&  ambassador to the&  humans?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5126", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5127", "* (Be the ambassador?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5128", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5133", "WOWi, Nice error./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5136", "\\E0YEAH^1!&FRISK WILL BE THE&BEST AMBASSADOR!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5137", "AND I^1, THE GREAT&PAPYRUS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5138", "WILL BE THE BEST&MASCOT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5139", "I'LL GO MAKE A&GOOD FIRST&IMPRESSION!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5143", "\\E0IT'S OK FRISK^1!&I'VE GOT YOU&COVERED!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5144", "IF YOU DON'T WANT&TO BE THE&AMBASSADOR.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5145", "I CAN DO IT FOR&YOU!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5146", "I'LL GO MAKE A&GOOD FIRST&IMPRESSION!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5151", "* Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5152", "\\E2* You came from this&  world^1, right...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5153", "\\E1* So you must have&  a place to return to^1,&  do you not?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5154", "\\E2* What will you do&  now?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5155", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5156", "         I want      I have&         to stay     places&         with you    to go\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5157", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5161", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5182", "* (The door has no mail slot.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5183", "* (Slide the letter under?)& &         Slide       NO!!!! \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5184", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5197", "* (You slide the letter under&  the door and give it a&  knock.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5206", "* (You'll keep the letter&  warm for a little longer.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5212", "* (It's a note from Alphys.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5213", "* (Read it...?)& &         Read        Do not \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5214", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5220", "* (It's hard to read because&  of the handwriting^1, but&  you try your best...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5221", "* Hey./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5222", "* Thanks for your help back&  there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5223", "* You guys..^1.&* Your support really means a&  lot to me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5224", "* But..^1.&* As difficult as it is&  to say this.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5225", "* You guys alone can't&  magically make my own&  problems go away./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5226", "* I want to be a better&  person./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5227", "* I don't want to be&  afraid anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5228", "* And for that to happen^1,&  I have to be able to&  face my own mistakes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5229", "* I'm going to start&  doing that now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5230", "* I want to be clear./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5231", "* This isn't anyone else's&  problem but mine./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5232", "* But if you don't ever&  hear from me again.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5233", "* If you want to know&  \"the truth.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5234", "* Enter the door to the&  north of this note./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5235", "* You all at least deserve&  to know what I did./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5236", "* (That's all she wrote.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5240", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5250", "* (Buy chips for 25G?)& &         Buy         No \\C");
