  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5255", "* (There were no chips left&  in the machine.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5256", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5274", "* (The vending machine&  dispensed some chisps.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5275", "* (You didn't have enough&  gold.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5277", "* (You are carrying too&  many items.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5280", "*%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5285", "* Ring..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5286", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5290", "* Hello?&* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5291", "* For no reason in&  particular...&* Which do you prefer?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5292", "* Cinnamon or&  butterscotch?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5293", "\\E1* ... wait^1.&* Do not tell me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5294", "\\E0* It is ERROR MESSAGE!& &  Yes         No      \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5295", "\\E0* Is it Butterscotch?& &  Yes         No      \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5296", "\\E0* Is it Cinnamon?& &  Yes         No      \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5297", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5309", "\\E0* Hee hee hee^1.&* I had a feeling./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5310", "\\E1* When humans fall down&  here^1, strangely..^1.&* I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5311", "\\E1* I often feel like&  I already know them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5312", "\\E0* Truthfully^1, when I first&  saw you^1, I felt.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5313", "\\E1* ... like I was seeing&  an old friend for&  the first time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5314", "\\E0* Strange^1, is it not?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5315", "* Well^1, thank you for&  your selection./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5316", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5317", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5323", "\\E1* Oh..^1. I see./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5324", "\\E0* Well^1, thank you^1.&* Goodbye for now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5325", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5326", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5337", "* (Seems like you could skip&  Mettaton's monologue by&  turning him around now.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5338", "* (What will you do?)& &         Skip        Hear again\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5339", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5345", "* (You told Mettaton there&  was something cool&  behind him.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5353", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5359", "* though.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5360", "* one thing about you&  always struck me&  as kinda odd./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5361", "* now^1, i understand&  acting in self-defense./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5362", "* you were thrown into&  those situations&  against your will./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5363", "* but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5364", "* sometimes.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5365", "* you act like you&  know what's gonna&  happen./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5366", "* like you've already&  experienced it all&  before./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5367", "* this is an odd thing&  to say^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5368", "\\W* if you have some sort&  of \\Yspecial power\\W.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5369", "* isn't it your&  responsibility to do&  the right thing?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5370", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5371", " & &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5372", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5379", "\\E1* ah./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5380", "\\E0* i see./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5381", "\\E3* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5390", "\\E1* heh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5391", "\\E0* well^1, that's your&  viewpoint./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5392", "\\E2* i won't judge you&  for it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5393", "\\E3* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5402", "* (Ring...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5404", "\\E0* Hey!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5405", "\\E3* This um^1, doesn't have&  anything to do with&  guiding you..^1. but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5406", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5407", "\\E6* Uhh^1, hey^1, would you want&  to watch a human TV&  show together???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5408", "* Sometime???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5409", "\\E4* It's called^1, um^1,&  M..^1.Mew Mew Kissy&  Cutie.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5410", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5411", " & &         Sure!       ...no...\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5412", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5420", "* R-really!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5421", "\\E3* It's so good^1!&* It's um^1, my favorite&  show!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5422", "* It's all about this&  human girl named Mew Mew&  who has cat ears!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5423", "\\E3* Which humans don't have!&* S-so she's all&  sensitive about them!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5424", "\\E6* But like...&* Eventually!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5425", "* She realizes that her&  ears don't matter!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5426", "* That her friends like&  her despite the ears!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5427", "\\E7* It's really moving!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5428", "\\E5* Whoops, spoilers%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5429", "\\E6* Also, this sounds&  weird, but she has&  the power!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5430", "\\E5* To control the minds&  of anyone she kisses!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5431", "\\E3* She kisses people and&  controls them to fix&  her problems!!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5432", "\\E5* They don't remember&  anything after the&  kiss I mean!!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5433", "\\E3* BUT IF SHE MISSES&  THE KISS!!!&* THEN!!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5434", "\\E4* Then^1, uh^1, and^1, uh^1,&  also I mean^1, of course%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5435", "\\E5* Eventually^1, she&  realizes that&  controlling people%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5436", "\\E3* OKAY WELL I almost&  spoiled the whole&  show^1, but%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5437", "\\E5* Uhhh^1, I think you'd&  really like it!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5438", "\\E0* We should watch it^1!&* After you get through&  all this!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5439", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5440", "* (Click...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5445", "\\E5* Um^1! Well^1!&* That's okay!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5446", "* Just thought I'd!^1!&* Ask!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5447", "\\E6* B-but I think you'd&  really like it!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5448", "* If you gave it a&  chance!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5449", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5450", "* (Click...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5455", "\\M1* Did y'hear!^1?&* You're back!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5456", "\\M0* I'll tell you a big secret./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5457", "\\M1* I'm starting a band^1, y'hear?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5458", "\\M1* It's called the Red Hot&  Chibi Peppers./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5459", "\\M0* All I've thought of is&  the name./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5460", "\\M3* And I don't^1, play...&* Instruments^1, or sing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5461", "\\M1* Well^1!&* Do you think we'll be&  popular!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5462", " & &         Yeah        No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5463", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5471", "\\M0* Yeah^1, me too.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5477", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5485", "* (It's a lamp.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5486", "* (Turn it on?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5487", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5493", "* (There's no lightbulb.^1)&* (A flashlight is stuck in&  the bulb socket.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5494", "* (Turn it on?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5495", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5499", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5506", "* (The flashlight is out of&  batteries.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5510", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5517", "* Hey^1, hey^1!&* Did you remember my name?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5518", "* (Did you?)& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5519", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_5527", "* Wh-WHAT!^1?&* You REMEMBER!?/");
