  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6848", "   * Someone else");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6849", "   * Asriel Dreemurr");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6868", "* Dialing..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6876", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6877", "\\E0* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6878", "* You only wanted to&  say hello...^2?&* Well then./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6879", "\\E0* 'Hello!'/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6880", "* I hope that suffices^1.&* Hee hee./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6881", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6882", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6886", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6887", "\\E0* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6888", "* You want to say&  hello again?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6889", "* 'Salutations!'/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6890", "* Is that enough?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6891", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6892", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6896", "\\F1 \\TT %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6897", "\\E0* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6898", "* Are you bored^1?&* I should have given&  a book to you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6899", "* My apologies./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6900", "* Why not use your&  imagination to&  divert yourself?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6901", "* Pretend you are..^1.&* A monarch!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6902", "* Rule over the leaf pile&  with a fist of iron./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6903", "* Can you do that for me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6904", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6905", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6909", "\\F1 \\TT %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6910", "\\E0* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6911", "* Hello^1, my child./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6912", "\\E1* Sorry^1, I do not have&  much to say./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6913", "\\E0* It was nice to hear&  your voice^1, though^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6914", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6915", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6920", "* Dialing..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6921", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6922", "* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6923", "\\E1* Help with a puzzle^1.^1.^1.?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6924", "* Um^1, you have not&  left the room^1, have you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6925", "\\E0* Wait patiently for&  me and we can solve&  it together!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6926", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6927", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6931", "* Dialing..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6932", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6933", "* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6934", "\\E1* You want to know&  more about me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6935", "* Well^1, I am afraid there&  is not much to say./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6936", "\\E0* I am just a silly little&  lady who worries too&  much!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6937", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6938", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6943", "* Dialing..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6944", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6945", "* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6946", "\\E8* Huh^2?&* Did you just call&  me... \"Mom\"?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6947", "\\E1* Well...&* I suppose.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6948", "* Would that make you&  happy?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6949", "* To call me..^2.&* \"Mother?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6950", "\\E0* Well then^1, call me&  whatever you like!/!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6951", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6952", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6963", "* Dialing..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6964", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6965", "\\E8* ...^2 huh???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6966", "\\E1* Oh,^1 heh..^1 heh...^1 \\E0 &* Ha ha ha!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6967", "* How adorable...^1 I&  could pinch your cheek!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6968", "* You can certainly find&  better than an old woman&  like me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6969", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6970", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6974", "* Dialing..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6975", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6976", "\\E1* Oh dear,^1 are you&  serious...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6977", "\\E1* I do not know if this is&  pathetic,^1 or endearing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6978", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6979", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6982", "\\E8* And after you said you&  want to call&  me \"mother...\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6983", "\\E0* You are an...^2 &  \\E1... \"interesting\"&  child./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_6984", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
