  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5941", "* (The donation box slot is even&  bigger now.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5942", "* (You should be able to donate&  even more at once!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5943", "* (... actually^1, it looks like&  the sides of the slot are&  just painted on...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5944", "* (Seems you'll still have to&  donate just 1G at a time...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5954", "* (The donation box is sealed.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5955", "* (There was seemingly no point&  to all of this...)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5958", "* (Since your adventure is over^1,&  you can reminisce about how&  useful the Dog Shrine was...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5959", "* (... it wasn't useful at all.)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5970", "* (Something is wrong with&  the box.)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5977", "* (The box is full.)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5982", "* (Not enough money.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5983", "* (That's relieving...)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5993", "* (You donated 1G.)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5997", "* (You put 1G into the box.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_5998", "* (You feel like you're about to&  waste a lot of time...)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6003", "* (Clink!)&* (The box is filled with coins.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6004", "* (Perhaps if you leave and&  return^1, the donations will be&  used for something.)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6015", "* (You feel a sense of relief.)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6024", "* (Donation box.)& &         Use It      Do not\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6031", "* (... hand can't fit inside.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6032", "* (Check it again to try&  donating.)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6037", "* (Right.)/%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6045", "* (The boombox is playing...)&* (An upbeat song.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6046", "* (It's having a psychological&  effect on your desire to&  donate.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6047", "* (... It's not clear what kind&  of effect that is.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_dogshrine_6048", "* (Change the track?)& &         Change      Do not\\C");
