  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_125", "        DATING^1  STAR^5T^2.^2.^2.^3?%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_142", "Uhhh^1, sorry^2!&I'm still getting&dressed!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_170", "H-how do I look?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_171", "My friend helped me&pick out this&dress./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_172", "\\E1S\\M0he's got a great&sense of.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_173", "\\E0Um^1, anyway^1!&Let's do this thing!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_186", "        DATING^3  START^3.%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_199", "H-h-hey^1, w-w-wait!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_200", "Actually^1, we still&can't start the&date yet!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_209", "        DATING..^1.  STOP^4?%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_221", "Umm^1, I've gotta give&you items to raise&your affection&statistic^1, first!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_222", "That'll increase the&chance of a successful&outcome to the&date!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_223", "\\E6Right...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_224", "\\E0Anyway^1, d-don't worry^1!&I'm prepared!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_225", "\\E5I-I've been&stockpiling gifts&in anticipation&for a date like this!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_226", "\\E7F\\M6-first^1, I've got.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_227", "\\E5Some metal armor&polish!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_228", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_229", "\\E6Um^1, maybe you can't&use that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_230", "\\E5But!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_231", "I also brought some&waterproof cream for&your scales!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_232", "\\E3Your^1, uh..^1.&Scales.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_233", "\\E6Uh^1, well^1, how about.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_234", "This magical spear&repair kit^1, that I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_235", "\\E7Um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_236", "\\E5Hey^1, let's forget&about the items!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_237", "\\E0L\\M0et's just start&the date!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_301", "        DATING!^1!  START!^3!%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_314", "Yeah!!^1!&Let's^1, uh^1, date!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_352", "... uh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_353", "\\E4Do you..^3. like..^3.&Anime...^2?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_367", "                              &   Yes             No       &                            ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_391", "H-hey^1!&Me too!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_396", "Oh./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_414", "Hey^1!&Let's!^1!&Go somewhere!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_415", "\\E7But where's a good&place to go on&a date...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_416", "\\E2.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_417", "\\E0I've got it!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_418", "\\E5Let's go to the&garbage dump!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_476", "Here we are!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_477", "This is where Undyne&and I come all&the time.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_478", "\\E1We find all sorts&of great stuff&here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_479", "\\E5Heh^1, she's&really.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_480", "\\E6Uh.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_503", "Oh no./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_504", "\\E9That's her over&there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_505", "\\M4I c-can't let her&see me on a date&with you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_506", "\\E6Why...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_507", "\\M0Because^1, uh..^1.&Well.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_508", "\\E9Oh no^1, here she&comes!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_556", " Hey!^1!& There you are!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_557", "\\F2 I^1, uh^1, realized^1,& if you deliver that&  thing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_558", "\\F3 It might be a bad& idea./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_559", "\\F4 So I'm gonna do& it!!^1!& Give it to me!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_560", "\\F3 Huh!^1?& You don't have it!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_561", "\\F4 Ngggaaahhh!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_562", " Have you at least& seen her!?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_576", "                              &   Yeah            Nope     &                            ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_602", " Yes?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_603", "\\F6 So she's somewhere& around here.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_604", "\\F0 Thanks^1.& I'll keep looking./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_609", " No???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_610", " But she wasn't& at home.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_611", "\\F3 Where the heck& could she be!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_669", "\\E2Oh my god.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_670", "\\E6W... well^1, I guess&it's obvious^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_671", "\\E7I...^1 uh..^1.&I really like her./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_672", "\\E9I mean^1, more than&I like other people!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_673", "\\E7I'm sorry./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_674", "\\E6I j-just figured^1,&y-you know.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_675", "\\E7It'd be f-fun to&go on like^1, a cute^1,&kind of.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_676", "\\E6P\\M3retend date with you^1?&T-to make you feel&better?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_677", "\\E7.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_678", "\\E6Well^1, it sounds even&worse when I put it&like that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_679", "\\E8I\\M0'm sorry^1.&I messed up again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_680", "\\E7Undyne's the person I..^1.&Um..^1. really want to&go on a date with./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_681", "But, I mean..^1.&She's way out of&my league./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_682", "\\E9N-not that you&aren't^1, um^1, cool!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_683", "\\E7B-but..^1. Undyne.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_684", "She's so confident..^1.&And strong..^1.&And funny.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_685", "\\E8And I'm just a&nobody./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_686", "\\M3A fraud./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_687", "I'm the royal&scientist^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_688", "\\M0All I've ever done&is hurt people./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_689", "\\E7I've told her so&many lies^1, she thinks&I'm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_690", "\\E6She thinks I'm a&lot cooler than I&actually am./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_691", "\\E7If she gets close&to me^1, she'll.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_692", "\\E8She'll find out the&truth about me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_693", "\\E7.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_694", "\\E7What should I do?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_708", "                              &   Tell her        Keep     &   the truth       lying    ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_732", "\\E9The truth...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_733", "\\M4But if I tell her&that^1, she'll hate&me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_734", "\\E6I\\M0sn't it better&this way?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_735", "To live a lie where&both people are&happy.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_736", "\\E7Or a truth where&neither of us&are?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_737", "They say \"be&yourself.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_738", "\\E8But I don't&really like who&\"myself\" is./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_739", "\\E7I'd rather just&be whatever makes&people like me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_740", "\\E6Eheheh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_741", "\\E7.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_742", "\\E8.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_743", "No, you're right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_744", "Every day I'm&scared.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_745", "\\E7Scared what will&happen if people&learn the truth&on their own./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_746", "\\M3They'll all get&hurt because of&me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_747", "\\E9B\\M4ut how can I&tell UNDYNE the&tr..^1. truth?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_748", "\\E8I d-don't have the&confidence.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_749", "\\E9I'm going to mess&it up^1!&How can I&practice!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_755", "Yeah..^1. yeah^1, you're&right!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_756", "\\E6I\\M0've come this far^1,&I c-can't tell&her now!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_757", "\\E7Sh-she'd be really&hurt if she found&out^1, right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_758", "\\E5S-so it'll just&be^1, uh^1, a little&secret!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_759", "\\M1What people don't&know can't hurt&them!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_760", "\\M0Th-thank God I've&got an honest&friend like you!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_761", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_762", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_763", "\\M1B..^1. but what if she&finds out on her&own^1, somehow?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_764", "\\E7O\\M0r if I ever&m-mess up.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_765", "\\M4Sh-she'd find out&the truth^1, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_766", "\\E8Pr-probably be even&more hurt than if&I told her myself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_767", "\\E6N\\M0-not to mention^1,&l-lying so far..^1.&h..^1. has.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_768", "\\E8Been really&stressful^1, and scary./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_769", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_770", "\\E4I think I'm going&to have to tell&her the truth./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_771", "\\E9B-but how!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_772", "\\E8I..^1. I don't have&the confidence.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_773", "\\E7How am I supposed&to practice&something like that!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_794", "   Let's           Obviously&   Roleplay        Let's    &   It              Roleplay");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_827", "\\E4R..^1. roleplay?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_828", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_829", "\\E5.\\M1.. That actually&sounds kind of&fun!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_830", "\\M0OK^1, which one of&us will be Undyne?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_844", "                              &   I'll be         You'll be&   Undyne          Undyne   ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_868", "Oh^1. Right^1.&Obviously^1.&Ehehe./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_869", "\\E2A\\M1hem./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_870", "\\E0H-hi\\M3 Undyne..^1.&H-how are you doing&today?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_884", "                              &   I'm fine.       YOur &                      cute, ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_907", "\\E5Ha^1! Ha^1!&Glad to hear it!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_908", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_909", "\\E4Uhhh^1, so I'd like&to^1, um^1, talk to&you about&something./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_913", "\\E5Th..^1. thanks!/");
