  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1663", "\\F8ANIME'S REAL^1,&RIGHT?!?!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1688", "   Anime is        Anime &   Real            is not &                   real");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1708", "HA HA HA!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1709", "I KNEW IT!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1710", "GIGANTIC SWORDS!!^1!&MAGICAL PRINCESSES^1!&HERE I COME!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1714", "\\F3No..^1. NO!!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1715", "I CAN FEEL MY&HEART BREAKING&INTO PIECES!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1736", "\\F6.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1737", "Uhh^1, thanks for&taking care of&Alphys./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1738", "\\F9I didn't get to&say what I wanted&to^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1739", "\\F0Things seem like&they're going to get&better for her./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1740", "\\F6Well^1, I gotta go&catch up with&them!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1741", "Later!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1745", "\\F3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1746", "\\F5... no^1, I can&survive this.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1747", "\\F3I have to be strong./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1748", "\\F9For Alphys./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1749", "\\F0Thank you^1, human^1,&for telling me&the truth./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1750", "\\F9I'll try my best to&live in this&world.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_adate_1751", "\\F0See you later!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_153", "* (There's no response.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_207", "* (...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_208", "* (O^1-oh n^1-no^1, is that another&  letter...?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_209", "* (I don't want to open it...^1)&* (C-^1can't I just slide it&  back out...?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_210", "* (...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_211", "* (N..^1. no..^1. I can't keep doing&  this.^1)&* (I'll read this one.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_212", "* (...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_213", "* (Um...^1)&* (I-it's shut k-kind of&  strongly^1, isn't it?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_214", "* (Wait a second...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_252", "* Hey^1, if this is a&  joke^1, it's.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_253", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_254", "\\E3* Oh My God?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_255", "\\E5* Did YOU write this&  letter?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_256", "\\E6* It wasn't signed^1, so^1,&  I had no idea who&  could have.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_257", "\\E8* Oh my god^1.&* Oh no./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_258", "\\E7* That's adorable.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_259", "\\E5* And I h-had no idea&  you^1, um^1, wrote that way!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_260", "\\E9* It's surprising^1, too..^1.&* After all the gross&  stuff I did.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_261", "\\E8* I don't really deserve&  to be forgiven./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_262", "\\E4* Much less^1, um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_263", "\\E5* This?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_264", "\\E1* And so passionately^1,&  too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_265", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_266", "\\E0* You know what^1, okay^1!&* I'll do it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_267", "\\E5* It's the least I can&  do to make it up&  to you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alabdoor_l_268", "\\W*\\E7 Y-yeah^1!&* \\WLet's \\Rgo on a date\\W!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_81", "\\E0* On second thought^1,&  maybe I WON'T write&  fanfic of real people./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_82", "\\E7* I mean^1, isn't real life&  already the greatest&  fanfiction of all?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_83", "\\E8* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_84", "\\E3* Uh^1, don't tell&  anyone I said that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_85", "\\E1* Cause I'm gonna&  post it online!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_90", "\\E0* I sure am excited&  to finally use the&  human internet./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_91", "\\E7* I bet they have all&  sorts of things Undyne&  and I can watch!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_93", "\\E6* Oh man!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_94", "* We're gonna be&  able to watch&  anime online!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_96", "\\E7* Of course^1, Undyne!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_97", "\\E2* What do you think&  we've been fighting&  for all along?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_99", "\\E2* yeah^1, what do you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_100", "\\E1* whoops./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_102", "\\E1* Jinx^1!&* I knew you were&  gonna make that joke!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_104", "\\E3WAIT^1, ALPHYS, I&DIDN'T KNOW YOU&KNEW SANS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_106", "\\E5* Well..^1.&* I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_108", "\\E2* doesn't everybody?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_110", "\\E0* Who the hell is Sans?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_111", "\\E8* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_112", "\\E0* Who the HECK is Sans?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_114", "\\E1* TORIEL!?!?!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_119", "\\E0* Hey Frisk^1, why&  don't you go look&  for Mettaton?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_120", "\\E8* He was here for&  a while^1, too.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_friendc_121", "\\E0* But he said he&  had to go somewhere./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_npc_76", "* Th-that last&  question.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_npc_77", "\\E4* He wasn't s-supposed&  to ask that one.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_npc_82", "* (Yellow feet are tapping&  just behind the door.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_npc_91", "* I..^1. I just need&  a moment./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphys_npc_99", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_108", "* S..^1. Sorry about&  that!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_109", "\\E5* L-let's k-keep&  going!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_148", "* S-so you're about&  to meet ASGORE^1,&  h-huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_149", "\\E6* You must be..^1.&* Y-you must be.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_150", "\\E5* Pr..^1. pretty&  excited about all&  that^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_175", "* You'll f-f-finally.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_176", "\\E7* You'll finally get&  to go home!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_206", "* W..^1.&* Wait!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_228", "* I mean^1, um..^1.&* I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_229", "\\E1* I was just going&  to..^1.&* ...um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_230", "\\E2* Say goodbye^1, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_231", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_232", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_233", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_234", "* I can't take&  this anymore./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_262", "* I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_263", "\\E5* I lied to you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_264", "\\E7* A human SOUL isn't&  strong enough to&  cross the barrier alone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_265", "\\E6* It takes at least&  a human soul.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_266", "\\E5* And a monster&  soul./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_267", "\\E5* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_295", "* If you want to&  go home.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_296", "\\E5* You'll have to&  take his soul./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_297", "\\E7* You'll have to&  kill ASGORE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphysfollow_event_345", "* I'm sorry./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_166", "* Oh^1.&* My god./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_175", "* I didn't expect you&  to show up so&  soon!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_176", "* I haven't showered^1, I'm&  barely dressed^1, it's&  all messy^1, and.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_224", "* Ummm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_225", "* H-h-hiya!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_226", "* I'm Dr. Alphys^1.&* I'm ASGORE's royal&  scientist!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_227", "\\E3* B-b-but^1, ahhhh^1,&  I'm not one of&  the \"bad guys\"!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_228", "\\E0* Actually^1, since you&  stepped out of the&  RUINS^1, I've^1, um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_229", "\\E7* ... been \"observing\"&  your journey through&  my console./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_230", "\\E3* Your fights..^1.&* Your friendships..^1.&* Everything!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_231", "\\E0* I was originally&  going to stop&  you^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_236", "\\E7* Watching someone on&  a screen really makes&  you root for them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_237", "\\E7* Watching you^1, I felt&  like..^1. like I was&  seeing an old friend./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_238", "\\E0* S-so^1, ahhh^1, now I&  want to help you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_239", "\\E6* Using my knowledge^1,&  I can easily guide&  you through Hotland!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_240", "\\E0* I know a way right&  to ASGORE's castle^1,&  no problem!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_241", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_242", "\\E7* Well^1, actually^1, umm^1,&  there's just a&  tiny issue./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_243", "\\E0* A long time ago^1, I&  made a robot named&  Mettaton./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_244", "* Originally^1, I built&  him to be an&  entertainment robot./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_245", "\\E7* Uh^1, you know^1, like&  a robotic TV star&  or something./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_246", "\\E0* Anyway^1, recently I&  decided to make him&  more useful./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_247", "\\E7* You know^1, just some&  small practical&  adjustments./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_248", "\\E0* Like^1, um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_249", "\\E4* Anti..^1. anti-human&  combat features?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_250", "\\E6* Of c-course^1, when I&  saw you coming^1, I&  immediately decided.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_251", "\\E3* I have to remove&  those features!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_252", "\\E4* Unfortunately^1, I may&  have made a teensy&  mistake while doing so./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_253", "* And^1, um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_254", "\\E5* Now he's an unstoppable&  killing machine with a&  thirst for human blood?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_255", "* Ehehehehe.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_256", "\\E8* Heh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_257", "\\E0* But^1, ummm^1, hopefully&  we won't run into&  him!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_288", "* ...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_312", "* Did you hear&  something?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_344", "* Oh no./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_393", "* OHHHH YES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_394", "* WELCOME^1, BEAUTIES.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_441", "\\M1* ... TO TODAY'S QUIZ SHOW!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_468", "\\M0* OH BOY^1!&* I CAN ALREADY TELL IT'S&  GONNA BE A GREAT SHOW!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_469", "\\M2* EVERYONE GIVE A BIG&  HAND FOR OUR WONDERFUL&  CONTESTANT!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_493", "\\M0* NEVER PLAYED BEFORE^1,&  GORGEOUS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_494", "\\M2* NO PROBLEM^1!&* IT'S SIMPLE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_495", "\\M4* THERE'S ONLY ONE&  RULE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_496", "* ANSWER CORRECTLY.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_514", "* OR YOU DIE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_566", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger1_567", "\\E0* Well that was&  certainly something./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_87", "* Wait^1, wait!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_146", "\\E0* Let me give you my&  ph-phone number!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_147", "\\E7* Th-then..^1. m-maybe..^1.&* If you need help^1,&  I could.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_169", "\\E3* Wh..^1. where'd you get&  that phone!?&* It's ANCIENT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_170", "\\E1* It doesn't even have&  texting./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_171", "\\E3* W-wait a second^1,&  please!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_221", "\\E0* Here^1, I upgraded it&  for you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_222", "* It can do texting^1,&  items^1, it's got a&  key chain.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_223", "* I even signed you up&  for the underground's&  No. 1 social network!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_224", "\\E7* Now we're officially&  friends^1!&* Ehehehe!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_225", "\\E0* Heheh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_226", "\\E0* Heh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_227", "\\E0* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_228", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_229", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_230", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_231", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_alphystrigger2_232", "\\E4* I'm going to the&  bathroom./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_amalgam_fridge_99", "* (It's a refrigerator.^1)&* (It's empty.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_amalgam_fridge_103", "* (It's some sort of cold^1,&  rectangular object.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_amalgam_fridge_107", "* (You found a blue key on&  the ground.^1)&* (You put it on your keychain.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_artclass_sign_208", "* Art Club: Meet here!&* Next meeting:&* October 10th 8PM/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_artclass_sign_213", "* (Art club is cancelled!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_artclass_sign_218", "* (Art is dead.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_artclass_sign_224", "* Let's meet again someday!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_artclass_sign_231", "* Who knows what lies in the&  future for Art Club!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_artclass_sign_281", "* Ahhhh!!^1!&* I'm late!!^1!&* I'm late!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_artclass_sign_282", "* I'm so sorry!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_178", "* (A strange light fills the&  room.^5)   %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_179", "* (Twilight is shining through&  the barrier.^3)   %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_180", "* (It seems your journey is&  finally over.^4)%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_181", "     * (You're filled with&          DETERMINATION.^5) %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_213", "Human.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_214", "\\E1It was&nice to&meet&you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_215", "\\E0Goodbye./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_220", "\\E1Now,&now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_221", "There's&no need&to&fight./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_222", "Why not&settle&this.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_223", "Over a&nice cup&of tea?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_finalintro_496", "* ASGORE attacks!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_76", "\\E0* Howdy^1, Frisk./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_77", "\\E3* Sorry about almost&  trying to take&  your SOUL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_78", "\\E5* I feel very bad&  about it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_79", "\\E0* I hope we can&  still be pals./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_81", "\\E0* Hey^1, don't worry&  about it^1, ASGORE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_82", "\\E2* I think everybody's&  tried to kill Frisk&  at least once./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_84", "\\E2* Oh..^1. I see!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_85", "\\E0* In that case^1, I'm&  not sorry^1, Frisk./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_87", "\\E6* ASGORE^1!&* That's not what I&  meant!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_97", "\\E3* Oh^1, Frisk^1, if you're&  not busy.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_98", "\\E0* On nice days^1, you&  should walk around and&  have a good time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_friendc_99", "\\E0* That's important./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_243", "Ah.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_244", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_245", "So that&is how&it is./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_246", ".../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_251", "\\E3Why..^1.&You.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_275", "I remember the day&after my son&died./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_276", "The entire underground&was devoid of hope./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_277", "The future had once&again been taken&from us by the&humans./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_278", "In a fit of anger,&I declared war./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_279", "I said that I would&destroy any human&that came here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_280", "I would use their&souls to become&godlike.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_281", "... and free us from&this terrible prison./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_282", "Then, I would destroy&humanity.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_283", "And let monsters rule&the surface, in peace./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_284", "Soon, the people's&hopes returned./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_285", "My wife, however,&became disgusted with&my actions./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_286", "She left this place,&never to be seen&again./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_294", "Truthfully.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_295", "I do not want power./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_296", "I do not want to&hurt anyone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_297", "I just wanted everyone&to have hope.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_298", "But.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_299", "I cannot take this&any longer./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_300", "I just want to&see my wife./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_301", "I just want to&see my child./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_302", "Please..^1.&Young one.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_303", "This war has gone&on long enough./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_304", "You have the power.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_305", "Take my soul, and&leave this cursed&place./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_340", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_341", "\\E0After everything I&have done to&hurt you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_342", "\\E7You would rather&stay down here&and suffer.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_343", "\\E9Than live happily&on the surface?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_344", "\\E6.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_352", "\\E1Human.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_353", "\\E7I promise you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_354", "\\E7For as long as&you remain here.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_355", "\\E1My wife and I will&take care of you&as best we can./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_356", "\\E2We can sit in&the living room^1,&telling stories.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_357", "\\E1Eating butterscotch&pie.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_358", "\\E2We could be&like.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_359", "\\E8Like a family.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_623", "You&IDIOT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_627", "\\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_628", "You&haven't&learned&a thing./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_632", "Hee&hee&hee./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_633", "So you&finally&get it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_639", "\\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_640", "So you&DO&recall./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_651", "In&this&world.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_692", "It's KILL or BE killed^4.%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_769", "Hee hee hee^1.&Don't worry./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_770", "I know there's no&REAL point in&fighting you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_771", "The human souls&would probably just&revolt again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_772", "So...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_778", "Hee hee hee^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_779", "Did you REALLY&think killing me&would make a&DIFFERENCE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_780", "No./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_781", "Every time you&load your SAVE^1,&I'll come back./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_782", "And every time you&try to get a&happy ending.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_783", "I'll be there to&tear it away!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_784", "Ha ha ha!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_792", "Well^1, let's get&this over with./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_796", ".../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_831", "\\E2.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_832", "\\E0No^1.&That's just a&fantasy^1, isn't it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_833", "\\E1Young one^1, when I&look at you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_834", "\\E2I'm reminded of the&human that fell here&long ago.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_835", "\\E8You have the same&feeling of hope in&your eyes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_836", "\\E7There is an ancient&prophecy among our&people.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_837", "One day^1, a savior&will come from the&heavens./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_838", "\\E1... I believe the&one that was&prophecied was you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_839", "Somewhere in the&world outside.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_840", "There must be a way&to free us from our&prison./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_841", "\\E0It pains me to&give you this&responsiblity^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_842", "\\E0Please^1.&Take my soul..^1.&and seek the truth./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_898", "\\E0Ha... ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_899", "\\E6I'm sorry.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_900", "I couldn't give you&a simple^1, happy&ending.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_901", "But I believe your&freedom.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_902", "... is what my son.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_903", "\\E8... what ASRIEL would&have wanted./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_979", "See^1?&I never betrayed&you^2! %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_980", "It was all a&trick, see^2? %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_981", "I was waiting to&kill him for you^2! %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_982", "\\E1After all it's me&your best friend^2! %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_983", "\\E2I'm helpful, I can&be useful to you^1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_984", "\\E1I promise I won't&get in your way^1 %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_995", "\\E2I can help..^1.&I can..^1.&I can..^2. %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_lastcutscene_1006", "\\E3Please don't&kill me./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_78", "* How tense.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_79", "\\E2* Just think of it like.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_80", "\\E0* A visit to the dentist./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_112", "* Are you ready?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_113", "\\E3* If you are not^1, I&  understand./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgore_prebarrier_event_114", "\\E2* I am not ready either./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_652", "* ...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_658", "* Asgore has low HP.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_692", "* ASGORE 80 ATK 80 DEF /^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_705", "* But there was nothing to&  say./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_711", "* You quietly tell ASGORE&  you don't want to fight&  him./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_712", "* His hands tremble for a&  moment./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_716", "* You tell ASGORE that you&  don't want to fight him./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_717", "* His breathing gets funny&  for a moment./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_721", "* You firmly tell ASGORE to&  STOP fighting./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_722", "* Recollection flashes in his&  eyes.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_723", "* ASGORE's ATTACK dropped^1!&* ASGORE's DEFENSE dropped!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_729", "* Seems talking won't do any&  more good./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_731", "* All you can do is FIGHT./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_748", "* You tell ASGORE that he's&  killed you \\[1]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_killcount_1", "once before");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_killcount_2", "twice before");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_killcount_3", "three times");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_killcount_4", "four times");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_killcount_5", "five times");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_killcount_6", "six times");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_killcount_7", "seven times");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_killcount_8", "eight times");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_killcount_9", "nine times");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_killcount_10", "too many times&  to count");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_749", "* He nods sadly./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_751", "* He nods grievously./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoreb_753", "* He nods pitifully./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_131", "* Dum dee dum.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_132", "* Oh^1?&* Is someone there?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_133", "* Just a moment!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_134", "* I have almost finished watering&  these flowers./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_138", "* Curious^1.&* I've never seen a plant..^1.&* Cry before./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_162", "* ... Here we are!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_193", "* Howdy^1!&* How can I.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_224", "* Oh./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_247", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_248", "\\E2* I so badly want to&  say^1, \"would you like&  a cup of tea?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_249", "* But.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_250", "\\E3* You know how it is./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_289", "* Nice day today^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_290", "* Birds are singing^1,&  flowers are blooming.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_291", "* Perfect weather for a&  game of catch./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_313", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_314", "* You know what we must&  do./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_315", "* When you are ready^1,&  come into the next&  room./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_369", "\\E3* ... huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_370", "* You must be the one&  that flower just warned&  me about./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_371", "\\E0* Howdy!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_372", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_373", "\\E3* Erm..^1.&* What kind of monster&  are you...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_374", "\\E0* Sorry^1, I cannot tell./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asgoremeet_event_375", "* Well^1, we can always%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_174", "* I'm so sorry./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_440", "* Ha..^1. ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_441", "* I don't want to let&  go.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_495", "\\E7* Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_496", "* You're.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_497", "\\E0* You're going to do&  a great job^1, OK?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_498", "* No matter what you&  do./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_499", "* Everyone will be&  there for you^1,&  okay?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_533", "\\E7* Well..^1.&* My time's running out./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_534", "* Goodbye./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_572", "* By the way.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_573", "* Frisk./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asriel_overworldanim_574", "\\E6* ... take care of Mom&  and Dad for me^1, OK?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielappear_110", "Finally./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielappear_111", "I was so&tired of&being a&flower./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielappear_147", "Howdy!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielappear_148", "\\[C]^1,&are you&there?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielappear_149", "It's me^1,&your&best&friend./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_FinalWriter_34", " ASRIEL   DREEMURR ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_245", "\\E1You know.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_246", "\\M1I \\E0don't care about&destroying this&world anymore./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_251", "\\E1After I defeat you&and gain total&control over the&timeline.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_252", "\\E2I just want to reset&everything./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_257", "\\E3All your progress..^1.&Everyone's memories./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_258", "\\E2I'll bring them all&back to zero!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_263", "\\E2Then we can do&everything ALL over&again./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_268", "\\E3And you know what&the best part of&all this is?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_269", "\\E2You'll DO it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_274", "\\E1And then you'll&lose to me again./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_279", "\\E3And again./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_284", "\\E3And again!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_289", "\\E1Because you want a&\"happy ending.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_294", "Because you \"love&your friends.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_299", "Because you \"never&give up.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_304", "\\M1I\\E1sn't that&delicious?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_305", "\\M0Your \"determination.^1\"&The power that let&you get this far.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_306", "\\E2It's gonna be your&downfall!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_311", "\\E2Now^1, ENOUGH messing&around!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_312", "It's time to purge&this timeline once&and for all!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_541", "* Asriel readies \"STAR BLAZING.\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_542", "* Asriel charges \"SHOCKER&  BREAKER.\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_543", "* Asriel calls on \"CHAOS SABER.\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_544", "* Asriel readies \"CHAOS BUSTER.\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_545", "* Asriel readies \"GALACTA&  BLAZING.\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_546", "* Asriel calls on \"CHAOS SLICER.\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_547", "* Asriel readies \"SHOCKER&  BREAKER II.\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_548", "* Asriel readies \"CHAOS&  BLASTER.\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_549", "* Asriel readies \"HYPER GONER.\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_550", "* Asriel is glowing with a&  strange power.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_551", "* It's the end.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_585", "* ASRIEL DREEMURR \\z4   ATK \\z4   DEF&* Legendary being made of every&  SOUL in the underground./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_587", "* ASRIEL DREEMURR \\z4   ATK \\z4   DEF&* The Absolute GOD of Hyperdeath!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_597", "* You held on to your hopes..^1.&* You reduced how much DAMAGE&  you'll take this turn!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_598", "* You kept holding on^1.&* DAMAGE reduced!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_614", "* You think about why you're&  here now.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_615", "* You can feel the empty&  space in your inventory&  get smaller and smaller!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_618", "* Your items fill up with&  dreams./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_669", "\\E0... even after that&attack^1, you're still&standing in my way...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_670", "\\M1W\\E0ow..^1.&You really ARE&something special./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_671", "\\M0B\\E3ut don't get&cocky./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_672", "\\E0Up until now^1, I've&only been using&a fraction of my&REAL power!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielb_673", "\\E2Let's see what good&your DETERMINATION&is against THIS!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielbed_87", "* \\[C]^1, please.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielbed_88", "* Wake up!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielbed_89", "* You are the future&  of humans and&  monsters.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielbed_93", "* (It felt strange to lie&  in the bed.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielbed_94", "* (It feels entirely too&  small for you now.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_58", "* You feel something faintly&  resonating within ASRIEL.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_59", "* You feel something&  resonating within ASRIEL.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_60", "* You feel something strongly&  resonating within ASRIEL.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_61", "* You feel your friends' SOULs&  resonating within ASRIEL!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_423", "* The whole world is ending.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_425", "* You feel something faintly&  resonating within ASRIEL.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_426", "* You feel something&  resonating within ASRIEL.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_427", "* You feel something strongly&  resonating within ASRIEL.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_428", "* You feel your friends' SOULs&  resonating within ASRIEL!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_429", "* ...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_468", "* Strangely^1, as your friends&  remembered you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_469", "* Something else began resonating&  within the SOUL^1, stronger&  and stronger./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_470", "* It seems that there's still&  one last person that needs&  to be saved./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_471", "* But who...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_472", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_473", "* Suddenly^1, you realize./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_474", "* You reach out and call&  their name./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_552", "* Can't move your body^1.&* Nothing happened./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_553", "* You struggle..^1.&* Nothing happened./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_554", "* You tried to reach your&  SAVE file^1.&* Nothing happened./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_555", "* You tried again to reach&  your SAVE file^1.&* Nothing happened./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_556", "* Seems SAVING the game really&  is impossible./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_559", "* SAVING over ASRIEL's file&  seems like the only way to&  defeat him.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_560", "* But^1, having never SAVED&  before^1, you lack the power&  to do it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_561", "* Seems SAVING the game really&  is impossible./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_563", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_564", "* But.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_565", "* Maybe^1, with what little&  power you have.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_566", "* You can SAVE something else./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_577", "* Can't move your body./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_648", "* !?!?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_674", "Huh^1? What are you&doing...!?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_723", "");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_724", "");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_725", "");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_726", "");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_732", "");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_737", "");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_741", "");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_746", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_767", "Urah ha ha ha...&Behold my TRUE power!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_771", "I can feel it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_772", "Every time you die^1,&your grip on this&world slips away./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_773", "Every time you die^1,&your friends forget&you a little more./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_774", "Your life will end&here^1, in a world&where no one&remembers you.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_779", "Still^1, you're&hanging on...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_780", "That's fine./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_781", "In a few moments^1,&you'll forget&everything^1, too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_782", "That attitude will&serve you well in&your next life!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_787", "Ura ha ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_788", "Still!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_789", "Come on.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_790", "Show me what good&your DETERMINATION&is now!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_796", "Ultimate bepis/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_819", "\\E1Wh..^1.&what did you do...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_820", "\\E3What's this&feeling...^1?&What's happening&to me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_821", "\\E2No^1! NO^1!&I don't need&ANYONE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_826", "\\E6STOP IT^1!&Get away from me!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_827", "Do you hear me!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_828", "\\E2I'll tear you&apart!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_833", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_834", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_835", "\\[C]..^1.&Do you know why&I'm doing this...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_836", "Why I keep fighting&to keep you&around...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_841", "\\E4I'm doing this.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_842", "\\E6Because you're&special^1, \\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_843", "You're the only one&that understands&me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_844", "You're the only one&who's any fun to&play with anymore./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_849", "\\E4.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_850", "No.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_851", "\\E1That's not JUST&it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_852", "I..^1. I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_853", "\\E4I'm doing this&because I care&about you^1, \\[C]!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_854", "\\E4I care about you&more than anybody&else!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_859", "\\E4I'm not ready for&this to end./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_860", "I'm not ready for&you to leave./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_861", "I'm not ready to&say goodbye to&someone like&you again.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_868", "\\E7So, please..^1.&STOP doing this.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_869", "AND JUST LET ME&WIN!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_877", "\\E5.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_878", "\\[C].../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_886", "\\E5I'm so alone^1,&\\[C].../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_894", "\\E5I'm so afraid^1,&\\[C].../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_903", "\\[C]^1, I.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_asrielfinal_911", "I...");
