  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_64", "%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_70", "* Dear Diary^1:&* Shyren's sister \"fell down\"&  recently./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_71", "* It's sad^1.&* Without her sister to&  speak for her.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_72", "* She's become more&  reclusive than ever./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_73", "* So I reached out to her^1,&  and told her.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_74", "* That she^1, Blooky^1, and I&  should all perform together&  sometime./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_75", "* She seemed to like&  that idea./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_80", "* Dearer Diary^1:&* I like to buy a new diary&  for every entry I make./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_81", "* I love to collect diaries./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_85", "* Dearest Diary^1:&* Our cousin left the farm&  to become a training dummy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_86", "* That leaves just Blooky&  and I./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_87", "* Blooky asked me if I was&  going to try to become&  corporeal^1, too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_88", "* They sounded so..^1.&* Resigned.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_89", "* Come on^1, Blooky^1.&* You know I'd never leave&  you behind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_90", "* And besides.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_91", "* I'd never find the kind&  of body I'm looking for^1,&  anyway./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_96", "* My Darling Diary^1:&* I met someone..^1.&* Interesting today./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_97", "* Last week I posted that&  advertisement for my&  Human Fanclub./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_98", "* Today was our first meeting./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_99", "* Only one other person came./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_100", "* Honestly^1, she's a dork^1.&* And she's obsessed with&  these awful cartoons./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_101", "* But she's kind of funny^1,&  too..../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_102", "* I want to see her again./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_107", "* Diary... My dear:&* My diary collection is&  going fabulously./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_108", "* I have like five now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_115", "* Dear Diary^1:&* She surpised me with&  something today./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_116", "* Sketches of a body that&  she wants to create for&  me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_117", "* A form beyond my wildest&  fantasies./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_118", "* In a form like that^1, I&  could finally feel&  like... \"myself.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_119", "* After all^1, there's no&  way I can be a star&  the way I am now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blookdiary_120", "* Sorry^1, Blooky^1.&* My dreams can't wait&  for anyone.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blueattackgen_60", "* You're blue now.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blueattackgen_90", " YOU'RE BLUE NOW./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blueattackgen_91", " THAT'S MY ATTACK!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_blueattackgen_92", " NYEH HEH HEH& HEH HEH HEH& HEH HEH HEH!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_63", "HEY^1, THOSE ARE ALL&THE ATTACKS I USED&ON YOU./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_64", "GREAT MEMORIES^1,&HUH?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_65", "SEEMS LIKE IT&WAS ONLY&YESTERDAY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_66", "\\E3EVEN THOUGH&IT BASICALLY&JUST HAPPENED./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_70", "HEY^1, THOSE ARE ALL&THE ATTACKS I&DIDN'T USE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_71", "\\WHOW LUCKY OF YOU^1!&HAD I ONLY USED&MY \\YSPECIAL ATTACK\\W,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_72", "\\E2YOU SURELY WOULD&HAVE BEEN BLASTED&TO.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_73", "\\WH\\E3EY.^1 WAIT^1.&WHERE'S MY \\YSPECIAL&ATTACK\\W?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_74", "\\E1NO^1! I'VE BEEN&DOGBURGLED BY THAT&PERNICIOUS PUP!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_75", "\\E3THAT LOATHESOME&SCOUNDREL LOVES TO&SNEAK INTO MY ROOM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_76", "\\E5SOMETIMES IT EVEN&CRAWLS INTO MY BED&WHILE I'M RESTING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_77", "\\E3IF THAT WASN'T&BAD ENOUGH^1, IT HAS&VERY COLD FEET./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_81", "* (It's a box of bones.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonebox_85", "* (It's a box of bones.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_bonedrawer_check_84", "%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_80", "* Hey^1! You^1!&* Stop!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_113", "* We've^1, like^1, received an&  anonymous tip about a human&  wearing a striped shirt./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_114", "* They told us they were&  wandering around Hotland&  right now.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_115", "* I know^1, sounds scary^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_116", "* Well^1, just stay chill^1.&* We'll bring you someplace&  safe^1, OK?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_117", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_156", "* ... Huh^1?&* What is it, bro?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_157", "* The shirt they're wearing?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_158", "* ... like^1, what about it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_181", "* Bro.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_182", "* Are you thinkin..^1.&* What I'm thinkin?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_183", "* Bummer^1.&* This is^1, like..^1.&* Mega embarrassing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_boysnightout_184", "* We^1, like^1, actually&  totally have to kill&  you and stuff./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_businessmanticore_70", "* This elevator goes straight&  to the capital^1.&* But it stopped working./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_businessmanticore_71", "* The hotel's doing its best to&  accomodate everybody&  stuck here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_businessmanticore_75", "* Me^1?&* I just like explaining things&  to passersby./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_businessmanticore_80", "* Good news^1!&* The elevator started working&  again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_businessmanticore_81", "* But now it's been so busy^1,&  we still haven't gotten the&  chance to ride it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_businessmanticore_86", "* Mettaton hasn't made a&  performance for more&  than five minutes.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_businessmanticore_87", "* What's happening...^1?&* Can you explain it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_butterflybullet_102", "* Whimsalot doesn't want to&  fight anymore.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_cactus_55", "* Ah^1, the cactus.&* Truly the most tsundere&  of plants./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_cactus_58", "* It's not like this cactus&  was waiting for you to come&  back or anything.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_carbed_63", "THAT'S MY BED!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_carbed_64", "IF I EVER GET&TO THE SURFACE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_carbed_65", "I'D LIKE TO&DRIVE DOWN A&LONG HIGHWAY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_carbed_66", "WIND IN MY&HAIR.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_carbed_67", "SUN ON MY&SKIN.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_carbed_68", "\\E3OF COURSE^1, THAT'S&JUST A DREAM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_carbed_69", "\\E0SO INSTEAD I&CRUISE WHILE I&SNOOZE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_carbed_72", "WHY ARE YOU SO&INTERESTED IN MY&BED?/");
