  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_74", "* I'm visiting Waterfall&  from the city./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_75", "* Synchronicity...^1?&* My neighbor's daughter looks&  about your age./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_76", "\\W* Her name is \"\\YSuzy\\W.^1\"&* I feel like you two should&  be friends./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_77", "* You have..^1.&* A neighbor's blessing!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_81", "* Not knowing where I live&  is no issue^1.&* Fate finds a way./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_82", "* In life's grand scheme^1, she&  might be why you came here&  in the first place.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_93", "* I sense a disturbance in&  the nearby aura.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_94", "* I think you should leave&  that girl alone./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_102", "* So you never met my&  neighbor's daughter./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_103", "* Don't despair^1.&* This world has infinite&  opportunities./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_104", "* But there's a limit to the&  things you can do today^1.&* Accepting this is healthy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_105", "* Take my neighbor's blessing^1!&* And consider this blessing&  for anything you like!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_110", "* I wanted to tell you about&  my neighbor's daughter./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_111", "* But you walked right by me&  before I could tell you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamgirl_112", "* Fate has decided that I&  should not tell you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_73", "* O, k, k, k, k.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_74", "* I was thirsty^1, so I came&  over from Waterfall to get&  a drink!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_78", "* O, k, k.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_79", "* What are you doing with&  all of that water?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_83", "* O, k, k, k, k.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_84", "* So now we have a private pool^1?&* Worse things have happened./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_89", "* O, k, k, k, k.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_90", "* Are you just carrying that&  around to look sophisticated?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_91", "* Cause it's not working./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_98", "* O, k, k, k, k.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_clamguy_99", "* I'll be able to have a nice&  drink on the surface./%%");
