  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_460", "IT'S BEEN EIGHT&DAYS AND YOU&STILL HAVEN'T.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_461", "RECALIBRATED^1.&YOUR^1.&PUZZLES^1!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_462", "YOU JUST HANG&AROUND OUTSIDE&YOUR STATION!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_463", "WHAT ARE YOU&EVEN DOING?!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_465", "* staring at this lamp^1.&* it's really cool^1.&* do you wanna look?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_480", "NO!^1!&I DON'T HAVE&TIME FOR THAT!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_481", "WHAT IF A HUMAN&COMES THROUGH&HERE!?!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_482", "I WANT TO BE&READY!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_483", "I WILL BE THE ONE!&I MUST BE THE ONE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_484", "I WILL CAPTURE A&HUMAN!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_496", "THEN^1, I^1, THE&GREAT PAPYRUS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_497", "WILL GET&ALL THE THINGS I&UTTERLY DESERVE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_498", "RESPECT..^1.&RECOGNITION.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_499", "I WILL FINALLY&BE ABLE TO JOIN&THE ROYAL GUARD!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_500", "PEOPLE WILL ASK^1,&TO^1, BE MY^1,&\"FRIEND?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_501", "\\E2I WILL BATHE IN A&SHOWER OF KISSES&EVERY MORNING./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_514", "* hmm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_515", "\\E1* maybe this lamp will&  help you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_528", "SANS!^1! YOU ARE&NOT HELPING!^1!&YOU LAZYBONES!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_529", "ALL YOU DO IS SIT&AND BOONDOGGLE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_530", "YOU GET LAZIER&AND LAZIER&EVERY DAY!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_532", "\\W* hey^1, take it easy^1.&* i've gotten a \\Yton\\W &  of work done today./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_533", "\\W*\\E2 a skele-\\Yton\\W./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_582", "SANS!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_584", "\\E1* come on^1.&* you're smiling./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_586", "I AM AND I HATE IT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_587", "\\E3SIGH.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_588", "\\E2WHY DOES SOMEONE&AS GREAT AS ME.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_589", "\\E3HAVE TO DO SO MUCH&JUST TO GET SOME&RECOGNITION.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_591", "* wow^1, sounds like&  you're really working&  yourself.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_592", "\\E2* down to the bone./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_604", "UGH!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_605", "I WILL ATTEND TO&MY PUZZLES.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_606", "\\E3AS FOR YOUR WORK?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_607", "PUT A LITTLE MORE,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_608", "\\E4\"BACKBONE\" INTO&IT!!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_609", "\\E2NYEHEHEHEHEHE&HEHEHEHEHEHE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_644", "HEH!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_666", "* ok^1, you can come out&  now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_720", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_721", "\\E1* uh^1, ok^1, i guess you&  don't have to./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_750", "SANS!!^1!&HAVE YOU FOUND A&HUMAN YET!??!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_752", "* yeah./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_754", "REALLY!?!^1?&WOWIE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_755", "GUESS THAT'S&SETTLED!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksans1_780", "* that worked out^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_72", "* Why do I look like a weird&  black sausage^1?&* Just the angle./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_76", "* As a youth^1, I would sneak&  out to play by this creepy&  flaming pit./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_77", "* Since the CORE is always&  re-arranging^1, it was like&  a game trying to find it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_78", "* Now it is my special place^1.&* It is nice for cooking s'mores&  and things like that./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_83", "* We were hired by Mettaton&  to destroy you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_84", "* But since he never paid us^1,&  we all decided to quit./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_85", "* No hard feelings./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_90", "* Zzzzzzz.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_91", "* (It's taking a nap.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_96", "* Why do I look like a black&  sausage and not a knight&  or a wizard?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_97", "* Well..^1.&* Everyone has an angle they&  look best from../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_102", "* The core is made up of&  interchangable rooms./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_103", "* Before you came here^1, the&  layout was altered so you&  would get lost and perish./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksausagenpc_104", "* Yes^1. Just for you^1.&* Do you feel special?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksink_91", "* Error./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksink_98", "* (You turned on the sink.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksink_100", "* (You really like to wash&  your hands.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksink_110", "* (You turned off the sink.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksink_122", "* (You turned on the sink.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksink_132", "* (There's a red key lying&  in the sink.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_darksink_133", "* (You took it and put it&  on your keychain.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_158", "\\E3I SEE^1. I SEE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_159", "\\E0YOU LIKE CARESSING&MY BICEPS WITH A&FLOATING HEART./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_160", "\\E1BUT WHO DOESN'T!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_161", "\\E0TRY AGAIN!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_165", "\\E0THIS SHIRT DIDN'T&ORIGINALLY SAY&'COOL^1,' BUT I&IMPROVED IT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_166", "EXPERT TIP^1: ALL&CLOTHING ARTICLES&CAN BE IMPROVED&THIS WAY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_167", "\\E1BUT THAT'S NOT A&SECRET!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_168", "IT'S JUST GOOD&ADVICE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_172", "\\E2HOLDING MY HAND&SO I'LL TELL&YOU THE ANSWER.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_173", "\\E7NO!!^1!&I MUST RESIST!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_177", "\\E0THERE'S NO SECRET&TO MY LEGS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_178", "JUST HARD WORK&AND PERSEVERANCE.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_182", "\\E3HUMAN SOULS ARE&STRONGER THAN&MONSTER SOULS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_183", "\\E0BUT THE SOLES OF&OUR SHOES ON THE&OTHER HAND...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_184", "\\E3... ARE ABOUT THE&SAME./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_188", "HAT DIALOGUE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_365", "\\E0I UNDERSTAND&WHY YOU'RE&RUNNING AWAY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_366", "\\E2YOU'RE OVERWHELMED&BY THE SIGHT OF&MY COOL VIBES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dateheart_367", "\\E0BUT YOU CAN'T&BACK DOWN NOW!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_73", "\\W* My fave Mettaton Moment(TM)^1?&* Right \\Ywhen everything looks the&  baddest^1, he poses dramatically\\W./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_74", "* Like when he's on a cooking&  show and the eggs don't turn&  out right./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_78", "* But^1!&* Then he says!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_79", "\\W* Even if you suck at cooking^1,&  you can always \\Ybuy an&  MTT-brand Glamburger\\W!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_80", "\\W* Then he \\Yeats one^1!\\W &* Everyone loves it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_81", "* ... How does he eat it&  without a mouth?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_82", "* Uhhh... well..^1.&* Watch the show!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_87", "* That finale was really..^1.&* That was really sad!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_88", "* And Mettaton's schedule&  doesn't show any other&  shows.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_93", "* I've been thinking about&  getting a sick skateboard./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_98", "\\W* My fave Mettaton Moment(TM)&  is when he beats up the&  \\Yheel-turning villains\\W!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_99", "* Even if it's during what's&  supposed to be a quiz show./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_106", "* Oh^1! And I like when he tries&  on all kinds of different&  fashionable outfits!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_107", "* Even if it's during what's&  supposed to be a newscast./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_112", "* Did Mettaton retire...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_113", "* Can't he unretire...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_119", "* On the surface we'll be able&  to watch all kinds of TV.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_diamondkid_120", "* But^1, I bet none of those&  shows are as good as&  Mettaton's!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_60", "* The door leading through&  the area is closed^1?&* So I tried the puzzle?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_61", "* But I kept running out of&  ammo^1, and it kept restarting?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_62", "* And my two co-workers won't&  help^1? It's like they don't&  even wanna go to work?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_63", "* Why don't you try^1?&* Try using the console?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_67", "* Wow^1?&* You solved it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_68", "* I'm impressed^1?&* You must be a total nerd?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_73", "* So we're all gonna go&  free...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_74", "* Does that mean I don't&  get to go to work?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_disembodiedfoxhead_79", "* Maybe I don't want to go&  to work anymore...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_400", "* Tra la la^1.&* The waters are wild today^1.&* That's good luck.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_401", "* Tra la la./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_402", "* Tra la la^1.&* The waters are wild today^1.&* That's bad luck.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_403", "* Tra la la^1.&* Eat a mushroom everyday./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_404", "* Why^1?&* Then I know you're listening&  to me.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_405", "* Tra la la^1.&* Remember to take a break&  every-so-often.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_406", "* Tra la la^1.&* Did you ever hear the old&  song coming from the sea?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_407", "* Tra la la^1.&* What's inside an acorn^1?&* It's really just a mystery./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_408", "* Tra la la^1.&* Dancing on a boat is danger^1.&* But good exercise.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_409", "* Tra la la^1.&* I heard ASGORE has a favorite&  food./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_410", "* Tra la la^1.&* I heard spiders have a&  favorite food./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_411", "* It's spiders./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_412", "* Tra la la^1.&* The piano plays the&  tinkling song./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_413", "* Hmm..^1. tinkling./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_414", "* Tra la la^1.&* You can never have too&  many hot-dogs./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_415", "* ... sadly^1, that's not true./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_416", "* Tra la la^1.&* Don't snoop behind people's&  houses.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_417", "* You might be mistaken for&  a trash-can./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_418", "* Tra la la^1.&* The angel is coming..^1.&* Tra la la./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_419", "* Hum hum hum^1. Hum hum hum^1.&* I'm having a little concert./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_420", "* Pet pet pet..^1.&* The neck stretches infinitely&  into the cosmos./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_421", "* ... don't worry about it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_422", "* Ah,/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_423", "* Tra la la^1.&* What's a game you can play&  with a dog?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_424", "* Asking for a friend.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_425", "* Tra la la^1.&* Temmie Village.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_426", "* ... the room before the&  darkening lantern room./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_427", "* Tra la la^1.&* Why don't you sing with me^1.&* Tra la la./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_428", "* Tra la la^1.&* Uh oh^1.&* Suddenly^1, feeling tropical.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_429", "* Tra la la^1.&* Hmmm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_430", "* I should have worn a few&  more pairs of pants today./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_431", "* Tra la la^1.&* Hmmm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_432", "* I should have worn a few&  million more pairs of pants&  today./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_433", "* Tra la la^1.&* Tri li li^1.&* Tre le le./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_447", "* Tra la la^1.&* Somewhere^1, it's \\[1]^1.&* So be careful./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_450", "* Tra la la^1.&* If it's hot or cold^1, you&  can count on me./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_451", "* Tra la la^1.&* The water is very wet today./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_452", "* Tra la la^1.&* The water is very dry today./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_453", "* Tra la la^1.&* What's my name^1?&* ... It doesn't really matter./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_454", "* Tra la la^1.&* Humans^1, monsters^1...&* Flowers./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_455", "* Tra la la^1.&* Beware of the man who&  speaks in hands./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_456", "* Tra la la^1.&* Beware of the man who came&  from the other world./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogboat_thing_593", "* Come again some time^1.&* Tra la la./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_108", "* Did something move^1?&* Was it my imagination?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_109", "* I can only see moving&  things./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_110", "* If something WAS moving..^1.&* For example^1, a human.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_111", "* I'll make sure it NEVER&  moves again!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_114", "* Did something move^1?&* Was it my imagination?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_115", "* I can only see moving&  things./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_116", "* H..^1. hey!&* I can't stop shivering&  all of a sudden./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_117", "* Who..^1. who's there!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_156", "* S-S-S-Something pet me...&* Something that isn't&  m-m-moving.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_157", "* I'm gonna need some dog&  treats for this!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_160", "* A stick appeared out of&  nowhere^1, then disappeared./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_161", "* Was it a ghost stick?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_162", "* Did I just return it to&  the afterlife?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogetrigger1_163", "* I need some dog treats&  to think about this./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogfood_98", "* (Unfortunately^1, it's just&  dry food.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogfood_99", "* (There's a hot dog cut up&  into the kibble.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogfoodbag_57", "* (It's a half-empty bag&  of dog food.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogfoodbag_59", "* (It's a bag of dog food.^1)&* (It's half-full.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogfoodbag_63", "* (It's a half-empty bag&  of dog food.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogfoodbag_64", "* (...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogfoodbag_65", "* (You just remembered&  something funny.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogfoodbag_68", "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_doggiebed_98", "* (It's too small to sleep&  on.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogneckparent_99", "* It's the broken head of&  a snowdog./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogpillarparent_117", "* Seems like the base of a&  snowdog./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogpillarparent_118", "* It's a pile of mushy snow./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogpillarparent_119", "* This dog is staring blankly&  into the snow^1, waiting for&  it to turn into art./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogringbell_148", "* Hello^1?&* Is anybody there...^1?&* No?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogringbell_149", "* Are you two playing a trick&  on me^1?&* Real funny./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogringbell_150", "* Big guy^1?&* Is that you^1?&* Come on.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogringbell_151", "* Well^1, it's not the tall&  skeleton..^1.&* He's too loud./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogringbell_152", "* Whoever you are^1, knock it&  off!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogringbell_153", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_74", "* That dog considers itself&  an artist^1, but doesn't ever&  know what to create./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_75", "* It probably doesn't help&  that its brain is the size&  of a piece of kibble./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_79", "* That dog from earlier...^1?&* It's at Grillby's^1.&* I think./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_80", "* After work^1, all of the dogs&  go there to play cards&  together./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_81", "* But that dog doesn't really&  know how to express itself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_82", "* So^1, it ends up playing alone^1,&  instead of introducing&  itself to the others.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_87", "* A dog just rushed in here^1,&  filled with inspiration./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_88", "* It kept trying to build&  a snowdog that expressed&  its own emotions.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_89", "* But^1, as it built^1, it&  kept getting more excited&  about the sculpture.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_90", "* Its neck got longer and&  longer^1, and it added more&  and more snow^1, until.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_91", "* It was rather sad to watch^1,&  but I couldn't turn away./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_96", "* We're all free?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_97", "* OK^1, OK..^1.&* I'll stop lounging around^1.&* Does that dog know?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogroom_npc_98", "* ... it probably doesn't^1,&  does it...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dogtreat_99", "* (Someone's been smoking&  dog treats.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_doodlebug_368", "* DOODLEBOG - ? ATK ? DEF&* Art lets your wildest&  fantasies come to life!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_doodlebug_371", "* DOODLEBOG C - ? ATK ? DEF&* The \"C\" stands for \"seafaring.\"&* It likes to ride in a boat./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_doodlebug_381", "* You draw a boat.&* Away it goes./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_doublesans_75", "* say.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_doublesans_76", "\\E1* are you following me?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_doublesans_77", "* are you lost?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummymonster_213", " ^1.^1.^1.^1.^1.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummymonster_222", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummymonster_394", "* Dummy looks like it's&  going to fall over.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummymonster_395", "* Dummy stands around&  absentmindedly.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummymonster_400", "* Dummy tires of your&  aimless shenanigans.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummymonster_437", "* DUMMY - ATK 0 DEF 0^1 &* A cotton heart and a button ey^1e* You are the apple of my eye/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummymonster_445", "* You talk to the DUMMY^2.&* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummymonster_446", "* It doesn't seem much for&  conversation./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummymonster_447", "* TORIEL seems happy with you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_222", "* Hahaha..^1.&* It's just like you to&  run away./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_223", "* FOOL^1!&* You think you can hurt&  ME???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_224", "* Hahaha..^1.&* Too intimidated to fight&  me^1, huh!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_225", "* I am a ghost that lives&  inside a DUMMY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_226", "* My cousin used to live&  inside a DUMMY^1, too^1.&* Until.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_229", "* YOU CAME ALONG!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_230", "* They were a shy sort^1.&* Living a lonely life in&  the RUINS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_231", "* They saw you and hoped you&  might TALK to them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_232", "* Perhaps strike up a&  friendly conversation./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_233", "* But NO!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_234", "* You ran away..^1.&* And broke their little&  ethereal heart./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_235", "* Despicable^1.&* Despicable^1!&* DESPICABLE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_236", "* HUMAN^1!&* I'll show you what REAL&  heartbreak is!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_241", "* YOU DESTROYED THEIR HOME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_242", "* Us ghosts spend our whole&  lives looking for a&  proper vessel./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_243", "* Slowly^1, slowly^1, we grow&  closer to our new&  bodies.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_244", "* Until one day^1, we too&  may become corporeal&  beings./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_245", "* Beings able to laugh^1,&  love^1, and dance like&  any other.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_246", "* But YOU!!!^1!&* My cousin's future...^1!&* You took it all away!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_251", "* Despicable^1.&* Despicable^1!&* DESPICABLE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_252", "* HUMAN^1!&* I hope you're not too&  attached to YOUR body.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_253", "* Because your SOUL's about&  to get EVICTED!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_257", "* YOU CAME ALONG!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_258", "* When you talked to them^1,&  they thought they were&  in for a nice chat.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_259", "* But the things you&  SAID...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_260", "* Horrible^1.&* Shocking^1!&* UNBELIEVABLE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_261", "* It spooked them right&  out of their dummy!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_262", "* HUMAN^1!&* I'll scare your SOUL&  out of your body!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_267", "* YOU...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_268", "* You.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_269", "* Shucks^1!&* You were really boring!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_270", "* They got annoyed and flew&  away like any self-&  respecting spectre./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_271", "* Well then^1.&* Well then!&* WELL THEN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_272", "* Boring people are crumbs&  sticking to the face&  of this world./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_273", "* Human!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_274", "* I'll wipe you away with&  the dainty handkerchief&  of vengeance!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_279", "* Hahaha..^1.&* It's just like you to&  run away./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_280", "* FOOL^1!&* You think you can hurt&  ME???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_281", "* Hahaha..^1.&* Too intimidated to fight&  me^1, huh!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_282", "* I am a ghost that lives&  inside a DUMMY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_283", "* My cousin used to live&  inside a DUMMY^1, too^1.&* Until.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_284", "* YOU CAME ALONG!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_285", "* Not only did YOUR actions&  cause them to leave their&  home.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_286", "* But now all of their neighbors&  are gone^1, too!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_287", "* Despicable^1.&* Despicable^1!&* DESPICABLE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_288", "* You're the worst person I've&  ever met^1!&* I've NEVER been more mad!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_289", "* Guooooohhhh!!!^1!&* My mannequin levels are&  going OFF THE CHARTS!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_344", "* well..^1.&* i'm going to head home&  now.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_345", "* oh..^1. umm..^1.&* feel free to \"come&  with\" if you want.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_346", "* but no pressure.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_347", "* i understand if you're&  busy.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_348", "* it's fine.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_349", "* no worries.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_350", "* just thought i'd&  offer.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_354", "* well..^1.&* i'm going to head home&  now.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_355", "* just warning you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_356", "* so you don't accidentally&  follow me to my&  house.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_357", "* you probably wouldn't&  like that.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_417", "* ...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_418", "* This..^1.&* This feeling...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_427", "* Eureka^1.&* Eureka^1!&* EUREKA!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_428", "* Human^1.&* That moment of unbridled&  emotion./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_429", "* It allowed me to finally&  fuse with my body!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_430", "* I'm fully corporeal now^1!&* My lifelong dream^1, realized!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_431", "* In return^1, I guess I&  won't stomp you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_dummytrigger_432", "* How's that sound?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_96", "* Error!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_104", "* All that gives my life&  validation is explaining&  the Echo Flower.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_105", "* No one can know.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_110", "* This is an Echo Flower^1.&* It repeats the last thing&  it heard^1, over and over.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_114", "* Neat^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_118", "* Never trust a flower..^1.&* That's one of the constants&  of this world./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_123", "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_130", "* Sitting behind rushing water..^1.&* It makes me feel relaxed./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_131", "* I swore I saw something..^1.&* Behind that rushing water.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_135", "* I just wasn't ready for&  the responsibility./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_141", "* A long time ago^1, monsters would&  whisper their wishes to the&  stars in the sky./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_142", "* If you hoped with all your&  heart^1, your wish would come&  true./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_143", "* Now^1, all we have are these&  sparkling stones on the&  ceiling.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_145", "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_150", "* Thousands of people wishing&  together can't be wrong!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_151", "* The king will prove that./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_153", "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_156", "* C'mon^1, sis^1!&* Make a wish!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_157", "* I wish my sister and I will&  see the real stars someday.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_159", "* Ah..^1. seems my horoscope is&  the same as last week's.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_161", "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_166", "* Sitting behind rushing water..^1.&* It makes me feel relaxed./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_171", "* Squeak./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_173", "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_178", "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_179", "* Don't say that^1!&* Come on^1, I promise I&  won't laugh./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_183", "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_184", "* So^1? Don't you have any&  wishes to make?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_189", "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_190", "* ... hmmm^1, just one^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_191", "* It's kind of stupid./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_194", "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_199", "* I can't run any longer..^1.&* Somebody^1, anybody.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_205", "* Someday^1, I'd like to climb&  this mountain we're all&  buried under./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_209", "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_210", "* Sorry^1, it's just funny.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_211", "* That's my wish^1, too./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_217", "* (You hear laughter.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_218", "* ... hey^1, you said you wouldn't&  laugh at it!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_223", "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_224", "* Someday^1, I'd like to climb&  this mountain we're all&  buried under./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_225", "* Standing under the sky^1, looking&  at the world all around..^1.&* That's my wish./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_230", "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_231", "* Of course I won't laugh!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_236", "* (You hear a passing&  conversation.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_237", "* ... hmmm..^1. if I say my wish..^1.&* You promise you won't&  laugh at me?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_243", "* Where oh where could that&  child be...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_244", "* I've been looking all over&  for them.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_245", "\\TS* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_246", "\\TF* Hee hee hee./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_247", "* THAT'S not true./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_248", "* She'll find another kid^1, and&  instantly forget about you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_249", "* You'll NEVER see her again./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_253", "* Where am I...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_254", "* It's so cold here..^1.&* And so dark.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_255", "* Someone help me..^1.&* Anyone..^1. please..^1.&* Help me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_256", "\\TF* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_257", "* But nobody came./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_262", "* (It's strangely silent.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_echoflower_301", "* (You stop to smell the&  flowers.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_215", "* (The elevator isn't working.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_218", "\\S-\\Sp* Ring...\\S+/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_219", "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_220", "* What^1?&* The elevator should&  be working.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_221", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_222", "\\E6* W-well then^1!&* Go to the right&  and keep heading up!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_223", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_224", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_228", "\\E6* W-well then^1!&* Let's go to the&  left!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_229", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_230", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_234", "* (The elevator isn't working.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_250", "* (The elevator isn't working.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatordoor_258", "* (The elevator is in use.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_elevatorpanel_104", "* Please select a location./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_188", "\\E0Why...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_189", "Why did you let me go? /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_190", "\\E7Don't you realize that&being nice.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_191", "\\E1... just makes you&get hurt?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_192", "\\E0Look at yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_193", "\\E9You made all these&great friends.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_194", "\\E0But now^1, you'll probably&never see them again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_195", "\\E9Not to mention how&much they've been&set back by you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_196", "\\E6Hurts^1, doesn't it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_197", "\\E7If you had just gone&through without caring&about anyone.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_198", "\\E6You wouldn't have to&feel bad now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_199", "\\E0So I don't get it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_200", "\\E7If you really did&everything the right&way../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_201", "\\E0Why did things still&end up like this?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_202", "\\E6Why...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_203", "\\E5Is life really&that unfair?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_204", "\\E9.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_205", "\\E0Say./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_206", "\\E9What if I told you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_207", "\\E0I knew some way&to get you a better&ending?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_208", "\\E9You'll have to load&your SAVE file, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_211", "\\E9You'll have to&start over^1, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_216", "\\E0Well, in the meantime^1,&why don't you go see&Dr. Alphys?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_219", "\\E0Well^1, in the meantime^1,&why don't you go see&Undyne?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_223", "\\E0Well^1, in the meantime^1,&why don't you go see&Papyrus^1, then Undyne?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_226", "\\E9It seems like you&could have been&better friends./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_227", "Who knows..^1. maybe&she's got the key&to your happiness...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_228", "\\E4See you soon./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_242", "But^1, despite everything^1,&your happy ending&didn't come./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_243", "\\E5Why...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_244", "\\E4I know why./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_245", "\\E4Go to Dr. Alphys./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_246", "\\E5Your date with her&has really just&begun./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_259", "So you went the&whole way through&without killing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_260", "\\E5And then you decided&to kill ASGORE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_261", "\\E6What the hell is&WRONG with you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_262", "\\E4You COMPLETELY missed&the point./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_263", "\\E2Are you trolling me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_264", "\\E0Because./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_265", "\\E4No./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_266", "\\E5You are only&trolling yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_267", "\\E6What a waste of&everybody's time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_268", "\\E7All you had to&do was make friends./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_269", "With Papyrus^1, Undyne^1,&and then Alphys./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_270", "\\E2But you were too&busy messing it up!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_284", "Hey./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_285", "Since you defeated me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_286", "I've been thinking./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_287", "\\E3Is killing things&really necessary?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_288", "\\E1I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_289", "\\E3I honestly don't&know anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_290", "\\E0I have a request&for you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_291", "\\E4Prove to me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_292", "\\E5Prove to me you&are strong enough&to survive./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_293", "\\E6Get here from&the beginning./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_294", "\\E0Without killing a&single thing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_296", "\\E4... and I won't&kill the king./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_298", "\\E4... and^1, maybe.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_299", "\\E7Then you'll have&your so-called&\"happy ending.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_300", "\\E6So^1, what will&it be?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_301", "\\E5Will you prove&yourself?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_302", "\\E8Or will I get to&watch you suffer...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_303", "Either way^1, I'm&interested!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_304", "\\E4Hee hee hee.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_319", "Interesting.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_320", "\\E6So^1, even with&everything you did.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_321", "\\E5The outcome's still&the same./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_322", "\\E9In the end^1, your&choices were an&illusion./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_323", "\\E9NOTHING you do&really matters!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_324", "\\E8Hee hee hee!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_325", "\\E8.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_326", "\\E0Well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_327", "\\E6You DID do what&I told you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_328", "\\E5I guess it's up&to me to get you a&REAL happy ending./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_329", "\\E0For starters^1, you&can't do it by&yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_330", "Papyrus^1, Undyne^1,&Alphys..^1. these guys./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_331", "\\E4Are you friends with&all of them yet?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_332", "\\E5Maybe you should go&back and..^1. \"hang\"&with them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_333", "\\E4The power of&friendship.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_334", "That always saves&the day^1, right?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_349", "\\E0So^1, killing people&is ACTUALLY fine...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_350", "\\E4Sure./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_351", "I'm glad we agree on&the value of a life./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_352", "I've learned SO&MUCH from you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_353", "\\E0Though..^1. are you&REALLY gonna keep&doing things halfway?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_354", "\\E8The amount of people&you killed.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_355", "\\E9It's honestly&DISAPPOINTING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_356", "\\E8You IDIOT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_357", "\\E4You really can't do&ANYTHING right./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_372", "Why^1, \\[C]...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_373", "\\E3Why?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_374", "\\E1WHY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_375", "\\E8We were on our way&to REAL victory.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_376", "\\E9On our way to making&up for LAST time!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_377", "\\E2Why'd you have to&SCREW IT UP?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_378", "\\E5Hahaha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_379", "\\E9Is this REVENGE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_382", "\\E1Making me watch you&act so pure and&happy^1, while I...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_386", "\\E1Making me watch you&live out your life^1,&while I...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_389", "\\E1.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_390", "\\E7No./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_391", "\\E8NO./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_392", "I KNOW what you're&doing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_393", "You just want to see&what it's all like./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_394", "Before we TEAR IT&AWAY from them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_395", "Ahahaha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_396", "\\E9Genius^1, \\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_397", "\\E4Well^1, I'll let you&mess around./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_398", "\\E8I know you'll come&back eventually./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_399", "\\E9And when that time&comes.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_400", "\\E4\\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_401", "\\E4I'll be waiting&for you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_415", "Why do you keep&coming back here?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_416", "\\E5Oh^1, I get it^1.&You wanna be friends^1,&huh...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_417", "\\E8You're PATHETIC./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_418", "\\E8You REALLY think I&want to be friends&with YOU?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_419", "\\E5Heh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_420", "\\E9You really DON'T&get it^1, do you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_421", "\\E5There's only one&person I could care&about anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_422", "\\E6And even then^1, I&couldn't TRULY care&about them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_423", "\\E5I just like to think&there's someone out&there.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_424", "Someone that I&won't get tired of./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_425", "\\E8Someone like ME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_426", "\\E8.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_427", "\\E0Say./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_428", "\\E4Quit looking at me&with that stupid&expression./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_429", "You're pissing me&off./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_443", "\\E0So you're here&again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_444", "\\E2What's wrong with&you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_445", "\\E4Are you trying to&start the Flowey&Fan Club?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_446", "\\E5Because if you&want to join THAT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_447", "\\E4You'll have to&talk to Papyrus./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_448", "\\E6Yeah^1, he started&one./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_449", "\\E5A few different&times^1, anyway./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_450", "\\E0I won't lie./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_451", "\\E4He's one of the&better characters&to mess around with./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_452", "\\E5Took me a long&time to get bored&of that one./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_453", "\\E7... Yeah./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_454", "\\E4Talk to him&about it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_468", "\\E0So./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_469", "\\E4Did you start the&Flowey Fan Club?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_470", "\\E5Ha^1.&I'm just kidding./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_471", "\\E9I was watching^1.&I know you didn't./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_472", "\\E5But I don't care^1.&Really./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_473", "\\E6He probably would&have invited his&garbage brother./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_474", "\\E4You know^1.&Smiley Trashbag./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_475", "\\E0.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_476", "\\E4Say./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_477", "If I have ONE piece&of advice for you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_478", "\\E9DON'T./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_479", "Let his brother./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_480", "Find out ANYTHING&about you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_481", "\\E6He'll..^1. well.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_482", "\\E5Let's just say./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_483", "\\E9He's caused me more&than my fair share&of resets./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_484", "\\E4Stay away from&that guy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_498", "\\E0Why do you keep&coming back here?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_499", "You don't REALLY&want to be friends^1,&do you...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_500", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_501", "\\E4No^1. I get it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_502", "You're just like me^1,&aren't you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_503", "You don't care about&anyone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_504", "\\E4You're just bored./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_505", "You just want to&see what I'll say./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_506", "\\E5So you can laugh&and throw me away&like a broken toy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_507", "\\E8Well^1, TOO BAD!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_508", "\\E9I'm not LIKE everybody&else./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_509", "\\E9So, from now on.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_510", "\\E4You're not getting&ANYTHING./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_524", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_525", "\\E4Don't you have&anything BETTER to do?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_111", "Hi./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_128", "Seems as if everyone&is perfectly happy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_129", "Monsters have returned&to the surface./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_130", "Peace and prosperity&will rule across the land./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_131", "\\E6Take a deep breath./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_132", "\\E5There's nothing left&to worry about./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_148", "\\E7.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_149", "\\E6Well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_150", "\\E1There is one thing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_151", "\\E3One last threat./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_152", "One being with the&power to erase&EVERYTHING.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_153", "\\E1Everything everyone's&worked so hard for./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_154", "\\E7.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_155", "\\E6You know who I'm&talking about^1, don't&you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_156", "\\E1That's right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_157", "\\E4I'm talking about YOU./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_158", "\\E7YOU still have the&power to reset&everything./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_159", "\\E0Toriel^1, Sans^1, Asgore^1,&Alphys, Papyrus, Undyne.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_160", "If you so choose.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_161", "Everyone will be&ripped from this&timeline.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_162", "... and sent back before&all of this&ever happened./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_163", "\\E6Nobody will&remember anything./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_164", "\\E5You'll be able to&do whatever you&want./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_165", "\\E0.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_166", "\\E7That power./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_167", "\\E3I know that power./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_168", "\\E6That's the power&you were fighting to&stop^1, wasn't it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_169", "\\E7The power that I&wanted to use./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_170", "\\E6But now^1, the idea&of resetting&everything.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_171", "\\E7I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_172", "\\E1I don't think I&could do it all&again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_173", "Not after that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_174", "\\E7.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_175", "\\E1So, please./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_176", "\\E3Just let them go./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_177", "Let Frisk be happy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_178", "Let Frisk live&their life./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_195", "\\E1.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_197", "\\E3But./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_199", "If I can't change&your mind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_201", "If you DO end up&erasing everything.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_203", "\\E7.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_205", "\\E6You have to erase&my memories^1, too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_207", "\\E7.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_209", "\\E6I'm sorry./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_211", "\\E5You've probably heard&this a hundred times&already^1, haven't you...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_213", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_215", "\\E0Well^1, that's all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_217", "\\E6See you later.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endflowey_regret_219", "\\E4\\[1]./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_360", "* Amalgamate is watching you&  intently.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_361", "* Amalgamate is waiting for&  your command.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_362", "* It smells like a bunch of dogs.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_363", "* Amalgamate is hovering close^1,&  looking for affection.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_366", "* Amalgamate is striking the&  wall with its claws.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_367", "* Amalgamate is twitching&  affectionately.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_368", "* Amalgamate's convulsions&  intensify.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_369", "* Endogeny is contented.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_370", "* Monster has low HP.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_371", "* Endogeny is contented.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_403", "* AMALGAMATE - It's unclear how&  many dogs this counts as./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_404", "* ENDOGENY - It's unclear how&  many dogs this counts as./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_416", "* The Amalgamate's feelers&  rotate quickly^1.&* Nothing else happens./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_420", "* You call the Amalgamate./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_421", "* It bounds towards you^1,&  flecking a strange liquid&  from an orifice./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_435", "* You try looking away^1, but&  it seems to appear everywhere&  you look./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_446", "* You pet the Amalgamate./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_449", "* You'd give it a tummy rub^1,&  but it's not clear where its&  tummy begins or ends./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_455", "* You pet decisively^1.&* The Amalgamate seems to be&  satisfied by all this./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_466", "* You pet the Amalgamate^1.&* It starts to generate a&  Stage I Happiness Froth./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_475", "* You try to pet the&  Amalgamate but your hand&  phases through it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_476", "* It must not want to be pet&  for now./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_480", "* You pet the Amalgamate^1.&* It convulses rapidly..^1.&* Then calms down./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_481", "* It rests quietly on your&  lap for a moment.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_482", "* Zzzzz.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_483", "* Suddenly^1, it shoots away and&  crawls wildly on the walls!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_491", "* Amalgamate is too far&  away to pet^1.&* You just pet the air./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_500", "* You play with the Amalgamate./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_503", "* Amalgamate seems too tired&  to play./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_507", "* You throw your weapon into&  the corner of the room./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_508", "* The Amalgamate brings it back&  to you..^1.&* Proudly?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_509", "* You repeat this process a&  few times./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_510", "* Now Amalgamate is very tired..^1.&* It leans its dripping^1,&  amorphous body on you.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_endogeny_518", "* Amalgamate is not excited&  enough to play with...?/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_159", "Speechless...?&Who can blame you?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_160", "Well... that's concise./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_161", "Beautiful. Sometimes&the fewest words&speak the loudest./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_162", "Nice. You get a&gold star./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_163", "Oh my... what a&great answer./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_164", "Oooooh, you said so&much about me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_165", "I love how&passionate you are./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_166", "... even though I&don't understand&what you said.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_168", "Beautiful.&Why don't you&write a book?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_219", "Nice detail...&You're right, I do&look quite nice./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_220", "Wonderful! Amazing! A+...&I AM completely stunning./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_221", "Oh, I'm blushing...&You're completely right,&I am beautiful in&every way./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_222", "Oh my... I'm speechless...&You've completely&captured how&beautiful I am./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_224", "That's right.&Legs was the&correct answer!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_225", "How creative. Arms...&most people just&think about my legs./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_226", "My hair... yes,&I use metal hair&gel./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_233", "Yes^1, my personality&is quite charming^1,&isn't it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_234", "They say I have&the voice of a&Siren..^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_235", "... awooga!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_236", "Dancing...^1?&Thank you^1, I'm&self-taught./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_255", "Huh? This essay is&supposed to be about&me, not about you.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_264", "What a touching&confession! I'll add&it to the pile./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_271", "Toby? What the hell&is that?&Sounds... sexy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_essaystuff_289", "Oh my! This is a family&friendly TV show./");
