  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_122", "\\E1* Hello..^1.&* Are you all right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_123", "* You must be so lost&  and confused.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_124", "\\E2* Ah, do not be&  afraid^1, my child./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_125", "\\W* I am \\BTORIEL\\W,&  caretaker of the&  \\RRUINS\\W./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_126", "* I pass through here&  every day to see if&  anyone has fallen down./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_127", "* You are the first&  human to come here&  in a long time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_128", "* I will do my best&  to protect you during&  your time here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_129", "* Come^1!&* I shall guide you&  through the catacombs./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_316", "\\W* Howdy^2!&* I'm\\Y FLOWEY\\W.^2 &* \\YFLOWEY\\W the \\YFLOWER\\W!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_317", "* Hee hee hee.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_318", "* Why'd you make me&  introduce myself?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_319", "* It's rude to act&  like you don't&  know who I am./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_320", "* Someone ought to teach&  you proper manners./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_321", "* I guess little old me&  will have to do./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_322", "* Ready^2?&* Here we go!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_327", "* Don't you have anything&  better to do?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_338", "* Error/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_342", "* Really^1, \\[C]?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_343", "\\E5* Well^1, do what you&  will./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_344", "\\E4* I'll be waiting for&  you!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_348", "\\E0* Hey^1.&* Remember./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_349", "\\E2* DON'T kill anyone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_350", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_351", "\\E1* I can't believe this&  is a REAL thing I&  have to remind you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_352", "\\E0* Hee hee hee.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_353", "* Good luck!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_357", "* Remember.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_358", "\\E1* THIS time^1, you've&  GOT to become friends&  with everyone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_359", "\\E2* OK?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_360", "\\E5* If you DON'T^1, you'll&  be miserable FOREVER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_361", "\\E1* And we wouldn't want&  THAT^1, would we?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_362", "\\E0* No..^1.&* We just want you&  to be happy^1, right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger_363", "* Good luck. /%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_158", "* Error/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_162", "* Hee hee hee.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_163", "\\E2* I hope you like your&  choice./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_164", "* After all^1, it's not&  as if you can go&  back and change fate./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_165", "\\E0* In this world^1, it's kill&  or be killed./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_166", "\\E2* That old hag thought&  she could break the&  rules./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_167", "\\E1* She tried so hard&  to save you humans./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_168", "\\E0* But when it came&  down to it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_169", "\\TF*\\E5 Hee hee.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_170", "\\E4* SHE COULDN'T EVEN&  SAVE HERSELF./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_171", "* WHAT AN IDIOT!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_175", "\\E2* Heheheheh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_176", "* You just can't&  get enough^1, can you!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_177", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_178", "\\E6* How many more&  times will you&  kill her?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_179", "* Ha ha ha ha ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_180", "\\E4*\\TF You disgusting animal./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_181", "* You didn't even&  TRY to spare her./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_186", "* Wow^1, you really&  can't get enough./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_187", "\\E5* You kind of remind&  me of myself./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_195", "* Wow^1, you're utterly&  repulsive./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_196", "\\E6* You spared her life.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_197", "* Then you decided that&  just wasn't interesting&  enough for you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_198", "\\E7* So you murdered her&  just to see what&  would happen./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_199", "\\E5* You killed her out&  of boredom./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_200", "* Truly disgusting.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_203", "* Hee hee.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_204", "\\E4* You naive idiot./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_205", "* Do you think you&  are the only one&  with that power?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_206", "\\E4* The power to reshape&  the world.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_207", "* Purely by your&  own determination./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_208", "* The ability to&  play God!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_209", "* The ability to \"SAVE.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_210", "\\E0* I thought I was&  the only one with&  that power^1. But.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_211", "\\E1* I can't SAVE anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_212", "* Apparently YOUR&  desires for this&  world override MINE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_213", "\\E5* Well well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_214", "* Enjoy that power&  while you can./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_215", "\\E4* I'll be watching./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_226", "* Hahaha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_227", "\\E1* You're not really human^1,&  are you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_228", "\\E1* No.^2 You're empty inside^2.&* \\E4Just like me^1.&* In fact.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_229", "\\E8* You're \\[C],^1 right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_230", "\\E0* We're still inseparable^1,&  after all these years.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_231", "* Listen^1.&* I have a plan to become&  all powerful./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_232", "\\E2* Even more powerful than&  you and your stolen&  soul./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_233", "\\E4* Let's destroy everything&  in this wretched world./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_234", "\\E6* Everyone^1, everything in&  these \\E7worthless&  memories.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_235", "\\E5* Let's turn 'em all&  to dust./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_245", "* Clever.&* Verrrryyy clever./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_246", "* You think you're really&  smart^1, don't you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_247", "\\E0* In this world^1, it's kill&  or be killed./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_248", "\\E1* So you were able to&  play by your own&  rules./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_249", "*\\E4 You spared the life&  of a single person./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_250", "* Hee hee hee.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_253", "* Froggit^1, Whimsun^1.&* Vegetoid^1, Loox^1.&* Migosp^1, Moldsmal./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_254", "* Think about those names./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_255", "* Do you think any of&  those monsters have&  families?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_256", "* Do you think any of&  them have friends?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_257", "\\E6* Each one could have&  been someone else's&  Toriel./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_258", "\\E7* Selfish brat./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_259", "* Somebody is dead&  because of you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_264", "\\E2* I bet you feel&  really great./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_265", "* You didn't kill&  anybody this time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_266", "\\E0* But what will you&  do if you meet a&  relentless killer?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_267", "* You'll die and you'll&  die and you'll&  die./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_268", "\\E1* Until you tire of&  trying./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_269", "\\E0* What will you do&  then?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_270", "\\E5* Will you kill&  out of frustration?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_271", "* Or will you give&  up entirely on&  this world.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_272", "\\E4* ... and let ME inherit&  the power to control&  it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_273", "\\E5* I am the prince of&  this world's future./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_274", "* Don't worry^1, my little&  monarch^1, my plan&  isn't regicide./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_275", "* This is SO much&  more interesting./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_283", "* But don't act so&  cocky./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_284", "* I know what you did./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_285", "\\E6* You murdered her./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_286", "\\E7* And then you went&  back^1, because you&  regretted it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_287", "* Ha ha ha ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_288", "\\E5* You naive idiot./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_289", "* Do you think you&  are the only one&  with that power?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_290", "\\E4* The power to reshape&  the world.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_291", "* Purely by your&  own determination./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_292", "* The ability to&  play God!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_293", "* The ability to \"SAVE.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_294", "\\E0* I thought I was&  the only one with&  that power^1. But.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_295", "\\E1* I can't SAVE anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_296", "* Apparently YOUR&  desires for this&  world override MINE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_297", "\\E5* Well well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_298", "* Enjoy that power&  while you can./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_floweytrigger2_299", "\\E4* I'll be watching./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_forcedright_142", "* What's that smell^1?&* (Where's that smell?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_forcedright_143", "* If you're a smell^1...&* (... identify yoursmellf!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_forcedright_175", "* Hmmm..^1.&* Here's that weird smell.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_forcedright_176", "* It makes me want to&  eliminate./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_forcedright_177", "* (... Eliminate YOU!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_forcedright_220", "* Dogs can pet other dogs??^1?&* (A new world has opened&  up for us...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_forcedright_221", "* Thanks^1, weird puppy!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_forcedright_224", "* Weird smells can bring&  good things..^1.&* (Friendly fun fetch!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_forcedright_225", "* Thanks^1, weird smell^1!&* (It sure was fun to&  \"stick\" together!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_115", "  Frisk!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_116", "  This is all just&  a bad dream...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_117", "  Please^1, wake up...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_181", "* Oh^1!&* You are awake^1!&* Thank goodness!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_183", "* W-we were so&  worried...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_184", "* It felt like you&  were out forever!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_186", "* Yeah^1! Any longer and&  I would have freaked&  out!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_187", "\\E2* Tell us next time&  you decide to take&  a nap^1, okay!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_189", "* yeah^1.&* you made papyrus cry&  like a baby./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_191", "WHAT!^1!&I DIDN'T CRY!!^1!&I DON'T CRY!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_192", "\\E3I JUST..^1.&CAUGHT SOMETHING&IN MY EYE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_194", "* what did you catch?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_196", "TEARS!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_198", "* Now^1, now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_199", "* The important part&  is that Frisk is&  all right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_200", "* Here^1, Frisk^1.&* Why not drink some&  tea?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_201", "* It'll make you feel&  better./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_203", "* Errr..^1.&* How about we give&  them space^1, first?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_204", "\\E2* They must be very&  exhausted./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_205", "\\E8* Though^1, from what^1,&  I am not certain./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_206", "\\E1* Frisk..^1.&* We do not remember&  exactly what happened./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_207", "\\E1* There was a flower..^1.&* And then^1, everything&  went white./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_208", "\\E0* But now the barrier&  is gone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_209", "* When you are ready^1,&  we will all return&  to the surface./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_210", "* It seems the door to&  the east will lead&  us there now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_211", "\\E2* But before then.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_212", "\\E0* Perhaps you might&  want to take a&  walk?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_213", "* You can say goodbye&  to all of your&  wonderful friends./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendc_event_214", "* Do as you wish^1.&* We will all wait&  for you here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_182", "\\E4What a miserable&creature^1, torturing&such a poor^1,&innocent, youth.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_183", "\\E0Do not be afraid^1,&my child./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_184", "\\E0It is I^1, TORIEL^1,&your friend and&guardian./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_185", "\\E1At first^1, I thought&I would let you&make your journey&alone.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_186", "\\E4But I could not&stop worrying about&you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_187", "\\E4Your adventure must&have been so&treacherous./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_188", "\\E2... and ultimately^1,&it would burden you&with a horrible&choice./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_189", "To leave this place^1,&you would have to&take the life of&another person./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_190", "\\E2You would have to&defeat ASGORE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_191", "\\E4However..^1.&I realized.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_192", "\\E1I cannot allow that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_193", "It is not right to&sacrifice someone&simply to let&someone leave here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_194", "\\E4Is that not what&I have been trying to&prevent this&whole time?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_195", "\\E1So^1, for now^1, let&us suspend this&battle./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_196", "\\E4As terrible as&ASGORE is.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_197", "\\E0He deserves mercy^1,&too./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_226", "Tori..^1.&You&came&back...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_236", "\\E5Do not \"Tori\" me^1,&Dreemurr!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_237", "\\E2You pathetic whelp./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_238", "If you really wanted&to free our kind.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_239", "You could have gone&through the barrier&after you got ONE&SOUL.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_240", "... taken six SOULs&from the humans^1, then&come back and freed&everyone peacefully./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_241", "\\E5But instead^1, you made&everyone live in&despair.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_242", "Because you would&rather wait here^1,&meekly hoping another&human never comes./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_271", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_272", "... Tori.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_273", "You're right.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_274", "I am a miserable&creature.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_275", "... but^1, do you think&we can at least be&friends again?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_301", "(Sigh.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_302", "NO^1,&Asgore./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_353", "Ngahhhhhh!!^1!&ASGORE^1! Human!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_354", "Nobody fight each&other!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_355", "Everyone's gonna&make friends^1, or&else I'll...!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_356", "I'll.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_357", ".../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_376", "Hello^1.&I am&TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_377", "Are you&the&human's&friend?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_378", "It is&nice to&meet&you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_388", "Uh^1,&yeah...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_389", "Nice to&meet&you!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_413", "Hey&ASGORE^1,&is that&your ex?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_414", "Jeez^1.&That's&rough^1,&buddy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_450", "H-hey^1!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_451", "Nobody&hurt&each&other!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_452", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_453", ".../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_477", "Oh^1!&Are you&another&friend?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_478", "I am&TORIEL^1.&Hello!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_487", "Uh^1,&h-h-hi!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_488", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_489", "(THERE'S&TWO OF&THEM???)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_546", "HEY^1!&NOBODY FIGHT&ANYONE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_547", "IF ANYONE FIGHTS&ANYONE...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_548", "THEN I'LL!!^1!&BE FORCED!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_549", "TO ASK UNDYNE&FOR HELP!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_572", "Hello!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_582", "OH^1!&HELLO^1, YOUR&MAJESTY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_583", "PSST^1!&HEY^1, HUMAN.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_584", "DID ASGORE&SHAVE...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_585", "AND..^1.&CLONE HIMSELF????/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_631", "hey&guys..^1.&what's&up?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_644", "That&voice&...!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_678", "Hello^1,&I think&we&may.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_679", "Know&each&other?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_691", "oh hey..^1.&i recognize your&voice^1, too./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_705", "I am&TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_706", "So nice&to meet&you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_717", "the&name's&sans./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_718", "and^1, uh^1,&same./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_733", "Oh^1!&Wait^1,&then...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_760", "This must be your&brother^1, Papyrus!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_761", "Greetings^1, Papyrus^1!&It is so nice to&finally meet you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_762", "Your brother has&told me so much&about you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_779", "WOWIE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_780", "I CAN'T BELIEVE&ASGORE'S CLONE&KNOWS WHO I&AM!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_781", "THIS IS THE BEST&DAY OF MY&LIFE!!!!!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_795", "Hey^1, Papyrus.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_796", "What does a skeleton&tile his roof&with?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_808", "HMMM..^1.&SNOW-PROOF ROOF&TILES???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_819", "No^1, silly^1!&A skeleton tiles&his roof with.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_820", "SHIN-gles!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_846", "I CHANGED MY&MIND!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_847", "THIS IS THE WORST&DAY OF MY LIFE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_863", "Come on^1, ASGORE^1!&It's gonna be OK!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_864", "There are plenty&of fish in the&sea.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_880", "Y-yeah^1, ASGORE!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_881", "Undyne's totally&right about that&fish thing!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_882", "S-sometimes you've&just got to^1, uh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_883", "S-stop going after&furry boss monsters&and^1, uh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_884", "J-just get to know&a really cute&fish...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_885", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_886", "It's a metaphor./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_910", "Well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_911", "I think&it's a&good&analogy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_945", "OH MY GOD!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_946", "\\XWILL YOU TWO&JUST \\RSMOOCH\\X &ALREADY!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_947", "THE AUDIENCE IS&DYING FOR SOME&ROMANTIC ACTION!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_962", "HEY^1, SHUT UP!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_963", "Man^1, the nerve of&that guy!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_964", "Right^1,&Alphys!??/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_965", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_966", "Uh^1, Alphys?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_982", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_983", "No./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_984", "He's&right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_985", "LET'S&DO&IT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1003", "??????????????/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1004", "Well??^1? Uh??^1?&I guess??^1?&If you want to??^1?&Then????/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1005", "Don't hold anything&back!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1047", "W-wait!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1048", "Not in&front of&the&human!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1066", "Uhh^1, right^1!&S-sorry^1, I got a&little carried&away there./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1082", "Hee hee hee./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1083", "My child^1, it&seems as if you&must stay here&for a while./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1084", "\\E6But looking at&all the great&friends you have&made.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1085", "\\E0I think.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1086", "\\E7I think you will&be happy here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1108", "H-hey^1, that&reminds me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1109", "Papyrus..^1.&YOU called&everyone here^1,&right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1110", "Well^1, besides^1,&uh^1, her./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1111", "Uh^1, anyway..^1.&If I got here&before you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1112", "How did you know&how to call&everybody?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1122", "LET'S&JUST&SAY.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1132", "A TINY&FLOWER&HELPED&ME./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1146", "A tiny..^1.&flower?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1194", "\\E0You IDIOTS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1195", "\\E2While you guys were&having your little&pow-wow.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1196", "\\E6I took the human&SOULS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1197", "\\E5And now^1, not only&are THOSE under my&power.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1198", "\\E6But all of your&FRIENDS' SOULS are&gonna be mine^1, too!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1199", "\\E0Hee hee hee./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1200", "\\E1And you know what&the best part is?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1201", "\\E5It's all your&fault./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1202", "\\E6It's all because&you MADE THEM&love you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1203", "\\E7All the time you&spent listening to&them.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1204", "\\E2Encouraging them..^1.&Caring about them.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1205", "\\E0Without that^1, they&wouldn't have come&here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1206", "\\E7And now^1, with their&souls and the humans'&together.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1207", "\\E5I will achieve my&REAL FORM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1208", "\\E0Hee hee.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1209", "\\E3Huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1210", "\\E1WHY am I still&doing this?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1211", "\\E7Don't you get it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1212", "\\E0This is all just&a GAME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1213", "\\E3If you leave the&underground satisfied^1,&you'll \"win\" the&game./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1214", "\\E4If you \"win^1,\" you&won't want to \"play\"&with me anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1215", "\\E0And what would I&do then?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1216", "\\E6But this game&between us will&NEVER end./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1217", "\\E5I'll hold victory&in front of you^1,&just within your&reach.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1218", "\\E6And then tear it&away just before&you grasp it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1219", "\\E8Over^1, and over^1,&and over.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1220", "\\E5Hee hee hee./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1221", "\\E1Listen./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1222", "\\E0If you DO defeat&me^1, I'll give you&your \"happy ending.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1223", "\\E7I'll bring your&friends back./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1224", "I'll destroy the&barrier./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1225", "\\E0Everyone will&finally be&satisfied./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1226", "\\E6But that WON'T&happen./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1227", "\\E8You...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1228", "\\E0I'll keep you here&no matter what!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1266", "\\E0Even if it means&killing you&1,000,000 times!!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1357", "What?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1375", "Do not be afraid^1,&my child.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1376", "No matter what&happens.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1377", "We will always&be there to&protect you!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1434", "THAT'S RIGHT^1,&HUMAN^1!&YOU CAN&WIN!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1435", "JUST DO&WHAT I^1,&WOULD&DO.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1436", "BELIEVE&IN YOU!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1449", "Hey^1! Human^1! If&you got past&ME^1, you can&do ANYTHING!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1450", "So don't worry^1!&We're with you&all the way!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1463", "huh^1?&you haven't&beaten&this guy yet?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1464", "come on^1, this&weirdo's got&nothin' on you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1514", "Technically^1, it's&impossible for you&to beat him.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1515", "B-but..^1.&Somehow^1, I know&you can do it!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1532", "Human^1, for the&future of&humans and&monsters...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1533", "You have to stay&determined...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1589", "Urrrgh..^1. NO!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1590", "Unbelievable!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1591", "This can't be&happening...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1592", "You..^1. YOU...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1635", "I can't believe&you're all so&STUPID./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_friendscene_1665", "ALL OF YOUR SOULS&ARE MINE!!!/%%");
