  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_a_94", "* Alphys might work faster^1.&* But the old Royal Scientist^1,&  Doctor W.D. Gaster?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_a_95", "* One day^1, he vanished&  without a trace./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_a_96", "* They say he shattered&  across time and space./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_a_97", "* Ha ha..^1.&* How can I say so&  without fear?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_a_98", "* I'm holding a piece of&  him right here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_b_94", "* It makes sense why ASGORE&  took so long to hire a&  new Royal Scientist./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_b_95", "* After all^1, the old one..^1.&* Dr. Gaster^1.&* What an act to follow!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_b_96", "* They say he created the CORE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_b_97", "* However^1, his life..^1.&* Was cut short./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_b_98", "* One day^1, he fell into&  his creation^1, and.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_b_102", "* Will Alphys end up the&  same way?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_c_95", "* I understand why ASGORE&  waited so long to hire a&  new Royal Scientist./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_c_96", "* The previous one..^1.&* Dr. Gaster./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_c_97", "* His brilliance was&  irreplaceable./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_c_98", "* However^1, his life..^1.&* Was cut short./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_c_99", "* One day^1, his experiments&  went wrong^1, and.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_c_103", "* Well^1, I needn't gossip./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_follower_c_104", "* After all^1, it's rude to&  talk about someone who's&  listening./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gaster_room_34", "ENTRY NUMBER&SEVENTEEN/");
