  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_greatdog_573", "* Greater Dog is not excited&  enough to play with./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_74", "* I'm thinking of getting a&  spiked collar to show off&  my personality./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_75", "* It makes a statement like..^1.&* \"Attach a leash to me and&  take me for a walk please.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_79", "* He may not look like it^1,&  but this big guy writes&  the most eloquent letters./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_80", "* Here^1, take a look!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_81", "* (It's just the word \"Bark\"&  but in flowery cursive.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_86", "* Papyrus^1?&* Is that you^1?& Come on.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_91", "* Undyne!^1?&* Did you come all the way&  out here...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_96", "* Huh^1?&* Since when did you and&  Sans become friends...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_97", "* I don't like him..^1.&* He loves to appear without&  moving./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_101", "* Where're the other two^1?&* I can't play with this&  big dumb guy alone.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_102", "* He'll just win!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_104", "* Sometimes the others like to&  prank me^1. They sit still&  so I can't see them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_105", "* They must be here^1, playing a&  joke on me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_106", "* I'll just wait until one of&  them admits it.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_110", "* Having an amorphous^1,&  shambling family member&  is great./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_111", "* They're always moving^1, so I&  can see them 100-percent&  of the time!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_73", "* Hmmm..^1.&* Isn't human food different&  from monster food?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_74", "* It does things like \"spoil.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_75", "* And when you eat it^1, it&  passes all the way through&  your whole body./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_76", "* Disgusting./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_77", "* I'd love to try it sometime./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_80", "* And I've heard they have&  things called bathrooms./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_84", "* To a human^1, monster food&  would be very interesting./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_85", "* As soon as you eat it^1, it&  converts perfectly into&  energy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_86", "* ... that makes me wonder^1.&* How do humans do it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_87", "* Eat during battle...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_90", "* Ice cream in one hand^1,&  sword in the other./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_91", "* That's the way of the&  monster warrior.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_97", "* Hmmm^1, this is around the&  time that Sans comes in./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_98", "* Then^1, a little bit later^1,&  his brother comes in^1,&  irritated./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_99", "* Yes^1, his brother^1.&* Papyrus./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_100", "* He's an interesting fellow./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_101", "* He always orders a glass of&  milk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_102", "* He says it's \"full of&  strong bones.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_104", "* Hope he shows up today./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_109", "* Soon^1, I'll be able to try&  some human food.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_110", "* And then I guess I'll try&  a human bathroom^1, too./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_115", "* Sans is interesting^1.&* He has told me about all&  kinds of incredible foods./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_116", "* But^1, despite his knowledge^1,&  he always orders the worst&  burger off the menu./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_grillby_73", "* ..^1.&* ..^1.&* ..^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_grillby_74", "* Grillbz said that he'd offer&  you a glass of water^1, but he&  doesn't touch the stuff./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_grillby_78", "* .............^1.&* ..............^1.&* ... good job./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_grillby_83", "* ..^1.&* ..^1.&* ..^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_grillby_84", "* Grillbz said that your&  food is probably cold&  by now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_73", "* Those dogs are part of&  the ROYAL GUARD^1, the elite&  military group led by UNDYNE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_74", "* She's rude^1, loud^1, and beats up&  everybody who gets in her&  way.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_75", "* It's no wonder all the kids&  want to be like her when&  they grow up!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_77", "* I want to be like UNDYNE&  when I grow up^1, too^1!&* Hoo hoo hoo!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_81", "* Sans is a sentry^1.&* But don't let his title make&  you think he does anything./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_82", "\\W* Everyone knows he sits&  around in the forest&  reading \\Ycar magazines\\W./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_87", "* Ehhhhhhhhnnnnn..^1.&* I wish I had something else&  to do./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_92", "* Those dogs are part of&  the ROYAL GUARD^1, the.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_93", "* Huh^1?&* Where are they?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_94", "* Something feels really off./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_101", "* Wow^1, a brand new world.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_102", "* I might not get to&  translate for Grillby&  anymore.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_103", "* ... which is fine^1, since I&  was actually just making&  up what he was saying./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_109", "* Grillby is getting nervous./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_110", "* Sans is his best customer^1,&  and he hasn't shown up&  at all today.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_115", "* Something feels really bad^1.&* Our lives are going nowhere^1,&  aren't they...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_116", "* I think I need another&  espresso.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_73", "* No matter where I go^1,&  it's the same menu^1, the&  same people.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_74", "* Help^1!&* I want new drinks an'&  ^1h-^1h-^1h-hot guys!!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_75", "* I guess the bartender's kind&  of ^1h-^1h-^1h-hot.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_79", "* C'mon everybody!!^1!&* ^1L-^1l-^1l-let's party!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_80", "* ... anyone?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_84", "* Sansyyyy..^1.&* Come back and sit with me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_85", "* Everything's so fun when&  you're around!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_90", "* It's s-s-so quiet in here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_91", "* L-lighten up everybody^1!&* This is why I hate&  th-this place./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_98", "* I w-wonder if the&  o-overworld h-has h-hot&  guys.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_99", "*  A-and neat d-drinks.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_100", "* Ooooooo^1, I'm ready!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_105", "* H-hey^1, isn't Sansy s'posed&  to come swinging in right&  about now???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_106", "* C'mon Sansy^1!&* You're the life of the&  party.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_lesserdog_71", "* (It's playing poker against&  itself.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_lesserdog_72", "* (It appears to be losing.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_lesserdog_76", "* (It has switched to Go Fish.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_lesserdog_81", "* (It finally won a game of&  poker against itself...?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_75", "* You better watch where you&  sit down in here^1, kid./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_76", "* Because that big guy WILL jump&  into your lap and give you&  lots of love and attention./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_80", "* Where's Sans..^1.&* He's supposed to give me&  a pat on the head.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_85", "* She hasn't been responding&  to our letters.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_86", "* Maybe it's because we let&  Doggo write them all./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_91", "* I was hoping Sans came in&  to give me a pat on the&  head./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_92", "* Interloper...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_96", "* Where's that big lug^1?&* We can't start until he&  shows up./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_98", "* Smells kinda..^1. quiet./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_103", "* Hmmm^1, now that our parents&  are the same entity.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_104", "* Does that mean I'm&  married to my sister?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_105", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_106", "* Wait^1, we're dogs^1.&* That stuff's normal./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_121", "* fast shortcut^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_129", "* hey^1, everyone./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_164", "* Hey^1, Sans.&* (Hi^1, Sans.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_208", "* Greetings^1, Sans.&* Hiya^1, Sansy~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_245", "* Hey Sans^1, weren't you just&  here for breakfast a&  few minutes ago?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_247", "* nah^1, i haven't had&  breakfast in at least&  half an hour./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_248", "\\E2* you must be thinking&  of brunch./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_286", "* here^1, get comfy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_521", "* (You tip the ketchup...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_522", "* (The cap falls off and all&  the ketchup in the bottle&  pours onto your food.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_545", "* whoops./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_546", "\\E0* eh, forgeddaboudit^1.&* you can have mine./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_547", "\\E1* i'm not hungry anyway./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_577", "* anyway^1, cool or not^1,&  you have to agree&  papyrus tries real hard./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_578", "\\E0* like how he keeps&  trying to be part of&  the royal guard./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_579", "\\E1* one day^1, he went to&  the house of the head&  of the royal guard.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_580", "\\E0* and begged her to&  let him be in it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_581", "\\E1* of course^1, she shut&  the door on him because&  it was midnight./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_582", "\\E0* but the next day^1, she&  woke up and saw him&  still waiting there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_583", "* seeing his dedication^1,&  she decided to give&  him warrior training./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_584", "\\E1* it's^1, uh^1, still a&  work in progress./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_609", "\\E1* oh yeah^1, I wanted&  to ask you something./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_683", "* welp^1, that was a&  long break./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_684", "\\E1* i can't believe i let&  ya pull me away from&  work for that long./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_708", "* just kidding./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_709", "* grillby^1, put it on&  my tab./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_751", "* by the way.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_752", "* ... i was going to say&  something^1, but i forgot./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_76", "* (We're sentries^1, but we never&  get any respect.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_77", "* (I wish those skeletons would&  throw us a bone.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_78", "* (We love bones.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_81", "* (Where are those skeletons?^1)&* (I wanted to get a bone&  from them...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_86", "* (We're considering paying a&  visit to the doctor.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_87", "* (No^1! Not the vet!^1)&* (... well^1, maybe she's a&  little like a vet.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_92", "* (I like Sans.^1)&* (Sometimes he feeds us scraps&  of food under the table.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_93", "* (Then his brother gets mad...^1)&* (But why!^1? We're adults!^1)&* (We can handle it!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_97", "* (Where's Doggo?^1)&* (I hope he didn't get&  lost again.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_99", "* (It's lonely in here today.^1)&* (If our friends don't show up^1,&  would you like to play?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_105", "* (All of our parents have&  been combined into one&  horrible being.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_106", "* (That's OK^1, though.^1)&* (It's really \"brought our&  families together.\")/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_271", "Error!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_273", "Is this&funny to&you?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_274", "Don't&put any&more on&me!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_275", "Leave me&alone...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_276", "Hohoho!&Go ahead&and&laugh...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_277", "Get this&off of&me...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_279", "Thanks.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_283", "Aw, you&shouldn'&have...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_284", "You even&wrapped&it...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_285", "Keep&away&from me!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_286", "I don't&want&your&gift!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_287", "How do&I know&it's not&a trick?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_293", "GOSHDARN&TEENAGE&GOOGLY&EYES!!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_294", "I WAS&STARTING&TO TRUST&YOU!!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_300", "That's&a little&better.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_301", "Er...&Those&are&real.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_303", "A weight&has been&lifted.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_304", "Thanks&for&nothing!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_312", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_507", "* Gyftrot laments its lack of&  hands.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_508", "* Gyftrot eyes you with&  suspicion.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_509", "* Gyftrot distrusts your&  youthful demeanor.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_510", "* Ah^1, the scent of fresh&  pine needles.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_511", "* Gyftrot tries vainly to&  remove its decorations.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_512", "* Gyftrot pretends to refuse&  your gift.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_513", "* Gyftrot politely accepts&  your gift.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_514", "* Gyftrot stumbles blindly.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_515", "* Gyftrot is slightly less&  irritated.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_516", "* Gyftrot's problems have&  been taken away.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_517", "* Gyftrot looks disappointed.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_519", "* Gyftrot's antlers tremble.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_534", "* GYFTROT - ATK 16 DEF 8&* Some teens \"decorated\" it as&  a prank./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_544", "* You remove the striped cane&  that says \"I use this tiny&  cane to walk\" on it./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_545", "* You remove the box of&  non-dog-related raisins./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_546", "* You remove the lenticular&  bookmark of a smug teen&  winking./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_547", "* You remove the barbed wire&  made of pipe cleaners./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_548", "* You remove a childhood&  photograph of Snowdrake and&  his parent./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_549", "* You remove a small^1, confused&  dog./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_550", "* You remove a stocking filled&  with chicken nuggets./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_551", "* You remove the shirt that says& 'I'm with stupid' and points&  inward./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_553", "* You try to undecorate...?/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_554", "* You remove the googly eyes./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_579", "* You add some googly eyes&  you found on the ground./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_586", "* You can't improve on&  perfection./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_601", "* You give the cheapest gift&  of all..^1.&* Friendship./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_610", "* You give 35 G because&  you can't think of an&  appropriate gift./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_616", "* You give your remaining&  money because you can't&  think of a better gift./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_624", "* Gyftrot refuses your gift./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_625", "* Hey now^1.&* You aren't made of money./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrot_626", "* Hey now^1.&* You aren't made of friendship./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrotnpc_70", "* I've heard there's a local&  tradition based off of&  my own suffering./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrotnpc_71", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrotnpc_72", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrotnpc_76", "* Everyone's leaving^1, eh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_gyftrotnpc_77", "* Good riddance^1!&* Maybe I'll finally get&  some peace and quiet!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_heartdefeated_0_0", "  You cannot give&  up just yet.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_heartdefeated_0_1", "  \\[C]^1!&  Stay determined.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_heartdefeated_100_0", "  \\[C], this is just&  a bad dream.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_heartdefeated_100_1", "  Wake up^1!&  It's not over!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_heartdefeated_101_0", "  \\[C]! It's like&  he says.../");
