  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_judgeshroom_231", "* It symbolizes my unbridled&  happiness./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_judgeshroom_232", "* The government told me&  they are willing to&  transplant me outside!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_judgeshroom_233", "* Why didn't you smile at my&  dance^1? It almost feels&  a little rude.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerboysnightout_event_101", "* ... you're here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerboysnightout_event_102", "* So that means Undyne..^1.&* She's.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerboysnightout_event_103", "* Like^1, Undyne^1!&* We'll avenge you!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_113", "* OH^1, THERE YOU ARE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_114", "\\M5* YOU UGLY LITTLE CREATURE^1.&* YOU'VE MADE QUITE A NAME&  FOR YOURSELF./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_115", "\\M3* SUCH INFAMY...^1!&* I'M IMPRESSED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_116", "\\M4* OH^1. YES^1.&* IF YOU'RE LOOKING FOR ALPHYS^1,&  SHE'S NOT HERE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_117", "\\M0* WHILE YOU WERE BUSY DOING&  YOUR^1, AHEM^1, THING.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_118", "* SHE WAS RUNNING AROUND&  EVACUATING PEOPLE TO SAFETY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_119", "\\M4* NOW THEY'RE IN A PLACE&  WHERE YOU'LL NEVER GET TO&  THEM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_120", "\\M2* DECIDING NOT TO FIGHT YOU^1.&* MY MY^1, SHE REALLY IS THE&  ONLY SMART ONE^1, ISN'T SHE?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_151", "\\M0* OH^1?&* HOW SASSY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_152", "\\M4* YOU'RE JUST ITCHING TO GET&  YOUR HANDS ON ME^1, AREN'T&  YOU?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_153", "\\M5* WELL..^1. T-O-O B-A-D!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_154", "\\M4* THIS WORLD NEEDS STARS MORE&  THAN IT NEEDS CORPSES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_killerlab_event_155", "\\M1* TOODLES!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_kitchenforcefield_123", "* (As per culinary standard^1,&  a death forcefield surrounds&  the kitchen.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_kitchenforcefield_124", "* (As per journalistic standards^1,&  a death forcefield surrounds&  the area of intrigue.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_kitchenforcefield_125", "* (It's the kind of every-day&  death forcefield you see&  at home.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_kitchenforcefield_126", "* (It's a forcefield.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_kitchenforcefield_127", "* (It's a battery-powered&  forcefield.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_kitchenforcefield_128", "* (It's a forcefield.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_62", "%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_65", "* (Doesn't seem like&  anyone's home.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_67", "* (If someone's there^1,&  they aren't answering&  the door.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_69", "* (No one is home.^1)&* (And you get the feeling&  no one ever will be.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_71", "* (You hear irritated groans&  from the inside.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_75", "* (Sounds like only fire&  lives here now.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_81", "* Who's there^1?&* I'm in the middle of&  my favorite TV program./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_82", "* I know^1, I know..^1.&* Staring at a screen...&* Sounds like a boring hobby./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_83", "* But TV offers an escape&  to another world^1.&* We really need that./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_86", "* You wanna watch too^1?&* Sorry^1, this is a one-player&  TV show./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_91", "* Ahh^1, what a beautiful knock..^1.!&* Maybe if I don't answer^1,&  I'll hear it again./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_93", "* Ahh^1, my patience rewards me./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_95", "* Ahh.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_99", "* (No answer.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_knock_room_113", "* (No answer.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_218", "* Hey^1!&* Stop!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_258", "* I got you guys some&  food^1, okay!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_294", "\\E4* Sorry about that.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_295", "\\E2* They get kind of sassy&  when they don't get&  fed on time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_296", "\\E3* Um!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_299", "\\E3* I think they smelled&  the potato chips you&  had^1, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_301", "\\E3* Anyway!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_302", "\\E6* The power went out^1,&  and I've been trying&  to turn it back on!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_303", "\\E4* But it seems like you&  were one step ahead&  of me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_304", "\\E2* This was probably just&  a big inconvenience&  for you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_305", "\\E4* B-but I appreciate&  that you came here&  to back me up!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_306", "\\E4* As I said^1, I was&  afraid I might.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_307", "\\E8* Not come back.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_308", "\\E5* But that's not because&  of these guys or&  anything!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_309", "\\E4* I was just worried I&  would be too afraid.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_310", "\\E9* To tell the truth.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_311", "\\E8* That I might run away^1,&  or do something.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_312", "\\E9* Cowardly./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_313", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_314", "*\\E8 Uh..^1. I..^1.&* I suppose I owe you&  an explanation./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_315", "\\E9* As you probably know^1,&  ASGORE asked me to study&  the nature of SOULs./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_316", "\\E3* During my research^1, I&  isolated a power I&  called \"determination.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_317", "\\E6* I injected it into dying&  monsters so their SOULs&  would last after death./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_318", "\\E9* But the experiment&  failed./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_319", "* You see^1, unlike humans',&  monsters' bodies don't&  have enough.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_320", "* Physical matter to take&  those concentrations&  of \"determination.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_321", "* Their bodies started to&  melt^1, and lost what&  physicality they had./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_322", "\\E3* Pretty soon^1, all of the&  test subjects had melted&  together into.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_323", "\\E8* Those./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_324", "\\E9* Seeing them like this^1,&  I knew.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_325", "\\E8* I couldn't tell their&  families about it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_326", "\\E8* I couldn't tell anyone&  about it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_327", "\\E9* No matter how much&  everyone was asking me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_328", "\\E9* And I was too afraid to&  do any more work^1,&  knowing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_329", "\\E8* ... everything I'd done&  so far had been such&  a horrific failure./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_330", "\\E9* ... but now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_331", "\\E9* Now^1, I've changed my&  mind about all this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_332", "\\E9* I'm going to tell&  everyone what I've done./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_333", "\\E9* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_335", "* It's going to be hard./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_336", "* Being honest..^1.&* Believing in myself.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_337", "* I'm sure there will be&  times where I'll&  struggle./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_338", "* I'm sure there will be&  times where I screw&  up again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_339", "\\E0* But knowing^1, deep down^1,&  that I have friends&  to fall back on.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_340", "\\E7* I know it'll be a&  lot easier to stand&  on my own./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_341", "* Thank you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_406", "* Come on^1, guys./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lab_powerswitch_407", "* It's time for everyone&  to go home./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_a_242", " WARNING! WARNING^6!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_a_243", " ELEVATOR LOSING POWER^6!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_a_244", " EM TETHER STABILITY LOST^6!%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_a_245", " ALTITUDE DROPPING^6!%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_b_122", "* (Ring...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_b_123", "* (It's a voice you have&  never heard before.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_b_131", "* \\[C]..^1.&* Are you there?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_b_132", "* It's been a long time^1,&  hasn't it...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_b_133", "* But you've done well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_b_134", "* Thanks to you^1, everything&  has fallen into place./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_b_135", "* \\[C].../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labelevator_b_136", "* See you soon./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_94", "* (There's a VHS player with a&  few tapes picked out beside&  it...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_95", "* (They seem to be labelled&  in a specific order.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_96", "* (Will you watch one...?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_98", "* (Choose a tape to watch.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_287", "* Psssst^1.&* Gorey^1, wake up. \\Ta/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_288", "* Mmm^1?&* What is it^1, dear?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_289", "* ... err^1, and why do you&  have that video camera? \\TT/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_290", "* Shush^1!&* I want to get your&  reaction./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_291", "* Gorey^1, dearest^1.&* What is my favorite&  vegetable?\\Ta/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_292", "* Hmmm..^1.&* Carrots^1, right?\\TT/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_293", "* No no no^1!&* My FAVORITE vegetable is.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_294", "* Eda-MOM-e./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_295", "* ... get it???\\Ta/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_296", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_297", "* Go back to bed^1, dear.\\TT/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_298", "* No no!^1!&* Not yet^1!&* Hee hee hee./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_299", "* Now^1, If I were a dog^1,&  what breed of dog would&  I be?\\Ta/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_300", "* Hmmm..^1. I don't know^1, honey^1.&* What kind of dog would&  you be?\\TT/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_301", "* I would be.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_302", "* A MOMERANIAN.\\Ta/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_303", "* Hohoho!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_304", "* You sure are excited to&  have this child./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_305", "* You know^1, if you keep&  making jokes like&  this.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_306", "* One day^1, you could be.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_307", "* ... a famous MOMedian.\\TT/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_308", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_309", "* Well^1, I am going to bed.\\Ta/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_310", "* Hey^1!&* Come on^1, Tori^1!&* That one was funny!\\TT/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_311", "* Hahaha^1, I know^1.&* I am just teasing you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_312", "* Goodnight^1, dear.\\Ta/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_313", "* Goodnight, honey.\\TT/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_314", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_315", "* Oh dear^1, perhaps it is too&  dark in here for the&  video to come out.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_350", "* Okay^1, \\[C]^1, are you ready?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_351", "* Do your creepy face!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_352", "* AHHHHH!^1!&* Hee hee hee!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_353", "* Oh^1!&* Wait^1!&* I had the lens cap on.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_354", "* What!^1?&* You're not gonna do it&  again...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_355", "* Come on^1, quit tricking me^1!&* Haha!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_391", "* Howdy^1, \\[C]^1!&* Smile for the camera!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_392", "* Ha^1, this time I got YOU^1!&* I left the cap on..^1.&* ON PURPOSE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_393", "* Now you're smiling for&  noooo reason^1!&* Hee hee hee!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_394", "* What^1?&* Oh^1, yeah^1, I remember./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_395", "* When we tried to make&  butterscotch pie for Dad^1,&  right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_396", "* The recipe asked for cups&  of butter.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_397", "* But we accidentally put&  in buttercups instead./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_398", "* Yeah^1!&* Those flowers got him&  really sick./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_399", "* I felt so bad^1.&* We made Mom really upset./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_400", "* I should have laughed it&  off^1, like you did.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_401", "* Um^1, anyway^1, where are you&  going with this?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_402", "* Huh^1?&* Turn off the camera...^1?&* OK./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_435", "* I..^1. I don't like this idea^1,&  \\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_436", "* Wh.^1. what^1?&* N-no, I'm not.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_437", "* ... big kids don't cry./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_438", "* Yeah^1, you're right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_439", "* No^1!&* I'd never doubt you^1, \\[C]..^1.&* Never!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_440", "* Y..^1. yeah^1!&* We'll be strong^1!&* We'll free everyone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_441", "* I'll go get the flowers./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_473", "* \\[C]..^1.&* Can you hear me^1?&* We want you to wake up...\\Ta/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_474", "* \\[C]^1!&* You have to stay determined!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_475", "* You can't give up..^1.&* You are the future of humans&  and monsters...\\TR/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_476", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_477", "* Psst... \\[C]..^1.&* Please..^1. wake up.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_478", "* I don't like this plan&  anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_479", "* I..^1. I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_480", "* ..^1. no^1, I said..^1.&* I said I'd never doubt you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_481", "* Six^1, right^1?&* We just have to get six.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_labtv_event_482", "* And we'll do it together^1,&  right?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ladiesfishingrod_137", "* You send the line back out./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_90", "* (Didn't work.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_119", "* Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_120", "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_121", "\\E3* H-hey^1, watch out^1!&* You're going to get&  really hurt!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_122", "\\E8* I can't watch this^1.&* I'm disabling the&  lasers./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_161", "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_162", "\\E6* Th..^1. there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_163", "\\E3* Be careful^1, okay?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_164", "\\E8* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_165", "\\E8* I-I'm sorry^1, it's&  m-my fault you&  got hurt./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_166", "\\E8* I didn't explain the&  lasers well enough^1,&  and../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_167", "\\E8* If I hadn't..^1.&* If I hadn't..^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_168", "\\E4* Um^1, delayed using&  my hacking skills^1,&  I mean.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_169", "\\E8* ... sorry./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_170", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_171", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_174", "\\E8* I-I'm sorry^1, it's&  m-my fault you&  got hurt./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_175", "\\E8* I didn't explain the&  lasers well enough^1,&  and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_176", "\\E3* O-oh^1, there's no&  time for this now!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_177", "\\E8* Sorry./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_178", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_laserswitch1_179", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastbeam_230", "STOP IT!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastbeam_255", "STOP IT NOW!!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastbeam_296", "* ...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_187", "* So you finally made it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_188", "* The end of your journey&  is at hand./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_189", "* In a few moments^1, you&  will meet the king./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_190", "* Together.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_191", "* You will determine the&  future of this world./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_192", "* That's then./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_193", "* Now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_194", "* You will be judged./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_195", "* You will be judged for&  your every action./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_196", "* You will be judged for&  every EXP you've earned./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_197", "* What's EXP?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_198", "* It's an acronym./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_199", "\\W* It stands for \"\\Rexecution&  points\\W.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_200", "* A way of quantifying the&  pain you have inflicted on&  others./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_201", "* When you kill someone^1,&  your EXP increases./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_202", "* When you have enough EXP^1,&  your LOVE increases./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_203", "* LOVE^1, too^1, is an&  acronym./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_204", "\\W* It stands for \"\\RLevel of&  Violence\\W.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_205", "* A way of measuring someone's&  capacity to hurt./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_206", "* The more you kill^1, the&  easier it becomes to&  distance yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_207", "* The more you distance&  yourself^1, the less you&  will hurt./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_208", "* The more easily you&  can bring yourself to&  hurt others./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_214", "* So you finally made it.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_243", "* Now^1, you understand./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_244", "* It's time to begin your&  judgment./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_245", "* Look inside yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_246", "* Have you really done the&  right thing?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_247", "* And^1, considering what&  you've done.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_248", "* What will you do now?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_249", "* Take a moment to think&  about this./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_268", "\\TS* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_269", "\\Ts*\\E0 ... but you^1.&* you never gained&  any LOVE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_270", "\\E1* 'course^1, that doesn't&  mean you're completely&  innocent or naive./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_271", "\\E0* just that you kept&  a certain tenderness&  in your heart./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_274", "* no matter the struggles&  or hardships you&  faced.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_275", "* you strived to do the&  right thing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_276", "* you refused to hurt&  anyone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_277", "* even when you ran&  away^1, you did it&  with a smile./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_278", "* you never gained LOVE^1,&  but you gained love./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_279", "* does that make sense?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_280", "* maybe not./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_283", "\\E3* ..^1.&* now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_284", "\\E0* you're about to face&  the greatest challenge&  of your entire journey./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_285", "* your actions here.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_286", "* will determine the&  fate of the entire&  world./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_287", "* if you refuse to&  fight.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_288", "* asgore will take&  your soul and&  destroy humanity./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_289", "* but if you kill&  asgore and go&  home.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_290", "* monsters will remain&  trapped underground./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_291", "* what will you do?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_292", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_293", "* well^1, if i were you^1,&  i would have thrown&  in the towel by now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_294", "\\E1* but you didn't get&  this far by giving&  up^1, did you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_295", "\\E0* that's right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_296", "* you have something&  called \"determination.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_297", "* so as long as you&  hold on.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_298", "* so as long as you&  do what's in your&  heart.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_299", "* i believe you can do&  the right thing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_300", "\\E3* alright./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_301", "\\E0* we're all counting&  on you, kid./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_302", "\\E2* good luck./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_361", "\\TS* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_362", "\\Ts*\\E0 truthfully^1, it doesn't&  really matter what you&  said./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_363", "\\E0* all that's important is&  that you were honest&  with yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_364", "* what happens now.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_365", "* we leave up to you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_390", "* Then why'd you&  kill my&  brother?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_402", "* You dirty brother&  killer./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_421", "* huh^1?&* you look bored./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_422", "\\E1* i get the feeling&  you aren't gonna learn&  anything from this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_423", "\\E0* well^1, guess I gotta&  judge you then./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_424", "* come on^1.&* really?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_428", "* lv2..^1.&* seems like you messed&  up the slightest amount./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_429", "\\E1* welp^1.&* that's pretty sad./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_430", "\\E3* you probably weren't&  even aware of what you&  were doing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_431", "* and when you learned^1,&  it was too late./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_432", "\\E2* nah^1, just kidding./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_433", "\\E1* who gets to lv2 on&  accident^1?&* get outta here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_437", "\\E3* lv3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_438", "\\E1* 3's just an ok number^1,&  i guess./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_439", "\\E2* i'll give you a C+./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_440", "\\E1* you can do better^1,&  right?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_444", "\\E3* hmmm..^1.&* over lv3^1, huh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_445", "\\E0* you killed some people&  on purpose^1, didn't you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_446", "\\E1* that's probably bad./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_447", "\\E3* though^1, maybe some&  of it was in self-&  defense.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_448", "\\E1* i don't know^1.&* help me out here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_449", "* i wasn't watching./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_450", "\\E2* anyways^1, don't do that./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_454", "\\E3* hmmm..^1.&* over lv9^1, huh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_455", "\\E0* that's over halfway to&  lv20^1, the maximum./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_456", "\\E1* but don't think that&  means you're still 50-&  percent good./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_457", "\\E3* 50-percent^1, 20-percent./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_458", "\\E4* those are both still&  failing grades./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_459", "\\E1* besides^1.&* chances are.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_460", "* i've already tried to&  steer you in the right&  direction./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_461", "\\E0* so what can i say?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_462", "\\E3* what can i say that&  will change the mind of&  a being like you...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_466", "\\E3* hmmm..^1.&* over lv14^1, huh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_467", "\\E1* well^1, hmmm..^1.&* judgment-wise.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_468", "\\E4* you're a pretty bad&  person./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_469", "* you wander around^1,&  looking for people.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_470", "* killing them to take&  their money./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_471", "\\E3* that's just plain&  messed up./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_472", "\\E1* and what's worse^1, is&  that as bad as you&  are.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_473", "\\E2* you aren't anywhere near&  as bad as you could&  be./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_474", "\\E1* you pretty much suck&  at being evil./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_475", "\\E1* honestly^1, it's super&  embarrassing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_476", "\\E2* but maybe you'd be&  better.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_477", "\\E1* at not killing anyone?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_478", "\\E2* crazy idea^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_479", "\\E0* let me know how that&  one goes./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_485", "* ... huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_486", "\\E0* what's with that look&  in your eye?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_487", "\\E3* did you go through and&  kill someone.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_488", "\\E3* just to see what i'd&  say about it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_489", "\\E1* wow^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_490", "\\E2* you're a pretty gross&  person^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_494", "\\E1* huh^1?&* you STILL look bored./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_495", "\\E2* okay then^1, consider&  our session over./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_513", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_514", "\\E1* wait a second./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_515", "\\E1* that look on your&  face while i was&  talking.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_516", "\\E2* you've already heard&  my spiel^1, haven't you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_517", "\\E3* i suspected something&  like this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_518", "\\E3* you're always acting&  like you know what's&  going to happen./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_519", "\\E1* like you've seen it&  all before./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_520", "\\E3* so..^1.&* i have a request for&  you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_521", "\\W*\\E1 i kind of have a&  \\Ysecret codeword\\W &  that only i know./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_522", "\\E0* so i know if someone&  tells it to me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_523", "\\E1* they'll have to be a&  time traveller./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_524", "\\E2* crazy^1, right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_525", "\\E1* anyway^1, here it is.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_526", "\\E3* (whisper^1, whisper)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_527", "\\E2* i'm counting on you to&  come back here and&  tell me that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_528", "\\E1* see you later./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_532", "\\E0* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_533", "\\E1* huh^1?&* do you have something&  to say to me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_534", "\\E2* what^1? a codeword^1?&* can you speak a&  little louder?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_535", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_536", "* did you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_537", "\\E2* ... just say \"i'm a&  stupid doodoo butt?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_538", "\\E1* wow^1.&* i can't believe you&  would say that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_539", "\\E3* not only is that&  completely infantile.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_540", "\\E2* but it's also my&  secret codeword./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_541", "\\E3* that^1, however^1, isn't&  good enough./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_542", "\\W*\\E1 what you need is the&  \\Ysecret\\W secret codeword./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_543", "\\E2* it's only for people&  that know the secret&  codeword./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_544", "\\E0* anyway^1, here it is.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_545", "\\E4* (whimsper^1, whimsper).../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_546", "\\E2* i'm counting on you to&  come back here and&  tell me that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_547", "\\E1* see you later./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_553", "\\E0* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_554", "\\E1* huh^1?&* do you have something&  to say to me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_555", "\\E2* what^1? a codeword^1?&* can you speak a&  little louder?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_556", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_557", "* did you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_558", "\\E2* ... just say \"i'm the&  legendary fartmaster?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_559", "\\E1* wow./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_560", "\\E1* that's..^1. uh..^1.&* really childish./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_561", "\\E2* why would you think&  that was a secret&  secret codeword?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_562", "\\E1* whoever told you that&  is a dirty liar./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_563", "\\E2* i don't have a secret&  secret codeword./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_564", "\\E3* however./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_565", "\\E2* i do have a secret&  secret triple-secret&  codeword./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_566", "\\E1* which you just said./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_567", "\\E2* so^1, i guess you're&  qualified./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_568", "\\E2* here's the key to my&  room./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_569", "\\E3* it's time.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_570", "* you learned the truth./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_571", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_572", "* (When you looked^1, the key was&  already on your keychain.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_578", "\\E0* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_579", "\\E1* huh^1?&* triple secret codeword?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_580", "\\E2* nah^1, i'm out of&  material./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_581", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_582", "* (You felt something on your&  keychain.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_634", "\\E0* heya./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_635", "\\E1* you've been busy^1,&  huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_636", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_637", "\\E0* so^1, i've got a&  question for ya./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_638", "\\E3* do you think even&  the worst person can&  change...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_639", "\\E3* that everybody can be&  a good person^1, if&  they just try?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_643", "\\E0* heya./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_644", "\\E1* you look frustrated&  about something./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_645", "\\E4* guess i'm pretty good&  at my job^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_650", "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_651", "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  twice in a row./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_652", "\\E2* suffice to say^1, you&  look really..^1.&* unsatisfied./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_653", "\\E3* all right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_654", "\\E4* how 'bout we make it&  a third?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_659", "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_660", "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  thrice in a row./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_661", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_662", "\\E1* hey^1, what comes after&  \"thrice^1,\" anyway?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_663", "\\E4* wanna help me find out?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_668", "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_669", "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  quice in a row./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_670", "\\E1* quice^1?&* frice?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_671", "\\E4* welp^1, won't have to&  use it again anyways./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_676", "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_677", "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  five times in a row./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_678", "\\E2* convenient^1, huh^1?&* that's one for each&  finger./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_679", "\\E3* but soon.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_680", "\\E4* you'll need a cool&  mutant hand to count&  all of your deaths./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_685", "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_686", "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  six times in a row./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_687", "\\E2* that's the number of&  fingers on a mutant&  hand./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_688", "\\E3* but soon.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_689", "\\E4* you'll need to find&  a mutant hand with&  even more fingers./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_694", "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_695", "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  seven times in a row./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_696", "\\E0* hey^1, that's good^1.&* seven's supposed to be&  a lucky number./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_697", "\\E2* who knows^1, maybe&  you'll hit the&  jackpot.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_698", "\\E4* and that number will&  multiply tenfold./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_703", "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_704", "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  eight times in a row./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_705", "\\E2* that's the number of&  fingers on a spider./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_706", "\\E3* but soon.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_707", "\\E1* wait^1, don't spiders&  have legs?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_713", "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_714", "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  seven times in a row./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_715", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_716", "\\E2* nope^1, wait^1, that's&  definitely nine^1, sorry./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_717", "\\E4* or was it ten?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_723", "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_724", "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  ten times in a row./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_725", "\\E2* hey^1, congrats^1!&* the big one-oh!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_726", "\\E1* let's invite all your&  friends over for a&  big shindig./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_727", "\\E2* we can have pie^1, and&  hot dogs^1, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_728", "\\E3* hmmm..^1. wait^1.&* something's not right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_729", "\\E4* you don't have any&  friends./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_735", "\\E0* hmm^1.&* that expression.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_736", "\\E1* that's the expression&  of someone who's died&  eleven times in a row./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_737", "\\E2* well^1, give or take./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_738", "\\E1* there's nuance to&  this stuff./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_739", "\\E2* don't think i'll be&  able to count very&  well from here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_740", "\\E1* count for me^1, ok?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_741", "\\E4* we'll start from 12./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_747", "\\E0* let's just get to&  the point./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_752", "\\E0* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_753", "\\E1* that expression that&  you're wearing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_754", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_755", "\\E4* well^1, i won't grace&  it with a description./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_759", "\\E0* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_760", "\\E1* that expression that&  you're wearing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_761", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_762", "\\E4* you're really kind&  of a freak^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_786", "\\E3* heh heh heh heh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_787", "\\E1* all right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_788", "\\E3* well^1, here's a better&  question./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_789", "\\E4* do you wanna have&  a bad time?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_790", "\\E3* 'cause if you take&  another step&  forward.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_791", "\\E4* you are REALLY not&  going to like what&  happens next./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_815", "\\E3* welp./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_817", "\\E3* sorry^1, old lady./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lastsans_trigger_818", "* this is why i never&  make promises./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_latchkey_71", "* (You took the key and&  put it on your phone's&  key-chain.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lemonbread_175", "But&nobody&came.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lemonbread_176", "Do you&think&I'm&pretty?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lemonbread_177", "That's&what&they all&say.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lemonbread_178", "Stay&here&with&me...");
