  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_422", "* Lesser Dog is really not&  paying attention.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_423", "* Smells like dog chow.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_424", "* Lesser Dog is barking&  excitedly.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_425", "* Lesser Dog is overstimulated.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_426", "* Lesser Dog shows no signs&  of stopping.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_427", "* Lesser Dog is lowering.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_428", "* Lesser Dog is learning&  to read.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_429", "* Lesser Dog is whining&  because it can't see&  you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_430", "* Hello there.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_431", "* Lesser Dog is questioning&  your choices.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_432", "* Lesser Dog has gone where&  no Dog has gone before.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_433", "* Lesser Dog tucks its tail&  between its legs.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_449", "* LESSER DOG - ATK 12 DEF 2&* Wields a stone dogger made&  of pomer-granite./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_457", "* You barely lifted your&  hand and Lesser Dog&  got excited./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_458", "* You lightly touched the&  Dog^1.&* It's already overexcited.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_459", "* You pet the Dog.&* It raises its head up&  to meet your hand./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_460", "* You pet the Dog.&* It was a good Dog./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_461", "* You pet the Dog.&* Its excitement knows no&  bounds./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_462", "* Critical pet!&* Dog excitement increased./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_463", "* You have to jump up&  to pet the Dog./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_464", "* You don't even pet it^1.&* It gets more excited./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_465", "* There is no way to&  stop this madness./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_466", "* Lesser Dog enters the&  realm of the clouds./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_467", "* You call the Dog but it&  is too late^1.&* It cannot hear you./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_468", "* .../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_469", "* You can reach Lesser Dog&  again./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_470", "* You pet Lesser Dog./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_471", "* It's possible that you&  may have a problem./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_472", "* Lesser Dog is unpettable&  but appreciates the attempt./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_473", "* Perhaps mankind was not&  meant to pet this much./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_474", "* It continues./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_475", "* Lesser Dog is beyond&  your reach./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_lesserdoge_476", "* Really.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_70", "* Beautiful^1.&* An error message./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_73", "* That look in your eye.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_74", "* You're someone that has&  difficulty solving Junior&  Jumble^1, aren't you?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_78", "* That look in your eye.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_79", "* You're someone that has&  trouble doing crosswords^1,&  aren't you?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_84", "* That look in your eye.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_85", "* You think Sudoku is just&  moderately challenging^1,&  don't you?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_92", "* The greatest struggle of&  my life is over.../");
