  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_quiz_490", "* Mettaton.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_quiz_514", "* METTATON - ATK 30 DEF 255&* His metal body renders him&  invulnerable to attack./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_quiz_524", "* Screaming is against the&  rules./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_256", "THIS IS IT, DARLING!&SAY GOODBYE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_265", "HA!&THAT BUTTON WON'T&SAVE YOU NOW, DARLING!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_268", "YOU WOULDN'T DARE&USE THE [ACT] COMMAND&AND PRESS THAT&BUTTON!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_271", "THAT'S RIGHT!&DON'T PRESS IT!&I'LL DESTROY YOU!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_274", "WITHOUT THAT BUTTON,&YOU ARE INCHING&CLOSER AND CLOSER&TO YOUR DEMISE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_277", "ANY MINUTE NOW!&    /%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_280", "ANY... MINUTE...&....NOW!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_284", ".............&............/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_290", "..........&...(COUGH)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_299", "OH!!!&THAT YELLOW GLOW...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_300", "TOOK YOU LONG&ENOUGH!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_542", "* Mettaton.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_564", "* METTATON - ATK 30 DEF 255&* His metal body STILL renders&  him invulnerable to attack./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_574", "* You yell..^1.&* Nothing happened./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_579", "* You press the yellow button^1.&* The phone is resonating with&  Mettaton's presence...!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_640", "IS THAT YOUR PHONE?&YOU'D BETTER ANSWER&IT!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_652", "H-hey!!&Th-this seems bad,&but don't worry!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_653", "Th-there's one last&thing I installed&on your phone...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_654", "\\WYou see that\\Y &yellow button\\W...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_655", "Go to this phone's&[[ACT]] menu and&press it!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_662", "* Your phone's [[ACT]] menu is&  glowing.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_703", "Now press \\*Z!!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_746", "OOOH!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_747", "OOOOOOOH!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_748", "YOU'VE DEFEATED ME!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_749", "HOW CAN THIS BE,&YOU WERE STRONGER&THAN I THOUGHT, ETC./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_second_757", "WHATEVER.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_214", "THIS IS IT, DARLING!&SAY GOODBYE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_224", "YES, I WAS THE ONE&THAT RE-ARRANGED&THE CORE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_225", "I WAS THE ONE THAT&HIRED EVERYONE TO&KILL YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_226", "THAT, HOWEVER, WAS A&SHORT-SIGHTED PLAN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_227", "YOU KNOW WHAT WOULD&BE A HUNDRED TIMES&BETTER?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_228", "KILLING YOU MYSELF!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_233", "LISTEN, DARLING.&I'VE SEEN YOU FIGHT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_234", "YOU'RE WEAK./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_235", "IF YOU CONTINUE&FORWARD, ASGORE WILL&TAKE YOUR SOUL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_236", "AND WITH YOUR SOUL,&ASGORE WILL DESTROY&HUMANITY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_241", "BUT IF I GET YOUR&SOUL, I CAN STOP&ASGORE'S PLAN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_242", "I CAN SAVE HUMANITY&FROM DESTRUCTION!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_247", "THEN, USING YOUR SOUL,&I'LL CROSS THROUGH&THE BARRIER.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_248", "AND BECOME THE STAR&I'VE ALWAYS DREAMED&OF BEING!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_249", "HUNDREDS, THOUSANDS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_250", "NO!&MILLIONS OF HUMANS&WILL WATCH ME!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_255", "GLITZ! GLAMOUR!&I'LL FINALLY HAVE&IT ALL!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_256", "SO WHAT IF A FEW&PEOPLE HAVE TO DIE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_257", "THAT'S SHOW BUSINESS,&BABY!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_523", "* Mettaton.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_545", "* METTATON - ATK 30 DEF 255&* Seriously^1, his metal body&  is invulnerable!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_555", "* This is probably what you'll&  do if things continue in&  this manner./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_560", "* You tell Mettaton that there's&  a mirror behind him./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_644", "U..uh... I can't see&what's going on in&there, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_645", "D-d-don't give up,&okay!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_646", "Th... there's o-one&l-l-last way to beat&Mettaton.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_647", "It's... um... it's.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_648", "This is a work in-&progress, so don't&judge it too hard.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_649", "But, you know how&Mettaton always faces&f-f-forward?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_650", "That's because&there's a switch&on his backside./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_651", "S-s-so if y-y-you&c-c-can turn him&around... um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_652", "And, umm... press&th-th-th-the&switch.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_653", "He'll be... um...&He'll be.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_654", "Vulnerable./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_655", "Well, g-g-gotta go!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_688", "* Seems like a good time to&  turn Mettaton around.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_820", "OH???&A MIRROR???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_821", "RIGHT, I HAVE TO&LOOK PERFECT FOR&OUR GRAND FINALE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_831", "HMMM...&I DON'T SEE IT...&WHERE IS IT...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_848", "DID YOU./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_849", "JUST FLIP./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_850", "MY SWITCH?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_943", "THAT WORTHLESS PEA-&SHOOTER WON'T WORK&ON ME, DARLING. ^3 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_944", "DON'T YOU UNDERSTAND&WHAT ACTING IS!?^3 %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonb_third_952", "* Mettaton.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_167", ".../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_190", "Lights!&Camera!&Action!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_196", "Drama!&Romance!&Blood-&shed!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_202", "I'm the&idol&everyone&craves!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_208", "Smile&for the&camera!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_214", "Oooh, it's time&for a pop quiz!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_215", "I hope you brought&a keyboard.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_215_console", "Have fun with that&on-screen keyboard.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_216", "This one's an&essay question!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_222", "Your essay really&showed everyone&your heart./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_223", "Why don't I show&you mine?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_231", "Ooooh,&I'm just&warming&up!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_237", "But how are you&on the dance floor!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_244", "Can you&keep up&the&pace!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_253", "Lights!&Camera&Bombs!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_259", "Things&are&blowing&up!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_267", "Time for our union-&regulated break!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_274", "We've grown so&distant, darling.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_275", "How about another&heart-to-heart?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_285", "A.. arms?&Wh... who needs arms&with legs like&these?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_286", "I'm still going&to win!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_297", "Come on&...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_307", "The show&...&must go&on!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_317", "Dr...&Drama!&A...&Action!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_329", "\\E5L... lights...&C... camera.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_330", "Enough of this!&Do you really want&humanity to perish!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_331", "\\E7... or do you just&believe in yourself&that much?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_353", "Haha, how inspiring!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_354", "Well, darling!&It's either me&or you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_355", "\\E4But I think we both&already know who's&going to win./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_356", "\\E8Witness the true&power of humanity's&star!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_368", "... then.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_369", "\\E8Are YOU the star?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_370", "Can you really&protect humanity!?/%%");
