  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_677", "* METTATON EX - ATK 47 DEF 47&* His weak point is his&  heart-shaped core./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_691", "* You say you aren't going&  to get hit at ALL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_692", "* Ratings gradually increase&  during Mettaton's turn./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_706", "* You posed dramatically^1.&* The audience nods./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_708", "* Despite being hurt^1, you&  posed dramatically^1.&* The audience applauds./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_710", "* Despite being wounded^1, you&  posed dramatically^1.&* The audience gasps./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_712", "* With the last of your power^1,&  you pose dramatically^1.&* The audience screams./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_726", "* You turn and scoff at the&  audience./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_727", "* They're rooting for your&  destruction this turn!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_770", "H.. ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_771", "So I was wrong./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_772", "Darling.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_773", "\\E1You really are&strong enough to&get past ASGORE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_774", "\\E0Well then.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_775", "It's time for&you to go./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_776", "\\E0Don't worry about&me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_777", "I might seem like&I'm dying now^1,&but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_778", "\\E1Dr. Alphys can&always repair me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_779", "\\E0And... besides.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_780", "Even if I'm not&cut out to be&a star.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_781", "\\E1I still got to&perform for a&human, didn't I?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_782", "So, thank you,&darling.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_804", "\\E1You've been a&great audience!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_836", "OOH^1, LOOK AT&THESE RATINGS!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_837", "\\E6THIS IS THE MOST&VIEWERS I'VE EVER&HAD!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_838", "WE'VE REACHED THE&VIEWER CALL-IN&MILESTONE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_839", "\\E8ONE LUCKY VIEWER&WILL HAVE THE CHANCE&TO TALK TO ME.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_840", "\\E7... BEFORE I LEAVE&THE UNDERGROUND&FOREVER!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_841", "\\E9LET'S SEE WHO&CALLS IN FIRST!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_866", "\\E0HI^1, YOU'RE ON TV!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_867", "WHAT DO YOU HAVE&TO SAY ON THIS^1,&OUR LAST SHOW???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_880", "...../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_881", "oh......../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_882", "\\E1hi..^1.&mettaton.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_883", "i really liked&watching your show.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_884", "my life is pretty&boring..^1. but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_885", "seeing you on the&screen..^1. brought&excitement to my&life..^1. vicariously/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_886", "i can't tell^1, but..^1.&i guess this is&the last episode...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_887", "\\E3i'll miss you..^1.&mettaton....../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_888", "... oh...^1. i didn't&mean to talk so&long.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_889", "\\E2oh........../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_900", "NO^1, WAIT^1!&WAIT^1, BL.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_901", "\\E1H..^1.&THEY ALREADY HUNG&UP./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_902", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_903", "\\E0I'LL TAKE ANOTHER&CALLER!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_915", "\\E1Mettaton^1, your show&made us so happy!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_928", "Mettaton^1, I don't&know what I'll&watch without you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_941", "Mettaton^1, there's&a Mettaton-shaped&hole in my Mettaton-&shaped heart./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_964", "\\E3AH..^1. I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_965", "I SEE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_966", "\\E4.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_967", "EVERYONE..^1.&THANK YOU SO MUCH./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_968", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_969", "\\E0DARLING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_970", "\\E1PERHAPS..^1. IT MIGHT BE&BETTER IF I STAY&HERE FOR A WHILE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_971", "\\E2HUMANS ALREADY HAVE&STARS AND IDOLS^1,&BUT MONSTERS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_972", "\\E0THEY ONLY HAVE ME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_973", "\\E1IF I LEFT..^1.&THE UNDERGROUND WOULD&LOSE ITS SPARK./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_974", "\\E3I'D LEAVE AN ACHING&VOID THAT CAN NEVER&BE FILLED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_975", "\\E0SO..^1. I THINK I'LL&HAVE TO DELAY MY&BIG DEBUT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_976", "\\E2BESIDES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_977", "\\E1YOU'VE PROVEN TO&BE VERY STRONG./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_978", "\\E0PERHAPS..^1. EVEN STRONG&ENOUGH TO GET PAST&ASGORE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_979", "\\E0I'M SURE YOU'LL BE&ABLE TO PROTECT&HUMANITY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_980", "\\E4HA^1, HA.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_981", "IT'S ALL FOR THE&BEST^1, ANYWAY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_982", "\\E3THE TRUTH IS^1, THIS&FORM'S ENERGY&CONSUMPTION IS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_983", "INEFFICIENT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_984", "IN A FEW MOMENTS^1,&I'LL RUN OUT OF&BATTERY POWER^1, AND.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_985", "\\E4WELL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_986", "\\E0I'LL BE ALRIGHT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_987", "\\E5KNOCK 'EM DEAD^1,&DARLING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_988", "\\E0AND EVERYONE..^1.&THANK YOU./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettatonex_989", "YOU'VE BEEN A&GREAT AUDIENCE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_170", "* REALLY^1?&* WHERE?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_187", "* CLEVER..^1.&* VERY CLEVER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_230", "* OH YES.&* THERE YOU ARE, DARLING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_231", "* IT'S TIME TO HAVE OUR&  LITTLE SHOWDOWN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_232", "* IT'S TIME TO FINALLY STOP&  THE \"MALFUNCTIONING\" ROBOT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_233", "* ... NOT!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_234", "* MALFUNCTION?&* REPROGRAMMING?&* GET REAL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_235", "* THIS WAS ALL JUST A BIG&  SHOW./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_236", "* AN ACT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_237", "* ALPHYS HAS BEEN PLAYING&  YOU FOR A FOOL THE&  WHOLE TIME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_238", "* AS SHE WATCHED YOU ON THE&  SCREEN^1, SHE GREW ATTACHED&  TO YOUR ADVENTURE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_239", "* SHE DESPERATELY WANTED TO&  BE A PART OF IT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_240", "* SO SHE DECIDED TO INSERT&  HERSELF INTO YOUR STORY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_241", "* SHE REACTIVATED PUZZLES^1.&* SHE DISABLED ELEVATORS^1.&* SHE ENLISTED ME TO TORMENT YOU./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_242", "* ALL SO SHE COULD SAVE&  YOU FROM DANGERS THAT&  DIDN'T EXIST./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_243", "* ALL SO YOU WOULD THINK&  SHE'S THE GREAT PERSON.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_244", "* THAT SHE'S NOT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_245", "* AND NOW^1, IT'S TIME FOR&  HER FINEST HOUR./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_247", "* AT THIS VERY MOMENT,&  ALPHYS IS WAITING OUTSIDE&  THE ROOM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_248", "* DURING OUR \"BATTLE,\" SHE&  WILL INTERRUPT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_249", "* SHE WILL PRETEND TO&  \"DEACTIVATE\" ME, \"SAVING\" YOU&  ONE FINAL TIME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_250", "* FINALLY.&* SHE'LL BE THE HEROINE OF&  YOUR ADVENTURE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_251", "* YOU'LL REGARD HER SO HIGHLY&  SHE'LL EVEN BE ABLE TO&  CONVINCE YOU NOT TO LEAVE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_252", "* ... OR NOT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_253", "* YOU SEE, I'VE HAD ENOUGH OF&  THIS PREDICTABLE CHARADE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_254", "* I HAVE NO DESIRE TO HARM&  HUMANS.&* FAR FROM IT, ACTUALLY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_255", "* MY ONLY DESIRE IS TO&  ENTERTAIN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_256", "* AFTER ALL, THE AUDIENCE&  DESERVES A GOOD SHOW,&  DON'T THEY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_257", "* AND WHAT'S A GOOD SHOW.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_258", "* WITHOUT A PLOT TWIST?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_263", "* MY^1, MY^1.&* SO YOU'VE FINALLY ARRIVED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_264", "* AFTER OUR FIRST MEETING^1, I&  REALIZED..^1.&* SOMETHING GHASTLY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_265", "* YOU'RE NOT JUST A THREAT&  TO MONSTERS..^1.&* BUT HUMANITY^1, AS WELL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_266", "* OH MY^1.&* THAT'S AN ISSUE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_267", "* YOU SEE^1, I CAN'T BE A&  STAR WITHOUT AN AUDIENCE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_268", "* AND BESIDES.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_269", "* THERE ARE SOME PEOPLE..^1.&* I WANT TO PROTECT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_303", "* H-hey!!^1!&* Wh-wh-what's going on!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_304", "* Th-th-the door just&  locked itself!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_321", "\\M1* SORRY^1, FOLKS^1!&* THE OLD PROGRAM'S BEEN&  CANCELLED!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_322", "* BUT WE'VE GOT A FINALE&  THAT WILL DRIVE YOU WILD!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_341", "\\M5* REAL DRAMA!!&* REAL ACTION!!&* REAL BLOODSHED!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_342", "* ON OUR NEW SHOW.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_343", "* \"ATTACK OF THE KILLER&  ROBOT!\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_411", "* AH HA HA^1.&* EAGER, AS ALWAYS, EH?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_412", "* BUT DON'T TOUCH THAT DIAL.&* THERE'S SOMETHING YOU&  HAVEN'T ACCOUNTED FOR./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_413", "* AS ANY TRUE FAN WOULD KNOW,&  I WAS FIRST CREATED AS&  A HUMAN ERADICATION ROBOT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_414", "* IT WAS ONLY AFTER BECOMING A&  STAR THAT I WAS GIVEN A&  MORE... PHOTOGENIC BODY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_415", "* HOWEVER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_416", "* THOSE ORIGINAL FUNCTIONS&  HAVE NEVER BEEN FULLY&  REMOVED.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_417", "* COME ANY CLOSER, AND&  I'LL BE FORCED TO SHOW&  YOU.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_418", "\\M5* MY TRUE FORM!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_443", "\\M0* FINE THEN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettboss_event_444", "\\M5* RRRRREADY^1?&* IIIIIIIT'S SHOWTIME!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_169", "* I..^1. I managed to open&  the lock^1!&* Are you two.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_197", "* Oh my god./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_222", "* Mettaton!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_223", "\\E1* Mettaton^1, are you.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_244", "* H..^1. hey.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_245", "* D..^1. don't worry&  about it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_246", "* I can always.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_247", "\\E5* I can always build&  a different robot!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_248", "\\E6* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_249", "\\E5* Why don't you go&  on ahead?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_254", "* ... thank GOD^1, it's just&  the batteries./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_255", "\\E9* Mettaton^1, if you were&  gone^1, I would have..^1.&* I would have.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_256", "\\E8* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_257", "\\E6* I m-mean^1, h-hey^1, it's&  n-^1no problem^1, you&  know?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_258", "\\E5* He's just a robot^1, if&  you messed it up^1, I&  c-could always.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_259", "\\E6* J-just build another./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_260", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettdestroyed_event_261", "* Why don't you go&  on ahead?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_metteggs_58", "* (You found the eggs.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettmilk_58", "* (You found the milk.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_artifact_117", "* Error Baby%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_199", "* Error./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_204", "* Great job^1!&* Keep heading around the&  room!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_205", "* Try to go for the&  one in the bottom-&  left next!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_209", "* Great job^1!&* Keep heading around the&  room!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_210", "* Try to go for the&  one in the top-&  right next!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_214", "* Great job^1!&* Head to the left&  next!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_218", "* Great job^1!&* Head to the right&  next!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_223", "* You couldn't even&  get one bomb...!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_246", "* Error,/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_249", "* Great job^1!&* Head for the center^1!&* There's one left there!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_252", "* Great job^1!&* Head for the center!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_253", "* I'm using^1, uh^1, EM fields&  to trap the glass of&  water there!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_257", "* Great job^1!&* There's only one left&  in the bottom-right!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_261", "* Great job^1!&* There's only one left&  at the top!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_265", "* Great job^1!&* There's only one left&  at the top-right!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_269", "* Great job^1!&* There's only one left&  at the bottom-left!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnews_battleobj_275", "* It's..^1. it's.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_88", "* Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_89", "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_90", "* Okay^1, I'm back!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_91", "\\E0* A-another dark room^1,&  huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_92", "\\E6* Don't worry!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_93", "\\E0* M-my hacking skills&  have got things&  covered!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_159", "\\E3* Are you serious?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_174", "* OHHHHHH YESSS!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_175", "* GOOD EVENING^1, BEAUTIES AND&  GENTLEBEAUTIES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_176", "* THIS IS METTATON^1, REPORTING&  LIVE FROM MTT NEWS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_177", "\\M2* AN INTERESTING SITUATION HAS&  ARISEN IN EASTERN HOTLAND!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_178", "\\M3* FORTUNATELY^1, OUR CORRESPONDENT&  IS OUT THERE^1, REPORTING LIVE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_179", "\\M6* BRAVE CORRESPONDENT^1!&* PLEASE FIND SOMETHING&  NEWSWORTHY TO REPORT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_180", "\\M4* OUR TEN WONDERFUL VIEWERS&  ARE WAITING FOR YOU!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_229", "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A DOG!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_230", "\\M4* (CUE AUDIENCE AWWS)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_231", "\\M3* THAT'S RIGHT^1, FOLKS^1!&* IT'S THE FEEL-GOOD&  STORY OF THE YEAR!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_232", "\\M4* LOOK AT ITS LITTLE&  EARS^1, TINY PAWS^1, FLUFFY&  TAIL.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_233", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_234", "* WAIT A SECOND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_235", "\\M5* THAT'S NOT A TAIL!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_236", "\\M3* THAT'S.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_237", "\\M5* A FUSE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_264", "\\M4* THAT'S RIGHT..^1.&* THAT DOG.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_265", "\\M5* IS A BOMB!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_266", "\\M5* BUT DON'T PANIC!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_267", "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_283", "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A GLASS OF WATER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_284", "\\M4* BUT WHAT'S ASTONISHING&  ABOUT THIS GLASS OF&  WATER.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_285", "\\M3* IS HOW UNINTERESTING IT IS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_286", "\\M4* LIKE ALL GLASSES OF WATER^1,&  IT'S COMPRISED OF WATER^1,&  GLASS^1, NITROGLYCERIN.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_287", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_288", "* WAIT A SECOND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_289", "\\M5* THAT'S NOT A GLASS OF&  WATER!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_290", "\\M3* THAT'S.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_291", "\\M5* A BOMB!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_318", "\\M5* OH NO!!^1!&* THIS NEWS REPORT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_319", "\\M5* IS TURNING INTO A DISASTER&  REPORT!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_320", "\\M3* BUT DON'T PANIC!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_321", "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_337", "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A MOVIE SCRIPT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_338", "\\M5* OH MY^1!&* AND IT LOOKS LIKE IT'S&  FOR MY LATEST FILM!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_339", "\\M3* LET'S NOT KEEP THEM WAITING^1!&* LET'S OPEN IT UP AND GET&  THE SCOOP!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_372", "\\M4* ... OH??^1?&* WHAT'S THAT INSIDE THE&  SCRIPT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_373", "\\M4* THAT TICKING SOUND..^1.&* THAT LIT FUSE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_374", "\\M5* OH MY!!^1!&* LOOKS LIKE I WAS WRONG&  ABOUT THE MOVIE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_375", "* WE DEFINITELY HAVE A BOX&  OFFICE BOMB ON OUR HANDS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_376", "* AND IT'S ABOUT TO BLAST&  YOU TO BITS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_377", "\\M3* BUT DON'T GET TOO EXCITED!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_378", "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_394", "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A BASKETBALL!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_395", "\\M4* AH^1.&* BASKETBALLS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_396", "\\M3* CIRCLES OF FUN^1.&* ORBS OF JOY^1.&* SPHERES OF AMUSEMENT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_397", "\\M4* BUT YOU SHOULDN'T PLAY&  WITH THIS ONE^1.&* IT'S AN MTT-BRAND FASHIONBALL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_398", "\\M3* PROPER MAINTENANCE IS&  REQUIRED TO KEEP IT LOOKING&  GOOD./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_399", "\\M3* AS YOU CAN SEE^1, EVEN EXPOSURE&  TO HUMAN BODY HEAT CAUSES&  THE PAINT TO SLOUGH OFF./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_400", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_401", "* WAIT A SECOND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_402", "* THAT'S NOT A BASKETBALL./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_429", "\\M5* THAT'S A BOMB!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_430", "* OH NO!!^1!&* THIS SPORT REVIEW.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_431", "* IS TURNING INTO A SHORT&  REVIEW!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_432", "* BECAUSE IT'LL BE OVER^1.&* AFTER YOU BLOW UP./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_434", "\\M3* BUT DON'T GET TOO EXCITED!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_435", "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_449", "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A PRESENT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_450", "\\M4* AND IT'S TIME FOR THE&  UNBOXING VIDEO!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_451", "\\M5* LET'S FIND OUT WHAT'S&  INSIDE!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_479", "\\M2* THAT ROUND^1, BLACK SHAPE..^1.&* COULD IT BE???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_480", "\\M4* LOOKS LIKE CHRISTMAS CAME&  EARLY THIS YEAR./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_481", "\\M5* IF SANTA GAVE PEOPLE BOMBS&  INSTEAD OF PRESENTS!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_482", "\\M2* REALLY THOUGH^1.&* A BOMB^1.&* WHAT A THOUGHTFUL GIFT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_483", "\\M4* THEY EVEN DECIDED TO&  LIGHT IT FOR YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_484", "\\M3* BUT DON'T GET TOO EXCITED!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_485", "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_499", "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A VIDEO GAME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_500", "\\M4* THIS ACTION-PACKED GAME&  IS GUARANTEED TO BLOW YOU&  AWAY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_501", "\\M3* STRANGE ENEMIES^1!&* STRANGE ALLIES^1!&* ATTRACTIVE ROBOTS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_502", "\\M4* FEATURING UP TO SIX&  ARBITRARY DIALOGUE CHOICES&  AT ONCE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_503", "\\M5* CORRESPONDENT^1!&* LET'S LOOK INSIDE THE CASE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_531", "\\M4* ..^1.&* THOSE RED CYLINDERS WITH&  BURNING FUSES.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_532", "\\M5* OH NO^1!&* THIS GAME LITERALLY IS&  DYNAMITE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_533", "\\M5* I GUESS THEY WERE RIGHT&  ALL ALONG!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_534", "\\M5* VIDEO-GAMES DO CAUSE&  VIOLENCE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_535", "\\M4* OR AT LEAST THIS ONE'S&  ABOUT TO./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_536", "\\M3* BUT DON'T GET TOO EXCITED!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_537", "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_609", "* OH MY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_610", "* IT SEEMS EVERYTHING IN THIS&  AREA IS ACTUALLY A BOMB!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_613", "* THAT DOG'S A BOMB!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_618", "* THAT PRESENT'S A BOMB!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_649", "* THAT BASKETBALL'S A BOMB!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_654", "* THAT PRESENT'S A BOMB!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_684", "* EVEN MY WORDS ARE...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_694", "\\TS ^7  %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_695", " %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_708", "\\W* BRAVE CORRESPONDENT..^1.&* IF YOU DON'T DEFUSE ALL OF&  THE BOMBS.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_730", "\\W*\\M9 THIS BIG BOMB WILL BLOW&  YOU TO SMITHEREENS IN&  \\YTWO MINUTES\\W!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_731", "\\M8* THEN YOU WON'T BE REPORTING&  \"LIVE\" ANY LONGER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_732", "* HOW TERRIBLE^1!&* HOW DISTURBING!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_733", "\\M9* OUR NINE VIEWERS ARE GOING&  TO LOVE WATCHING THIS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_734", "* GOOD LUCK^1, DARLING!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_827", "* Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_828", "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_829", "* D-don't worry!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_830", "\\E6* I installed a&  bomb-defusing program&  on your phone!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_831", "\\W* Use the 'defuse' option&  when the bomb is in the&  \\GDEFUSE ZONE\\W!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_832", "\\E0* N-now^1, go get 'em!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_925", "* WELL DONE^1, DARLING!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_926", "* YOU'VE DEACTIVATED ALL OF&  THE BOMBS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_927", "\\W* IF YOU DIDN'T DEACTIVATE&  THEM^1, THE BIG BOMB WOULD&  HAVE EXPLODED IN \\YTWO MINUTES\\W./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_928", "\\W* NOW IT WON'T EXPLODE&  IN \\YTWO MINUTES\\W!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_929", "\\W*\\M9 INSTEAD IT'LL EXPLODE&  IN \\YTWO SECONDS\\W!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_930", "* GOODBYE^1, DARLING!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_934", "* TOO BAD^1, DARLING!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_935", "\\W* YOU FAILED TO DEFUSE ALL&  OF THE BOMBS WITHIN \\YTHREE&  MINUTES\\W!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_936", "* NOW THE BIG BOMB IS&  GOING TO BLOW YOU TO&  SMITHEREENS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_937", "* READY^1, VIEWERS^1?&* HERE COMES THE MOMENT&  YOU'VE ALL BEEN WAITING FOR!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_938", "* AHAHAH!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_939", "* GOODBYE^1, DARLING!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_987", "\\M8* AH./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_988", "* IT SEEMS THE BOMB ISN'T&  GOING OFF./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_989", "\\S-\\Sp\\T0* Ring...\\S+/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_991", "* That's b-because!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_992", "* While you were&  monologuing... I...!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_993", "\\E4* I f..^1. fix..^1.&* Um..^1. I ch-change.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_994", "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\TM %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_995", "* OH NO^1.&* YOU DEACTIVATED THE BOMB&  WITH YOUR HACKING SKILLS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_997", "* Yeah^1!&* That's what I did!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_998", "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\TM %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_999", "\\M9* CURSES^1!&* IT SEEMS I'VE BEEN FOILED&  AGAIN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1000", "* CURSE YOU^1, HUMAN^1!&* CURSE YOU^1, DR. ALPHYS^1,&  FOR HELPING SO MUCH!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1001", "\\M8* BUT I DON'T CURSE MY&  EIGHT WONDERFUL VIEWERS&  FOR TUNING IN!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1002", "* UNTIL NEXT TIME^1, DARLING!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1017", "* W-wow..^1.&* W-we really showed&  him^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1018", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1019", "\\E4* H-hey^1, I know I was&  kind of weird at&  first.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1020", "\\E0* But I really think&  I'm getting more.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1021", "\\E4* Uh^1, more.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1022", "\\E6* M-more confident about&  guiding you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1023", "\\E0* S-so don't worry&  about that b-big&  d-dumb robot.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1024", "\\E6* I-I'll protect you&  from him!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1025", "\\E3* A-and if it really&  c-came down to it^1,&  we could just t-turn.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1026", "\\E5* Um^1, nevermind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1027", "\\E0* Later!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1028", "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1029", "* (Click...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1034", "* B-boy..^1.&* That was close^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1035", "\\E8* I guess a little&  closer than I would&  have liked./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1036", "\\E9* I should have given&  you better directions.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1037", "\\E8* A-and there j-just&  w-wasn't enough&  time.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1038", "\\E6* W-well^1!&* That's Mettaton's fault^1,&  not mine!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1039", "\\E9* I c-can't second&  guess myself now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1040", "\\E4* I'm f-finally starting&  to f-feel confident&  about g-guiding you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1041", "\\E6* I'll protect you from&  that mean old robot^1,&  n-no matter what!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1042", "\\E3* If I have to^1,&  I'll even t-turn.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1043", "\\E5* Um^1, nevermind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1044", "\\E0* We're over halfway&  to the core!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mettnewsevent_1045", "* Let's go!/");
