  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mkid_actor_337", "* So^1, one time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mkid_actor_338", "* We had a school project where&  we had to take care of&  a flower./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mkid_actor_339", "* The king ^1- we had to call him&  \"Mr. Dreemurr\" ^1- volunteered&  to donate his own flowers./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mkid_actor_340", "* He ended up coming to school&  and teaching the class about&  responsibility and stuff./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mkid_actor_341", "* That got me thinking.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mkid_actor_342", "* YO^1!&* How COOL would it be if&  UNDYNE came to school!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_mkid_actor_343", "* She could beat up ALL&  the teachers!!/%%");
