  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_notify_room_398", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_271", "* (It's a trash can.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_272", "* (It's full of crumpled-up&  recipes for butterscotch&  pie.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_277", "* (It's a trophy.^1)&* (Number 1 Nose-Nuzzle&  Champs '98!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_282", "* This is an Echo Flower^1.&* It repeats the last thing&  it heard^1, over and over.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_283", "* Neat^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_284", "* Never trust a flower..^1.&* That's one of the constants&  of this world./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_291", "* This cheese has been here so&  long^1, a magical crystal has&  grown around it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_292", "* It's stuck to the table.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_295", "* (Seems like the mouse has&  freed some of the cheese&  from the crystal somehow.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_300", "* What's a star?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_301", "* Can you touch it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_302", "* Can you eat it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_303", "* Can you kill it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_304", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_305", "* Are you a star?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_308", "* What are you holding^1?&* Is that a star?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_313", "* We can go and see the&  real stars now.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_314", "* But I still don't know&  what those are./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_319", "* One of the stars faded out./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_320", "* What does that mean...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_334", "* (It's a dirty sock with a&  series of notes on it.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_335", "\\TP %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_336", "SANS^1!&PLEASE PICK UP YOUR SOCK!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_337", "\\Ts %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_338", "* ok./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_339", "\\TP %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_340", "DON'T PUT IT BACK DOWN^1!&MOVE IT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_341", "\\Ts %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_342", "* ok./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_343", "\\TP %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_344", "YOU MOVED IT TWO INCHES^1!&MOVE IT TO YOUR ROOM!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_345", "\\Ts %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_346", "* ok./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_347", "\\TP %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_348", "AND DON'T BRING IT BACK!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_349", "\\Ts %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_350", "* ok./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_351", "\\TP %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_352", "IT'S STILL HERE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_353", "\\Ts %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_354", "* didn't you just say not&  to bring it back to my&  room?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_355", "\\TP %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_356", "FORGET IT!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_368", "* What^1.&* What^1?&* WHAT!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_369", "* It's a living./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_372", "* So^1, you helped get us&  all free.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_373", "* I guess I really acted&  like a dummy to you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_377", "* Sorry for acting like a&  dummy before./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_378", "* You've really helped me&  out!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_384", "* (It's a snail.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_385", "* (For some reason^1, you can't&  help but wonder what it&  tastes like...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_388", "* (It's a snail.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_389", "* (You wonder if Toriel has&  seen it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_406", "* We were hanging out&  when suddenly^1, a buncha puzzles&  reactivated out of nowhere./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_407", "* This is a huge problem..^1.&* It rules^1! They've GOTTA&  cancel school over this!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_409", "* Wait a second..^1.&* Auuuugh^1, it's summer vacation!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_417", "* Hey^1, did you hear^1?&* The barrier's opened up!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_418", "* Now school HAS to be&  cancelled^1, right!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_423", "* Why should we bother going&  to school^1, anyway...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_424", "* This world's got no future./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_430", "* Finally!&* Someone turned off that laser!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_431", "* Now that we're free we can..^1.&* Well^1, uh^1, I guess we'll just&  keep standing here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_434", "* Hm^1?&* Nice try^1, but your loitering&  technique still needs work./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_436", "* There will be lots of places&  to loiter on the surface^1,&  I bet./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_440", "* Loitering around..^1.&* What's the point?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_451", "* The way to work is blocked^1,&  so I had time to catch&  Mettaton's show on my phone.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_452", "* The special effects were&  amazing today^1!&* That human almost looked REAL!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_454", "* Of course^1, an experienced&  viewer like me knows CGI&  when they see it.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_458", "* The barrier's opened up^1, so&  we don't have to go to&  work today./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_459", "* I mean^1, sure^1, we're free^1,&  but it's the little&  things^1, you know?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_464", "* That last episode had me&  really shaken.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_465", "* But Mettaton's OK^1.&* Everyone knows it's just CGI!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_470", "* Mettaton^1?&* Yeah^1, he's the most popular&  star in the underground!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_471", "* His fan club probably has&  at least two..^1. no^1, THREE&  dozen members!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_474", "* And that's not even counting&  me!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_478", "* Today^1, we all started as&  co-workers.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_479", "* Who knows what we'll be&  tomorrow?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_484", "* What a heartbreaker./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_485", "* I bet his fanclub's almost&  doubled in size from that!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_508", "* (There's a piece of cheese&  inside this computerized&  laser-safe.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_509", "* (The lasers have melted the&  edges of the cheese..^1.)&* (It's stuck to the table.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_513", "* (Seems like the mouse hacked&  the safe and took the&  cheese out.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_523", "* It's so nice to&  have you over!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_524", "* Why not take a&  seat at the&  table?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_527", "* Sit at the freakin'&  table^1, you little&  nerd./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_534", "* I..^1. I..^1. I ended up buying a&  donut.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_535", "* I..^1. I..^1. I didn't want to^1, but&  that girl..^1. even though I told&  her no^1, she.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_536", "* ... kept staring at me in this&  creepy way and licking her&  lips./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_537", "* N..^1. now I'm outta cash./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_540", "* Maybe I can sell it online&  and double my money back.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_545", "* On the surface^1, I won't&  buy any donuts from&  spiders./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_546", "* That's my resolution./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_551", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_568", "* (It's just a regular flower.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_580", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_582", "* ... what?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_588", "* (It's an empty dog food&  bowl.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_593", "* (It's a treadmill.^1)&* (There's a message attached.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_594", "* \"the truth is that you got&  owned^1, nerd......\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_599", "* (... he seems happy.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_604", "* Sn..^1. ow..^1. y.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_615", "\\E0* There you are^1,&  Frisk-darling./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_616", "\\E8* Feast your eyes^1!&* Dr. Alphys completed&  my wonderful new body./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_617", "\\E7* Oooh^1!&* And did you hear^1?&* The barrier's OPEN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_618", "\\E4* I can't wait to see&  the sun.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_619", "\\E5* ... the greatest&  spotlight of all!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_620", "\\E9* Oh yes^1.&* I suppose I should thank&  you^1, too^1, darling./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_621", "\\E2* Before fighting you^1,&  I had.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_622", "\\E4* Forgotten how fun it&  was to perform with&  others./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_623", "\\E6* So I've been searching&  for HOT TALENTS to fill&  up my upcoming troupe./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_624", "\\E0* So far^1, Shyren's agreed&  to be my back-up singer./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_625", "\\E0* And Bl..^1.&* Napstablook^1, here^1, will&  be my sound mixer!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_626", "\\E2* The three of us&  performing together.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_627", "\\E4* It really feels overdue^1,&  doesn't it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_631", "\\E0* Frisk^1, darling^1.&* Can you help me with&  something?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_632", "\\E2* What kind of merchandise&  do you think humans&  would want to buy...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_633", "\\E1* I've thought of a few&  ideas so far./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_634", "\\E6* Buttons (with my face)&* Stickers (with my face)&* CDs (with my face)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_635", "\\E7* Posters (with my face)&* T-shirts (with my face)&* Underwear (with my face)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_636", "\\E9* ... and plush dolls of&  TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_638", "\\E8* But, you know^1.&* With my face instead&  of hers./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_640", "\\E0* So what do you think?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_641", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_642", "* (...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_644", "* (A yes or no prompt was not&  provided.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_645", "\\TS \\F8 \\TM %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_646", "\\E9* Fabulous^1!&* I completely agree!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_651", "\\E2* Oh^1, Frisk^1.&* Why don't you go see&  how Alphys is doing?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_652", "\\E1* Since the flash of light&  she's been working hard&  to set everything right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_653", "\\E0* Ha-Ha^1.&* About time^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_662", "* (By barking with text-to-speech&  on^1, the dog accidentally&  programmed a whole game.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_663", "* (Hmmm..^1. seems fine.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_669", "* Blub blub..^1.&* You'll have to reserve a&  table to eat here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_670", "* You'll also need to reserve&  your chair^1, your silverware^1,&  your food^1, your.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_674", "* Blub blub..^1.&* Now we can live life&  without reservations./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_679", "* Blub blub..^1.&* Mettaton isn't here to press&  his face into the steaks./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_680", "* He told me that if he ever&  disappeared^1, we could use&  my face instead.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_681", "* But^1, I'm nervous^1.&* What if my face doesn't&  taste very good...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_686", "* As I came in^1, I realized I&  forgot to make a reservation./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_687", "* But I didn't want to look&  like I messed up^1.&* So I kept walkin' in anyway./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_688", "* Now I'm just..^1. kinda..^1.&* Consuming dew off this ficus./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_692", "* Oh^1, we're all free?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_693", "* Oh..^1.&* Guess I can..^1.&* Stop lickin' this ficus./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_694", "* ... but I don't want to look&  like I messed up^1, so&  I'll keep going.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_699", "* What would Mettaton think if&  he saw me licking this&  plant of his...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_700", "* Eh..^1. who cares./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_709", "* I work at the CORE^1.&* The inside is a maze made of&  swappable parts.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_710", "* That means we can shuffle the&  layout at will./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_711", "* Boy^1, was today a FUN day^1!&* I sure love PUZZLE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_715", "* So^1, if we're leaving^1, will&  my job...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_716", "* Ugh^1, and I just got a raise^1!&* Well^1, guess every apple has&  its CORE^1, heheh./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_721", "* Today^1, we received the&  promise of a lot of money&  from a strange source./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_722", "* It may not be kosher^1, but..^1.&* Whew^1! I love puzzle!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_728", "* Originally^1, we dug mazes&  with puzzles in order to&  foil human attacks./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_729", "* But now^1, building things&  winding and confusing...^1.&* It's some awful tradition./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_730", "* You can't go (ugh) two feet&  without being up to your&  armpits in puzzles./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_734", "* The surface world..^1.&* Really!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_735", "* Maybe I'll be able to&  go two feet without running&  into a puzzle./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_740", "* One thing I can say.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_741", "* I respect Mettaton for not&  putting any puzzles here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_742", "* At another hotel^1, I had&  to find 12 magic keys just to&  unlock the shower./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_751", "* Mettaton looked really..^1.&* Really cool in that dress./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_752", "* It sort of makes me feel like&  I could wear one^1, too!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_756", "* Mettaton..^1.!&* He recognized my voice from&  when I called in^1, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_757", "* He..^1. he gave me his dress^1!&* I'm so...^1!&* Ha ha ha!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_762", "* Please don't talk to me^1.&* I am feeling discouraged&  about something./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_769", "* Welcome to MTT Resort - &* Hotland's biggest apartment-&  building-turned-hotel!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_770", "* Whether you're here for a night&  or still live here^1, MTT Resort&  prides itself on a great stay!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_771", "* Just passing through...^1? Nice^1!&* MTT Resort prides itself on&  being passed through!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_775", "* Sorry - the resort's shutting&  down./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_776", "* But I think you'll find it's&  still great to pass through!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_781", "* Welcome to MTT Resort^1!&* Have you seen Mettaton?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_782", "* He hasn't come by lately^1.&* I have a lot of respect for&  that man./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_783", "* I had trouble getting a job&  because I am so pointy and&  angular./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_784", "* But^1, being a rectangle^1, he&  understood my struggles./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_792", "* I love hot dogs!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_793", "* Hey..^1.&* Isn't it weird there's&  SNOW on that guy's roof?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_794", "* ... guess he's just too lazy&  to clean it off./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_798", "* I love hot dogs!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_799", "* But the hot dog guy left..^1.&* Even though all of his&  stuff is still here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_800", "* ... guess he's just too lazy&  to clean it away./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_805", "* I wanted another hot dog^1.&* But the hot dog guy never&  came back./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_806", "* Besides that^1?&* Today was fine./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_807", "* Count your blessings^1.&* Even if you don't get a&  second hot dog./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_812", "* Toasty bun!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_npc_room_817", "* (It's hard-boiled.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_181", "* Hey..^1. there..^1.&* Noticed you were..^1.&* Here.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_182", "\\M1* I'm Onionsan^1!&* Onionsan^1, y'hear!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_211", "\\M1* You're visiting Waterfall^1, huh^1!* It's great here^1, huh^1!&* You love it^1, huh!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_212", "\\M0* Yeah^1!&* Me too^1!&* It's my Big Favorite./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_224", "\\M3* Even though^1, the water's&  getting so shallow here..^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_225", "* I^1, have to sit down all&  the time^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_226", "\\M1* He^1-hey^1! That's OK^1!&* It beats moving to the city!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_227", "* And living in a crowded&  aquarium!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_228", "\\M2* Like all my friends did!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_241", "\\M3* And the aquarium's full^1,&  a-anyway^1, so^1, even if I&  wanted to^1, I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_242", "\\M1* That's okay though^1, y'hear!&* Undyne's gonna fix&  everything^1, y'hear!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_243", "* I'm gonna get out of here&  and live in the ocean^1!&* Y'hear!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_256", "\\M2* Hey..^1. there..^1.&* That's the end of this room./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_257", "* I'll see you around^1!&* Have a good time!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_258", "* In Waterfalllllllllllllllll&  lllllllllllll/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_312", "\\M1* Oh^1!&* Did y'hear!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_313", "\\M1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_314", "\\M1* I got nothing else..^1.&* To talk about.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_317", "\\M2* I've been wondering when&  we're all gonna go free./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_318", "\\M3* S-since..^1. if we did..^1.&* How would I ever know?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_319", "\\M1* Well^1, I'll keep my&  tentacles out for you^1!&* Y'hear!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_320", "* As soon as I know I'll be&  the first to tell you^1!&* Y'hear!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_onionsan_event_337", "\\M0* It's gotta be any day now!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_operatingtable_64", "* (It's some kind of operating&  table.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_operatingtable_65", "* (It's sticky...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_otherphonecall_100", "* (Ring... ring...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_otherphonecall_115", "* U-uhhh..^1.&* (Oh my god^1, help...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_otherphonecall_116", "* I'd like to order a..^1.&* Um..^1.&* A pizza...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_otherphonecall_117", "* With^1, uhh..^1.&* The toppings are^1, uh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_otherphonecall_118", "* I have them copied^1, I'll&  just paste them to you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_otherphonecall_119", "\\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_otherphonecall_120", "* (Your phone is too old to&  receive texts...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_otherphonecall_121", "* (It reads out loud^1, character-&  by-character^1, an ASCII art&  of an anime catgirl.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_otherphonecall_122", "\\TA* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_otherphonecall_133", "* (Click...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_158", "\\E0* welp./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_159", "\\E1* someone's gotta keep&  him from getting&  into trouble./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_160", "\\E2* see you guys./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_183", "\\E0* Man^1, do I have&  to do EVERYTHING?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_184", "\\E6* Papyrus^1, wait!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_219", "\\E0* Hey^1, Undyne!^1!&* Wait up!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_255", "* Whoops./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_273", "* Uh^1, should I do&  something?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_275", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_277", "* Well^1, gotta go!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_309", "* It seems that everyone&  is quite eager to&  set off./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_344", "* What?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_345", "\\E1* Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_346", "\\E0* You really are a&  funny child./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_347", "\\E1* If you had said that&  earlier^1, none of this&  would have happened./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_348", "\\E0* It is a good thing&  you took so long to&  change your mind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_349", "* Hee hee hee./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_350", "* Well..^1.&* I suppose./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_351", "* If you really do&  not have any other&  place to go.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_352", "* I will do my best to&  take care of you^1, for&  as long as you need./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_353", "* All right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_354", "* Now^1, come along./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_372", "* Everyone is waiting&  for us!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_413", "\\E1* Ah./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_414", "\\E0* ... I see./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_415", "\\E1* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_416", "\\E0* Well^1, I hope that&  I am not keeping&  you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_478", "* Frisk./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_outsideworld_event_479", "* \"See you around.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papbookshelf_63", "THAT BOOK'S ONE&OF MY&FAVORITES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papbookshelf_64", "\"ADVANCED PUZZLE&CONSTRUCTION FOR&CRITICAL MINDS.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papbookshelf_66", "THAT NEXT BOOK'S&ANOTHER ONE OF&MY FAVORITES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papbookshelf_67", "\"PEEK-A-BOO WITH&FLUFFY BUNNY.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papbookshelf_68", "\\E3THE ENDING&ALWAYS GETS ME./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papbookshelf_71", "* (Complex manuals and&  children's books.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papbookshelf_76", "* (The bookshelf is filled&  with complex tomes&  about puzzle creation.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papbookshelf_77", "* (And children's books.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcheckpoint_98", "* There's some narration on this&  cardboard box./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcheckpoint_99", "\\TP %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcheckpoint_100", "YOU OBSERVE THE&WELL-CRAFTED&SENTRY STATION./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcheckpoint_101", "WHO COULD HAVE&BUILT THIS^1, YOU&PONDER.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcheckpoint_102", "I BET IT WAS&THAT VERY FAMOUS&ROYAL GUARDSMAN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcheckpoint_103", "(NOTE: NOT YET A&VERY FAMOUS&ROYAL GUARDSMAN^1.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcheckpoint_107", "(NOTE: NOT YET A&VERY FAMOUS&ROYAL GUARDSMAN^1.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcheckpoint_108", "(UPDATE: AM I A&ROYAL GUARDSMAN&YET???)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcheckpoint_112", "* These instructions&  are written in&  chicken scratch./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcomputer_63", "THE INTERNET^1!&I'M QUITE&POPULAR THERE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcomputer_64", "I'M JUST A&DOZEN AWAY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_papcomputer_65", "FROM A DOUBLE&DIGIT FOLLOWER&COUNT!/");
