  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_phonecall_room_310", "\\E3* I don't really...&* Like giving away&  puzzle solutions./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_phonecall_room_311", "\\E6* But if you need&  help^1, just call&  me^1, ok?/");
