  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_626", "SIMPLE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_627", "TO IMPRESS MR.&ASGORE DREEMURR,&OF COURSE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_628", "OR AS ALPHYS&CALLS HIM.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_629", "\"MR. DREAMY.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_630", "THOSE STRONG ARMS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_631", "THAT LUSTROUS&BEARD.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_632", "LIKE ALL THOSE WHO&CREATE WEAPONS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_633", "SHE CRAVES THE&TENDER EMBRACE OF&A BURLY MAN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_634", "CAN SHE TRULY&BE BLAMED?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_642", "... SERIOUSLY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_643", "MY MY..^1.&HOW CONCEITED CAN&YOU GET...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_644", "I LOVE IT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_645", "AND WHILE YOU ARE&COMPLETELY WRONG^1,&YOU DESERVE SOME&CREDIT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_646", "I'VE SEEN HER WATCH&YOU ON HER COMPUTER&SCREEN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_647", "SMILING WHEN YOU&SUCCEED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_648", "SHRIEKING WHEN YOU&FAIL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_649", "AND ALWAYS, ALWAYS,&WHISPERING.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_650", "\"NO! WRONG!&YOU HAVE TO&GO THAT WAY!\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_651", "IN ITS OWN WAY^1,&IS THIS NOT&LOVE??/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_657", "CORRECT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_658", "DR. ALPHYS HAS&A CRUSH ON.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_659", "THE UNKNOWABLE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_660", "YOU SEE, ALPHYS&BELIEVES THERE IS&SOMEONE OUT THERE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_661", "SOMEONE WATCHING HER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_662", "SOMEONE SHE THINKS&IS \"CUTE\" AND&\"INTERESTING.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_663", "HELLO, THEORETICAL&PERSON./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_664", "DR. ALPHYS LIKES&YOU./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_665", "TOO BAD YOU&ARE NOT REAL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_666", "*DERISIVE&LAUGHTRACK*/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_691", "H-hey^1, I've done&research about this!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_692", "There are alternate&universes out there!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_693", "S-someday^1, maybe^1, I&could meet them.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_704", "YOU SAID THE&EXACT SAME THING&ABOUT \"MEW MEW&KISSY CUTIE.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_705", "BUT I'LL GIVE YOU&THE BENEFIT OF&THE DOUBT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_706", "PERSON^1, IF YOU'RE&OUT THERE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_707", "HOW ABOUT GIVING US&A SIGN^1, RIGHT NOW?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_725", "THAT SETTLES&THAT, DOESN'T IT?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_745", "WELL WELL WELL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_746", "WITH DR. ALPHYS&HELPING YOU.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_747", "THE SHOW HAS NO&DRAMATIC TENSION!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_748", "WE CAN'T GO ON&LIKE THIS!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_749", "BUT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_750", "BUT!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_751", "THIS WAS JUST THE&PILOT EPISODE!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_752", "NEXT UP, MORE&DRAMA!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_753", "MORE ROMANCE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_754", "MORE BLOODSHED!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_questionasker_755", "UNTIL NEXT TIME,&DARLINGS...!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_modernbook_59", "%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_modernbook_60", "* (Here I am..^1.&* Writing this book.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_modernbook_61", "* (A person comes in and picks&  up the book...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_modernbook_62", "* (They start reading it...!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_modernbook_63", "* Oh^1, sorry^1.&* I'm still writing that one./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_modernbook_68", "* (Some unfinished book.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_64", "%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_65", "* Only the fearless may proceed.&* Brave ones, foolish ones.&* Both walk not the middle road./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_66", "* Stay on the path./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_67", "* The western room is the&  eastern room's blueprint./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_68", "* Three out of four grey rocks&  recommend you push them./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_69", "* (There's an ant-sized frog in&  a crack in the wall...^1)&* (It waves at you.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_69_console_1", "* (There's a small crack in the&  wall here.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_69_console_2", "* (There's a frog inside...^2)&* (Wait^1! There are two!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_69_console_3", "* (You had a wonderful,&  exclusive experience...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_69_console_4", "* (... that only someone who&  saw two frogs could feel.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_70", "* There is just one switch./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_71", "* The far door is not an exit^1.&* It simply marks a rotation&  in perspective./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_72", "* If you can read this^1,&  press the blue switch./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_73", "* If you can read this^1,&  press the red switch./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_74", "* If you can read this^1,&  press the green switch./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_75", "* These books are worn...&* They must have been read&  many times./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_78", "* (There's an old calendar from&  the end of 201X.^1)&* (A date is circled on it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_79", "\\R* (The date I came here.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_81", "* The ends of the tools have&  been filed down to&  make them safer./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_82", "* Seems like gardening tools./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_83", "* Look at these cool toys^2!&* They don't interest you&  at all./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_84", "* (Dusty toys.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_86", "* Throne Room/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_90", "* (It's a coffin.^1)&* (There's a name engraved on&  it.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_91", "* (\"\\[C].\")/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_92", "* (It's empty.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_96", "* (The coffin is empty...?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_97", "* (You didn't notice before^1,&  but there's something like...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_98", "* (... mummy wrappings at the&  bottom of it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_103", "\\R* (It's as comfortable as it&  looks.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_112", "* You peek inside..^2.&* Scandalous!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_113", "* It's TORIEL's sock&  collection./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_114", "* You can't stop looking&  at the socks./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_118", "* (You came all the way&  back here to look at&  Toriel's socks.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_119", "* (You have great priorities&  in life.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_125", "* It's a clothes drawer^1.&* There are robes^1, button-up&  shirts.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_126", "* ... and a pink^1, hand-knit&  sweater that says&  \"Mr. Dad Guy.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_130", "\\R* Still has that sweater./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_134", "* (It's just a chair.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_139", "* (It's a throne.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_142", "* \"Room under renovations.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_143", "* \"Room under renovations.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_144", "* For some reason^1, there&  is a brand-name chocolate&  bar in the fridge./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_147", "* (The fridge is full of&  unopened containers of&  snails.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_151", "\\R* No chocolate./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_154", "* ...!^1?&* There's a camera hidden&  in the bushes./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_155", "* (His.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_158", "* There's a switch hidden&  in the snow^1.&* Click!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_159", "* The switch is stuck now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_162", "* There's a switch here^1.&* It's been depressed with&  vines./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_164", "* On the floor inside is&  a box of pomeraisins./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_198", "* (It's a school report about&  monster funerals.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_199", "* Monster funerals^1, technically&  speaking^2, are cool as heck./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_200", "* When monsters get old and&  kick the bucket^1, they turn&  into dust./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_201", "* At funerals^1, we take that&  dust and spread it on that&  person's favorite thing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_202", "* Then their essence will live&  on in that thing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_203", "* Uhhh^1, am I at the page&  minimum yet^1?&* I'm kinda sick of writing this./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_208", "\\W* Mom says that sleeping&  can recover your health&  \\Yabove your maximum HP\\W./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_209", "* ... what's maximum HP?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_213", "* Mom says that we can&  go to the surface world&  now!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_214", "* ... what's so great about&  that^1, anyway^1?&* I don't wanna move./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_219", "* (It's merely a decoy.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_228", "* \"The power to take their&  SOULs.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_229", "* \"This is the power that&  the humans feared.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_235", "* (Ancient writing covers the&  walls..^1. you can just make&  out the words.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_236", "* \"The War of Humans and&  Monsters.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_241", "* The northern room hides a&  great treasure./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_247", "* Hurt, beaten, and fearful for&  our lives, we surrendered&  to the humans./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_248", "* Seven of their greatest&  magicians sealed us underground&  with a magic spell./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_249", "* Anything can enter through the&  seal, but only beings with a&  powerful SOUL can leave./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_256", "* However...&* There is a prophecy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_257", "* The Angel...&* The One Who Has Seen The&  Surface.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_258", "* They will return.&* And the underground will go&  empty./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_263", "* The ancient glyphs have been&  painted over with a list of&  21 different flavors./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_269", "* Achoo^1!&* Tried to catch a bug^1, but&  I just caught a cold.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_274", "* The humans, afraid of our&  power^1, declared war on us./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_275", "* They attacked suddenly, and&  without mercy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_280", "* Without candles or magic to&  guide them Home^1, the monsters&  used crystals to navigate./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_292", "* (It's a beat-up figurine&  of a female human with&  cat ears.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_293", "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_299", "* (Scientific books.^1)&* (They seem very dusty.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_304", "* (It's a fridge.^1)&* (It's strangely warm.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_306", "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_312", "* MILK^1? EGGS^1? IN THE FRIDGE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_313", "* NO WAY^1, DARLING^1!&* THEY'D GET COLD!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_320", "* Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_321", "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_322", "* Um^1, is it really&  a good idea to be&  getting a snack?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_323", "\\E8* Well^1, I guess I&  really shouldn't&  judge you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_324", "\\E0* After all^1, I'm the&  one eating potato&  chips in my PJs!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_325", "\\E5* Uhhh^1, I mean..^1.&* H-hey^1, go over to&  the right!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_328", "* Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_329", "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_330", "* H-hey^1!&* Head over to the&  right!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_347", "* I hate cold food./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_349", "\\E0* So Alphys fixed up&  my fridge so it&  heats up food instead!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_350", "\\E6* Hot Fridge..^1.&* The world's greatest&  invention!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_354", "\\E6* Hot Fridge..^1.&* The world's greatest&  invention!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_360", "* This oven is some&  top-of-the-line&  MTT thing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_361", "\\E4* But^1, y'know^1, as much&  as technology&  advances.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_362", "\\E0* Nothing beats food&  home-cooked with&  fire magic./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_369", "* (It looks like some sort of&  powerful bracelet...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_370", "* (Wait.^1)&* (It's just a croissant...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_375", "* (It's just a regular wall.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_380", "* (East...)&* (The End.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_385", "* (Solve this puzzle,&  and The End will open.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_390", "* (Traverse the northern&  room^1, and The End will&  open.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_395", "* (I cannot fight.)&* (I cannot think.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_396", "* (But^1, with patience^1,&  I will make my way&  through.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_401", "* (Get lost...)&* (And stay that way.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_406", "* (Why not relax and have&  a nice snack?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_416", "* (It's completely trashed.^1)&* (There's no way it could&  ever be repaired.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_419", "* (It's out of batteries.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_425", "* ENTRY NUMBER 1/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_426", "* This is it..^1.&* Time to do what the King&  has asked me to do./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_427", "* I will create the power to&  free us all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_428", "* I will unleash the power of&  the SOUL./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_430", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_435", "* POWER ROOM/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_436", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_441", "* ENTRY NUMBER 6/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_442", "* ASGORE asked everyone&  outside the city for monsters&  that had \"fallen down.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_443", "* Their bodies came in today./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_444", "* They're still comatose..^1.&* And soon^1, they'll all&  turn into dust./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_445", "* But what happens if I&  inject \"determination\" into&  them?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_446", "* If their SOULS persist&  after they perish^1, then.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_447", "* Freedom might be closer&  than we all thought./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_449", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_454", "* ENTRY NUMBER 9/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_455", "* things aren't going well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_456", "* none of the bodies have&  turned into dust^1, so I&  can't get the SOULs./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_457", "* i told the families that&  i would give them the&  dust back for the funerals./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_458", "* people are starting to&  ask me what's happening./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_459", "* what do i do?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_462", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_467", "* ENTRY NUMBER 12/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_468", "* nothing is happening^1.&* i don't know what to do./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_469", "* i'll just keep injecting&  everything with& \"determination.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_470", "* i want this to work./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_471", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_476", "* ENTRY NUMBER 14/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_477", "* Everyone that had fallen&  down.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_478", "* ... has woken up./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_479", "* They're all walking around&  and talking like nothing&  is wrong./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_480", "* I thought they were&  goners...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_481", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_486", "* ENTRY NUMBER 7/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_487", "* We'll need a vessel to&  wield the monster SOULs&  when the time comes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_488", "* After all^1, a monster&  cannot absorb the SOULs&  of other monsters./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_489", "* Just as a human cannot&  absorb a human SOUL.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_490", "* So then.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_491", "* What about something that's&  neither human nor monster?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_492", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_497", "* ENTRY NUMBER 15/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_498", "* Seems like this research&  was a dead end.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_499", "* But at least we got a&  happy ending out of it...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_500", "* I sent the SOULS back to&  ASGORE^1, returned the&  vessel to his garden..../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_501", "* And I called all of the&  families and told them&  everyone's alive./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_502", "* I'll send everyone back&  tomorrow. :) /%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_503", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_517", "* DT EXTRACTION MACHINE&* STATUS: INACTIVE/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_518", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_523", "* ENTRY NUMBER 4/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_524", "* I've been researching humans&  to see if I can find any&  info about their SOULS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_525", "* I ended up snooping around&  the castle...&* And found these weird tapes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_526", "* I don't feel like ASGORE's&  watched them.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_527", "* I don't think he should./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_528", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_538", "* ENTRY NUMBER 19/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_539", "* the families keep calling&  me to ask when everyone&  is coming home./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_540", "* what am i supposed to say?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_541", "* i don't even answer the&  phone anymore./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_542", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_543", "* (It's too dark to see near&  the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_548", "* (Seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_551", "* ENTRY NUMBER 8/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_552", "* I've chosen a candidate./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_553", "* I haven't told ASGORE yet^1,&  because I want to surprise&  him with it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_554", "* In the center of his&  garden^1, there's something&  special./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_555", "* The first golden flower^1,&  that grew before all the&  others./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_556", "* The flower from the outside&  world./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_557", "* It appeared just before&  the queen left./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_558", "* I wonder.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_559", "* What happens when something&  without a SOUL gains&  the will to live?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_565", "* (None of the buttons work.^1)&* (It seems to have lost power.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_570", "* (The door is jammed shut&  with vines.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_575", "* (Seems like another elevator&  has lost its power.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_580", "* (The jukebox is broken.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_585", "* (It's locked.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_590", "* (It's a worn mattress.^1)&* (The sheets are bunched up in a&  weird^1, creasy ball.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_595", "* (There's a photo album inside&  the drawer.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_596", "* (There are photos of Sans with&  a lot of people you don't&  recognize.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_597", "* (He looks happy.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_602", "* (There's a photo album inside&  the drawer.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_603", "* (There are photos of Sans with&  a lot of people you don't&  recognize.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_604", "* (... and^1, one photo of you&  standing with Sans and all&  your friends.)/");
