  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_610", "* (There's a photo album inside&  the drawer.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_611", "* (There are photos of..^1. Huh?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_612", "* (A card is sticking out from&  the back flap of the binder.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_613", "* (It's a poorly drawn picture&  of three smiling people.^1)&* (Written on it...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_614", "* \"don't forget.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_621", "* (It's a poster for Mettaton's&  latest stage performance.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_622", "* (A tragic tale of two star-&  crossed lovers^1, kept apart&  by the tides of fate...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_623", "* (Looks like it's almost time&  for the performance.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_628", "* (It's locked from the inside.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_633", "* (There's an inscription on&  this fountain.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_634", "* Royal Memorial Fountain&* Built 201X&* (Mettaton Added Last Week)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_639", "* (It's a Wall of Fame full of&  quotes and photos from visiting&  celebrities.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_640", "* \"The food is to die for!^1\"&* \"Gorgeous style and fragrance!^1\"&* \"My face tastes beautiful!\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room1_641", "* (... these are all Mettaton.)/%%");
