  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_67", "* (An empty photo frame.)&* (Someone's dusted it off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_72", "* (It's a family photograph.^1)&* (Everyone is smiling.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_75", "\\R* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_80", "* It's a history book^1.&* Here's a random page.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_81", "* Trapped behind the barrier&  and fearful of further&  human attacks^1, we retreated./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_82", "* Far^1, far into the earth&  we walked^1, until we reached&  the cavern's end./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_83", "* This was our new home^1,&  which we named.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_84", "* \"Home.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_85", "* As great as our king is^1,&  he is pretty lousy at&  names./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_90", "* It's a bureau./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_91", "* There's a Santa Claus outfit&  inside./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_94", "\\R* Nothing useful./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_100", "* (There are photo albums...^1)&* (Scrapbooks...^1)&* (Books on how to make tea...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_101", "* (They all seem very worn.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_105", "\\R* Nothing useful./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_111", "* It's a golden flower./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_114", "* Inside is an old calendar&  from the beginning of&  201X./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_115", "* (It's a golden flower.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_119", "* (It's another throne covered&  by a white sheet.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_124", "* Just a regular old bucket^3 & &  of snails./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_127", "* It's an encyclopedia of&  subterranean plants. You&  open to the middle.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_128", "* \"Typha\" - A group of wetland&  flowering plants with&  brown^1, oblong seedpods./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_129", "* Known more commonly as& \"water sausages.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_135", "* You have seen this type&  of plant before but&  do not know its name./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_136", "* Oh^2!&* It is a \"water sausage.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_140", "* What a nice smell...&* Too hot to eat^1, though./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_141", "* The size of the pie&  intimidates you too much&  for you to eat it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_144", "* (Most of the pie is gone.^1)&* (There are dog prints in&  it...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_149", "* While monsters are mostly made&  of magic^1, human beings are&  mostly made of water./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_150", "* Humans^1, with their physical&  forms^1, are far stronger&  than us./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_151", "* But they will never know&  the joy of expressing&  themselves through magic./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_152", "* They'll never get a bullet-&   pattern birthday card.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_164", "* It's a door./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_166", "* ...!^1?&* There's a camera hidden&  in the bushes./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_178", "\\W* \\OBravery^1. \\YJustice.\\W  &*\\B Integrity^1. \\GKindness^1.\\W &*\\P Perseverance^1. \\LPatience. \\W /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_179", "\\W* Using these^1, you were&  able to win at \"\\RBall Game\\W.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_180", "* (You are awarded 50G.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_186", "\\W* \\RRED\\W - Try as you might^1,&  you continue to be yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_187", "* (You are awarded 10G.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_194", "\\W* \\OORANGE\\W - You are the kind of&  person who rushes fists-first&  through all obstacles./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_195", "* (You are awarded 5G.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_201", "\\W* \\YYELLOW\\W - Your sure-fire&  accuracy put an end to&  the mayhem of \"Ball.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_202", "* (You are awarded 3G.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_208", "\\W* \\BBLUE\\W - Hopping and twirling^1,&  your original style&  pulled you through./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_209", "* (You are awarded 2G.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_215", "\\W* \\GGREEN\\W - Your concern and care&  for \"Ball\" led you to a&  delicious victory./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_216", "* (You are awarded 1G.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_222", "\\W* \\PPURPLE\\W - Even when you felt&  trapped^1, you took notes and&  achieved the end of \"Ball.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_223", "* (You are awarded 2G.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_229", "\\W* \\LLIGHT BLUE\\W - \"Ball\" is \"Small.^1\"&* You waited^1, still^1, for&  this opportunity.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_230", "* ... then dethroned \"Ball\" with&  a sharp attack./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_231", "* (You are awarded 4G.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_238", "* (This flag has nothing else&  to offer.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_245", "\\W* Ah^1! Wow^1! Woah^1!&* It's a \"\\RHole\\W\"./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_247", "* There's a hole here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_252", "* (Hers.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_259", "THIS IS MY BROTHER'S&PET ROCK./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_260", "\\E1HE ALWAYS FORGETS&TO FEED IT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_261", "\\E3AS USUAL^1, I HAVE&TO TAKE&RESPONSIBILITY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_262", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_263", "* (The rock is covered in&  sprinkles.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_266", "* (This rock is covered in&  sprinkles.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_268", "* (This rock is covered in&  sprinkles.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_276", "ISN'T THAT FLAG&NEATO?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_277", "UNDYNE FOUND IT&AT THE BAY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_278", "\\E3I THINK IT'S FROM&THE HUMAN WORLD?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_279", "\\E0NOW^1, I KNOW&WHAT YOU'RE&THINKING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_280", "\\E3WHY WOULD A&HUMAN FLAG.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_281", "HAVE A COOL&SKELETON ON IT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_282", "WELL..^1.&I HAVE A THEORY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_283", "\\E3I THINK HUMANS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_284", "\\E0MUST HAVE&DESCENDED FROM&SKELETONS!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_285", "NYEH HEH HEH!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_287", "* (It's a beat-up pirate&  flag.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_288", "* (It's a beat-up pirate&  flag.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_295", "* Why did the humans attack^1?&* Indeed^1, it seemed that they&  had nothing to fear./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_296", "* Humans are unbelievably strong.&* It would take the SOUL of&  nearly every monster.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_297", "* ... just to equal the power&  of a single human SOUL./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_302", "* This power has no counter.&* Indeed, a human cannot&  take a monster's SOUL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_303", "* When a monster dies, its&  SOUL disappears./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_304", "* And an incredible power&  would be needed to take the&  SOUL of a living monster./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_310", "* There is only one way to&  reverse this spell./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_311", "* If a huge power, equivalent&  to seven human SOULs, attacks&  the barrier.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_312", "* It will be destroyed./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_318", "* In the end, it could&  hardly be called a war./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_319", "* United, the humans were too&  powerful, and us monsters,&  too weak./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_320", "* Not a single SOUL was taken,&  and countless monsters were&  turned to dust.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_326", "* I'm catching bugs^1.&* But the underground doesn't&  have many.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_327", "* I keep catching the same&  one./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_332", "* (It's a computer.^1)&* (It's accessing some kind of&  puzzle in Snowdin.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_333", "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_343", "* (It's an oven.^1)&* (It looks pretty modern.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_345", "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_353", "* OH YES^1! MTT-BRAND OVENS CAN &  REACH TEMPERATURES UP TO&  NINE-THOUSAND DEGREES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_354", "* ROASTING^1! TOASTING^1! BURNING^1!&* CHARRING^1! YOU'RE EXCITED^1,&  AREN'T YOU^1, DARLING? (TM)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_360", "* (It's the oven.^1)&* (Looks like someone forgot&  to preheat it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_373", "* You wanna see my&  room?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_374", "\\E3* TOO BAD^1!&* No nerds allowed!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_375", "\\E9* ... well^1, maybe some&  nerds.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_377", "* You're being kind&  of creepy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_390", "* (It's a spider donut.^1)&* (It looks more...^1)&* (Rubbery than usual.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_395", "* (North^1, the warrior's path.)&* (West^1, the sage's path.)&* (Any path leads to The End.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_400", "* (To the East^1!)&* (This is The End.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_405", "* ENTRY NUMBER 2/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_406", "* The barrier is locked by&  SOUL power../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_407", "* Unfortunately^1, this power&  cannot be recreated&  artificially./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_408", "* SOUL power can only be&  derived from what was&  once living./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_409", "* So^1, to create more^1, we&  will have to use what we&  have now.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_410", "* The SOULs of monsters./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_412", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_417", "* ENTRY NUMBER 13/");
