  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_431", "* it doesn't seem to be&  any different from the&  control cases./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_432", "* whatever^1.&* they're a hassle to work&  with anyway./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_433", "* the seeds just stick to&  you^1, and won't let go.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_434", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_439", "* ENTRY NUMBER 16/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_440", "* no No NO NO NO NO NO/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_441", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_446", "* (There are a bunch of VHSes.^1)&* (Seems like it's mostly&  cartoons of some kind.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_447", "* (They seem to be alphabetized^1,&  save for a few stray...^1)&* (... sticky ones?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_452", "* ENTRY NUMBER 11/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_453", "* now that mettaton's made it&  big^1, he never talks to&  me anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_454", "* ... except to ask when i'm&  going to finish his body./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_455", "* but i'm afraid if i finish&  his body^1, he won't need me&  anymore.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_456", "* then we'll never be friends&  ever again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_457", "* ... not to mention^1, every time&  i try to work on it^1, i&  just get really sweaty.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_462", "* ENTRY NUMBER 20/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_463", "* ASGORE left me five&  messages today./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_464", "* four about everyone being&  angry/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_465", "* one about this cute teacup&  he found that looks like&  me/");
