  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_483", "* (It's locked from the&  inside.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_488", "PLEASE DON'T ENTER&THE MYSTERIOUS&SHACK./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_492", "HELLO^1.&THAT'S NOT&MY HOUSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_493", "THAT'S JUST MY&COOL TOOLSHED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_495", "* Do you call it&  your COOLSHED!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_497", "NO!!^1!&I'VE NEVER THOUGHT&OF THAT!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_498", "THAT'S WHY WE'RE&FRIENDS^1,&UNDYNE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_499", "YOU ENRICH MY&LIFE WITH SHED-&BASED PUNS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_501", "* That's the only&  one I've ever&  made^1, dude./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_506", "READY FOR ANOTHER&NIGHT IN THE&PUNISHMENT SHACK?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_509", "READY FOR ANOTHER&NIGHT IN THE&PUNISHMENT SHACK?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_511", "* Oh my GOD^1, I don't&  even wanna KNOW./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_513", "DON'T BE SO&JUDGMENTAL^1,&UNDYNE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_514", "MY SHACK IS A&FOUR STAR&ESTABLISHMENT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_516", "* What^1, lemme guess./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_517", "\\E6* Sometimes you cut a&  hot dog into the&  dog food^1, right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_519", "WHAT!?!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_520", "\\E0HOW'D YOU KNOW?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_522", "* OH MY GOD^1! NO^1!&* I WAS JOKING!!^1!&* DON'T DO THIS!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_528", "YOU SHOULD LEARN&A PRIVACY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_534", "* (You can't go through the&  fire exit because you're&  not made of fire.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_539", "* (It's an uncovered pillow.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_544", "* (You look in the drawer.^1)&* (There's some kind of badge.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_549", "* (It's a performance schedule.^1)&* (Comedians^1, dancers^1, Sans...^1)&* (Seems there's a break now.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_554", "* (It's some sort of giant bottle&  of perfume.^1)&* (Eau de Rectangle.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_555", "* (The cap is so comically large^1,&  you can't open it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_560", "* (Feeling of being watched.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_563", "* (She's waiting for someone to&  let her out.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_569", "* (The gems on the southern&  wall shine in a&  spectacular pattern.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room2_570", "* (It's a nice thing you can&  see the southern wall from&  this angle.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_59", "%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_60", "* (A box of kids' shoes in&  a disparity of sizes.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_63", "* (It's a drawing of a&  golden flower.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_66", "\\R* My drawing./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_71", "* (Definitely bigger than&  a twin-sized bed.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_74", "* (Earlier^1, you identified&  this as bigger than a&  twin-sized bed.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_75", "* (But now^1, you realize&  it's actually one size&  bigger than a double.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_79", "* The coals are still warm./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_81", "* (Macaroni art of a flower.^1)&* ('For King Dad!')/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_83", "* Inside the drawer are&  flower seeds and some&  broken crayons./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_84", "* There is some white fur&  stuck in the drain./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_85", "* (There is some white fur&  stuck in the drain.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_89", "* Because they are made of&  magic^1, monsters' bodies are&  attuned to their SOUL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_90", "* If a monster doesn't want&  to fight^1, its defenses will&  weaken./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_91", "* And the crueller the intentions&  of our enemies^1, the more&  their attacks will hurt us./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_92", "* Therefore^1, if a being with&  a powerful SOUL struck with&  the desire to kill.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_93", "* Um^1, let's end the chapter&  here.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_104", "* ...!^1?&* There's a camera behind the&  sentry station./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_108", "* ...!^1?&* There is a camera behind the..^1.&  \"sentry station.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_112", "* ...!^1?&* There's a camera hidden inside&  this lump of snow./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_116", "* ...!^1?&* There's a camera hidden inside&  this tree./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_120", "* ...!^1?&* There's a camera hidden inside&  this tree./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_124", "* ...!^1?&* There's a camera behind the&  sentry station./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_128", "* ...!^1?&* There's a camera underneath&  the bridge./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_132", "* ...!^1?&* There's a camera hidden in&  the trees here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_139", "* When four Bridge Seeds align&  in the water^1, they will&  sprout./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_141", "* If an error is made, the Bell&  Blossom can call Bridge Seeds&  back to where they started./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_142", "* WISHING ROOM/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_147", "* But humans have one weakness.&* Ironically, it is the strength&  of their SOUL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_148", "* Its power allows it to persist&  outside the human body, even&  after death./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_154", "* There is only one exception./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_155", "* The SOUL of a special species&  of monster called a&  \"Boss Monster.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_156", "* A Boss Monster's SOUL is&  strong enough to persist&  after death.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_157", "* If only for a few moments./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_158", "* A human could absorb this&  SOUL.&* But this has never happened./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_159", "* And now it never will./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_165", "* But this cursed place has&  no entrances or exits./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_166", "* There is no way a human&  could come here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_167", "* We will remain trapped&  down here forever./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_175", "A CLASSIC IMAGE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_176", "IT ALWAYS REMINDS&ME OF WHAT'S&IMPORTANT IN LIFE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_180", "* (It's a painting of a&  cartoon bone.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_195", "* (Whenever the girl moves her&  net^1, this bug scurries straight&  into it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_200", "* (Seems like the notes to&  something^1, but it's all&  written in chicken scratch.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_201", "* (It seems like a walkthrough&  to a game^1, or...?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_202", "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_207", "* (VHSes and DVDs of various&  cartoons.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_208", "* (They are all labelled \"Human&  History.\")/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_213", "* (It's a specifically-regular&  -sized sink.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_215", "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_222", "* THIS ISN'T A SHOW ABOUT&  WASHING YOUR HANDS, DARLING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_223", "* THAT'S ON WEDNESDAYS!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_228", "* THIS ISN'T A SHOW ABOUT&  WASHING YOUR HANDS, DARLING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_229", "* THAT'S ON WEDNESDAYS!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_242", "* One time^1, Alphys's..^1.&* Uh^1, friend??^1?&* Came over here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_243", "\\E4* All he did was&  lie seductively&  on the piano.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_244", "\\E5* And fed himself&  grapes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_245", "\\E4* I don't really&  like that guy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_246", "\\E3* But I admire&  his lifestyle./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_248", "* What^1?&* I'm not gonna&  serenade you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_254", "* ENTRY NUMBER 3/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_255", "* But extracting a SOUL from&  a living monster would&  require incredible power.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_256", "* Besides being impractical^1,&  doing so would instantly&  destroy the SOUL's host./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_257", "* And^1, unlike the persistent&  SOULs of humans.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_258", "* The SOULs of most monsters&  disappear immediately upon&  death./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_259", "* If only I could make a&  monster's SOUL last.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_261", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room3_266", "* (There are a bunch of VHSes.^1)&* (Seems like it's mostly&  cartoons of some kind.)/%%");
