  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_114", "* \"MONSTER HISTORY PART 4\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_116", "* Fearing the humans no longer^1,&  we moved out of our old&  city^1, HOME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_117", "* We braved harsh cold^1, damp&  swampland^1, and searing heat.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_118", "* Until we reached what we now&  call our capital./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_119", "* \"NEW HOME.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_120", "* Again^1, our King is really&  bad at names...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_126", "* Excuse me..^1.&* Yes^1, you^1, with the striped&  shirt./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_127", "* Can you do something about&  your friend...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_128", "* Yes^1, your friend..^1.&* The one behind you^1, with the&  creepy smile./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_131", "* Hmmm^1?&* Where'd your friend go?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_139", "* If a monster defeats a human^1,&  they can take its SOUL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_140", "* A monster with a human SOUL..^1.&* A horrible beast with&  unfathomable power./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_145", "* (It's a video feed of your&  location.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_146", "* It's you...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_147", "* It's me^1, \\[C]./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_159", "* (It's a microwave.^1)&* (That's great if you're a&  microwave fan.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_161", "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_168", "* MTT-BRAND MICROWAVE^1!&* ORIGIN OF THE MTT CHALLENGE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_169", "* PUT YOUR FOOD IN AND SET&  THE MICROWAVE ON HIGH FOR&  FIVE MINUTES.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_170", "* IF YOU CAN STILL RECOGNIZE&  YOUR MEAL^1, WE'LL DOUBLE YOUR&  MONEY BACK!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_174", "* STILL FIDDLING WITH THAT&  MICROWAVE, EH, DARLING?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_175", "* CAN'T BLAME YOU FOR BEING&  TOTALLY ENAMORED WITH AN&  ELECTRONIC BOX./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_182", "* (In the sink is a teacup&  in the shape of a fish.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_193", "* ENTRY NUMBER 5/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_194", "* I've done it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_195", "* Using the blueprints^1, I've&  extracted it from the&  human SOULs./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_196", "* I believe this is what&  gives their SOULs the strength&  to persist after death./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_197", "* The will to keep living..^1.&* The resolve to change fate./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_198", "* Let's call this power.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_199", "\\Y* \"Determination.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_201", "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_206", "* (Golden flowers.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_212", "* (It's Sans's dirty sock pile.^1)&* (Sc..^1. scandalous...?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_217", "* (There's a strange machine&  behind the curtain.^1)&* (It seems to be broken.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_222", "* (It's locked.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_226", "* (You unlocked the door and&  entered.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_234", "* (Finally^1, the pieces of the&  puzzle are coming together.^1)&* (The jigsaw puzzle.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room4_237", "* Huh!^1?&* There's a camera behind&  the waterfall./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_64", "%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_68", "* (There are a lot of striped&  shirts in here.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_69", "* Our clothes./%%");
