  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_93", "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_104", "* (It's a promo poster for&  Mettaton's TV premiere.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_105", "* (On the flap it says \"Thank&  you for making my dreams&  come true.\")/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_110", "* (An incredible invention.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_111", "* (When not in use^1, this bed&  folds into an extremely-&  easy-to-draw box.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_116", "* (Pink goop drips from this&  strange machine.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_126", "* A haunting song echoes&  down the corridor...&* Won't you play along?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_127", "* Only the first 8 are fine./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_131", "* (It's an illustration of a&  strange creature...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_132", "* (There's something very&  unsettling about this drawing.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_readable_room5_138", "* Love^1, hope^1, compassion..^1.&* This is what people say&  monster SOULs are made of./");
