  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_540", "* Seeing her remember you^1, the&  male Lost Soul tried hard&  to remember you^1, too!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_556", "* You hug the Lost Soul and&  tell her that you're going&  to see her again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_557", "* Something about this&  is so familar to her.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_560", "* Suddenly^1, the memories are&  flooding back!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_566", "* Suddenly^1, her memories are&  flooding back!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_567", "* Seeing her remember you^1, the&  male Lost Soul tried hard&  to remember you^1, too!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_587", "* You tell the Lost Soul you&  prefer butterscotch instead&  of cinnamon./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_592", "* You tell the Lost Soul you&  prefer cinnamon instead&  of butterscotch./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_595", "* Somehow^1, she faintly recalls&  hearing this before.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_598", "* Suddenly^1, her memories&  are flooding back!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_604", "* Suddenly^1, her memories are&  flooding back!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_605", "* Seeing her remember you^1, the&  male Lost Soul tried hard&  to remember you^1, too!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_665", "Your fate is up to&you now!/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_toriel_672", "You are our future!/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_287", "Default");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_288", "All&humans&will&die!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_289", "You're&our&real&enemy.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_290", "Mercy&is for&the&weak.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_322", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_563", "* The Lost Soul stands there.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_597", "* You tapped the Lost Soul&  lightly./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_598", "* Something about the way you&  fight is familiar to her.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_601", "* Something about the way you&  fight..^1.&* It's all flooding back!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_614", "* You asked the Lost Soul to&  teach you how to cook./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_615", "* She doesn't know why^1, but&  she kind of wants to&  teach you how.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_618", "* Suddenly^1, the memories are&  flooding back!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_632", "* You gave the Lost Soul a big&  smile^1, like you remember&  she likes to do./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_633", "* For some reason^1, she sort&  of wants to smile back.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_636", "* Suddenly^1, the memories are&  flooding back!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_649", "* You clashed against the Lost&  Soul with all of your might./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_650", "* She feels your fighting&  spirit..^1.&* It's familiar somehow./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_653", "* She recognizes your fighting&  spirit..^1. suddenly^1, memories&  are flooding back!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_ripoff_undyne_748", "Well^1, some humans&are OK^1, I guess!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_roundedge_135", "* \"The true final battle\" was&  finally beginning.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_87", "* Sorry..^1. UNDYNE^1, like^1, told&  us there was totally a&  human in the area./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_88", "* So^1, like^1, us Royal Guards are&  blocking off the elevators&  for now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_89", "* Ngah^1! Even if the elevators&  aren't working anyway^1, we'll&  do our best^1, Ms. UNDYNE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_93", "* Like^1, NO WAY you're getting&  by us./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_94", "* But^1, between you and me...&* I think you could go through&  that creepy lab over there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_95", "* Between you^1, me^1, and my&  bro here^1, I mean./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_96", "* I tell him ALL my secrets./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_101", "* Hey^1!&* No loitering!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_102", "* Like^1, just kidding^1.&* I don't care^1.&* Like^1, loiter your heart out./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_107", "* Oh^1, hey./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_108", "* We're^1, like^1, taking a rain&  check on that killing-you&  thing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_109", "* Like^1, don't tell Undyne&  about this^1, OK?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_113", "* You didn't tell her^1, did&  you...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_118", "* Undyne told us that the&  Royal Guard is being disbanded./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_119", "* Like^1, bummer..^1.&* Guess we'll have to get&  used to Love and Peace./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_saddragon_70", "* Yeah^1, I'm not gonna be home&  tonight... um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_saddragon_71", "* I think there's some cold&  pizza in my treasure horde&  you can heat up.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_saddragon_75", "* Ummm^1, are you guys on your&  way out^1?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_saddragon_76", "* Guess I'll catch up with you&  later.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_saddragon_81", "* Yeah^1, I'm not gonna be home&  tonight... um.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_saddragon_82", "* In fact^1, I don't feel like&  I'll be home tomorrow^1,&  either^1, at this rate.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_75", "* hey^1, frisk^1, what's&  with that weird&  expression?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_77", "\\E2* Sans^1, did I tell you&  about the time Frisk&  flirted with me...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_79", "\\E8* And then asked to&  call me \"mother?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_81", "\\E0* I felt so embarrassed&  for them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_83", "\\E1* oh boy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_85", "\\E3WOW^1, FRISK.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_86", "\\E0THIS REALLY PUTS&OUR RELATIONSHIP&IN A NEW LIGHT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_88", "\\E1* hey^1, tori^1, do you&  have any other&  embarrassing stories?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_90", "\\E0* Oh^1, do I ever!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_91", "\\E1* But, I think that&  story is one of the&  most unbelievable./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_92", "\\E0* It is hard to think&  anyone would want to&  flirt with me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_94", "\\E0* Ehehe.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_95", "\\E7* Ehehehe.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_96", "\\E1* AHA^1! AHAHAH^1!&* HA!^1! HA!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_97", "\\E2* Oh^1, Toriel^1.&* You have NO idea./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_102", "\\E0* oh hey^1, what's up^1,&  frisk?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_103", "\\E2* we were just talking&  about you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_104", "\\E1* apparently you asked&  to call tori \"mom\" right&  after meeting her?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_106", "\\E1* Well^1, it was not&  RIGHT after./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_107", "\\E0* It took a couple&  minutes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_109", "\\E0* frisk..^1.&* i gotta tell ya./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_110", "\\E2* that's^1, uh^1, not the&  best way to get&  to know someone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_112", "\\E3IT'S NOT???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_114", "\\E9* Papyrus^1, we've been&  over this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_116", "\\E4WHATEVER^1, MOM!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_118", "\\E1* Don't talk back to&  me like that!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_119", "\\E6* Go to your room^1,&  Papyrus!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_121", "\\E5OK^1, UNDYNE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_123", "\\E1* Wait^1!&* Don't ACTUALLY go&  to your room!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_125", "\\E7I'M GETTING MIXED&  MESSAGES HERE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_131", "\\E0* frisk^1, tori was telling&  me how she made&  b'scotch pie for you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_133", "\\E0* Oh^1, I should bake it&  for everyone sometime!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_135", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_137", "\\E3* (O-oh^1, that sounds&  REALLY good.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_139", "\\E3COOKING???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_140", "\\E0CAN I HELP?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_142", "* Wait a second!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_143", "\\E6* Can I help too!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_145", "\\E0* Certainly^1!&* It would be fun to&  cook together!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_147", "\\E9* (On second thought^1,&  maybe I'll o-order&  a pizza.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_154", "\\E0* sorry..^1.&* i don't have time&  to talk^1, frisk./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_155", "\\E1* i'm supposed to be&  working right now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_157", "\\E4BUT YOU AREN'T&  WORKING!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_friendc_159", "\\E2* i know^1, and it's&  taking all my&  concentration./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_interactable1_68", "* you oughta get going^1.&* he might come back^1.&* and if he does.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_interactable1_69", "\\E2* ... you'll have to&  sit through more of&  my hilarious jokes./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_interactable1_74", "* what's the holdup^1?&* look^1, there's nothin&  to be afraid of./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_interactable1_75", "\\E2* it's just a dark cavern&  filled with skeletons&  and horrible monsters./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_interactable1_79", "* well?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_interactable1_85", "* ... are you just gonna&  stare at me^1, or...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_prefinaldate_127", "* grievous error/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_prefinaldate_297", "* over here^1.&* i know a shortcut./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_114", "* hey^1, here's something&  important to remember./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_115", "\\W* my brother has a very&  \\Bspecial attack\\W./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_116", "\\W* if you see a \\Lblue&  attack\\W,^1 don't move and&  it won't hurt you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_117", "* here's an easy way to&  keep it in mind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_118", "\\W* imagine a stop sign^1.&* when you see a stop&  sign^1, you \\Rstop^1,\\W right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_119", "\\W* stop signs are \\Rred\\W.&* so imagine a \\Lblue\\W stop&  sign instead./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_120", "\\W* simple^1, right^1?&* when fighting^1, think&  about \\Yblue stop signs\\W./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_123", "* remember..^1.&* blue stop signs./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_128", "* ... hi./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_135", "* hey^1, thanks..^1.&* my brother seems like&  he's having fun./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_136", "* by the way^1, did you&  see that weird outfit&  he's wearing?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_137", "* we made that a few&  weeks ago for a costume&  party./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_138", "* he hasn't worn anything&  else since.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_139", "* keeps calling it his&  \"battle body.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_140", "* man./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_141", "\\E1* isn't my brother cool?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_145", "* it would make my&  brother happy if you&  played along./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_160", "* thanks for saying&  \"junior jumble\" just&  to appease my brother./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_161", "\\E1* yesterday he got&  stumped trying to&  \"solve\" the horoscope./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_166", "* papyrus..^1.&* ... finds difficulty in&  interesting places./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_167", "\\E1* yesterday he got&  stumped trying to&  \"solve\" the horoscope./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_175", "* guess you don't like&  word searches^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_176", "\\E2* me neither^1.&* i'm more of a funny&  pages kind of guy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_177", "\\E0* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_178", "\\E1* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_182", "\\E1* i guess despite all&  that^1, you still like&  word searches^1, huh...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_183", "\\E0* that means you can't&  be all bad./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_191", "* actually^1, that spaghetti&  from earlier..^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_192", "* it wasn't too bad for&  my brother./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_193", "* since he started cooking&  lessons^1, he's been&  improving a lot./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_194", "\\E1* i bet if he keeps it&  up^1, next year he'll even&  make something edible./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_198", "* hey..^1.&* puzzles might be fun^1.&* if you tried them./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_211", "* good job on solving it&  so quickly^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_212", "* you didn't even need&  my help./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_213", "* which is great^1, 'cause&  i love doing absolutely&  nothing./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_217", "* ... you must be really&  good at puzzles^1,&  huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_218", "* i mean./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_219", "* it's impossible for&  you to have seen&  this one before./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_223", "* hey^1, why didn't you&  ask for help?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_224", "\\E1* i was right here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_229", "* no problem^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_237", "* what's up?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_238", "* you sure do like to&  exercise./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_246", "* i don't know what my&  brother's going to do&  now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_247", "\\W* if i were you^1, i would&  make sure i understand&  \\Bblue attacks\\W./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_250", "* here^1, i'll give you some&  advice about fighting&  my brother./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_251", "\\E1* don't^1.&* capiche?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_256", "\\E1* hmmm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_257", "\\E2* guess we didn't need&  your help to have a&  good time after all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_258", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_259", "\\E2* say^1, i've been&  thinking./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_260", "\\E1* seems like you're&  gonna fight my brother&  pretty soon./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_261", "\\E2* here's some friendly&  advice./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_262", "\\E3* if you keep going the&  way you are now.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_263", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_264", "\\E4* you're gonna have a&  bad time./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_280", "\\E0* dang^1, i wish i brought&  a parasol./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_room_281", "\\E1* i'm getting a nasty burn&  from all this sun./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_sentry2_127", "* grievous error/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_sentry2_134", "* let's hang out again&  sometime./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_sentry2_141", "\\E3* hey^1, i really&  respect what you did&  back there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_sentry2_142", "\\E2* thanks./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sans_sentry2_306", "* over here^1.&* i know a shortcut./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_90", "* Skipped ahead.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_252", "what^1?&you think i'm just&gonna stand there&and take it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_256", "our reports showed&a massive anomaly&in the timespace&continuum./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_257", "timelines jumping&left and right,&stopping and&starting.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_262", "\\E4until suddenly^1,&everything ends./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_266", "\\E4heh heh heh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_267", "\\E5that's your fault^1,&isn't it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_272", "\\E1you can't understand&how this feels./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_277", "\\E4knowing that one&day^1, without any&warning.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_278", "\\E9it's all going to&be reset./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_284", "\\E9look^1.&i gave up trying&to go back a long&time ago./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_290", "\\E4and getting to the&surface doesn't&really appeal&anymore^1, either./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_296", "\\E4cause even if we&do.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_297", "\\E5we'll just end up&right back here^1,&without any memory&of it^1, right?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_303", "\\E1to be blunt.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_304", "\\E4it makes it kind&of hard to give&it my all./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_310", "\\E1... or is that just&a poor excuse for&being lazy...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_311", "\\E3hell if i know./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_317", "\\E4all i know is..^1.&seeing what comes&next.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_318", "\\E9i can't afford not&to care anymore./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_334", "\\E9ugh..^1.&that being said.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_335", "\\E1you^1, uh^1, really&like swinging that&thing around^1,&huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_336", "\\E0.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_337", "\\E4listen./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_338", "i know you didn't&answer me before^1,&but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_339", "\\E4somewhere in&there^1.&i can feel it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_340", "\\E0there's a glimmer&of a good person&inside of you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_341", "\\E4the memory of&someone who once&wanted to do the&right thing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_342", "\\E1someone who^1, in&another time^1,&might have even&been.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_343", "\\E4a friend?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_344", "\\E3c'mon^1, buddy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_345", "\\E0do you remember&me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_346", "\\E4please^1, if you're&listening.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_347", "\\E9let's forget all&this^1, ok?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_348", "\\E3just lay down&your weapon^1, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_349", "\\E4well^1, my job&will be a lot&easier./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_353", "\\E9ugh..^1.&that being said.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_354", "\\E1you^1, uh^1, really&like swinging that&thing around^1,&huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_355", "\\E0.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_356", "\\E4listen./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_357", "friendship.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_358", "\\E3it's really great^1,&right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_359", "let's quit fighting./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_380", "\\E3welp^1, it was&worth a shot./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_381", "\\E5guess you like&doing things the&hard way^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_384", "\\E3woah^1, you look&REALLY pissed off.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_385", "\\E4heheheh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_386", "\\E5did i getcha?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_387", "\\E4well^1, if you came&back anyway.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_388", "\\E1i guess that means&we never really&WERE friends^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_389", "\\E4heh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_390", "\\E9don't tell that&to the other&sans-es^1, ok?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_398", "\\E4sounds strange^1, but&before all this i&was secretly hoping&we could be friends./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_399", "\\E1i always thought the&anomaly was doing&this cause they&were unhappy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_400", "and when they got&what they wanted^1,&they would stop&all this./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_405", "\\E3and maybe all they&needed was..^1.&i dunno./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_406", "\\M1some good food^1,&some bad laughs^1,&some nice friends./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_411", "\\E4but that's&ridiculous^1,&right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_412", "\\E5yeah^1, you're the&type of person&who won't EVER&be happy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_417", "\\E5you'll keep&consuming timelines&over and over^1,&until.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_418", "\\E4well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_419", "\\M1hey./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_420", "\\E3take it from me^1,&kid./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_421", "someday.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_422", "you gotta learn&when to QUIT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_423", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_427", "\\E3and that day's&TODAY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_433", "\\E4cause..^1.&y'see../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_434", "\\E1all this fighting&is really tiring&me out./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_441", "\\E4and if you keep&pushing me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_442", "\\Xt\\E3hen i'll be&forced to use my\\R &special attack\\X./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_448", "\\Xy\\E3eah^1, my \\Rspecial&attack\\X.&sound familiar?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_449", "\\Xw\\E1ell^1, get ready^1.&cause after the&next move^1, i'm&going to \\Ruse it\\X./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_450", "\\E3so^1, if you don't&wanna see it^1, now&would be a good&time to die./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_456", "\\E4well^1, here goes&nothing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_457", "\\E3are you ready?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_458", "\\Xs\\E5urvive THIS^1, and&i'll show you my\\R &special attack\\X!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_477", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_478", "you're sparing me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_479", "\\E1finally./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_480", "\\E3buddy^1.&pal./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_481", "\\E4i know how hard&it must be.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_482", "to make that&choice./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_483", "to go back on&everything you've&worked up to./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_484", "\\E0i want you to&know..^1.&i won't let it&go to waste./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_485", "\\M1.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_486", "\\E3c'mere^1, pal./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_954", "* Just keep attacking.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_956", "* Sans's movements grow a&  little wearier.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_958", "* Sans's movements seem to be&  slower.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_960", "* Felt like a turning point.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_962", "* You felt your sins crawling&  on your back.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_963", "* You felt your sins weighing&  on your neck.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_964", "* KARMA coursing through your&  veins.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_965", "* Doomed to death of KARMA!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_969", "* The REAL battle finally begins.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_971", "* Reading this doesn't seem&  like the best use of time.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_973", "* Sans is starting to look&  really tired.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_975", "* Sans is preparing something.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_977", "* Sans is getting ready to&  use his special attack.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_985", "* Sans is sparing you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_1013", "* SANS 1 ATK 1 DEF&* The easiest enemy^1.&* Can only deal 1 damage./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_1014", "* Can't keep dodging forever^1.&* Keep attacking./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_1018", "* SANS 1 ATK 1 DEF&* The easiest enemy^1.&* Can only deal 1 damage./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_1079", "it's a beautiful&day outside./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_1080", "birds are singing^1,&flowers are&blooming.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_1081", "on days like these^1,&kids like you.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_1084", "it's a beautiful&day outside./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_1085", "birds are singing^1,%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_1089", "ready?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_1152", "Should&be&burning&in hell./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_1446", "\\E1huh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_1447", "\\M1always wondered why&people never use&their strongest&attack first./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_1450", "\\E3anyway^1, as i was&saying^1, it's a&nice day out./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_1451", "\\M1why not relax and&take a load off?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_1455", "here we go./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_1468", "* You feel like you're going to&  have a bad time.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2091", "huff..^1. puff.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2092", "all right^1.&that's it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2093", "\\Xi\\M1t's time for my\\R &special attack\\X./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2094", "\\E3are you ready?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2095", "\\E4here goes nothing./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2111", "\\E1yep./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2112", "\\E1that's right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2113", "\\E3it's literally&nothing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2114", "\\E1and it's not gonna&be anything^1,&either./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2115", "\\E4heh heh heh..^1.&ya get it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2116", "\\E1i know i can't&beat you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2117", "\\E4one of your turns.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2118", "\\E9you're just gonna&kill me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2119", "\\E1so^1, uh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2120", "\\E4i've decided.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2121", "it's not gonna BE&your turn^1.&ever./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2122", "\\E3i'm just gonna&keep having MY&turn until you&give up./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2123", "\\E5even if it means&we have to stand&here until the&end of time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2124", "\\E1capiche?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2141", "\\E9you'll get bored&here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2142", "\\E1if you haven't&gotten bored&already^1, i mean./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2143", "\\E5and then^1, you'll&finally quit./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2161", "\\E5i know your type./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2162", "\\E1you're^1, uh^1, very&determined^1, aren't&you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2163", "\\E4you'll never give&up^1, even if&there's^1, uh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2164", "\\E3absolutely NO&benefit to&persevering&whatsoever./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2165", "\\E1if i can make&that clear./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2166", "\\E4no matter what^1,&you'll just keep&going./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2167", "\\E9not out of any&desire for good&or evil.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2168", "\\E3but just because&you think you&can./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2169", "\\E1and because you&\"can\".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2170", "\\E9... you \"have to.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2188", "\\E9but now^1, you've&reached the end./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2189", "\\E4there is nothing&left for you now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2190", "\\E1so^1, uh^1, in my&personal opinion.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2191", "\\E3the most&\"determined\"&thing you can&do here?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2192", "\\E1is to^1, uh^1,&completely give&up./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2193", "\\E3and..^1. (yawn)&do literally&anything else./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2344", "heh^1, didja&really think you&would be able to");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2495", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2496", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2497", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2498", "so.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2499", "guess that's it^1,&huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2500", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2501", "just.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2502", "don't say i&didn't warn you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2539", "welp./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2540", "i'm going to&grillby's./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansb_body_2574", "papyrus^1, do you&want anything?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansbyetrigger_124", "* actually^1, hey..^1.&* hate to bother ya^1, but&  can you do me a favor?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansbyetrigger_125", "* i was thinking..^1.&* my brother's been&  kind of down lately.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansbyetrigger_126", "* he's never seen a human&  before^1. and seeing you&  might just make his day./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansbyetrigger_127", "* don't worry^1, he's not&  dangerous./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansbyetrigger_128", "\\E1* even if he tries to be./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansbyetrigger_129", "\\E0* thanks a million^1.&* i'll be up ahead./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansbyetrigger_132", "\\E0* well^1, i'll be straight-&  forward with you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansbyetrigger_133", "\\E1* my brother'd really&  like to see a human.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansbyetrigger_134", "\\E2* so^1, y'know^1, it'd&  really help me out.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansbyetrigger_135", "\\E1* if you kept pretending&  to be one./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sanscheckpoint_98", "* It's some sort of checkpoint&  or sentry-station./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sanscheckpoint_99", "* But there are bottles of&  ketchup^1, mustard^1, and relish&  sitting inside.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_116", "* well^1, here we are./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_124", "* so./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_125", "* your journey's&  almost over^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_126", "\\E0* you must really&  wanna go home./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_127", "\\E1* hey^1.&* i know the feeling^1,&  buddo./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_128", "\\E0* though.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_129", "\\E1* maybe sometimes it's&  better to take what's&  given to you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_130", "\\E0* down here you've&  already got food^1,&  drink^1, friends.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_131", "* is what you have&  to do.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_132", "\\E1* really worth it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_149", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_150", "\\E1* ah^1, forget it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_151", "\\E0* i'm rootin' for&  ya^1, kid./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_168", "* hey./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_169", "\\E1* let me tell you&  a story./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_170", "\\E0* so i'm a sentry in&  snowdin forest^1, right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_171", "* i sit out there&  and watch for humans^1.&* it's kind of boring./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_172", "\\E2* fortunately^1, deep in&  the forest.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_173", "\\E0* there's this HUGE&  locked door./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_174", "* and it's perfect&  for practicing&  knock knock jokes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_175", "* so one day^1, i'm&  knocking 'em out^1,&  like usual./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_176", "* i knock on the&  door and say&  \"knock knock.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_177", "* and suddenly^1, from&  the other side.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_178", "\\E1* i hear a woman's&  voice./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_179", "\\Tt*\\E0 \"who is there?\" /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_180", "\\Ts*\\E1 so^1, naturally^1, I&  respond:/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_181", "\\E0* \"dishes.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_182", "\\Tt* \"dishes who?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_183", "\\Ts*\\E2 \"dishes a very&  bad joke.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_184", "\\E0* then she just&  howls with laughter./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_185", "\\E1* like it's the best&  joke she's heard&  in a hundred years./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_186", "\\E0* so I keep 'em&  coming^1, and she keeps&  laughing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_187", "\\E1* she's the best&  audience i've ever&  had./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_188", "\\E0* then^1, after a&  dozen of 'em^1,&  SHE knocks and says.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_189", "\\Tt* \"Knock knock!\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_190", "\\Ts* \\E1i say \"whos&  there?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_191", "\\Tt* \\E0\"old lady!\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_192", "\\Ts*\\E1 \"old lady who?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_193", "\\Tt*\\E2 \"oh! I did not&  know you could&  yodel!\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_194", "\\Ts*\\E1 wow./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_195", "\\E2* needless to say^1,&  this woman was&  extremely good./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_196", "\\E0* we kept telling&  each other jokes&  for hours./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_197", "\\E0* eventually^1, i had&  to leave./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_198", "\\E2* papyrus gets kind&  of cranky without&  his bedtime story./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_199", "\\E0* but she told me&  to come by again^1,&  and so i did./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_200", "\\E0* then i did again^1.&* and again^1.&* it's a thing now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_201", "* telling bad jokes&  through the door./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_202", "\\E1* it rules./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_221", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_222", "\\E0* one day^1, though^1, i&  noticed she wasn't&  laughing very much./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_223", "* i asked her what&  was up./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_224", "* then she told me&  something strange./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_225", "* \\Tt\"if a human ever&  comes through this&  door.../\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_226", "* \"... could you please^1,&  please promise&  something?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_227", "* \"watch over them^1,&  and protect them^1,&  will you not?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_228", "\\E0*\\Ts now^1, i hate making&  promises./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_229", "\\E1* and this woman^1,&  i don't even know&  her name./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_230", "\\E3* but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_231", "\\E1* someone who sincerely&  likes bad jokes.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_232", "\\E2* has an integrity&  you can't say&  \"no\" to./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_259", "\\E1* do you get what&  i'm saying?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_260", "\\E0* that promise i made&  to her.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_261", "\\E1* you know what would&  have happened if she&  hadn't said anything?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_262", "\\E3* ... buddy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_279", "* ... You'd be dead&  where you stand./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_304", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_305", "\\E1* hey^1, lighten up^1,&  bucko!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_306", "\\E2* i'm just joking&  with you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_307", "\\E1* besides.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_308", "\\E0* haven't i done a&  great job protecting&  you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_309", "* i mean^1, look at&  yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_310", "\\E2* you haven't died&  a single time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_313", "\\E0* that's right^1, isn't&  it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_314", "\\E2* well^1, chalk it&  up to my great&  skills./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_317", "\\E0* hey^1, what's that&  look supposed to&  mean?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_318", "\\E1* am i wrong...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_336", "* heh./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_380", "* well^1, that's all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_381", "\\E1* take care of&  yourself^1, kid./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdate3_382", "\\E0* 'cause someone really&  cares about you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdoor_98", "* (The door is locked.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansdoor_102", "* (You unlock the door and&  enter...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sansmailbox_60", "* (It's a mailbox overflowing&  with unread junk mail.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sanssnowman_98", "* (It's a lump of snow with the&  word 'sans' written on it&  in red marker.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sanssteps_56", "* Seems like someone was&  walking in circles just&  to make noises.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_97", "\\R* \\[1] left./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_99", "\\R* That comedian.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_101", "* Determination./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_103", "* The comedian got away^1.&* Failure./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_118", "\\R* \\[1] left./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_120", "* Determination./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_135", "\\R* \\[1] left./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_137", "* Determination./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_145", "* Determination./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_266", "Howdy!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_267", "It's me, FLOWEY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_268", "\\E2FLOWEY the FLOWER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_269", "\\E0I owe you a HUGE thanks./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_270", "\\E9You really did a number&on that old fool./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_271", "\\E0Without you^1, I NEVER could&have gotten past him./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_272", "\\E7But now^1, with YOUR help.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_273", "\\E8 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_274", "\\TFHe's DEAD./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_275", "\\E6And I'VE got the human&SOULS!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_278", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_332", "\\E0Boy!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_333", "\\E0I've been empty for so&long.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_334", "\\E4It feels great to have a&SOUL inside me again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_335", "\\E1Mmmm^1, I can feel them&wriggling.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_337", "\\E6Awww^1, you're feeling&left out^1, aren't you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_338", "\\E1Well^1, that's just perfect./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_339", "\\E0After all^1, I only have&six souls./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_340", "\\E1I still need one more.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_341", "\\TFB\\E2efore I become GOD./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_342", "\\E3And then^1, with my&newfound powers.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_343", "\\E7Monsters./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_344", "\\E5Humans./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_345", "\\E5Everyone^2./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_346", "\\E8I'll show them all the REAL&meaning of this world./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_347", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_435", "\\E0Oh^1, and forget about escaping&to your old SAVE FILE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_436", "\\TFI\\E2t's gone FOREVER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_439", "\\E0Golly^1, if only you&had a SAVE FILE you&could run away to.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_440", "\\TFB\\E2ut you were just&too STUPID to make one!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_442", "\\TfB\\E3ut don't worry./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_443", "\\E0Your old friend FLOWEY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_444", "\\E1Has worked out a replacement&for you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_445", "\\TFI\\E6'll SAVE over your own&death./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_446", "\\E7So you can watch me tear&you to bloody pieces.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_447", "\\E8Over^1, and over^1, and over.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_490", "\\E9... what?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_491", "Do you really think&you can stop ME?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_492", "\\TfH\\E4ee hee hee.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_savepoint_fake_507", "\\E5You really ARE an idiot^4.%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shamblingmass_70", "* As a slime^1, I'm outraged./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shamblingmass_74", "* As a slime^1, I'm overjoyed./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shamblingmass_79", "* As a slime^1, I'm saddened./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_263", "\\E0* Take your time./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_264", "\\E0* Hello^1, traveller^1.&* How can I help you?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_265", "* But nobody came./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_352", "\\E0What would&you like&to buy?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_353", "\\E5Thanks for&your&purchase./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_354", "\\E0Just&looking?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_355", "\\E6That's not&enough&money./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_356", "\\E6You're&carrying&too much./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_357", "/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_438", "\\E0Care to&chat?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_476", "\\E3* Huh^1?&* Sell somethin'^1?&* Does this look like a&  pawn shop?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_477", "\\E4* I don't know how it works where&  you come from... but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_478", "\\E0* If I started spending money&  on old branches and used&  bandages^1, I'd be out of business&  in a jiffy!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_480", "\\E4* If you're really hurtin' for&  cash^1, then maybe you could&  do some crowdfunding./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_481", "* I hear people will pay for&  ANYTHING nowadays./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_486", "* You took 758G from behind the&  counter./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_492", "* Nothing left./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_498", "\\E0* Bye now^1!&* Come again sometime!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_500", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_504", "\\E0* Hiya^1! Welcome to Snowdin^1!&* I can't remember the last&  time I saw a fresh face around&  here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_505", "\\E4* Where did you come from^1?&* The capital?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_506", "\\E0* You don't look like a tourist^1.&* Are you here by yourself?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_511", "\\E0* I mean^1, it happened to you^1,&  right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_512", "* There was a strange flash of&  white light..^1.&* Then I felt my body being pulled&  into..^1. something./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_513", "* Then^1, suddenly^1, everything was&  back to normal./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_518", "\\E0* You want to know what to do&  here in Snowdin?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_519", "\\E4* Grillby's has food^1, and the&  library has information.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_520", "* If you're tired^1, you can take&  a nap at the inn^1.&* It's right next door ^1- my sister&  runs it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_521", "\\E0* And if you're bored^1, you can&  sit outside and watch those wacky&  skeletons do their thing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_522", "\\E0* There's two of 'em..^1.&*\\E4 Brothers^1, I think^1.&* They just showed up one day&  and..^1.&*\\E0 ... asserted themselves./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_523", "* The town has gotten a lot&  more interesting since then./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_528", "\\E0* I heard that it was all 'cause&  a human came through here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_529", "* A human..^1.&* I can hardly believe it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_530", "* Well if they decide to stop&  in^1, I'll be sure to give&  them a hero's welcome./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_536", "\\E4* Think back to your history&  class.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_537", "\\E0* A long time ago^1, monsters lived&  in the RUINS back there in&  the forest./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_538", "* Long story short^1, we all decided&  to leave the ruins and head&  for the end of the caverns./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_539", "* Along the way^1, some fuzzy folk&  decided they liked the cold&  and set up camp in Snowdin./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_540", "\\E6* Oh^1, and don't think about&  trying to explore the RUINS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_541", "\\E0* The door's been locked for&  ages^1.&* So unless you're a ghost&  or can burrow under the door^1,&  forget about it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_545", "\\E0* Didja hear^1?&* The RUINS have been opened up^1,&  and get this.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_546", "* They were opened from the&  INSIDE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_547", "* Apparently the Queen had been&  staying inside there for God&  knows how long./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_548", "* Pretty unbelievable^1, huh!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_555", "\\E0* Life is the same as usual./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_556", "\\E1* A little claustrophobic.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_557", "\\E2* But..^1. we all know deep down&  that freedom is coming^1, don't we?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_558", "\\E2* As long as we got that hope^1, we&  can grit our teeth and face the&  same struggles^1, day after day.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_559", "\\E5* That's life^1, ain't it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_563", "\\E0* Well^1, I suppose I'll move&  my store to the overworld.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_564", "* ... haven't planned much&  more than that^1, I'm afraid./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_570", "* (There's a note here.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop1_571", "* Please don't hurt my family./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_234", "* Don't be shy now./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_235", "* Woah there^1!&* I've got some neat&  junk for sale./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_236", "* Wah ha ha^1!&* I knew you could&  do it!/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_237", "* Wa ha ha..^1.&* So you came here^1.&* What a treat!/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_287", "What are&you lookin&for?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_288", "Thanks!&Wa ha ha./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_289", "Careful&with that./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_290", "You're&a bit&short&on cash./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_291", "You're&carrying&too much!/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_295", "Don't&expect a&discount./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_296", "Here we&are./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_297", ".../*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_298", "Eh^1?&You can't&afford&it?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_299", "Don't you&have&enough?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_390", "Anything&you&wanna&know?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_392", "Really?&YOU&wanna&chat?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_438", "\\E2* Ha^1!\\E0 &* I'm tryin' to get RID of&  my junk^1, not get more of it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_439", "\\E4* Though^1, I've heard if you&  want to sell stuff^1, the Temmie&  Village is your best bet./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_440", "\\E0* Where is it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_441", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_442", "\\E0* I don't remember./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_444", "* For the last time^1, I'm not&  taking it!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_445", "* I hear people will pay for&  ANYTHING nowadays./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_448", "\\E3* I wouldn't buy your chitzy&  garbage at knifepoint./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_454", "* Be careful out there^1, kid!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_456", "* Good riddance./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_462", "* I've been around a long time^1.&*\\E3 Maybe too long./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_463", "\\E2* Studying history sure is&  easy when you've lived through&  so much of it yourself^1!&*\\E0 Wa ha ha!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_468", "\\E0* Long ago^1, ASGORE and I&  agreed that escaping would&  be pointless.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_469", "\\E3* Since once we left^1, humans&  would just kill us./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_470", "\\E1* I felt a little betrayed when&  he eventually changed his&  mind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_471", "\\E4* But now^1, I think..^1.&* Maybe he was right to./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_472", "\\E2* 'Cause after all^1, even though&  we never escaped.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_473", "\\E3* A human's killing us anyway^1,&  ain't that right?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_478", "* OK^1, OK^1!&* I remember it clearly now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_479", "\\E3* It was the monthly address at&  the castle^1, and the queen&  was giving her part on&  current events./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_480", "\\E0* After finishing her update^1,&  she moved to pass the&  microphone to the king./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_481", "\\E3* However^1, she didn't realize&  the microphone was still in&  her hands when she said:/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_482", "\\E2* \"Your turn^1, Fluffybuns.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_483", "\\E0* The audience burst into&  laughter./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_484", "\\E2* Realizing what she had said^1,&  she started laughing too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_485", "\\E0* After a few moments^1, the&  king held up his arms^1.&* The crowd grew silent./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_486", "\\E3* He leaned towards the&  microphone^1, expression..^1.&* Stern./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_487", "\\E0* \"Dear citizens.^1\"&* \"Thank you for coming&  here today.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_488", "\\E3* \"I..^1. King Fluffybuns...\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_489", "\\E2* And the rest is history./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_497", "\\E2* What's that^1?&* You want me to repeat myself?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_498", "\\E0* Heck no^1!&* Your eyes still work..^1.&* Go read a book or something^1!&* Wahaha!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_503", "\\E0* Oh yeah..^1.&* The prophecy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_504", "\\E4* Legend has it, an 'angel' who has&  seen the surface will descend&  from above and bring us freedom./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_505", "\\E3* Lately^1, the people have been&  taking a bleaker outlook.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_506", "\\E4* Callin' that winged circle the&  'Angel of Death.'/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_507", "\\E3* A harbinger of destruction^1,&  waitin' to 'free' us from&  this mortal realm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_508", "* In my opinion^1, when I see&  that little circle.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_509", "\\E2* I jus' think it looks neat^1!&* Wahaha!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_516", "\\E0* That emblem actually predates&  written history^1.&* The original meaning has been&  lost to time.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_517", "\\E4* All we know is that the&  triangles symbolize us monsters&  below^1, and the winged circle&  above symbolizes.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_518", "\\E3* Somethin' else./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_519", "\\E0* Most people say it's the&  'angel^1,' from the prophecy.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_524", "\\E0* Eh^1?&* You don't know what that is?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_525", "\\E1* What are they teaching you&  kids in school nowadays...^1?&*\\E2 Wa ha ha!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_526", "\\W*\\E0 That's the \\YDelta Rune^1,\\W the&  emblem of our kingdom^1.&* The Kingdom.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_527", "* ... of Monsters./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_528", "* Wahaha^1!&* Great name^1, huh^1?&* It's as I always say.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_529", "* Ol' King Fluffybuns can't name&  for beans!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_537", "\\E3* Eh^1?&* Goat?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_538", "\\E2* Actually^1, that reminds me^1.&* Toriel once wore a flower-&  patterned muu-muu... /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_539", "\\E0* Folks kept saying \"nice muu-&  muu\" to her^1, but she kept&  thinking they were calling&  her a cow./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_540", "\\E1* So she never wore it again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_541", "\\E3* What was the question again?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_542", "\\E0* Oh^1.&* Right^1.&* ASGORE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_543", "\\E3* He's a real interesting&  type of monster^1.&* The strongest type of all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_544", "\\E0* We call 'em Boss Monsters./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_545", "* When they have an offspring^1,&  the SOUL power of the&  parents flows into the&  child.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_546", "* Causing the child to grow&  as the parents age./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_547", "\\E3* But ASGORE doesn't have a&  child^1.&* So he's been stuck at the&  same age..^1.&* And probably will be forever./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_548", "\\E1* Huh^1?&* What if the child is a&  human...^1? What?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_549", "\\E1* Nah^1. That wouldn't work^1.&* So if ASGORE's your father^1,&  he'll definitely outlive&  you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_555", "\\E1* I've lived too long to&  be afraid of something&  like you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_556", "\\E2* Try it^1, kiddo!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_557", "\\E3* ... I know you can't here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_558", "\\E1* Wah ha..^1.&* Knowledge like that is&  the only reason I've&  survived so long./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_564", "* King Fluffybuns^1?&* He's a friendly^1, happy-go-lucky&  kind of guy.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_565", "\\E4* If you keep walking around long&  enough^1, you'll probably meet him^1.&*\\E0 He loves to walk around and&  talk to people./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_566", "\\E3* Eh^1?&* Why do I call Dreemurr&  'Fluffybuns?^1'&*\\E2 Oh^1, that's a great story!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_567", "\\E3* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_568", "\\E0* I don't remember it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_569", "* But if you come back much&  later^1, I'm sure I'll have&  remembered by then./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_573", "\\E2* Oh yeah^1!&* Of course^1.&* Toriel was queen^1, and&  Asgore was the king./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_574", "\\E3* It was tragic when she left./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_575", "\\E1* Since everyone knew she was&  really the brains behind the&  throne.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_576", "\\E0* But it was also just a&  teensy^1, teensy bit relieving^1,&  you know?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_577", "\\E3* Those two were really&  insufferable together..^1.&* Nuzzling noses^1, bein' all cute&  n' cuddly in public..^1.&* Embarrassing their children.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_578", "\\E0* They were so sweet it&  made me SICK^1.&* Thank god those days are&  over!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_584", "\\E3* Eh^1? Fight you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_585", "\\E1* Nah..^1. I'm not a hero^1.&* Never was./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_586", "\\E2* And b'sides..^1.&* These old bones aren't fit&  for fighting anyhoo./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_587", "\\E3* One attack from you^1, and&  then I'd... well.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_588", "\\E2* At least by talking to&  you^1, I've bought enough time&  for some of them to escape./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_595", "\\E0* Undyne^1?&* Yeah^1, she's a local hero&  around here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_596", "\\E4* Through grit and determination&  alone^1, she fought her way to&  the top of the Royal Guard./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_597", "\\E3* Actually^1, she just came through&  here asking about someone who&  looked just like you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_598", "\\E0* I'd watch your back^1, kid^1.&* And buy some items..^1.&* It might just save your hide^1!&* Wa ha ha!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_601", "\\E0* Undyne^1.&* She's really come a long way&  since she was a little&  urchin./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_602", "\\E2* I used to be a hero myself^1,&  back in the old days^1.&* Gerson^1, the Hammer of Justice./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_603", "\\E3* When she was younger^1, Undyne&  would follow me around^1, to&  watch me beat up bad guys.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_604", "\\E0* Sometimes she'd even try&  to help!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_605", "\\E3* Though^1, most of the time&  the folks she attacked weren't&  bad guys^1.&* It'd be the mailman or&  something like that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_606", "\\E2* Anyhoo^1, I appreciated it^1!&* Wah ha ha ha!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_612", "\\E1* I'm not a hero./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_613", "\\E3* But I know there's someone&  out there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_614", "\\E0* Someone who'll never give&  up trying to do the&  right thing^1, no matter&  what./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_615", "\\E4* There's no prophecy or&  legend 'bout anyone like&  that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_616", "\\E3* It's just something I know&  is true./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop2_617", "\\E0* That someone like that&  will strike you down./%%");
