  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1822", "\\E7* Did we say&  that?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1834", "\\M4* Probably?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1835", "\\M1* It's^1, like^1,&  practically&  our&  catchphrase./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1847", "\\E8* Really^1?&* I thought our&  catchphrase&  was.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1848", "\\E4* B-B-Bratty's&  the best^1,&  C-C-Catty's&  the coolest!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1861", "\\M1* Um^1, no?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1862", "* We've like&  literally&  NEVER said&  that./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1873", "\\E1* CAN it be&  though!^1?&* CAN it be!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1886", "\\E4* OMG^1, we&  can finally&  fulfill our&  DREAM of having&  a pet cat!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1899", "\\M1* That's^1, like^1,&  YOUR dream^1,&  Catty./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1910", "* But Bratty.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1911", "\\E5*\\M5 I don't wanna&  have a dream&  without YOU&  in it...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1924", "* Aww..^1.&* Catty..^3./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1936", "\\E1* And^1, in my&  dream^1, YOU clean&  up after&  the cat!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1949", "\\M1* Catty!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1974", "\\E5* Bratty&  NOOOO!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1987", "\\M1* I'm just&  kidding!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1988", "\\M4*\\E8 Kind of./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_1989", "\\M5*\\E7 Anyway^1, when&  was the last&  time you even&  SAW a cat&  around here?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2001", "\\E8* Oh!^1!&* JUST the other&  day!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2002", "\\E3* There was&  this CUTE&  little white&  cat walking&  around.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2003", "\\E4* It was^1, like^1,&  SOOOOOO&  clueless&  looking./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2004", "\\E1* I pet it&  for like an&  hour!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2017", "\\M5* ....^1.&* ....^1.&* ... Catty^2./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2028", "\\E7* Yeah^1, Bratty?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2042", "\\M1* I think that&  was^1, like..^1.&* A dog^3./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2053", "\\E1* DOGS ARE JUST&  FIRM CATS!!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2067", "* If you're&  reading&  this.../*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2077", "\\E7* Then^1, like^1,&  bad news you&  mega-evil&  weirdo!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2088", "* Alphys just&  came here&  and she's&  taking us.../*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2098", "\\E7* Someplace&  super duper&  safe!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2109", "* But^1, first^1,&  we gotta use&  up these gel&  pens./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2119", "\\E7* Yeah^1!&* Chill^1, Alphys!&* We don't wanna&  waste pens!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2131", "* And don't even&  THINK about&  stealing our&  stuff./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2141", "* Yeah^1, creep^1!&* Leave our&  junk alone!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2152", "* Catty^1, it's&  not JUNK^1.&* It's really&  valuable./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2162", "* Yeah^1!&* Our garbage&  is REALLY&  valuable!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2174", "* Anyway^1.&* In closing^1:&* You're a&  total loser!/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2184", "* Yeah^1!&* Loser!!^1!&* Nya ha ha!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2196", "* Signed^1,&  Bratty <3/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop3_2198", "* Signed^1,&  Catty <3/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_244", "\\E0* The customer is&  always right./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_245", "\\E0* Welcome to MTT-Brand&  Burger Emporium^1, home&  of the Glamburger^1.&* Sparkle up your&  day (TM)./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_249", "\\E3* Anything else you&  need?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_250", "\\E3* What can I do for you^1,&  little buddy?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_252", "\\E1* (Why do I always&  get the freaks?)/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_329", "\\E0How can&I help&you, O&customer?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_330", "\\E2Thanksy!&Have a&FABU-FUL&day!!!/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_331", "\\E1So do&you want&it or&not???/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_332", "\\E1That's not&the right&amount of&money./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_333", "\\E1You&don't&have&room./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_334", "\\E1We don't&HAVE&any&more./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_338", "\\E6Take what&you want^1,&little&buddy./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_339", "\\E6Here you&go^1,&little&buddy./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_340", "\\E6Don't&worry&about&it./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_341", "\\E6Sorry...&You can't&take it&for free./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_342", "\\E6You gotta&drop some&stuff./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_343", "\\E6Like I'm&making&THAT&again./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_347", "\\E3Are you&gonna&order or&what?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_348", "\\E6Here you&go^1,&little&weirdo./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_349", "\\E1So do&you want&it or&not???/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_350", "\\E1That's not&the right&amount of&money./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_351", "\\E1You&don't&have&room./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_352", "\\E1We don't&HAVE&any&more./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_472", "\\E3Take it&from me^1,&little&buddy./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_473", "\\E3Nothing&else to&do!/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_519", "\\E1* (WHY IS THIS PERSON TRYING TO&  SELL ME SOMETHING THIS IS&  A HAMBURGER RESTAURANT I'M&  JUST TRYING TO SURVIVE)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_521", "\\E3* WHO DO YOU THINK YOU ARE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_525", "\\E6* Hmmm..^1.&* Why not try selling that to&  the two chicks in the alley?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_529", "\\E3* Ah^1. Yes^1.&* I really want to buy your&  weird dusty artifacts..^1.&* NOT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_535", "\\E2* Have a SPARKULAR day!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_538", "\\E6* Any time^1, little buddy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_539", "\\E6* Alone again.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_545", "\\E6* I'm getting on in years^1, so&  let me give you some&  advice^1, little buddy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_546", "\\E3* You've still got time^1.&* Don't live like me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_547", "\\E6* I'm 19 years old and I've&  already wasted my entire life./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_551", "\\E0* So we're free^1, huh^1?&* Mettaton told us as much./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_552", "\\E4* Then he told me^1, \"don't&  think that means you're&  getting out of work early.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_553", "\\E6* Ah..^1. my boss.&* I love that guy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_554", "\\E3* And by that I mean I hate&  him so^1, so much./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_559", "\\E1* Evacuation^1?&* You're yanking my chain^1,&  little weirdo./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_560", "\\E3* So WHAT if everybody else&  left work?&* So WHAT if nobody's buying&  anything?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_561", "\\E6* Par for the course^1,&  little weirdo^1.&* Par for the course./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_566", "* I'm a goofy goober Yeah &  this errorr. message./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_570", "\\E6* Thank you^1, little buddy./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_575", "\\E5* They wanna hang out after&  work?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_576", "\\E3* Ha^1! Ahahaha!^1! Yes!!^1!&* I won't let you down!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_577", "\\E6* Little buddy..^1. thank you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_578", "* You've brought a tear to the&  eye of this old man./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_579", "\\E5* So^1, uh^1, where do they&  want to go?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_580", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_581", "* They want to hang out at&  the garbage dump./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_582", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_583", "\\E6* Well^1, nowhere to go but&  up^1, right^1, little buddy?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_588", "\\E6* Hey little buddy^1, wanna help&  me pick a spicy outfit for&  my little shindig later?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_589", "\\E4* Though^1, now that I think&  about it^1, I had to throw away&  all of my clothes to make&  room for the outfits Mettaton&  gave me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_590", "\\E5* Don't take it the wrong way^1.&* They're just all these.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_591", "\\E4* Weird getups./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_592", "\\E1* \"Promotional\" costumes^1.&* For \"holidays.^1\"&* Or \"specials.^1\"&* Or \"because he felt like it.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_593", "\\E3* The thing IS though^1!&* Most of the time I'm the&  only employee who has to&  wear this stuff!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_594", "\\E3* Sometimes he even calls me&  into his office just to..^1.&* Make me put something on.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_595", "\\E4* Then he laughs and lets me&  go back to work as normal./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_596", "\\E6* Anyways^1, I won't sweat it^1,&  little buddy^1.&* I'll take it casual./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_597", "* NEVER let hot people think&  you care^1.&* That's how they GET you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_603", "\\E5* Well^1?&* Don't keep me waiting^1,&  little buddy!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_608", "\\E4* The girls were..^1.&* Talking about me...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_609", "* They say I should stop acting&  like they owe me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_610", "\\E5* ... and if I want to be&  FRIENDS with them^1, I should&  just..^1. uh^1, try to see&  things from their&  perspective?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_611", "\\E4* Wow./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_612", "\\E6* Poor^1, naive little buddy^1.&* They've brainwashed you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_613", "* \"Friendship\" is just a hot&  person's way of making you&  their slave./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_614", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_615", "\\E5* So^1, uh^1, what time would&  they wanna hang out?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_620", "\\E5* Huh^1?&* Yeah^1, those two vendors in back^1.&* The girls./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_621", "\\E3* NOT the Nice Cream guy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_622", "\\E5* He keeps coming in here and&  asking me stuff like^1,&* \"Hey Burgy, what do you think&  of this joke for my next&  ice cream wrapper?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_623", "\\E4* Joke^1?&* Why are you calling it a JOKE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_624", "\\E3* You drew a picture of two&  dudes hugging and wrote&  \"I love hugs!\" on it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_625", "\\E3* You somehow understand comedy&  EVEN LESS than that guy who&  keeps going on stage and&  crying about his family./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_626", "\\E5* Anyway^1, I^1, uh^1, just tell him&  that they're good^1, because he&  gives me the nice cream for&  free afterward.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_631", "\\E4* Everyone calls me burgerpants&  now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_632", "\\E5* But you won't^1, will you^1,&  little buddy?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_638", "\\E6* So I went out to the alley&  to see those two ladies^1, and&  uh..^1. you know^1, see what'd&  happen next./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_639", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_640", "\\E5* Then my boss^1, uh^1, saw me and&  asked me what I was doing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_641", "\\E1* I was so startled^1, the hamburgers&  in my pockets tumbled out&  onto the ground./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_642", "\\E3* Not wanting to lose face^1,&  I scrambled to pick them up!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_643", "\\E3* But^1, as I was leaning over^1,&  the weight of the remaining&  hamburgers.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_644", "\\E5* ... caused my pants to fall&  down./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_645", "\\E4* Then the girls laughed at me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_646", "\\E4* Everyone calls me Burgerpants&  now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_647", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_651", "\\E6* Listen^1.&* I like you^1, little buddy^1.&* So I'm gonna save you a lot&  of trouble./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_652", "\\E3* Never interact with attractive&  people./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_653", "\\E6* Unless you're \"one of them^1,\"&  they're just gonna take&  advantage of you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_654", "\\E3* Like that time those two&  chicks asked me to sneak them&  some glamburgers./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_655", "\\E6* And I^1, naive teenager that&  I was^1, said yes to them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_656", "\\E4* Bad idea./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_662", "\\E4* Those girls?&* The ones who saw my pants&  fall down?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_663", "\\E5* Well^1, we're all gonna be&  free^1, so I'll never see&  them again^1, at least!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_667", "\\E4* So we're free now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_668", "\\E5* Does that mean my double-&  date is cancelled...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_669", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_670", "\\E5* I know^1, it wasn't really&  a..^1.&* A date./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_671", "\\E6* Here's a trick^1, little buddy^1:&* Lie to yourself all the time^1.&* It makes you feel better./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_678", "\\E4* Well^1, Mettaton didn't tell me&  I HAD to work, I guess.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_679", "\\E3* But that's the thing^1!&* Sometimes he doesn't even&  call me into work until&  halfway into my shift!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_680", "\\E4* If I don't play it safe^1,&  he's going to yell at me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_681", "\\E6* Okay^1, maybe \"yell\" is the&  wrong term./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_682", "\\E4* It's more like he has this..^1.&* CD album he plays.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_683", "\\E5* That's entirely full of&  songs about how bad I am&  at my job./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_698", "\\E5* Let's not talk about this./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_704", "\\E1* Why do people find him so&  attractive??/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_705", "\\E3* He's literally just a freaking&  rectangle./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_706", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_707", "* You know^1, one time^1, I bought&  one of those^1, uh^1, kits&  online..^1. to.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_708", "\\E5* Uh^1, make yourself more&  rectangular./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_709", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_710", "\\E5* They don't work./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_716", "\\E3* God^1, have you even looked&  around^1?&* This place is a labyrinth of&  bad choices./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_717", "* And every time we try to change&  something for the better^1, he&  vetoes it and says \"that's not&  how they do it on the&  surface.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_718", "\\E1Oh! Right!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_719", "\\E3* Humans are always eating&  hamburgers made of SEQUINS&  AND GLUE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_724", "\\E5* When I first came to Hotland^1,&  it was my dream to work&  with Mettaton./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_725", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_726", "\\E3* Well^1, be careful what you&  wish for^1, little buddy!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_734", "\\E3* Don't tell anyone this^1, Little&  Buddy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_735", "\\E4* (Because they'll make fun&  of me,)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_736", "\\E5* But I..^1.&* I feel like I played a hand in&  everyone getting free&  somehow./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_737", "\\E1* Even if it was just&  working this awful job.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_738", "\\E5* I think I did something!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_739", "\\E3* I don't know if it's true^1,&  but I'll believe it anyway!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_744", "\\E3* Huh?&* Everyone else is DEAD?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_745", "\\E4* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_746", "\\E5* Does that mean I don't&  have to work today?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_747", "\\E6* God^1.&* That it were true^1,&  little weirdo^1.&* That it were true./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_756", "\\E3* Future^1?&* WHAT future^1?&* Nothing down here EVER&  changes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_757", "\\E4* I'll probably be trapped&  at this stupid job forever./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_758", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_759", "\\E3* But wait^1!&* There's one thing that keeps&  me going!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_760", "* If ASGORE gets just one&  more SOUL^1, we'll finally get&  to go to the surface!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_761", "* It'll be a brand new world^1!&* There's gotta be a second&  chance out there for me^1!&* For everyone!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_762", "\\E6* So stay strong^1, little buddy^1.&* When I make it big^1, I'll&  keep you in mind./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_767", "\\E3* Little buddy^1!&* There's a brand new world&  out there waiting&  for us./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_768", "\\E6* I'm sure with my (ahem)&  qualifications^1, it won't&  be long before I'm a&  famous movie star.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_769", "\\E4* Or^1, maybe I'll just end up&  flipping burgers again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_770", "\\E3* But it's as I say^1!&* Nowhere to go but up^1!&* Literally^1, in this case!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_775", "\\E6* Sorry^1, little weirdo^1.&* Threats won't work on me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shop4_776", "* I can't go to hell^1.&* I'm all out of vacation&  days./%%");
