  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_502", "* SHYREN - ATK 19 DEF 0&* Tone deaf^1. She's too ashamed&  to sing her deadly song./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_503", "* SHYREN - ATK 19 DEF 0&* A talented singer^1, with&  a little help./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_504", "* SHYREN - ATK 19 DEF 0&* That's Shyren^1.&* She's your band-mate./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_514", "* You hum a funky tune^1.&* Shyren follows your melody./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_515", "* You hum a sad song^1.&* Shyren follows your melody./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_516", "* You hum a jazz ballad^1.&* Shyren follows your melody./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_517", "* You hum some more^1.&* Monsters are drawn to the&  music./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_518", "* Suddenly^1, it's a concert.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_519", "* You hum some more^1.&* The seats are sold out^1.&* You feel like a rock star./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_520", "* You hum some more^1.&* But the constant attention.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_521", "* The tours..^1.&* The groupies..^1.&* It's all.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_522", "* You and Shyren have come so&  far^1, but it's time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_523", "* You both have your own&  journeys to embark on./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_524", "* You hum a farewell song./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_537", "* You smile^1.&* You ask to see Shyren's smile^1,&  too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_538", "* Shyren gets quieter^1.&* In the corner^1, Aaron nods&  his head approvingly./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_539", "* You keep smiling^1.&* But nothing happened./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_shyren_540", "* You give a darling smile and&  a little wink./");
