  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_61", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Excuse me^1, human.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_62", "* (I have some advice&  for you about battling&  monsters.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_63", "\\W* (If you \\YACT\\W a certain way&  or \\YFIGHT\\W until you&  almost defeat them...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_64", "* (They might not want to&  battle you anymore.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_65", "* (If a monster does not&  want to fight you^1, please...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_66", "\\W* (Use some \\YMERCY^1,\\W human.^1)&* Ribbit./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_70", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Excuse me^1, human.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_71", "* (I have some advice&  for you about battling&  monsters.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_72", "* (The monsters in this world&  are very dangerous and&  aggressive.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_73", "* (In this place^1, running away&  will not work on the&  first turn.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_74", "* (It may be better to try&  another option.^1)&* Ribbit./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_79", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Excuse me^1, human.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_80", "* (You seem like you have&  grown into a thoughtful and&  conscientious person.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_81", "* (Whether that was from my&  advice or not...^1)&* (I'm quite proud.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_82", "* Ribbit./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_90", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Just between you and me...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_91", "\\W* (I saw \\BTORIEL\\W come out of&  here just a little&  while ago.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_92", "* (She was carrying some&  groceries.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_93", "* (I didn't ask what they&  were for...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_94", "* (We're all too intimidated&  to talk to her.^1)&* Ribbit./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_97", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Seems like the RUINS have&  finally opened up.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_98", "* (Maybe we should finally&  go out to the rest of&  the underground.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_99", "* (Huh^1? The barrier's open^1,&  too...?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_100", "* (... let's just take this&  one step at a time^1, OK?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_105", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Just between you and me...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_106", "\\W* (I saw \\BTORIEL\\W come out of&  here just a little&  while ago.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_107", "* (Normally^1, she carries&  groceries out of here.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_108", "* (But this time^1, she wasn't&  carrying anything.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_109", "* (She looked disappointed.^1)&* Ribbit./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_117", "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (I heard using \"F4\" can make&  you have a \"full screen.\")/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_118", "* (But what does \"F4\" stand for?^1)&* (\"Four frogs\"?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_119", "* (I have only seen a maximum of&  three frogs in this room...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_120", "* (This is troubling^1, to say&  the least.^1)&* Ribbit./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_117_console", "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (I heard using \"Borders\" can&  add some color to the world.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_118_console", "* (It seems you can choose&  them in the \"Settings\" menu&  before you load your game.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_119_console", "* (However, there isn't a&  frog-themed border.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_120_console", "* (So it's just pointless.^1)&* Ribbit./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_124", "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (Did you ever find this&  room's fourth frog?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_140", "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (Yellow names were nice for&  a while.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_141", "* (Next time^1, we should try a&  relaxing shade of green.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_145", "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (How was your adventure?)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_146", "* (It must have been difficult&  without being able to tell&  the enemy's feelings.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_150", "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (Finally^1, we can all remove&  these aging pink names.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_151", "* (Everyone gave you a big favor&  today.^1)&* (Try to respect that!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_59", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Sigh...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_60", "* (My friend never listens to&  me.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_61", "* (Whenever I talk^1, they skip&  through my words by pressing&  \\*X.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_62", "* (That's right.......^1)&* (Pressing \\*X............^1)&* (................)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_63", "* (Well^1, at least you listen&  to me.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_67", "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Say...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_68", "* (Now that your journey's&  over^1, maybe you'll have&  time to listen to me.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_69", "* (Since most people just&  press \\*X to skip through&  my dialogue.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_70", "* (That's right.......^1)&* (Pressing \\*X............^1)&* (................)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_71", "* (You've really matured^1,&  haven't you?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_150", "* (Oh^1, not you too!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_153", "* (... I suppose some things&  never change.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_smallweb_64", "* (It's a spider web.)/");
