  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_248", "\"Ice\"&to meet&you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_249", "Ice puns&are&\"snow\"&problem");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_250", "Fights&you in&\"cold\"&blood.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_251", "Better&not snow&\"flake\"&out!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_252", "My fave&ice&cereals:&\"frosted\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_253", "\"Chill\"&out...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_254", "M.. m..&macaroni&and&\"freeze\"");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_257", "Do I&really&...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_258", "Hey...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_259", "Guys...&guys...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_265", "You have&good&taste!!&(In jokes)");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_266", "See!?&Laughs!&Dad was&wrong!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_267", "Thanks,&you're&all&great.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_268", "See!?&Laughs!&Dad was&wrong!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_271", "What are&YOU&laughin'&at?!?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_278", "Is that&s'posed&to be&funny?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_279", "Ha...&Ha...&Nice&try.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_280", "I've&heard&that&one.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_285", "THIS&won't be&funny&either!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_286", "Is your&flesh&rotten&as you?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_287", "(Insults&towards&humans)");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_292", "IT'S&JUST&LIKE&'EM");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_293", "HAHA&YOU'RE&BETTER");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_294", "YOU&NAILED&IT");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_299", "That's&not&like&me...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_300", "I don't&do it&that&way...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_301", "It's&better&when I&do it...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_309", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_507", "* Snowdrake is assessing the&  crowd.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_508", "* Snowdrake is practicing&  its next pun.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_509", "* Snowdrake is smiling at its&  own bad joke.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_510", "* It smells like a wet&  pillow.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_511", "* Snowdrake realized its own&  name is a pun and is&  freaking out.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_512", "* Snowdrake is pleased with&  its \"cool\" joke.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_513", "* Snowdrake is laughing at&  your imitation of its&  cohort.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_514", "* Snowdrake pretends not to&  care.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_515", "* Snowdrake is puffed up..");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_516", "* Snowdrake is flaking&  apart.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_533", "* SNOWDRAKE - ATK 12 DEF 7&* This teen comedian fights to&  keep a captive audience./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_542", "* You boo the Snowdrake./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_543", "* You tell the Snowdrake that&  they aren't funny./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_545", "* You tell the Snowdrake that&  no one will ever love&  them the way they are.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_546", "* They struggle to make a&  retort^1, and slink away&  utterly crushed.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_559", "* You laugh at Snowdrake before&  it says anything funny./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_560", "* You laugh at Snowdrake's&  pun./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_568", "* You make a bad ice pun./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_570", "* You make a bad ice pun./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrake_571", "* The other monsters think&  it's hilarious.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_75", "* I'm the resort comedian.&* I'm very funny^1.&* People laugh at my jokes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_76", "* Now^1, my son^1.&* He wants to be a comedian&  like his fathah./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_77", "* But his jokes^1.&* Aren't funny./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_78", "* He tells these awful puns^1.&* He's an embarrassment to&  our family./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_79", "* Ha ha ha ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_80", "* That's not funny./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_81", "* Since his mothah passed on^1,&  he couldn't stand^1.&* Living at home anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_82", "* So he ran away^1.&* I haven't seen him since./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_83", "* I'm a terrible fathah^1.&* Ha ha ha ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_84", "* That's not funny./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_87", "* Talking to you about&  this..^1.&* It's breakin' my heart./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_88", "* Ha ha ha ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_89", "* That's not funny./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_94", "* The doctah^1.&* She brought my wife.&* Back from the dead./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_95", "* My son^1.&* He seems happy again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_96", "* Our family^1.&* It's biggah than evah./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_97", "* Now that my wife^1.&* Is combined^1.&* With 16 othah people./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_102", "* My boss stopped answering my&  calls./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_103", "* I don't know when my next&  performance will be./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_104", "* Maybe I shouldn't try to be&  a comedian anymore.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_105", "* It's tearing my family apart./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_110", "* My son..^1.&* He was always making these&  weird ice puns./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_111", "* I hated them^1, so he ran&  away from home.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_112", "* I think I should try to&  patch things up with him./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakedad_113", "* Have you seen him^1?&* Have you seen my son?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_158", " sn...& o...& wy...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_165", " haha...& i...& remem..&  ber...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_167", " haha...& thank...& you...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_173", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_387", "* It's so cold.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_388", "* It's so cold.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_389", "* It's so cold.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_390", "* It's so cold.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_391", "* Smells like salty slush.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_392", "* Seems calmed down.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_393", "* Monster has low HP.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_426", "* AMALGAMATE - ATK -12 DEF -5&* Seems like it's losing itself./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_435", "* You laugh^1, and keep laughing^1.&* It's SO funny^1, you can't stop^1.&* Tears run down your face./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_436", "* ... what^1?&* You didn't do that?/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_439", "* But it's not funny./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_451", "* You said something like..^1.&* \"You look horrible.^1\"&* \"Why are you even alive?^1\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_452", "* ... what^1?&* You didn't say that?/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_455", "* You call this a performance?/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_467", "* You told a bad pun about&  snow^1.&* Her expression starts to shift./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_469", "* You told a bad pun about&  snow^1.&* Her expression changes more./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakemom_472", "* You told a bad pun about&  snow^1.&* She's completely calmed down./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakenpc_76", "* I ran away from home^1.&* Why?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakenpc_77", "* 'Cause my father was so&  \"cold\" to me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakenpc_78", "* WHAT!^1?&* It's a JOKE!^1!&* LAUGH at it!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakenpc_82", "* I really don't^1!&* I don't care if he doesn't&  like my jokes!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakenpc_87", "* Mom might have to share her&  mind with other people now^1,&  but she's still my mom./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakenpc_88", "* And that's \"cool!\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakenpc_89", "* 'Cause^1, uhh^1, we're made&  of ice and stuff./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowdrakenpc_90", "* WHAT!?!^1?&* It's a JOKE!^1!&* LAUGH at it!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowpoff_100", "* It's a snow poff./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowpoff_101", "* And this..^1.&* Is a snow poff./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowpoff_102", "* This^1, however^1, is a snow poff./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowpoff_103", "* Surprisingly^1, it's a snow poff./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowpoff_104", "* Snow poff.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowpoff_105", "* Is it really a snow poff?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowpoff_106", "* Behold^1!&* A snow poff./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowpoff_107", "* What's this called?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_snowpoff_108", "* Eh^1?&* There's 30 G inside&  this..^1. what is this?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sockdrawer_60", "%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sockdrawer_66", "* You peek inside..^2.&* Scandalous!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sockdrawer_67", "* It's TORIEL's sock drawer./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sockdrawer_68", "* You can't stop looking&  at the socks./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_269", "AHHHHHHH!!!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_274", "\\E1AHHHHH!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_279", "\\E1Oh!&Whoops!&That hurt!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_280", "\\E2So sorry^1, I must&have gotten in the&way!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_281", "\\E1I really shouldn't&stand so close/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_282", "\\E4Ah I'm just being&troublesome/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_287", "\\E4Darn it, I keep&getting in the way/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_288", "\\E2So sorry, I'm such&an oaf/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_289", "\\E2Wandering in front&of you.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_294", "\\E1.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_295", "Are you...&trying to KILL me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_296", "\\E4... so sorry, but&I've had a really&tough year./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_297", "I don't know if I&could take you&killing me on top&of everything./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_298", "\\E2You should find&someone else to&kill.&So sorry./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_303", "\\E1?????/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_304", "\\E5I just said I'm&not interested in&the offer!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_305", "\\E5.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_306", "\\E2Sorry, I must not&have enunciated&clearly enough./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_307", "\\E2I am not interested&in being killed.&Thank you very much./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_312", "\\E5Look, stranger/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_313", "\\E4I... I guess I'm&going to have to&tell the truth./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_314", "My whole life, I've&never been worth a&lot of EXP./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_315", "Everyone else at my&work, in my classes,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_316", "Would raise a&person's LV by 4&or 5 when&destroyed.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_317", "\\E1But me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_318", "\\E6I wouldn't even&increase your LV&at LV 1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_319", "\\E4For this reason...&I...&I've always been.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_320", "I've never been&very good at&getting killed.&So.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_321", "\\E3I'm flattered&that you...&Want to destroy me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_322", "\\E8But you are making&a big waste of&your time!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_323", "\\E8Stop killing me!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_328", "\\E2OK, OK. Hm./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_329", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_330", "\\E7If you stop killing&me, I'll pay you&200G./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_335", "\\E8220G?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_340", "\\E9.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_341", "\\E8300G?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_346", "\\E1W..^1.&Wait a second./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_347", "\\E1You trying to&kill me...&C...&could it be...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_348", "\\E6Because you&don't like me&very much...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_349", "\\E2No, no, that&can't be!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_350", "This is just a&friendly, um,&killing between&acquaintances!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_351", "\\E8Pals... we're...&we're still pals,&right!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_352", "\\E1OK, maybe not&PALS, but, uh,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_353", "\\E2Friendly strangers?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_354", "\\E8You know, just&one step away from&being buds!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_355", "\\E0I mean, I was&practically.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_356", "\\E0I was about to&crack open the&sparkling cider!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_357", "\\E2Pull out some&baguettes and some&swiss cheese!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_358", "\\E8BLOW ON A FREAKING&PARTY HORN!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_363", "\\E1N... no, you don't&like me either,&huh...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_364", "\\E4Nobody likes me...&they're just putting&up with me/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_365", "\\E6I'm just annoying&you... I should just&leave/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_366", "\\E1ARRRRRGHHHH!!!&Why am I such an&idiot??!?!!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_367", "How did I not&see it before!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_368", "\\E1You weren't killing&me because you&LIKED me!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_369", "\\E6NOBODY does that!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_370", " That's NOT a thing!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_376", "\\E2Oh. Sorry. I was&being too loud.&Ugh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_377", "\\E4I'm wasting your&time, aren't I...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_378", "\\E9.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_379", "\\E1... whew, I feel&really...&strange./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_380", "\\E2I think I need to&go home and lie&down./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_392", "\\E1Oh, I'm so sorry!&How clumsy of me...&I've bumped into you/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_393", "\\E6I'm such a klutz./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_394", "I was just here to&find something to&draw, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_395", "\\E2Oh no, it's ok!&It's OK!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_396", "\\E0I'll give you a&gift to make up&for your troubles./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_397", "\\E0Let me look in&my vest!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_402", "\\E6Ummm, I couldn't&find anything I&want to give away./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_403", "\\E2Wait, wait!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_404", "\\M4I've got my notebook!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_405", "\\E0I can draw you a&picture in it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_406", "\\E7I'm quite the artist,&you know./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_407", "\\E8I'll draw you a&GREAT picture!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_413", "\\E6S.. sorry...&The drawing didn't&come out very well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_414", "\\E2Wait^1!&I know the problem!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_415", "\\M0I just have to&find a better piece&of paper for it!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_420", "\\E6None of my papers&are good enough to&use.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_421", "\\E2IT'S OK!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_422", "\\E8I know what I&can do!^1!&I'll use my magic&pencil!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_423", "\\E0It has to be under&some of these papers&somewhere!!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_429", "\\E1AHHHHH!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_434", "\\M5H\\E8ere!&I got it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_435", "My magic pencil is&amazing!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_436", "\\E2Everything I draw&with it looks.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_437", "\\E8COMPLETELY REAL!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_445", "\\E1I've messed up.&I've really messed up.&Oh no./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_446", "\\E2I'll just use a&regular pencil!&I'll try my best!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_453", "\\E8Are you ready!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_454", "\\E0I just finished./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_455", "\\M6Here's your picture!&What do you think!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_456", "\\E2It's a representation&of your deepest&essence.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_457", "\\E7It's great^1, right!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_458", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_459", "\\E8(They think my art&is terrible.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_460", "\\M0Well!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_461", "\\E2I'll leave you with&that thought!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_462", "\\E7Goodbye!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_463", "\\E8See you later!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_464", "\\E2Sayonara!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_465", "\\E1Nice knowing ya!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_466", "\\E7Hasta la vista./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_467", "\\E9.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_468", "\\E2I should leave./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_785", "* The enemy looks nervous.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_786", "* The enemy looks anxious.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_787", "* The enemy taps his fingers&  together like jackhammers.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_788", "* The enemy looks perturbed.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_789", "* The enemy tries to copy your&  movements so it fits in.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_790", "* The enemy uses a hypnotizing&  3D-tush-wiggle attack.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_791", "* Smells... furry.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_792", "* Are we good here!?.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_793", "* The enemy is apologizing to&  its visions of the Reaper.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_826", "* SO SORRY&* This creature is definitely&  in the wrong time and space!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_838", "* You wave^1.&* They're a bit preoccupied./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_841", "* You say hello^1.&* They're a bit preoccupied./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_844", "* You smile^1.&* They're a bit preoccupied./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_847", "* You cough^1.&* They're a bit preoccupied./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_850", "* You weep^1.&* They're a bit preoccupied./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_950", "\\E0Oh^1, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_951", "\\E1About all this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_952", "\\E4Um./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_953", "\\E2Sorry./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_sosorry_1007", "\\E1Uuuuhhhh, oh no!!&That's a little too&real!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spaghetti_98", "* (It's a plate of frozen&  spaghetti.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spaghetti_99", "* (It's so cold^1, it's stuck&  to the table...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spaghetti_102", "* (It's a plate of lukewarm&  spaghetti.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spaghetti_103", "* (Seems like something tried&  eating it and just..^1.)&* (Gave up.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_98", "* It's a note from Papyrus.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_99", "\\TP %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_100", "HUMAN!^1!&PLEASE ENJOY THIS&SPAGHETTI./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_101", "(LITTLE DO YOU KNOW^1,&THIS SPAGHETTI IS&A TRAP...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_102", "(DESIGNED TO ENTICE&YOU!!!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_103", "(YOU'LL BE SO BUSY&EATING IT...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_104", "(THAT YOU WON'T&REALIZE THAT YOU&AREN'T PROGRESSING!!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_105", "(THOROUGHLY JAPED&AGAIN BY THE GREAT&PAPYRUS!!!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_106", " &      NYEH-HEH-HEH^1,&         PAPYRUS/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_110", "* It's a note from Papyrus.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_111", "\\TP %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_112", "SEEING AS THIS&SPAGHETTI IS STILL&HERE SOMEHOW.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_113", "I HEREBY DONATE IT&TO THE PUBLIC./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_114", "IT'S LIKE A&PLAYGROUND FOR&YOUR MOUTH!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_115", " &      NYEH-HEH-HEH^1,&         PAPYRUS/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_120", "* It's illegible chicken-&  scratch./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_124", "WHAT!^1?&THAT'S IMPOSSIBLE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_127", "SORRY^1, I HAVE TO LOCK&YOU IN THE GUEST ROOM&UNTIL UNDYNE ARRIVES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_128", "FEEL FREE TO MAKE&YOURSELF AT HOME!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_129", "REFRESHMENTS AND&ACCOMODATIONS HAVE&BEEN PROVIDED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_130", " & - NYEHFULLY YOURS^1,&        PAPYRUS/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_134", "PLEASE ASK BEFORE&YOU ESCAPE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_135", "WHEN YOU WENT&MISSING I GOT&WORRIED SICK!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_136", "  - SLIGHTLY&  BONETROUSLED^1,&  PAPYRUS/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_140", "IF YOU'RE JUST&LOOKING FOR A&PLACE TO STAY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_141", "JUST ASK!!^1!&YOU DON'T NEED&TO FIGHT ME!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_142", " & - YOUR HOST^1,&   PAPYRUS/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_147", "* (This note is written&  very oddly^1, as if the paper was&  moving while it was written.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_148", "* (It says...^1)&* (Out to lunch...?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_153", "* (Shoot the opposing ship!^1)&* (Move the boxes to complete&  your mission.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_158", "* (Shoot the opposing ship!^1)&* (You have just one shot.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_163", "* (Hey^1!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spagnot_164", "* (Go up the creepy alleyway&  on the right for some&  great deals!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_220", "What is it,&deary?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_224", ".../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_225", "No, no, it's&time to go~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_226", "...&well... maybe&ONE little&nibble~~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_227", "Just kidding,&of course~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_228", "If you don't mind&being gobbled up~&Ahuhuhu~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_229", "Ahuhuhuhu~&Well, I don't&mind keeping&you here~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_230", "Feeling comfortable&trapped in that&web?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_231", "It's time to go~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_232", "Ahuhuhu~&What are you&doing~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_236", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_240", "Why so pale?&You should be proud~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_245", "Proud that you're&going to make a&delicious cake~&Ahuhuhu~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_250", "Let you go^1?&Don't be silly~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_255", "Your SOUL is going&to make every spider&very happy~~~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_256", "You're scaring off&all my customers!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_261", "Oh, how rude of me!&I almost forgot&to introduce you&to my pet~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_262", "It's breakfast time,&isn't it?&Have fun, you two~ /%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_267", "The person who warned&us about you.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_272", "Offered us a LOT of&money for your SOUL./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_273", "Looked like a total&nerd./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_278", "They had such a sweet&smile~ and... ahuhu~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_279", "She was very&adamant I run away&with her~~~&Ahuhuhu~~~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_284", "It's strange, but&I swore I saw them&in the shadows...&Changing shape...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_285", "She even left a&route for me to&escape from~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_291", "Oh, it's lunch time,&isn't it?&And I forgot to&feed my pet~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_296", "With that money,&the spider clans&can finally be&reunited~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_297", "She said she would&block off the rest&of Hotland after I&followed her~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_302", "You haven't heard?&Spiders have been&trapped in the RUINS&for generations!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_303", "Foolish nerd~&A spider NEVER leaves&her web~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_304", "(Except to sell&pastries~)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_309", "Even if they go&under the door,&Snowdin's fatal cold&is impassable alone./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_310", "Ah^1, but I do feel&a little regret&over it now.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_315", "But with the money&from your SOUL, we'll&be able to rent&them a heated limo~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_316", "Yes^1, I should have&wrapped her up when&I had the chance~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_321", "And with all of&the leftovers...^1?&We could have a&nice vacation~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_322", "Or even build a&spider baseball&field~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_323", "She looked like she&would have made a&juicy donut~~~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_328", "But enough of that...&It's time for&dinner, isn't it?&Ahuhuhu~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_336", "Don't look so&blue^1, my deary~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_599", "* Muffet pours you a cup of&  spiders.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_600", "* All the spiders clap along to&  the music.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_601", "* Muffet does a synchronized&  dance with the other spiders.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_602", "* Muffet tidies up the web&  around you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_603", "* Smells like freshly baked&  cobwebs.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_636", "* MUFFET - ATK 38.8 DEF 18.8&* If she invites you to her&  parlor^1, excuse yourself./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_646", "* You struggle to escape the web^1.&* Nothing happened./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_647", "* You struggle to escape the web^1.&* Muffet covers her mouth&  and giggles at you./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_648", "* You struggle to escape the web^1.&* Muffet laughs and claps&  her hands./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_649", "* You struggle to escape the web./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_650", "* Muffet is so amused by your&  antics that she gives you a&  discount!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_656", "* You struggle to escape the web^1.&* Nothing happened./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_678", "* You pay \\[1]G^1.&* Muffet reduces her ATTACK&  for this turn!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_693", "* You empty your pockets^1, but you&  don't have enough money.&* Muffet lowers the price./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_710", "* You're out of money^1.&* Muffet shakes her head./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_714", "* You empty your pockets..^1.&* But you don't have any&  money at all!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_715", "* Muffet takes pity on you&  and reduces her ATTACK for&  this turn./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_722", "* Muffet refuses your money./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_762", "... I think purple is&a better look on&you! Ahuhuhu~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_774", "* You're trapped in a strange&  purple web!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_783", "You're still alive^1?&Ahuhuhu~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_784", "Oh, my pet~&Looks like it's&time for dessert~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_787", "Huh^1?&Where did you get&that...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_788", "Did you steal it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_789", "Oh^1, my pet^1~&It's time to show&them what we do&with thieves~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_805", "Huh?&A telegram from&the spiders in&the RUINS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_806", "What?&They're saying&that they saw&you, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_807", "... that this is&an error message!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_811", "... even if you&are stingy, you&never hurt a&single spider!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_814", "... even if you&hurt others, you&never hurt a&single spider!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_819", "... you helped donate&to their cause!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_823", "... you were&really passionate&about spiders!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_827", "... you're a total&spider fanatic!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_832", "They say even if&you are a hyper-&violent murderer.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_833", "You never laid a&single finger on a&spider!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_836", "Oh my, this has&all been a big&misunderstanding~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_837", "I thought you&were someone that&hated spiders~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_838", "The person who&asked for that SOUL.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_839", "They must have&meant a DIFFERENT&human in a&striped shirt~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_842", "The person who&warned me about&you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_843", "They really had&no idea what they&were talking about~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_846", "Sorry for all the&trouble~&Ahuhuhu~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_847", "I'll make it up&to you~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_848", "You can come back&here any time...&And, for no charge&at all.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_849", "I'll wrap you&up and let you&play with my pet&again!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_850", "Ahuhuhuhuhuhu~&Just kidding~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_851", "I'll SPARE you&now~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spiderb_859", "* Muffet is sparing you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidergirl_shop_74", "* Welcome to our parlor^1, dearie^1~&* Interested in some spider&  pastries?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidergirl_shop_75", "* All proceeds go to real&  spiders~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidergirl_shop_76", "* Check out the webs to&  make a purchase~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_103", "* Ahuhuhuhu.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_104", "* Did you hear what they&  just said?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_106", "* Did you hear what she&  said?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_114", "* They said a human wearing a&  striped shirt will come&  through./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_122", "* I heard that they hate&  spiders./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_130", "* I heard that they love to&  stomp on them./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_132", "* I heard that they hate&  everybody./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_140", "* I heard that they like to&  tear their legs off./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_149", "* I heard.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_152", "* However.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_154", "* And even if they gave us&  money^1, I heard.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_267", "* ... that they're awfully&  stingy with their money./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_271", "* ... a certain stingy human&  hates spiders./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_273", "* Ahuhuhuhu.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_274", "* You think your taste&  is too refined for our&  pastries^1, don't you^1, deary?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_275", "* Ahuhuhu..^1.&* I disagree with that&  notion./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_276", "* I think your taste.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_277", "* Is exactly what this&  next batch needs!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_283", "* ... that can't be true^1,&  can it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_284", "* Ahuhuhu.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_285", "* You donated so much money&  to us./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_286", "* All the spiders want you&  to know how thankful&  they are!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_287", "* We're in your debt^1, dearie~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_293", "* ... that they have some awful&  taste./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_294", "* What a shame^1.&* A human comes through and they&  aren't even fit to be eaten~/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_295", "* Oh well^1!&* Rotten ingredients can&  always be discarded~/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_392", "* Ahuhuhuhu.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_spidertalkevent_393", "* That was fun^1!&* See you again^1, dearie!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_stick_95", "* (It's a tough-looking branch.)&* (It's too heavy to pick up.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_stick_99", "* (It's been smashed like it&  was nothing...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_295", "A long time ago,&a human fell&into the RUINS./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_307", "Injured by its&fall, the human&called out for&help./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_333", "ASRIEL^1, the king's&son^1, heard the&human's call./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_345", "He brought the&human back to&the castle./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_370", "Over time^1, ASRIEL&and the human&became like&siblings./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_383", "The King and&Queen treated the&human child as&their own./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_395", "The underground&was full of&hope./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_421", "Then..^1.&One day.../*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_433", "The human became&very ill./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_459", "The sick human&had only one&request./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_472", "To see the&flowers from&their village./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_484", "But there was&nothing we could&do./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_511", "The next day./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_523", "The next day./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_546", ".../*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_558", "The human died./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_583", "ASRIEL^1, wracked&with grief^1,&absorbed the&human's SOUL./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_594", "He transformed&into a being&with incredible&power./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_609", "With the human&SOUL^1, ASRIEL&crossed through&the barrier./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_622", "He carried the&human's body&into the sunset./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_634", "Back to the&village of the&humans./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_649", "ASRIEL reached&the center of&the village./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_662", "There^1, he&found a bed of&golden flowers./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_674", "He carried&the human&onto it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_689", "Suddenly^1, screams&rang out./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_702", "The villagers&saw ASRIEL&holding the&human's body./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_714", "They thought&that he had&killed the&child./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_727", "The humans&attacked him&with everything&they had./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_740", "He was struck&with blow after&blow./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_752", "ASRIEL had the&power to destroy&them all./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_767", "But.../*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_778", "ASRIEL did not&fight back./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_805", "Clutching the&human.../*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_816", "ASRIEL smiled^1,&and walked away./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_832", "Wounded^1, ASRIEL&stumbled home./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_845", "He entered the&castle and&collapsed./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_857", "His dust spread&across the&garden./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_872", "The kingdom fell&into despair./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_885", "The king and&queen had lost&two children&in one night./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_897", "The humans had&once again taken&everything&from us./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_911", "The king decided&it was time to&end our&suffering./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_924", "Every human who&falls down here&must die./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_936", "With enough souls^1,&we can shatter&the barrier&forever./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_951", "It's not long&now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_965", "King ASGORE&will let us&go.   /*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_971", "King ASGORE&will give us&hope./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_976", "King ASGORE&will save us&all. /%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1004", "You should be&smiling^1, too./*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1014", "Aren't&you&excited?/*");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1023", "Aren't&you&happy?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1047", "You're going&to be free./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1073", "\\E0Howdy^1, \\[C]!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1074", "You finally made&it home./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1075", "\\E0Remember when we&used to play here?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1076", "\\E0Hee hee hee.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1077", "Boy!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1078", "\\E9Today's gonna be&just as fun./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1093", "\\E1I remember when I&first woke up here^1,&in the garden./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1094", "I was so scared./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1095", "\\E2I couldn't feel my&arms or my legs.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1096", "\\E1My entire body had&turned into a&flower!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1097", "\\E5\"Mom^1! Dad^1!&Somebody help me^1!\"&I called out./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1098", "\\E9But nobody came./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1107", "\\E1Eventually^1, the king&found me^1, crying in&the garden./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1108", "I explained what had&happened to him./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1109", "Then he held me^1,&\\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1110", "He held me with&tears in his eyes^1,&saying.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1111", "\"There^1, there^1.&Everything is going&to be alright.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1112", "He was so..^1.&Emotional./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1113", "\\E1But..^1.&For some reason.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1114", "\\E1I didn't feel&anything at all./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1123", "\\E1I soon realized I&didn't feel ANYTHING&about ANYONE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1124", "My compassion had&disappeared!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1125", "\\E7And believe me^1,&it's not like I&wasn't trying./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1126", "\\E3I wasted weeks with&that stupid king^1,&vainly hoping I would&feel something./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1127", "\\E1But it became too&much for me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1128", "I ran away from&home./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1129", "Eventually^1, I reached&the RUINS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1130", "\\E0Inside I found HER^1,&\\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1131", "I thought of all&people^1, SHE could&make me feel whole&again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1132", "\\E1.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1133", "\\E7She failed./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1134", "\\E6Ha ha.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1144", "\\E1I realized those two&were useless./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1145", "I became despondent./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1146", "I just wanted to&love someone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1147", "I just wanted to&care about someone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1148", "\\[C]^1, you might&not believe this.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1149", "\\E2But I decided..^1.&It wasn't worth&living anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1150", "\\E7Not in a world&without love./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1151", "\\E6Not in a world&without you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1152", "\\E1So.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1153", "\\E0I decided to follow&in your footsteps./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1154", "\\E1I would erase myself&from existence./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1155", "\\E1And you know what?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1156", "\\E0I succeeded./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1165", "\\E1But as I left this&mortal coil.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1166", "I started to feel&apprehensive./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1167", "\\E9If you don't have&a SOUL^1, what happens&when you...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1168", "\\E1Something primal&started to burn&inside me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1169", "\"No^1,\" I thought^1.&\"I don't want to&die!\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1170", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1171", "Then I woke up./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1172", "Like it was all&just a bad dream./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1173", "I was back at the&garden./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1174", "\\E0Back at my&\"save point.\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1183", "Interested^1, I decided&to experiment./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1184", "Again and again^1, I&brought myself to&the edge of death./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1185", "At any point^1, I&could have let this&world continue on&without me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1186", "But as long as I&was determined to&live.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1187", "\\E0I could go back./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1188", "\\E6Amazing^1, isn't it^1,&\\[C]?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1189", "\\E0I was amazed^1, too./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1197", "\\E1At first^1, I used my&powers for good./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1198", "\\E0I became \"friends\"&with everyone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1199", "I solved all their&problems flawlessly./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1200", "Their companionship&was amusing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1201", "\\E1For a while. /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1202", "\\E1As time repeated^1,&people proved&themselves&predictable./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1203", "What would this&person say if I&gave them this?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1204", "What would they do&if I said this to&them?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1205", "Once you know the&answer^1, that's it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1206", "That's all they are./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1217", "\\E1It all started&because I was&curious./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1218", "\\E0Curious what would&happen if I killed&them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1219", "\\E2\"I don't like this^1,\"&I told myself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1220", "\\E1\"I'm just doing this&because I HAVE to&know what happens./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1221", "\\E8Ha ha ha..^1.&What an excuse!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1222", "\\E9You of all people&must know how&liberating it is to&act this way./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1223", "\\E8At least we're better&than those sickos&that stand around and&WATCH it happen.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1224", "\\E9Those pathetic people&that want to see it^1,&but are too weak to&do it themselves./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1225", "\\E0I bet someone like&that's watching right&now^1, aren't they...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1235", "\\E1Nowadays^1, even that's&grown tiring./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1236", "\\E7You understand^1,&\\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1237", "\\E6I've done everything&this world has to&offer./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1238", "\\E1I've read every book^1.&I've burned every&book./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1239", "I've won every game^1.&I've lost every game./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1240", "I've appeased&everyone^1.&I've killed everyone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1241", "Sets of numbers..^1.&Lines of dialogue..^1.&I've seen them all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1242", "\\E1But you..^1.&YOU'RE different./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1243", "\\E0I never could&predict YOU^1, \\[C]./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1252", "\\E1When I saw you in&the RUINS^1, I didn't&recognize you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1253", "\\E8I thought I could&frighten you^1, then&steal your SOUL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1254", "\\E1I failed./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1255", "\\E0And when I tried&to load my save&file.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1256", "\\E1It didn't work./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1257", "\\E9\\[C]..^1.&Your DETERMINATION!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1258", "\\E8Somehow^1, it's even&greater than mine!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1267", "\\E1I just have one&question for you^1,&\\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1268", "How did you get&back to the RUINS&from here...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1269", "\\E0... wait^1, I know./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1270", "She must have taken&you when she left./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1271", "\\E1And decided to give&you a proper burial^1,&rather than.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1272", "\\E0Hanging out in the&basement forever./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1273", "\\E1... but^1, why then...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1274", "What made you wake&up?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1275", "\\E6Did you hear me&calling you...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1286", "\\E1It doesn't matter&now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1287", "\\E1I'm so tired of&this^1, \\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1288", "I'm tired of all&these people./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1289", "I'm tired of all&these places./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1290", "I'm tired of being&a flower./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1291", "\\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1292", "\\E0There's just one&thing left I want&to do./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1293", "Let's finish what we&started./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1294", "Let's free everyone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1295", "\\E8Then..^1. let's let&them see what&humanity is&REALLY like!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1296", "\\E6That despite it all.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1297", "\\E9This world is still&\"kill or be killed!!\"/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1307", "\\E1Then...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1308", "\\E7Well^1.&I had.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1309", "\\E9Been entertaining a&few ways to use&that power./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1310", "\\E8Hee hee hee.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1311", "\\E1.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1312", "\\E1But seeing you here&changed my mind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1313", "\\E6\\[C]..^1.&I think if you're&around.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1314", "\\E7Just living in the&surface world&doesn't seem so bad./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1324", "\\E0We don't even need&to leave to get&them this time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1325", "The king has six of&them locked away./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1326", "\\E1I've tried hundreds&of ways to get him&to show me them.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1327", "\\E3But he just won't./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1328", "\\E1\\[C].../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1329", "\\E0I know he'll do it&for YOU./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1339", "\\E0Why am I telling&you all of this?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1340", "\\E6\\[C]^1, I said it&before./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1341", "\\E1Even after all this&time.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1342", "\\E0You're still the&only one that&understands me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1343", "\\E8You won't give me&any worthless pity!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1353", "\\E9Creatures like us.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1354", "\\E0Wouldn't hesitate to&KILL each other if&we got in each&other's way./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1355", "\\E0So that's.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1356", "\\E1So..^1. that's..^1.&Why.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1383", "\\E2.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1384", "\\E2... ha..^1.&Ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1385", "\\E6... what's this..^1.&... feeling?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1386", "Why am I..^1.&Shaking?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1387", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1388", "Hey..^1. \\[C]..^1.&No hard feelings about&back then^1, right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1389", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1390", "\\E4H-Hey^1, what are you&doing!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1391", "B..^1. back off!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1412", "I..^1. I've changed&my mind about all&this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1413", "This isn't a good&idea anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1414", "Y-you should go back^1,&\\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1415", "\\E0This place is fine&the way it is!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1416", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1417", "\\E4S-s-stop making that&creepy face!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1418", "This isn't funny!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_storybattle_gen_1419", "You've got a SICK&sense of humor!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_switch_100", "* (The machine isn't working.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_switchadvice1_61", "* Please press this switch.& &            - TORIEL/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_switchadvice2_61", "* Please press this switch&  too.&             - TORIEL/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_switchhelptrigger_69", "* (You noticed there was&  a blue switch behind the&  top pillar.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_telescope_71", "* Come on! What are you doing!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_telescope_75", "* (It's an odd-looking&  telescope.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tembattle_282", "awwAwa&cute!!&(pets u)");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tembattle_283", "OMG!!&humans&TOO CUTE&(dies)");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tembattle_284", "hOI!!!&i'm&TEMMIE!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tembattle_285", "fhsdhjf&dsfjsd&dshjfsd");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tembattle_288", "NO!!!!!&muscles&......&NOT CUTE");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tembattle_292", "NO!!!&so&hungr...&(dies)");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tembattle_298", "hOI!!!&i'm&tEMMIE!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tembattle_302", "FOOB!!!");
