  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_70", "* Hello^1, Frisk^1.&* Alphys upgraded my&  phone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_71", "* I am having a lot&  of fun with the&  \"texting\" feature./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_72", "* Sans^1, \"check out\" this&  one./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_74", "* oh man^1, tori.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_75", "\\E1* that's brutal./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_77", "I CAN'T BELIEVE&THE QUEEN HAS&RETURNED.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_78", "\\E4AND ALSO THAT&SHE'S A HUGE&DORK!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_79", "YOU TWO ARE TWO&FEET AWAY FROM&EACH OTHER!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_80", "WHY ARE YOU&TEXTING!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_82", "* Worry not^1, Papyrus^1.&* We are texting for&  a good reason./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_84", "WHY IS THAT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_86", "* well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_87", "\\E2* cause we're huge&  dorks./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_89", "* Sans^1, please do&  not say that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_90", "* You are not a dork./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_91", "\\E0* You are more of&  a bonehead!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_93", "HAHAHA^1, WOW!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_94", "\\E0THOSE PUNS ARE&EVEN LESS FUNNY&COMING FROM HER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_96", "* then why are you&  smiling?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_98", "IT'S A PITY&SMILE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_103", "* Frisk^1, do not feel&  left out./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_104", "* I have been writing&  messages to you as&  well!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_105", "\\W* You still have \\Ymy&  phone number\\W after&  all this time.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_106", "* Do you not?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_111", "* Frisk^1, how about&  you go look around&  before we all go?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_112", "* Seeing how many good&  friends you've made&  here.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_toriel_friendc_113", "* I am almost certain&  you must have made&  some more./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_366", " .....");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_367", " .....& .....");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_368", " .....& .....& .....");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_369", " ...?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_370", " What are& you& doing?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_371", " Attack& or run& away!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_372", " What are& you& proving& this way?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_373", " Fight me& or& leave!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_374", " Stop it.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_376", " Stop& looking& at me& that way.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_377", " Go away!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_378", " ...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_380", " ...& ...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_388", "I know you want&to go home^1, but...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_390", "But please... go&upstairs now.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_391", "I promise I will&take good care&of you here.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_392", "I know we do not&have much^1, but...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_393", "We can have a&good life here.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_395", "Why are you&making this so&difficult?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_397", "Please^1, go upstairs.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_399", ".....");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_401", "Ha ha...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_402", "Pathetic^1, is it not^2?&I cannot save even&a single child.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_403", "...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_416", "No^1, I understand./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_417", "You would just be&unhappy trapped&down here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_418", "The RUINS are very&small once you&get used to them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_419", "It would not be&right for you to&grow up in a&place like this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_420", "My expectations...&My loneliness...&My fear.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_421", "For you^1, my child...&I will put them aside./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_445", "\\E0Urgh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_446", "\\E0You are stronger&than I thought.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_447", "Listen to me^1,& small one.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_448", "If you go beyond&this door,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_449", "Keep walking as&far as you can./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_450", "Eventually you will&reach an exit./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_451", "\\E1..^1.&..../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_452", "\\RASGORE\\X..^1.&Do not let \\RASGORE\\X &take your soul./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_453", "His plan&cannot be allowed&to succeed./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_454", "\\E2....../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_455", "Be good^1,&won't you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_456", "\\E3My child.      %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_460", "Y... you...&really hate me&that much?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_461", "Now I see who I&was protecting by&keeping you here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_462", "Not you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_463", "\\E5But them!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_464", "\\E3Ha... ha... %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_469", "\\E4You.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_470", "... at my most&vulnerable&moment.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_471", "To think I was&worried you&wouldn't fit&in out there.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_472", "\\E5Eheheheh!!!&You really are&no different than&them!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_473", "\\E3Ha... ha... %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_803", "* Toriel prepares a magical&  attack.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_804", "* Toriel looks through you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_805", "* Toriel is acting aloof.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_806", "* Toriel takes a deep breath.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_809", "* ...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_834", "* TORIEL - ATK 80 DEF 80&* Knows best for you./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_843", "* You couldn't think of&  any conversation&  topics./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_847", "* You tried to think&  of something to say&  again^1, but.../^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_848", "* Ironically^1, talking does not&  seem to be the solution&  to this situation./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_850", "* You thought about telling&  Toriel that you saw&  her die./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_851", "* But...&* That's creepy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_852", "* Can you show mercy without&  fighting or running&  away...?/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_854", "* Can you show mercy&  without running away...?/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_855", "* Not worth talking to./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_90", "* Ring..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_91", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_92", "* Hello?&* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_93", "\\E1* You have not left&  the room^1, have you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_94", "* There are a few puzzles&  ahead that I have&  yet to explain./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_95", "* It would be dangerous&  to try to solve them&  yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_96", "* Be good^1, alright?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_97", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_98", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_102", "* Ring..\\E1.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_103", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_104", "* Hello^1? Hello^1?&* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_105", "* My apologies^1.&* A strange dog&  kidnapped my phone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_106", "* So if you called^1, I&  could not have helped&  you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_107", "\\E0* However^1, I have&  recovered it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_108", "* And you are still in&  that room^1, are you not?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_109", "* What a good child you&  are./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_110", "\\E1* There are a few puzzles&  ahead that I have&  yet to explain./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_111", "* It would be dangerous&  to try to solve them&  yourself./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_112", "\\E1* Be good^1, alright?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_113", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall1_114", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_88", "* Ring..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_89", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_90", "* Hello?&* This is TORIEL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_91", "\\E1* You do not DISLIKE&  butterscotch^1, do you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_92", "\\E1* You do not DISLIKE&  cinnamon^1, do you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_93", "* I know what your&  preference is^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_94", "* Would you turn up your&  nose if you found&  it on your plate?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_95", "* Right^1, right^1, I&  understand./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_96", "\\E0* Thank you for being&  patient^1, by the way./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_97", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall3_98", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall4_88", "* Ring..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall4_89", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall4_90", "* Hello?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall4_91", "\\E1* You do not have&  any allergies^1, do&  you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall4_92", "* Huh^1?&* Why am I asking?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall4_93", "\\E0* No reason..^1.&* No reason at all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall4_94", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall4_95", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_90", "* Ring..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_91", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_92", "* Hello?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_93", "\\E1* I just realized that it&  has been a while since&  I have cleaned up./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_94", "\\E0* I was not expecting to&  have company so soon./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_95", "* There are probably a lot&  of things lying about&  here and there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_96", "* You can pick them up^1,&  but do not carry more&  than you need./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_97", "* Someday you might see&  something you really&  like./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_98", "* You will want to leave&  room in your pockets&  for that./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_99", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_100", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_104", "* Ring..\\E0.\\TT /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_105", "\\F1 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_106", "* Hello?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_107", "\\E1* I have a question./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_108", "* You like things other&  than butterscotch or&  cinnamon^1, too.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_109", "* Do you not?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_110", "\\E0* ..^1. oh^1, what am I&  asking./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_111", "* I will keep looking./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_112", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielcall5_113", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger10_77", "* Every human that falls&  down here meets&  the same fate./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger10_78", "* I have seen it&  again and again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger10_79", "* They come./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger10_80", "* They leave./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger10_81", "* They die./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger10_82", "* You naive child..^1.&* If you leave the&  RUINS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger10_83", "\\W* They..^1.&* \\RASGORE\\W..^1.&* Will kill you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger10_84", "* I am only protecting&  you^1, do you understand?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger10_85", "* ... go to your room./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger11_79", "* Do not try to stop me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger11_80", "* This is your final&  warning./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_86", "\\E0* Goodbye^1, my child./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_149", "\\E2* That is right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_150", "* Go upstairs./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_183", "\\E2* If you truly wish to&  leave the RUINS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_184", "* I will not stop you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_185", "\\E2* However^1, when you&  leave.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_186", "\\E1* Please do not come&  back./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_187", "\\E2* I hope you understand./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_325", "* You want to leave&  so badly?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_326", "\\E6* Hmph./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_327", "* You are just like&  the others./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_328", "\\E7* There is only one&  solution to this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_329", "* Prove yourself.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_330", "* Prove to me you&  are strong enough&  to survive./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_336", "* Prove to me you&  are strong enough&  to survive!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_337", "\\E6* ... wait./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_338", "* ... why are you looking&  at me like that?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_339", "* Like you have seen&  a ghost./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_340", "\\E7* Do you know something&  that I do not?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_341", "* No...&* That is impossible./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_346", "* Prove to me that you&  are.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_347", "\\E1* Hey^1, let me finish%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_353", "* Already?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger12_354", "* What will it take&  for you to learn&  your lesson?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger5_185", "* How did you get&  here^1, my child^1?&* Are you hurt?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger5_186", "* Not a scratch..^1.&*\\E0 Impressive^1!&*\\E1 But still.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger5_187", "* There^1, there^1, I will&  heal you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger5_189", "* Who did this to you^2?\\E5 &* You will get an apology./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger5_190", "\\E1* I should not have&  left you alone&  for so long./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger5_191", "* It was irresponsible&  to try to surprise&  you like this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger5_192", "\\E8* Err.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger5_193", "\\E0* Well^1, I suppose I&  cannot hide it&  any longer./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger5_194", "* Come^1, small one!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger5_260", "* Oh dear^1, that took&  longer than I&  thought it would./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_39", "* Do you smell that^1?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_40", "* Surprise!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_41", "* It is a butterscotch-&  cinnamon pie./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_42", "* I thought we might&  celebrate your&  arrival./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_43", "* I want you to have&  a nice time living&  here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_44", "* So I will hold off&  on snail pie for&  tonight./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_45", "* Here^1, I have another&  surprise for you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_49", "* Do you smell that^1?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_50", "\\E1* Er^1, I assume that&  expression means you&  do./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_51", "\\E0* S..^1. surprise!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_52", "* I have baked a snail&  pie./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_53", "* I thought we might&  celebrate your&  arrival./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_54", "* I want you to have&  a nice time living&  here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_55", "\\E1* So I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger6_56", "\\E0* Here^1, I have another&  surprise for you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger7_41", "* This is it.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger7_77", "* Is something burning...?&* Um^1, make yourself&  at home!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger7_243", "* A room of your own.&* I hope you like it!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_77", "* I think you should&  play upstairs&  instead./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_78", "* It is dangerous&  to play here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_79", "* It is drafty here.&* You will catch&  a cold./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_80", "* It is dusty here.&* You will catch&  a cough./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_81", "* There is nothing&  to see here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_82", "* Do you want to&  read a book?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_83", "\\E7* I do not like&  the game you&  are playing./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_84", "\\E0* Why not go for&  a walk in the&  yard?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_85", "* Really now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_86", "\\E4* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_90", "* Hey^1, do not go down&  here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger8_91", "* I have something&  to show you&  upstairs./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger9_77", "* You wish to know how&  to return \"home,\"&  do you not?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger9_78", "* Ahead of us lies the&  end of the RUINS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger9_79", "* A one-way exit to the&  rest of the underground./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger9_80", "* I am going to destroy&  it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger9_81", "* No one will ever&  be able to leave&  again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torieltrigger9_82", "* Now be a good child&  and go upstairs./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_82", "* Do not worry about&  me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_83", "* Someone has to take&  care of these flowers./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_93", "* Don't worry about&  me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_94", "* Someone has to take&  care of these flowers./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_99", "* Frisk^1, please leave&  me alone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_100", "\\E3* I can't come back^1.&* I just can't^1, OK?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_106", "\\E7* I don't want to break&  their hearts all over&  again./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_107", "* It's better if they&  never see me./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_113", "\\E7* ... why are you still&  here?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_114", "* Are you trying to keep&  me company?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_115", "\\E0* Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_116", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_117", "\\E7* Hey./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_118", "\\E0* Let me ask you a&  question./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_119", "* Frisk..^1.&* Why did you come&  here?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_120", "* Everyone knows the&  legend^1, right...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_121", "* \"Travellers who climb&  Mt. Ebott are said&  to disappear.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_122", "\\E7* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_123", "* Frisk./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_124", "*\\E0 Why would you ever&  climb a mountain&  like that?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_125", "\\E7* Was it foolishness?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_126", "\\E0* Was it fate?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_127", "\\E1* Or was it..^1.&* Because you...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_128", "\\E7* Well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_129", "\\E0* Only you know the&  answer^1, don't you...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_135", "\\E2* I know why \\[C]&  climbed the mountain./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_136", "\\E7* It wasn't for a&  very happy reason./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_137", "\\E2* Frisk^1.&* I'll be honest with&  you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_138", "\\E7* \\[C] hated humanity./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_139", "\\E2* Why they did^1, they&  never talked about&  it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_140", "\\E1* But they felt very&  strongly about&  that./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_146", "\\E2* Frisk..^1.&* You really ARE different&  from \\[C]./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_147", "\\E0* In fact^1, though you&  have similar^1, uh^1,&  fashion choices.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_148", "* I don't know why I&  ever acted like you&  were the same person./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_149", "\\E7* Maybe..^1.&* The truth is.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_150", "\\E1* \\[C] wasn't really&  the greatest person./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_151", "\\E7* While^1, Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_152", "\\E0* You're the type of&  friend I wish I&  always had./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_153", "\\E7* So maybe I was kind&  of projecting a&  little bit./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_154", "\\E0* Let's be honest^1.&* I did some weird&  stuff as a flower./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_160", "\\E2* There's one last&  thing I feel like&  I should tell you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_161", "* Frisk^1, when \\[C]&  and I combined our&  SOULs together.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_162", "* The control over our&  body was actually split&  between us./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_163", "* They were the one&  that picked up their&  own empty body./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_164", "* And then^1, when we&  got to the village.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_165", "\\E2* They were the one&  that wanted to.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_166", "\\E1* ... to use our full&  power./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_167", "\\E2* I was the one that&  resisted./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_168", "\\E7* And then^1, because of&  me^1, we.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_169", "\\E1* Well^1, that's why I&  ended up a flower./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_170", "\\E2* Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_171", "* This whole time^1, I've&  blamed myself for&  that decision./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_172", "* That's why I adopted&  that horrible view&  of the world./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_173", "* \"Kill or be killed.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_174", "\\E7* But now..^1.&* After meeting you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_175", "\\E0* Frisk^1, I don't regret&  that decision anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_176", "\\E4* I did the right&  thing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_177", "* If I killed those&  humans.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_178", "* We would have had to&  wage war against all&  of humanity./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_179", "\\E0* And in the end^1,&  everyone went free^1,&  right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_180", "\\E7* I still feel kind&  of sad knowing how&  long it took.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_181", "\\E0* ... so maybe it&  wasn't a perfect&  decision./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_182", "* But you can't regret&  hard choices your&  whole life^1, right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_183", "\\E7* Well^1, not that I&  have much of a life&  left./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_184", "\\E0* But that's besides&  the point./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_190", "* Frisk^1, thank you&  for listening to me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_191", "* You should really go&  be with your friends&  now^1, OK?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_192", "* Oh^1, and^1, please.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_193", "\\E7* In the future^1, if you&  uh^1, see me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_194", "* Don't think of it as&  me^1, OK?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_195", "\\E0* I just want you to&  remember me like this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_196", "\\E0* Someone that was your&  friend for a little&  while./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_197", "\\E2* Oh^1, and Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_198", "\\E0* Be careful in the&  outside world^1, OK?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_199", "* Despite what everyone&  thinks^1, it's not as&  nice as it is here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_200", "\\E7* There are a lot of&  Floweys out there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_201", "\\E2* And not everything can&  be resolved by just&  being nice./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_202", "\\E0* Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_203", "* Don't kill^1, and&  don't be killed^1,&  alright?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_204", "* That's the best you&  can strive for./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_205", "* Well^1, see you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_212", "\\E7* Frisk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torinteractable7_213", "\\E6* Don't you have&  anything better to&  do?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_63", " error/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_67", "* (There's a note on the&  ground...^1)&* (You can't make it all out.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_68", "* \"elevator..^1. lost power..^1.\"&* \"enter the center door...\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_69", "* (That's all you could read.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_74", "* (There's a note on the&  ground...^1)&* (You can't make it all out.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_75", "* \"drain..^1. dropped it...\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_76", "* (That's all you could read.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_81", "* (There's a note on the&  ground...^1)&* (You can't make it all out.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_82", "* \"cold...\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_83", "* (That's all you could read.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_88", "* (There's a note on the&  ground...^1)&* (You can't make it all out.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_89", "* \"curtain...\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_90", "* (That's all you could read.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_95", "* (There's a note on the&  ground...^1)&* (You can't make it all out.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_96", "* \"under..^1. sheets...\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torn_note_97", "* (That's all you could read.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_70", "* This town doesn't have a&  mayor./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_71", "* But if there's ever a problem^1,&  a skeleton will tell a fish&  lady about it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_72", "* Thaaaaaat's politics!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_73", "* Politics./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_77", "* What if I ran for mayor...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_78", "* I don't think I would do&  a good job^1, and I hate&  responsibility.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_79", "* But I love politics^1.&* So I might be a perfect&  match./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_85", "* I heard Dr. Alphys told&  the king and queen the&  awful things she'd done./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_86", "* The king felt so bad&  that he didn't know^1.&* He gave her a big hug./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_87", "* Then the queen fired her./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_88", "* Now we don't have a Royal&  Scientist anymore.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_89", "* Thaaaaat's politics!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_93", "* Too bad there are no&  politics on the surface./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_99", "* Hmmm^1, usually that skeleton&  goes to meet with Undyne&  about now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bear1_100", "* Where is he...^1?&* I can feel our political&  system crumbling apart.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_70", "* Awful teens tormented&  a local monster by decorating&  its tree-like horns./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_71", "* So we started giving that&  monster presents to make it&  feel better./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_72", "* Now it's a tradition to put&  presents underneath a decorated&  tree./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_74", "* Guess it was a good thing&  those teens tormented that&  monster...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_78", "* Hmm^1?&* Adjusting the presents is&  my responsibility./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_79", "* Nah^1, to be honest^1, I&  just keep looking to see&  if I've gotten one.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_84", "* It'll be nice to show humans&  our presents-under-the-tree&  tradition./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_85", "* They'll probably be weirded&  out by it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_90", "* You know what's cute?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_91", "* Those two married dogs&  always put presents under&  the tree for each other./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_92", "* It's always the same^1.&* A single bone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_93", "* But every time^1, they act&  like it's the first time&  they've gotten it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_94", "* Then Papyrus comes to take&  his bones back./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_95", "* Anyway^1, where are those&  two...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_100", "* That's strange^1.&* There was a present here&  for Papyrus.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_beartree_101", "* Now it's gone^1.&* Did someone steal it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_70", "* That lady over there.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_71", "* Something about her disturbs&  me./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_72", "* I think I've figured it out^1.&* ... no^1, nevermind./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_76", "* That lady over there's&  been going for a walk&  for a while now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_77", "* ... but she hasn't moved&  an inch from where she's&  standing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_78", "* W-well^1, I haven't either^1,&  but I don't want her to&  notice me over here.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_83", "* Uhhh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_84", "* Is anyone else weirded out&  by those giant shambling&  amalgamates^1, or...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_85", "* ....../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_90", "* That lady over there&  seems happy today./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunboy_91", "* Don't know why^1, but it's&  sending shivers down my&  spine.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_70", "* Isn't my little Cinnamon&  just the cutest?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_71", "* Bun-buns are so adorable..^1.&* Tee hee!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_73", "* Bun-bun-bun-bun-bun.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_77", "* Huh^1? Yes^1, I'm taking&  my bunny for a walk./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_78", "* It's just a very slow one./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_83", "* That kid over there told&  me that it's weird that&  I have a pet bunny./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_84", "* First^1, there'd be nothing&  weird about it^1.&* It's cute!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_85", "* Second..^1.&* What?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_86", "* It's normal to walk your&  younger brother on a&  leash^1, right?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_91", "* Ah^1, it's so peaceful&  and quiet.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_92", "* Usually one of those dogs&  chases my little Cinnamon&  around./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_97", "* Ah^1, it's so peaceful&  and quiet.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_bunlady_98", "* Usually one of those&  skeletons chases my little&  Cinnamon around./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_70", "* The capital's getting pretty&  crowded^1, so I've heard they're&  going to start moving here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_71", "* Hmmm..^1.&* I don't want to see the&  erasure of our local culture./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_72", "* But I definitely want to see&  some city slickers slip onto&  their butts!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_73", "* Yeah^1, bring 'em on!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_77", "* What will happen to&  Grillby's if everyone&  moves in...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_78", "* We're gonna have to have&  chairs to the ceiling./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_83", "* Hey^1! People won't have to&  move in from the city&  anymore!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_84", "* Seems like we won't have&  to lose our local culture./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_85", "* ... except we're all moving&  out of here^1, huh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_86", "* Oh well^1. Guess it can't be&  all punk-peaches and punk-&  cream./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_91", "* The capital's getting pretty&  crowded^1, so I've heard they're&  going to start moving here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_hatescity_92", "* ... who knows^1.&* Maybe we'll have room./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_icewolf_71", "* Ice Wolf no longer has to&  throw Ice./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_icewolf_72", "* Ice Wolf can take a break to&  buy some pants now./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_icewolf_74", "* Ice Wolf thinking of changing&  their name to Jimmy Hotpants./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_innlady_114", "* Error./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_innlady_199", "* Hiya^1!&* You look like you&  had a great sleep./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_innlady_200", "* Which is incredible^1, because&  you were only up there for&  about two minutes.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_innlady_203", "* Here's your money back^1.&* You can pay me if you're&  going to stay overnight./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_innlady_207", "* Feel free to come back&  if you get tired./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_80", "* Yo^1!&* You're a kid too^1, right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_81", "* I can tell 'cause you're&  wearing a striped shirt./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_82", "* I wonder if that weird skeleton&  is an adult or a kid./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_88", "* Yo..^1.&* There you are!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_89", "* I've been kinda worried&  about you since you&  ran away./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_90", "* ... but now I'm just kinda&  mad^1, ha ha./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_91", "* If Undyne hadn't saved me^1,&  that woulda been bad.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_93", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_97", "* Yo..^1.&* Uh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_98", "* Don't talk to me./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_100", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_104", "* Yo!!^1!&* What's up!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_105", "* I've been kinda^1, doing&  some thinking.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_106", "* Maybe Undyne...&* Isn't actually as cool as&  we thought./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_107", "* She's just kinda..^1. mean./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_108", "* But YO!!^1!&* I just found out about&  someone WAYYY cooler!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_109", "* Nyeh heh heh!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_111", "* Nyeh heh heh^1, dude./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_117", "* Yo^1, everyone ran away and&  hid somewhere./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_118", "* Man^1, adults can be so&  dumb sometimes^1, haha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_119", "* Don't they know we've&  got Undyne to protect us!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_122", "* Yo^1!&* Are you sneaking out to&  see her^1, too?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_123", "* Awesome..^1.&* She's the coolest^1, right!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_124", "* I wanna be just like her&  when I grow up.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_125", "* Hey^1, don't tell my parents&  I'm here^1.&* Ha ha./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_127", "* OK^1, I'm ready when you&  are./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_129", "* Yo^1!&* Where were you going...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_130", "* My parents didn't tell you&  to come here^1, did they?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_132", "* You know where you're&  going^1, right...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_133", "* I was just gonna follow&  you..^1.&* Ha ha./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_141", "* Yo^1, this ledge is way&  too steep.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_147", "* Hmmm..../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_monsterkid1_161", "* Yo^1, you aren't going to&  be able to climb with&  an umbrella./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_reddemon_70", "* We all know the underground&  has problems^1, but we&  smile anyway./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_reddemon_71", "* Why?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_reddemon_72", "* We can't do anything^1, so&  why be morose about it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_reddemon_73", "* Smile smile./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_reddemon_83", "* Maybe I'll try frowning&  for once./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_reddemon_84", "* ... no^1.&* I just can't do it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_reddemon_89", "* Oh^1?&* We're free?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_reddemon_90", "* Finally..^1.&* I'll be able to stop&  smiling./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_reddemon_95", "* Just now^1, I felt my smile&  falter for a moment./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_reddemon_96", "* What's wrong?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedad_70", "* Ah^1, to be young again^1.&* The world sure felt boundless./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedad_74", "* You like to wander^1.&* You must be young./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedad_79", "* Seems like this is the&  beginning of a brand-new^1,&  boundless world.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedad_80", "* Wah-ha^1!&* This adventurous spirit^1!&* I'm like a kid again!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedad_81", "* And my children are like..^1.&* Double-children./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedad_86", "* I've sent the kids inside./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedad_87", "* It feels unsafe here today./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedaughter_80", "* You aren't gonna make me&  be the human again^1, are you?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedaughter_84", "* Can we PLEASE play something&  else...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedaughter_89", "* Hmmm..^1.&* When humans play Monsters&  and Humans.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimedaughter_90", "* Do they just call it&  Humans and Humans?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimeson_75", "* Let's play Monsters and Humans!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimeson_79", "* Let's continue to play&  Monsters and Humans!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_slimeson_84", "* Now we can play Monsters&  and Humans with REAL humans!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_70", "* Everyone is always laughing&  and cracking jokes^1, trying&  to forget our modern crises.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_71", "* Dreariness^1.&* Crowding^1.&* Lack of sunlight./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_72", "* I would join them^1, but I'm&  just not very funny./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_73", "* At least I'm not making puns./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_77", "* Wait^1!&* I've got a joke!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_78", "* Knock knock!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_79", "* ... Uh^1.&* That's all I've thought of./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_85", "* Looks like I don't have&  to worry about cracking&  jokes anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_86", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_87", "* I was going to say a joke&  here^1, but I really don't&  have one./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_unfunny_92", "* It just feels like..^1.&* Like everything is getting&  worse and worse./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_72", "* I \"put out a line\" for some&  girls today./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_73", "* Someone told me that there&  are plenty of fish in the&  sea.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_74", "* Well^1, I'm taking that&  seriously./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_75", "* I'm literally going to make&  out with a fish./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_76", "* I guess I could ask out Undyne^1.&* But I think she likes someone&  already./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_80", "* Did I catch anyone yet^1?&* I can't bear to look.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_85", "* Sans is the most regular&  regular of all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_86", "* He hasn't been showing up&  as much recently though./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_91", "* Where the heck is Sans?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_92", "* He told me he had some&  bait I could use./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_93", "* Though it was probably&  some kind of prank./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_94", "* But I wanted to know what&  the prank was!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_99", "* In the end^1, I never caught&  any girls on my fishing&  line./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_100", "* So kid^1, take it from me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_101", "* Don't try to catch hot&  people with a fishing rod./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_townnpc_weirdfish_102", "* (Somewhere^1, you hear a whinny&  of dismay.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_103", "HEY^1, SANS^1, HAVE&YOU SEEN MY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_104", "\\E0OH, HELLO^1.&YOU AREN'T SANS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_105", "\\E3WAIT A SECOND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_106", "\\E0WHY WERE YOU USING&A TREADMILL IN&THE DARK?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_107", "\\E3IS SANS PRANKING&YOU ACROSS TIME&AND SPACE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_108", "\\E1I HATE IT WHEN&HE DOES THAT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_109", "\\E1HOW IMMATURE CAN&YOU GET?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_110", "\\E3ALSO^1, HAVE YOU&SEEN MY ACTION&FIGURES?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_111", "\\E0WAIT^1!&I KNOW WHERE TO&LOOK!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_112", "IN MY COLLECTION^1!&NYEH HEH HEH!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_treadmill_event_113", "SOMETIMES^1, I'M A&GENIUS^1.&ALL THE TIME./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_120", "* Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_121", "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_122", "\\E6* OK^1!&* Now press the third&  one!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_123", "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_124", "* (Click...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_147", "\\E1* ............./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_148", "\\E2* ............./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_149", "\\E0* H-h-hey!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_150", "\\E5* Looks like you!!!^1 &* Only needed to press^1!&* Two of them!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_151", "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_152", "* (Click...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_213", "* Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_214", "\\TS \\E4 \\F6 \\TA %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_215", "\\E3* H-h-hey^1!&* You did it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_216", "\\E4* I was worried I&  messed it up&  there.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_217", "\\E0* But I guess we&  make a pretty good&  team!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_218", "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_triswitchevent_219", "* (Click...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_94", "Greetings./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_95", "I^2 am \\[C]./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_111", "Thank you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_112", "Your power awakened&me from death./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_113", "My \"human soul.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_114", "My \"determination.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_115", "They were not mine^1,&but YOURS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_116", "At first^1, I&was so confused./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_117", "Our plan had failed^1,&hadn't it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_118", "Why was I brought&back to life?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_119", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_120", "You./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_121", "With your guidance./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_122", "I realized the purpose&of my reincarnation./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_123", "Power./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_124", "Together^1, we eradicated&the enemy and became&strong./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_125", "HP. ATK. DEF.&GOLD. EXP. LV./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_126", "Every time a number&increases^1, that&feeling.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_127", "That's me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_128", "\"\\[C].\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_129", "Now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_130", "Now, we have reached&the absolute./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_131", "There is nothing&left for us here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_132", "Let us erase this&pointless world^1, and&move on to the next./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_136", "\"\\[C].\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_137", "The demon that comes&when people call&its name./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_138", "It doesn't matter when./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_139", "It doesn't matter where./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_140", "Time after time,&I will appear./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_141", "And, with your help./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_142", "We will eradicate the&enemy and become&strong./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_143", "HP. ATK. DEF.&GOLD. EXP. LV./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_144", "Every time a number&increases^1, that&feeling.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_145", "That's me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_146", "\"\\[C].\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_147", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_148", "But./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_149", "You and I are not&the same^1, are we?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_150", "This SOUL resonates&with a strange&feeling./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_151", "There is a reason&you continue to&recreate this world./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_152", "There is a reason&you continue to&destroy it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_153", "You./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_154", "You are wracked with&a perverted&sentimentality./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_155", "Hmm./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_156", "I cannot understand&these feelings&any more./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_157", "Despite this./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_158", "I feel obligated to&suggest./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_159", "Should you choose to&create this world&once more./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_160", "Another path would&be better suited./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_161", "Now, partner./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_162", "Let us send this&world back into the&abyss./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_186", "Right^1. You are a&great partner./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_187", "We'll be together&forever^1, won't we?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_209", "No...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_210", "Hmm.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_211", "How curious./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_212", "You must have&misunderstood./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_213", "SINCE WHEN WERE YOU&THE ONE IN CONTROL?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_217", "No...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_218", "Hmm...&This feeling you have./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_219", "This is what I&spoke of./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_220", "Unfortunately,&regarding this.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_truechara_221", "YOU MADE YOUR CHOICE&LONG AGO./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_235", "It's not&like I&LIKE&you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_236", "Id...&Idiot!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_237", "Hmph!&Don't&get in&my way.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_238", ">_<...&Human&...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_242", "...&H-human&...&...?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_243", "Id...&Idiot!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_250", "Eeeeh?&H-human&...?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_251", "Human,&I...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_256", "Huh!?&Y-you&sicko!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_257", "Ah...&Is that&true...?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_262", "No way!&Why&would I&like YOU");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_263", "Human,&I...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_266", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_465", "* Tsunderplane looks over^1,&  then turns up its nose.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_466", "* Tsunderplane shakes its&  nose dimissively at you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_467", "* Tsunderplane \"accidentally\"&  bumps you with its wing.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_468", "* Tsunderplane gives you a&  condescending barrel roll.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_469", "* Smells like an airport&  perfume counter.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_470", "* Tsunderplane is looking away&  shyly.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_471", "* Tsunderplane's body is smoking.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_490", "* TSUNDERPLANE - ATK 25 DEF 26&* Seems mean^1, but does&  it secretly like you?/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_499", "* You tell Tsunderplane it has&  an impressive wingspan./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_501", "* You tell Tsunderplane it has&  an impressive wingspan./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_502", "* You tell Tsunderplane it has&  nice turbines./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_503", "* You tell Tsunderplane it has&  a powerful rudder./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_504", "* You tell Tsunderplane that&  you like its taste in&  movies and books./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_505", "* You tell Tsunderplane that&  it has cute winglets./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplane_515", "* You get close to Tsunderplane^1.&* But not too close./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_75", "* Hey^1!&* Watch where you stand^1,&  jerk!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_76", "* Th-though^1, I guess if&  there's nowhere else^1, you&  can stand closer.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_79", "* Standing so spicey./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_83", "* A-ah..^1. H-human..^1.&* You're leaving?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_84", "* I have..^1.&* Something to say to you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_85", "* Admittedly^1, I may have had&  limerent feelings for you&  before./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_86", "* However^1, upon examining my&  own actions^1, I now&  realize.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_87", "* I did not love YOU./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_88", "* I was merely infatuated&  with the CONCEPT of love./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_89", "* The idea of romance^1, the&  concept of sharing affection&  with another.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_90", "* Through these desires^1, I&  built a false concept of&  you in my head./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_91", "* Such a relationship would&  not have ended well./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_92", "* In closing^1, I believe it&  is better that I chose to&  say nothing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_93", "* Y..^1. y-you i-idiot./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_96", "* I'm not saying it again./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_103", "* H-hey^1, why do you keep&  following me!!!&* You jerk!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_104", "* Eeeeh^1?&* You're walking in the&  opposite direction...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_105", "* H-hey^1, you think you're too&  good for me^1, huh...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_107", "* N-not spicey enough for you^1,&  h-huh.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_111", "* I..^1. I'm thinking of going&  to the surface.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_112", "* Eeeeeh^1?&* You're going to go there&  too?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_tsunderplanenpc_113", "* Idiot..^1.&* Quit following me!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_umbrellabox_62", "* NO!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_umbrellabox_135", "* (The cavern is too narrow&  for an umbrella.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_154", "\\TP %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_155", "\\M5H..^1. HI^1, UNDYNE!&I'M HERE WITH MY&DAILY REPORT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_156", "UHHH... REGARDING THAT&HUMAN I CALLED YOU&ABOUT EARLIER.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_157", "\\M0I THINK^1, UH...&HOW DO I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_158", "\\M1.\\M6.. HUH^1?&DID I FIGHT THEM?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_159", "\\M4Y-YES^1!&OF COURSE I DID!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_160", "\\M4I FOUGHT THEM&VALIANTLY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_161", "\\M5...WHAT^1?\\M1 &DID I CAPTURE THEM...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_162", "\\M0W-W-WELL.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_163", "\\M1NO./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_164", "\\M1I TRIED VERY HARD^1,&UNDYNE^1, BUT IN THE&END.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_165", "\\M0I FAILED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_166", "\\M6... W-WHAT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_167", "\\M1YOU'RE GOING TO TAKE&THE HUMAN'S SOUL&YOURSELF.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_168", "\\M5BUT UNDYNE^1, YOU DON'T&H-HAVE TO DESTROY&THEM^1! \\M0YOU SEE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_169", "\\M1YOU SEE.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_170", "\\M6..^1.&.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_171", "... I UNDERSTAND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_172", "I'LL HELP YOU IN&ANY WAY I CAN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_173", "\\TS %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_174", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_217", "\\M0.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_218", "\\M1... I UNDERSTAND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_219", "I'LL HELP YOU IN&ANY WAY I CAN./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_537", "* Yo..^1. did you see the&  way she was staring at&  you...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_538", "* That.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_539", "* ... was AWESOME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_540", "* I'm SOOOO jealous!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_541", "* What'd you do to get her&  attention...^1?&* Ha ha./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_542", "* C'mon^1!&* Let's go watch her beat&  up some bad guys!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_546", "* Yo..^1. did you see the&  way she was staring at&  you...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_547", "* That.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_548", "* ... was AWESOME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_549", "* I'm SOOOO jealous!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_550", "* She was just standing there&  waiting FOREVER^1, and&  then you just...!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne1_551", "* C'mon^1!&* Let's go watch her beat&  up some bad guys!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_echoflower_96", "* Behind you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_echoflower_102", "* You aren't gonna tell my&  parents about this^1, are you?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_echoflower_299", "* Undyne!!^1!&* I'll help you fight!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_echoflower_348", "* YO!!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_echoflower_349", "* You did it!!^1!&* Undyne is RIGHT in front&  of you!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_echoflower_350", "* You've got front row seats&  to her fight!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_echoflower_388", "* ... wait./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_echoflower_389", "* Who's she fighting???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_echoflower_419", "* H^1-hey!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_echoflower_420", "* You aren't gonna tell my&  parents about this^1, are you?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_781", "* The wind is howling...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_808", "* UNDYNE THE UNDYING 99ATK 99DEF&* Heroine reformed by her own&  DETERMINATION to save Earth./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_863", "Damn it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_864", "So even THAT&power..^1.&It wasn't enough...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_865", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_866", "\\E1Heh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_867", "Heheheh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_868", "\\E2If you..^1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_869", "If you think I'm&gonna give up hope^1,&you're wrong./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_870", "Cause I've..^1.&Got my friends&behind me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_871", "\\E3Alphys told me that&she would watch me&fight you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_872", "\\E4And if anything went&wrong^1, she would..^1.&evacuate everyone./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_873", "\\E5By now she's called&ASGORE and told him&to absorb the 6&human SOULs./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_881", "And with that&power.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_ex_893", "This world will&live on...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_76", "* Hey^1, punk^1!&* What's up!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_77", "\\E1* A-ACHOO!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_78", "\\E2* Papyrus^1, how can you&  stand this cold?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_80", "I HAVE NO SKIN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_82", "* So why don't we&  stand in Grillby's&  instead?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_84", "BECAUSE I HATE&GREASE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_86", "* But you don't have&  a stomach!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_88", "NO^1, BUT I HAVE&STANDARDS!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_92", "* Papyrus.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_93", "\\E1* Why do you live&  in an icy wasteland?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_95", "THE RENT'S CHEAP./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_97", "* Really^1?&* Don't you live in&  a huge house?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_99", "YEAH^1, BUT MY&BROTHER PAYS&FOR IT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_101", "* Where's your brother&  get the money to&  pay for it...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_103", "OH^1, THAT'S SIMPLE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_104", "\\E0IT'S A MYSTERY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_112", "* So^1? What are you&  waiting for?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_113", "* The sooner you get&  it over with^1, the&  better!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_121", "* Hey^1, you sure&  are carrying a&  lot of things./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_122", "* If someone needed&  to give you a thing^1,&  they sure couldn't!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_127", "* What^1?&* You LOST the letter!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_128", "* What the HECK!^1?&* How!^1? Why!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_129", "\\E7* Ughhh..^1.&* This is unbelievable./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_130", "* I should be really&  disappointed in you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_131", "\\E9* But^1, uh^1, to tell&  you the truth^1, I'm&  kind of relieved!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_132", "\\E1* While you were gone^1,&  I actually wrote&  a WAY BETTER letter!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_133", "\\E6* And this time^1, you&  WON'T lose it!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_134", "\\E2* I guarantee it!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_135", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_136", "* (You got the Undyne Letter&  EX.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_149", "* Hey^1, I have something&  to give you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_150", "\\E2* But you're carrying&  way too much!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_155", "* Um^1, so^1, I have a&  favor to ask you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_156", "\\E0* Uuuuh^1, I..^1.&* I need you to deliver&  this letter./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_157", "\\E9* To Dr. Alphys./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_158", "\\E1* Huh!^1?&* Why don't I do it&  myself...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_159", "\\E8* ... um^1.&* W-well.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_160", "\\E9* I-it's kind of&  personal^1, but we're&  friends..^1. so.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_161", "\\E8* I'll t-tell you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_162", "\\E6* Hotland SUUUUCKS!!^1!&* I don't wanna have&  to go over there!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_163", "\\E3* So here you go./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_164", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_165", "* (You got the Undyne's Letter.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_167", "* Oh^1, and if you&  read it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_168", "\\E2* I'll KILL you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_169", "\\E9* Thanks so much^1!&* You're the best!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_187", "* Hey^1, Alphys^1!&* Alphys!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_188", "\\E1* Do you think we&  can watch something&  with fighting next?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_189", "\\E9* Oh^1, and then...&* Something..^1.&* With princesses!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_190", "\\E2* Or FIGHTING&  princesses!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_192", "\\E5* I-I'll see if I&  can manage to find&  any like that^1, Undyne./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_194", "\\E6* Yayyyyy!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_199", "\\E0* Hey Frisk^1, why don't&  you go say hi to&  Napstablook?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_friendc_200", "\\E1* Oh^1, tell them I&  said hi^1, too!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_lettercall_113", "* Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_lettercall_115", "\\E0* Hey...^1!&* Uh^1, this is&  Undyne.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_lettercall_116", "\\E2* (Shut up^1, Papyrus^1!)&* (This was YOUR idea!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_lettercall_117", "\\E1* HUMAN^1!&* You have to deliver&  something for me!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_lettercall_118", "\\E9* Uh^1, please?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_lettercall_119", "\\E0* I'm at Snowdin&  in front of&  Papyrus's./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_lettercall_120", "\\E6* See ya^1, punk!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_lettercall_121", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyne_lettercall_122", "* Click.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_275", "...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_278", "Show me what&you've got!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_282", "Do your worst!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_286", "What's the&matter, scared?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_290", "\\E6What the hell&is the holdup?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_293", "COME ON ALREADY!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_295", "IT'S GETTING&HOT IN HERE!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_299", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_488", "* Undyne is letting you make&  the first attack.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_520", "* UNDYNE - ATK 41 DEF 21&* This time^1, don't hold&  anything back!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_530", "* You pretend to swing at&  UNDYNE with all your might./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_578", "I've been&defeated..^1.&My house is in&shambles.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_579", "I even failed to&befriend you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_580", "That's it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_581", "\\E8I don't care if&you're my guest&anymore./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_582", "\\E6One final rematch^1!&All out on both&sides!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_583", "IT'S THE ONLY WAY&I CAN REGAIN MY&LOST PRIDE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_584", "NOW COME ON^1!&HIT ME WITH&ALL YOU'VE GOT!&NGAHHHH!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_599", "* Undyne is letting you make&  the first attack.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_645", "What./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_646", "\\E2That's the best&you can manage?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_647", "\\E3Even attacking at&full force.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_648", "You just can't&muster any intent&to hurt me^1,&huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_649", "\\E4.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_650", "\\E7Heh^1, you know&what?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_670", "I don't actually&want to hurt you&either./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_671", "At first^1, I hated&your stupid&saccharine&schtick^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_672", "\\E3The way you hit&me right now^1,&it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_673", "\\E4Reminded me of&someone I used&to train with./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_674", "\\E7Now I know you&aren't just some&wimpy loser./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_678", "\\E9You're a wimpy&loser with a&big heart!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_679", "\\E4Just like him.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_680", "\\E7.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_681", "\\E3Listen^1, human./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_682", "\\E2It seems that you&and ASGORE are&fated to fight./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_683", "\\E3But knowing him.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_684", "\\E4He probably&doesn't want to./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_685", "\\E2Talk to him./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_686", "\\E1I'm sure you can&persuade him to&let you go home./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_687", "\\E3Eventually^1, some&mean human will&fall down here.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_688", "\\E3And I'll take&THEIR soul instead./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_689", "\\E1That makes sense^1,&right^1?&Fuhuhu./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_690", "\\E2Oh^1, and if you&DO hurt ASGORE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_691", "\\E7I'll take the&human souls..^1.&Cross the barrier.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_692", "\\E6And beat the&hell out of you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_693", "\\E9That's what friends&are for^1, right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_694", "\\E9Fuhuhu!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynebattle2_695", "\\E9Now let's get the&hell out of this&flaming house!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_401", "Ngahhh!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_402", "Bring&it on!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_403", "C'mon!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_404", "Fuhuhu!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_405", "Ngahh!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_406", "Urahhh!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_410", "\\E1  You're strong...&  But not strong&  enough!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_411", "\\E4  You're a pain in&  the neck, huh?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_412", "\\E5  DIE ALREADY, YOU&  LITTLE BRAT!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_416", "%%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_427", "  \\XAs long as you're&  \\GGREEN\\X you \\RCAN'T&  ESCAPE\\X!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_428", "  \\XUnless you learn&  to \\Rface danger&  head-on\\X.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_429", "  You won't last&  a SECOND against&  ME!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_437", "  You^1?&  Sparing ME^1?&  Fuhuhuhu!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_438", "  How insulting^1!&  I'd NEVER&  surrender to the&  likes of you!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_439", "  Not bad^1!&  Then how about&  THIS!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_442", "\\E0  I wanted this to&  be a fair fight./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_443", "\\E1  I thought if I&  beat you like&  this.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_444", "  It'd truly show&  how strong&  monsters can be./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_445", "\\E4  BUT NOW???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_446", "\\E5  I DON'T CARE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_447", "  I'M NOT YOUR&  FREAKING&  KINDERGARTEN&  TEACHER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_448", "\\E1  Unless your&  kindergarten&  teacher.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_449", "\\E5  DOES THIS!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_459", "\\E5  WHAT ARE YOU&  DOING?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_460", "  JUST FACE&  UPWARDS!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_461", "  IT'S NOT HARD!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_462", "\\E0 %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_470", "\\E4  Look./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_471", "\\E4  I gave you a&  spear to block&  the bullets with./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_472", "\\E4  Do I have to&  explain this&  any more&  clearly?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_473", "\\E0 %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_481", "\\E1  \\XWhen I said&  \\Rface towards&  danger\\X.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_482", "\\E4  I meant face&  towards the&  bullets!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_483", "\\E0 %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_496", "  For years,&  we've dreamed&  of a happy&  ending...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_501", "  And now,&  sunlight is&  just within&  our reach!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_506", "  I won't let&  you snatch it&  away from&  us!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_510", "\\E1  NGAHHH!&  Enough warming&  up!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_515", "  Heh...&  You're tough!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_519", "  Mercy^1!&  Ha!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_520", "  I still can't&  believe YOU&  want to spare&  ME!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_528", "  But even if&  you could&  beat me...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_530", "  But even if&  I spared&  YOU...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_538", "\\X  No human has&  EVER made it&  past&  \\RASGORE\\X!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_546", "  Honestly^1,&  killing you&  now is an act&  of mercy...!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_554", "  ...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_563", "  Honestly, I'm&  doing you&  a favor...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_570", "\\X  No human has&  EVER made it&  past&  \\RASGORE\\X!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_577", "\\E1  Killing you&  now is an act&  of mercy!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_582", "\\E4  So STOP being&  so damn&  resilient!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_587", "  What the&  hell are&  humans made&  out of!?");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_593", "  Anyone else&  would be DEAD&  by now!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_599", "  Alphys told me&  humans were&  determined...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_605", "  I see now what&  she meant by&  that!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_611", "  But I'm&  determined,&  too!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_616", "  Determined to&  end this&  RIGHT NOW!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_622", "  ... RIGHT NOW!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_628", "  ... RIGHT...&  ...&  ... NOW!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_634", "  Ha...&  Ha...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_639", "\\E5  NGAHHH!!!&  DIE ALREADY, YOU&  LITTLE BRAT!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_656", "  YOU'RE GETTING&  IN MY WAY!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_658", "  I WILL NEVER&  TAKE MERCY FROM&  THE LIKES OF YOU!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_664", "  I WILL NOT&  BE DEFEATED!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_666", "  YOU! WILL!&  NEVER! SPARE! ME!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_672", "\\X  YOU'LL NEVER \\RESCAPE\\X&  FROM ME!!!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_682", "  Come on^1, is that&  all you've got!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_686", "  ... pathetic./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_687", "  You're going to&  have to try&  harder than that!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_691", "  S-see how strong&  we are when we&  believe in&  ourselves?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_695", "  H... heh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_696", "  Had enough yet?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_700", "\\E7  .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_701", "  ... I won't..^1.&  ... give up.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_705", "\\E7.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1085", "* The wind is howling...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1086", "* Undyne flips her spear&  impatiently.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1087", "* Flower pollen drifts in&  front of you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1088", "* Water rushes around you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1089", "* The spears pause for a&  moment.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1094", "* Undyne points heroically&  towards the sky.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1095", "* Undyne flips her spear&  impatiently.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1096", "* Undyne suplexes a huge&  boulder^1, just because&  she can.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1097", "* Undyne bounces impatiently.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1098", "* Undyne flashes a menacing&  smile.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1099", "* Undyne draws her finger&  across her neck.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1100", "* Undyne holds her fist in&  front of her and shakes&  her head.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1101", "* Undyne towers threateningly.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1102", "* Undyne thinks of her friends&  and pounds the ground&  with her fists.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1103", "* Smells like sushi.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1107", "* Undyne's eye is twitching&  involuntarily.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1108", "* Undyne is smashing spears&  on the ground.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1109", "* Undyne's eyes dart around&  to see if this is&  a prank.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1110", "* Undyne is hyperventilating.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1111", "* Smells like angry fish.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1118", "* Undyne is smiling as if&  nothing is wrong.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1119", "* Undyne's body is wavering.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1120", "* Undyne's body is losing&  its shape.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1121", "* Undyne's body...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1122", "* ...");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1145", "* UNDYNE - ATK 50 DEF 20&* The heroine that NEVER gives&  up./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1168", "* You tell UNDYNE her attacks&  are too easy^1.&* She doesn't care./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1174", "* You tell UNDYNE her attacks&  are too easy^1.&* The bullets get faster./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1176", "* You tell UNDYNE her attacks&  are too easy^1.&* The bullets get unfair./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1182", "* Didn't work./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1195", "* Hamburger Helpers./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1205", "* You told Undyne you didn't&  want to fight^1.&* But nothing happened./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1209", "* You told Undyne you just&  want to be friends.&* She remembers someone.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1210", "* Her attacks became a little&  less extreme./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1215", "* Didn't work./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1278", "En guarde!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1281", "\\E1  You won't get&  away from me&  this time!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1286", "\\E4  You've escaped&  from me for&  the LAST time!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1292", "\\E5  STOP RUNNING&  AWAY!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1298", "\\E5  COME BACK HERE^1,&  YOU LITTLE&  PUNK!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1310", "* Undyne attacks!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1336", "Ngahhh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1337", "You were stronger...&Than I thought.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1338", "So then..^1.&... this is where..^1.&... it ends.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1339", ".../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1365", "  No.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1386", "NO!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1387", "I won't die!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1388", "Alphys..^1.&Asgore..^1.&Papyrus.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1389", "Everyone is counting&on me to protect&them!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1390", "NNNNGAH!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1401", "Human!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1402", "In the name of&everybody's hopes&and dreams.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1403", "I WILL DEFEAT YOU!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1410", "* Undyne looks determined.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1424", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1425", "Ha..^1. ha.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1426", "... Alphys.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1427", "This is what I&  was afraid of.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1428", "This is why I&  never told you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1429", ".../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1438", "No..^1.&No!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1439", "Not yet!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1440", "I won't die!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1449", "NGAHHHHHHHH!!^2! %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1460", " I WON'T DIE^3! %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1470", " I WON'T DIE^3! %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1480", " I WON'T DIE^3! %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneboss_1490", " I^2 WON'T^2 %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_114", "* Well^1, that was&  fun^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_115", "\\E6* We'll have to hang&  out again another&  time...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_116", "\\E9* But^1, uh^1, somewhere&  else I guess./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_117", "\\E0* In the meantime^1,&  I guess I'll go&  hang with Papyrus./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_118", "* So if you need&  me^1, drop by Snowdin^1,&  OK!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_119", "\\E1* OH^1!&* And if you ever&  need help.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_120", "\\E9* Just give Papyrus a&  ring^1, ok?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_121", "\\E0* Since we're in the&  same spot^1, I'll be&  able to talk too!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_122", "\\E6* Well^1, see ya&  later^1, punk!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_140", "* Well^1, that was&  fun^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_141", "\\E6* We'll have to hang&  out again another&  time...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_142", "\\E9* But^1, uh^1, somewhere&  else I guess./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_143", "\\E0* In the meantime^1,&  I guess I'll go&  hang with Papyrus./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_144", "* So if you need&  me^1, drop by Snowdin^1,&  OK!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_145", "\\E1* OH^1!&* And if you ever&  need help.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_146", "\\E9* Just give Papyrus a&  ring^1, ok?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_147", "\\E0* Since we're in the&  same spot^1, I'll be&  able to talk too!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_148", "\\E6* Well^1, see ya&  later^1, punk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_149", "\\E1* OH!!^1!&* WAIT!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_150", "\\E0* This is sudden^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_151", "\\E9* Can you deliver&  something for me?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_152", "\\E0* Papyrus suggested&  that I ask you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_153", "\\E3* But he told me when&  I still hated you^1,&  so.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_154", "\\E1* Uh^1! Anyway!!^1!&* Here^1! Just take it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_155", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_156", "* (You got the Undyne's&  Letter.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_158", "* Well^1, what are you&  waiting for!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_159", "\\E1* Go deliver it!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_160", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_161", "\\E9* Uhhhh..^1.&* Oh^1, yeah.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_162", "* It's addressed to&  Dr. Alphys./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_163", "\\E6* OK^1, see you!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_169", "* Well^1, that was&  fun^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_170", "\\E6* We'll have to hang&  out again another&  time...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_171", "\\E9* But^1, uh^1, somewhere&  else I guess./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_172", "\\E0* In the meantime^1,&  I guess I'll go&  hang with Papyrus./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_173", "* So if you need&  me^1, drop by Snowdin^1,&  OK!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_174", "\\E1* OH^1!&* And if you ever&  need help.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_175", "\\E9* Just give Papyrus a&  ring^1, ok?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_176", "\\E0* Since we're in the&  same spot^1, I'll be&  able to talk too!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_177", "\\E6* Well^1, see ya&  later^1, punk.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_178", "\\E1* OH!!^1!&* WAIT!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_179", "\\E0* This is sudden^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_180", "* Can you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_181", "\\E1* Hey^1, wait^1!&* Your inventory's&  full./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_182", "\\E9* Uh^1, well^1, I'll be&  at Papyrus's./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_afterward_183", "\\E6* Come see me when&  you have less&  stuff!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_120", "HERE^1, UNDYNE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_121", "MY FRIEND BROUGHT&A GIFT FOR YOU^1,&ON THEIR OWN!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_143", "* Uhhh..^1. thanks./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_177", "* I'll^1, uh^1, put it&  with the others./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_236", "* So are we ready&  to start?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_250", "WHOOPSY DOOPSY^1!&I JUST REMEMBERED!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_251", "I HAVE TO GO&TO THE BATHROOM!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_252", "\\E0YOU TWO HAVE&FUN!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_335", "DANG^1!&WHAT A SHAME.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_336", "\\E2I THOUGHT UNDYNE&COULD BE FRIENDS&WITH YOU./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_337", "\\E3BUT I GUESS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_338", "\\E3I OVERESTIMATED&HER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_339", "\\E3SHE'S JUST NOT&UP TO THE&CHALLENGE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_351", "* CHALLENGE!^1?&* What!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_352", "\\E0* Papyrus^1!&* Wait a second...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_367", "* Darnit!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_368", "* He thinks I can't&  be friends with&  YOU!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_369", "\\E6* Fuhuhu^1!&* What a joke!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_370", "* I could make friends&  with a wimpy loser&  like you any day!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_371", "\\E2* I'll show him!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_372", "\\E3* Listen up^1, human./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_373", "\\E2* We're not just&  going to be&  friends./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_374", "\\E3* We're going to&  be.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_375", "\\M1* BESTIES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_376", "* I'll make you&  like me so much.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_377", "\\E1* You won't be able&  to think of anyone&  else!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_378", "\\E3* Fuhuhuhu^1!&* It's the PERFECT&  REVENGE!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_379", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_380", "\\E9* Why don't you&  have a seat?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_415", "* Oh^1, leaving so soon?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_416", "\\E3* No^1.&* No you're not./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_471", "* Comfortable?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_472", "* I'll get you&  something to drink./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_561", "* All set^1!&* What would you like?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_604", "* HEY!!^1!&* DON'T GET UP!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_605", "* YOU'RE THE GUEST!^1!&* SIT DOWN AND ENJOY&  YOURSELF!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_606", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_614", "\\E9* Um^1, why not just&  point to what you&  want?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_615", "* You can use the&  spear!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_643", "\\E4* Y'know^1, I was a&  pretty hotheaded&  kid./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_644", "* Once^1, to prove I was&  the strongest^1, I tried&  to fight ASGORE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_645", "\\E1* Emphasis on TRIED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_646", "\\E0* I couldn't land&  a single blow&  on him!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_647", "\\E4* And worse^1, the whole&  time^1, he refused&  to fight back!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_648", "\\E7* I was so&  humiliated.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_649", "\\E0* Afterwards^1, he&  apologized and said&  something goofy.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_650", "* \"Excuse me^1, do you&  want to know how&  to beat me?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_651", "\\E0* I said yes^1, and&  from then on^1, he&  trained me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_652", "\\E4* One day^1, during&  practice^1, I finally&  knocked him down./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_653", "\\E7* I felt..^1. bad./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_654", "\\E9* But he was&  beaming.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_655", "\\E6* I had never seen&  someone more proud to&  get their butt kicked./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_656", "\\E1* ... oh!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_657", "\\E9* I almost forgot&  about your tea!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_658", "* Just a moment!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_696", "* Wait a second./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_697", "* Papyrus..^1.&* His cooking lesson.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_698", "\\M2* HE WAS SUPPOSED&  TO HAVE THAT RIGHT&  NOW!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_699", "\\E3* And if HE's not&  here to have it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_700", "\\E2* YOU'LL HAVE TO&  HAVE IT FOR HIM!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_833", "* That's right!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_834", "\\E1* NOTHING has brought&  Papyrus and I&  closer than cooking!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_835", "\\E3* Which means that if&  I give you his&  lesson.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_836", "\\E2* WE'LL BECOME CLOSER&  THAN YOU CAN&  EVER IMAGINE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_837", "\\E6* Fuhuhu!!^1! Afraid!^1?&* We're gonna be best&  friends!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1000", "* Ready!^1?&* It's spaghetti time!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1001", "* Let's start with the&  sauce!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1128", "* Uhh^1, we'll just scrape&  this into a bowl&  later./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1129", "\\E1* But for NOW!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1235", "* Alright^1!&* Now it's time&  to stir the pasta!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1236", "* As a general rule&  of thumb^1, the more&  you stir.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1237", "\\E1* THE BETTER IT IS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1238", "\\E0* Ready^1?&* Let's do it!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1326", "\\M0* Fuhuhuhu^1!&* That's the stuff!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1328", "\\E0* Alright^1, now for&  the final step:/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1329", "\\E1* TURN UP THE HEAT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1330", "\\E0* Let the stovetop&  symbolize your&  passion!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1331", "\\E1* Let your hopes and&  dreams turn into&  burning fire!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1332", "\\E2* READY^1?&* Don't hold anything&  back!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1444", "* Ah./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1445", "* Man^1, no wonder&  Papyrus sucks at&  cooking./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1465", "* So what's next^1?&* Scrapbooking^1?&* Friendship bracelets?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1466", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1475", "* ... oh^1, who am I&  kidding./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1476", "* I really screwed this&  up^1, didn't I?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1477", "\\E4* I can't force you to&  like me^1, human./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1478", "\\E4* Some people just&  don't get along&  with each other./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1479", "\\E7* I understand if&  you feel that&  way about me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1480", "\\E4* And if we can't&  be friends.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1481", "\\E7* That's okay./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1482", "\\E7* Because..^1.&* If we're not&  friends.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1490", "\\E2*\\M2 IT MEANS I CAN&  DESTROY YOU WITHOUT&  REGRET!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1641", "* It'll take a moment&  for the water to&  boil./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1671", "* Okay^1, it's all&  done!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1771", "* Here we are./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1833", "* Careful^1, it's hot./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1850", "* It's not THAT hot!^1!&* Just drink it already!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1851", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1852", "* (You take a sip of the&  tea.^1)&* (It's burning...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1853", "* (But other than that^1,&  it's pretty good.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1855", "* It's pretty good^1,&  right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1856", "\\E6* Nothing but the best&  for my ABSOLUTELY&  PRECIOUS FRIEND!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1873", "\\E9* Hey.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1874", "\\E9* You know...&* It's kind of strange&  you chose THAT tea./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1875", "\\E4* Golden flower tea.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1876", "\\E0* That's ASGORE's&  favorite kind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1877", "\\E4* Actually^1, now that&  I think about it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1878", "\\E9* You kind of remind&  me of him./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1879", "\\E6* You're both TOTAL&  weenies!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1880", "\\E7* ... sort of./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1898", "\\E4* Y'know^1, I was a&  pretty hotheaded&  kid./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1899", "* Once^1, to prove I was&  the strongest^1, I tried&  to fight ASGORE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1900", "\\E1* Emphasis on TRIED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1901", "\\E0* I couldn't land&  a single blow&  on him!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1902", "\\E4* And worse^1, the whole&  time^1, he refused&  to fight back!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1903", "\\E7* I was so&  humiliated.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1904", "\\E0* Afterwards^1, he&  apologized and said&  something goofy.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1905", "* \"Excuse me^1, do you&  want to know how&  to beat me?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1906", "\\E0* I said yes^1, and&  from then on^1, he&  trained me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1907", "\\E4* One day^1, during&  practice^1, I finally&  knocked him down./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1908", "\\E7* I felt..^1. bad./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1909", "\\E9* But he was&  beaming.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1910", "\\E6* I had never seen&  someone more proud to&  get their butt kicked./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1911", "\\E4* Anyway^1, long story&  short^1, he kept training&  me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1912", "\\E0* And now I'm the&  head of the Royal&  Guard!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1913", "\\E6* So I'm the one&  who gets to train&  dorks to fight!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1914", "\\E9* ... like^1, uh^1, Papyrus./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1935", "\\E4* But^1, um^1, to be&  honest.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1936", "\\E9*... I don't know if.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1937", "\\E7* I can ever let&  Papyrus into the&  Royal Guard./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1938", "\\E1* Don't tell him I&  said that!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1939", "\\E4* He's just..^1.&* Well.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1940", "\\E9* I mean^1, it's not&  that he's weak./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1941", "\\E1* He's actually&  pretty freaking&  tough!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1942", "\\E7* It's just that..^1.&* He's.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1943", "\\E1* He's too innocent&  and nice!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1944", "\\E7* I mean^1, look^1, he&  was SUPPOSED to&  capture you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1945", "\\E5* And he ended up&  being FRIENDS with&  you instead!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1946", "\\E1* I could NEVER send&  him into battle!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1947", "\\E7* He'd get ripped&  into little smiling&  shreds./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1948", "\\E7* That's part of why.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1949", "\\E9* I started teaching&  him how to cook^1,&  you know?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1950", "\\E7* So^1, um^1, maybe he&  can do something&  else with his life./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1978", "\\E1* Oh^1, sorry^1, I was&  talking for so&  long.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1979", "\\E9* You're out of tea^1,&  aren't you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_inside_1980", "\\E0* I'll get you some&  more./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_155", "PSST./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_156", "\\E0MAKE SURE TO&GIVE HER THIS!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_173", "SHE LOVES THESE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_241", "* Hi^1, Papyrus!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_243", "* Ready for your extra-&  private^1, one-on-one&  training?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_245", "YOU BET I AM!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_246", "AND I BROUGHT&A FRIEND!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_276", "* Hi^1, I don't think&  we've.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_277", "\\E2* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_278", "\\M9* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_280", "\\M0.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_282", "\\E1* Why don't^1.&* You two^1.&* Come in?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_364", "* (You hear someone shouting&  a whisper at you from&  inside the house.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynedate_outside_366", "NO^1!&YOU CAN'T ESCAPE&FRIENDSHIP!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_329", "* Yo..^1. did you see that!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_330", "* Undyne just.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_331", "* ... TOUCHED ME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_332", "* I'm never washing my face&  ever again...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_333", "* Man^1, are you unlucky./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_334", "* If you were standing just&  a LITTLE bit to the left...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_335", "* Yo^1, don't worry^1!&* I'm sure we'll see her&  again!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_338", "* ... yo^1, did you notice^1?&* She seemed really mad&  about something!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_339", "* She looked liked she was&  gonna blast me to pieces!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_340", "* But..^1. sigh..^1.&* Then she decided to put&  me down.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter2_341", "* Yo^1!&* There's always next time^1,&  right^1? Let's go!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter4_255", "It sounds like it&came from over&here.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter4_256", "Oh^1! You've fallen&down^1, haven't you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter4_257", "Are you okay?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter4_258", "Here^1, get up.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter4_259", ".../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter4_260", "\\[C]^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter4_261", "That's a nice name./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undyneencounter4_275", " My name is     %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynefall_99", "* (Someone has meticulously&  cleaned all the slime off of&  this snail.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_69", "* (The trashcan is full&  of broken spears.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_72", "* (The trashcan is empty.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_76", "* (You found a trashcan.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_77", "* (Inside the trashcan&  was a key^1, barely visible&  to the naked eye...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_78", "* (You take it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_87", "* (A garbage can.^1)&* (But it's pretty cute.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_88", "* (It's too dark to see&  near the walls.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_91", "* (There's a message crumpled&  up in the trash can.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_92", "* (It's in a strange kind&  of handwriting.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_93", "* (It says...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrash_94", "* (I KNOW WHAT YOU DID.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_157", "* Seven./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_158", "\\W* Seven human souls^1, and&  \\RKing ASGORE\\W will become&  a god./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_159", "* Six./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_160", "* That's how many we have&  collected thus far./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_161", "* Understand?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_162", "* Through your seventh and&  final soul^1, this world will&  be transformed./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_163", "* First^1, however^1, as is customary&  for those who make it this&  far.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_164", "* I shall tell you the tragic&  tale of our people./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_165", "* It all started^1, long ago.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_190", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_191", "* No^1, you know what?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_199", "* SCREW IT^3! %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_206", "* WHY SHOULD I TELL THAT STORY^1  %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_213", "* WHEN YOU'RE ABOUT TO DIE!?^1!   %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_220", "* NGAAAAAHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH^1! %%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_325", "* YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_326", "* You're standing in&  the way of everybody's&  hopes and dreams!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_327", "\\E4* Alphys's history books&  made me think&  humans were cool.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_328", "\\E0* ... with their giant&  robots and flowery&  swordswomen./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_329", "\\E1* BUT YOU?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_330", "\\E2* You're just a coward!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_331", "\\E3* Hiding behind that kid&  so you could run away&  from me again!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_332", "* You abandoned your&  friend just so you&  could run away!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_335", "\\E2* And let's not forget&  your wimpy goody-two-&  shoes-schtick!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_336", "\\E6* Oooh^1! I'm making such a&  difference by hugging&  random strangers!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_337", "*\\E3 You know what would&  be more valuable&  to everyone?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_338", "*\\E1 IF YOU WERE DEAD!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_339", "\\E0* That's right^1, human^1!&* Your continued&  existence is a crime!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_340", "* Your life is all&  that stands between&  us and our freedom!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_341", "* Right now^1, I can&  feel everyone's hearts&  pounding together!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_342", "\\E0* Everyone's been&  waiting their whole&  lives for this moment!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_343", "\\E0* But we're not&  nervous at all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_344", "\\E1* When everyone puts&  their hearts together^1,&  they can't lose!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_345", "\\E5* Now^1, human^1!&* Let's end this^1,&  right here^1, right now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_346", "\\E0* I'll show you how&  determined monsters&  can be!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_347", "\\E0* Step forward when&  you're ready^1!&* Fuhuhuhu!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_351", "\\E1* And^1! And!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_352", "\\E7*... and something's&  been bothering me^1,&  too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_353", "\\E4* The whole time I was&  chasing after you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_354", "\\E7* I felt something..^1.&* Strange./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_355", "* The echoes of something&  warm^1, something.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_356", "\\E9* Something like \"I miss&  being friends with you.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_357", "\\E2* BUT THAT'S RIDICULOUS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_358", "\\E6I WOULD NEVER GET&  CHUMMY WITH A COWARD&  LIKE YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_359", "\\E1* You^1!&* You must have been&  mind-controlling me!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_360", "\\E6* Manipulating people to&  make them like you..^1.&* What a Grade-A FREAK!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_361", "\\E1* Now enough^1!&* For everyone's hopes^1!&* For everyone's dreams!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_362", "\\E2* And for my own&  freaking dignity!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_363", "\\E3* I^1, UNDYNE^1, will&  knock you down!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_369", "* YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_370", "* You're standing in&  the way of everybody's&  hopes and dreams!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_371", "\\E4* Alphys's history books&  made me think humans&  were compassionate.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_372", "\\E1* BUT YOU?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_373", "\\E5* You're just a&  remorseless criminal!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_374", "* You wander through the&  caverns^1, attacking&  anyone in your path./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_375", "\\E4* Self-defense^1?&* Please./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_376", "* You didn't kill them&  because you had to./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_377", "\\E5* You killed them&  because it was&  easy for you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_378", "* Because it was fun&  for you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_379", "\\E4* Do you think it&  was fun when I&  found out...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_381", "* Do you think it's&  fun when people's&  family members.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_382", "* ... never come home^1?&* Is that fun?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_386", "* Shyren^1, who was&  just learning to&  sing.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_387", "* ... was dead^1, because&  of the whims of&  a single human?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_392", "* A teenage comedian&  who fell in with&  the wrong crowd.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_393", "* ... was dead^1, because&  of the whims of&  a single human?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_399", "* Doggo^1, who always&  made me laugh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_400", "* ... was dead^1, because&  of the whims of&  a single human?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_405", "* Those two sweet dogs^1,&  who always took care&  of each other.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_406", "* ... were dead^1, because&  of the whims of&  a single human?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_412", "* That big dog^1, who&  wanted nothing more&  than to play.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_413", "* ... was dead^1, because&  of the whims of&  a single human?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_419", "* Lesser Dog^1, who&  wanted nothing more&  than affection.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_420", "* ... was dead^1, because&  of the whims of&  a single human?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_425", "* The Snowdin Canine&  Unit had been&  completely decimated./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_426", "* My troops and friends^1,&  destroyed..^1.&* Is that fun?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_429", "\\E5* No./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_430", "\\E3* But your time's up^1,&  villain!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_431", "\\E0* You won't hurt anyone&  else./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_432", "* A knight in shining&  armor has appeared./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_433", "\\E4* And all the pain&  you inflicted on&  the fallen.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_434", "* Every hope^1, every&  dream you've turned&  to dust.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_435", "\\E0* She's gonna send&  right back through&  her spear!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_436", "\\E1* NGAHHH!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_437", "\\E0* I'll show you how&  determined monsters&  truly are!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_438", "* Come on^1!&* Step forward and&  let's end this!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_468", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_469", "* Forget it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_undynetrigger_boss_490", "* Look./");
