  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_507", "* Woshua is looking for some&  good clean fun.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_508", "* Smells like detergent.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_510", "* Woshua is revolted at its own&  wounds.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_526", "* WOSHUA - ATK 18 DEF 5&* This humble germophobe seeks&  to cleanse the whole world./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_535", "* You reach out^1.&* Woshua recoils from your&  touch./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_536", "* Woshua is terrified of&  your slimy body!&* It runs away./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_537", "* You give Woshua a friendly&  pat./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_546", "* You ask Woshua to clean you^1.&* It hops around excitedly./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_547", "* Woshua continues cleaning./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_558", "* You tell a joke about two&  kids who played in a&  muddy flower garden./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_559", "* You tell a joke about a kid&  who ate a pie with&  their bare hands./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_560", "* You tell a joke about a kid&  who slept in the soil./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshua_561", "* Woshua's powers neutralized!/^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshuanpc_72", "* Everything's so dirty..^1.&* If I could erase everything^1,&  I would./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshuanpc_73", "* Ohhhh^1.&* Don't get the wrong idea^1.&* I don't want anyone to die./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshuanpc_74", "* People turn to dust when&  they die^1, and that's hard&  to clean up.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshuanpc_77", "* Don't turn to dust./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshuanpc_81", "* The surface intimidates me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshuanpc_82", "* The entire outer layer of the&  Earth is made of dirt./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshuanpc_88", "* I clean off all of the&  trash and arrange it into&  symmetrical piles./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshuanpc_89", "* It's hard work^1, but somebody&  has to do it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_woshuanpc_93", "* Don't drag your dirty feet&  in here^1.&* I just cleaned this trash!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_wrongnumbersong_96", "* (Ring... ring...)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_wrongnumbersong_97", "* Hello^1!&* Can I speak to G.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_wrongnumbersong_98", "* ...&* Wait a second./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_wrongnumbersong_99", "* Is this the wrong number?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_wrongnumbersong_107", "* Oh it's the wrong number^1!&* The wrong number song!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_wrongnumbersong_108", "* We're very very sorry that&  we got it wrong!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_wrongnumbersong_109", "* Oh it's the wrong number^1!&* The wrong number song!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_wrongnumbersong_110", "* We're very very sorry that&  we got it wrong!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_wrongnumbersong_118", "* (Click...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_xmastree_60", "* (It's a carefully decorated&  tree.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_xmastree_61", "* (Some of the presents are&  addressed from \"Santa\" to&  various locals.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_xmastree_65", "* (Nothing for you.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_battlegroup_116", "* You tripped into a&  line of Moldsmals.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_battlegroup_133", "* A pair of Froggits hop&  towards you.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_battlegroup_148", "* Moldsmal and Moldsmal&  block the way.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_battlegroup_163", "* Migosp crawled up close!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_battlegroup_207", "* Vegetoid and Loox attacked!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_battlegroup_342", "* Doggo blocks the way!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_battlegroup_445", "* Chilldrake saunters up!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_battlegroup_450", "* Snowdrake flutters forth!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_battlegroup_465", "* Chilldrakes flutter forth!");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_itemdesc_2", "* If you are reading this,&  I messed up somehow./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_7", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_8", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_17", "HMMMM..^1.&THE STRANGE DOOR&IN THE WOODS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_18", "\\E0ACTUALLY^1,&MY BROTHER SPENDS&A LOT OF TIME HERE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_19", "\\E3WHAT'S HE DOING...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_20", "\\E1I'VE GOT TO KEEP&HIM ON THE STRAIGHT&AND NARROW!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_24", "ARE YOU STILL&AROUND THAT DOOR?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_25", "\\E1OH NO!!^1!&MY BROTHER'S A&BAD INFLUENCE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_31", "THIS IS WHERE MY&BROTHER IS SUPPOSED&TO PATROL.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_32", "\\E3BUT^1, EVERY TIME I&SHOW UP^1, HE'S&SLACKING OFF./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_33", "\\E0IT'S A GOOD THING&I SPOTTED YOU&FIRST!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_34", "\\E3I'M SURE HE WOULD&HAVE MADE A WEIRD&FIRST IMPRESSION./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_39", "IF HE'S NOT AROUND^1,&HE WON'T COME&BACK.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_40", "\\E3THAT'S JUST THE&WAY HE FUNCTIONS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_46", "WHAT??^1?&ARE YOU LOST???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_47", "\\E0HMMM..^1. YOU SHOULD&TRY CALLING&SOMEONE FOR HELP!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_52", "HUH??^1?&WHY ARE YOU&CALLING ME??/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_58", "IT'S TOO COLD&TO SWIM IN THE&RIVER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_59", "UNLESS YOU HAVE A&WATERPROOF&SWEATER!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_65", "IT'S JUST A&RIVER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_71", "NYEH HEH HEH!^1!&IMPRESSED!?!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_72", "NOT ONLY AM I&GREAT AT PUZZLES.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_73", "BUT I'M ALSO&AN ESTEEMED&ARCHITECT!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_79", "MY BROTHER HELPED&ME FIND THE BOX!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_85", "THE STATION OF&DOGGO./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_86", "HE HAS THE AMAZING&POWER TO SEE THINGS&WHEN THEY MOVE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_87", "\\E3OKAY^1, MAYBE IT'S&NOT AN AMAZING&POWER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_93", "DOGGO'S NOT HOME./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_100", "CAREFUL!^1!&THE ICE IS&SLPPERY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_101", "\\E0BUT IF YOU SLIDE&ON THE ICE^1, NO ONE&WILL ATTACK YOU./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_102", "\\E3NO ONE WANTS TO&PRATFALL DURING A&COOL TECHNIQUE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_108", "I'M COLD OUT OF&THINGS TO SAY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_114", "IT MUST BE TOUGH&BEING A SNOWMAN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_115", "\\E2TRY TO BE NICE&TO PEOPLE MADE OF&STRANGE MATERIALS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_121", "IS THAT SNOWMAN&STILL THERE?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_127", "OH HO^1!&THE ELECTRIC MAZE^1!&THAT SURE WAS FUN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_128", "\\E3EXCEPT FOR WHEN&I GOT SHOCKED./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_133", "OH HO^1!&THE ELECTRIC MAZE^1!&A GREAT PUZZLE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_134", "\\E3EXCEPT FOR THE&PART WHERE WE&DIDN'T EVEN DO IT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_135", "\\E0MINUS THAT ONE&TINY FLAW^1, IT'S AN&EASY 10 OUT OF 10!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_141", "DISAPPOINTING^1, BUT&I TURNED OFF THE&ELECTRICITY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_149", "THE FAMOUS SNOWDIN&SNOWBALL GAME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_150", "FASTER COMPLETION&GIVES DIFFERENT&PRIZES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_151", "\\E3WHERE DOES THE&MONEY COME FROM?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_152", "\\E0THE SNOWBALL TAX^1,&OF COURSE!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_157", "WHAT^1?&YOU'VE NEVER HEARD&OF A SNOWBALL TAX?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_158", "\\E2THE SURFACE WORLD&MUST BE PARADISE.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_166", "THE STATION OF THE&MARRIED DOGS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_167", "\\E3HMMM^1. DO YOU EVER&THINK ABOUT DOING&THAT SOMEDAY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_168", "\\E0MARRYING A DOG?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_173", "NAH..^1.&THAT'S WEIRD./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_174", "\\E0THERE ARE WAY&BETTER ANIMALS TO&MARRY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_175", "LIKE SKELETONS!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_182", "HMM... CROSSWORD^1.&I GUESS IT'S AN&APT NAME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_183", "\\E4THOSE WORDS MAKE&ME CROSS!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_188", "ARE YOU STILL&LOOKING AT THAT&WORD SEARCH?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_195", "AH^1, THE SPAGHETTI&TRAP ROOM.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_196", "ERROR????/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_199", "\\E3I STILL HAVE TO&GO VISIT IT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_200", "\\E2THE SPAGHETTI YOU&LEFT ME IS STILL&THERE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_204", "\\E3WELL^1, I GUESS IT'S&NOT MUCH OF A&TRAP ANYMORE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_205", "\\E0SINCE YOU ATE THE&WHOLE THING^1,&RIGHT!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_211", "NOTHING LIKE A&HOT BUCKET OF&SPAGH.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_218", "THIS ROOM IS&NORMALLY BLOCKED&BY THOSE SPIKES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_219", "\\E3BUT WE'RE THINKING&OF GETTING RID&OF THEM.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_220", "\\E0THE KING RELEASED&A MANDATE ON&PUZZLES RECENTLY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_221", "\\E3HE THINKS SPIKES&ARE INEFFECTIVE AND&HAZARDOUS TO KIDS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_222", "\\E4BUT I THINK HE'S&WRONG!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_223", "\\E0KIDS LOVE DEADLY&SPIKES!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_228", "IF YOU KNOW ANY&KIDS^1, YOU SHOULD&ASK THEM!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_234", "HMMM..^1.&THE SOLUTION TO&THIS ONE...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_235", "\\E5I ACTUALLY JUST&STEPPED OVER THE&SPIKES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_236", "\\E0SO THE SOLUTION&IS TO BE VERY&TALL AND HANDSOME./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_241", "I'M SOLVING IT&AS WE SPEAK.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_248", "OH-HO!!^1! &THIS PUZZLE^1!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_249", "YOU FIGURED IT OUT&SO EASILY!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_250", "\\E2THAT WAS VERY&PAPYRUS OF YOU./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_255", "TALKING ON THE&PHONE..^1. HOW&PAPYRUS OF YOU./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_262", "OH-HO!!^1!&THE PUZZLE THAT&DR. ALPHYS MADE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_263", "I HAD TO ASK&UNDYNE TO ASK&HER TO MAKE ONE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_264", "\\E3I ONLY FOLLOW&HER ONLINE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_265", "\\E3I'M NOT REALLY&FRIENDS WITH HER.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_266", "\\E0YET!!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_271", "SOMEDAY I'LL&IMPRESS HER WITH&MY HUGE BICEPS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_272", "\\E0THAT'S A GOOD&WAY TO MAKE&FRIENDS!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_278", "THE STATION OF&LESSERDOG./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_279", "THIS DOG LOVES&TO BE PET./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_280", "THAT'S ITS DEFINING&PERSONALITY&TRAIT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_281", "\\E3WAIT^1, WHY ARE THEY&A ROYAL GUARD&AND NOT ME!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_282", "\\E0I LOVE TO BE&PET TOO!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_287", "SIGH..^1.&IT'S ALL JUST A&PUPULARITY CONTEST./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_293", "WE WERE GETTING&BORED WAITING&FOR YOU.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_294", "\\E0SO I BUILT A&SNOW-PAPYRUS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_295", "\\E3AND SANS...&DID HIS THING./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_300", "ACTUALLY^1, IT'S ONE&OF HIS BETTER&LUMPS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_306", "I ALWAYS JUMP OVER&THE GAP INSTEAD OF&SOLVING THE PUZZLE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_307", "SANS NEVER SOLVES&IT EITHER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_308", "\\E3HE ALWAYS JUST..^1.&UM.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_309", "GETS ACROSS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_314", "I THINK HE HAS&A SHORTCUT OR&SOMETHING./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_321", "GYFTROT LIVES NEAR&THERE^1.&THEY LIKE GIFTS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_322", "\\E3DON'T WORRY IF&YOU CAN'T AFFORD&SOMETHING NICE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_323", "\\E0IT'S THE THOUGHT&THAT COUNTS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_324", "SO IMAGINE YOU&HAVE A LOT OF&MONEY.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_329", "DID YOU MEET&GYFTROT?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_336", "MY SIGNAL IS&GETTING WEAK./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_337", "\\E3LOOKS LIKE THE&PHONE WON'T WORK&PAST HERE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_338", "\\E0SO THERE'S NO&REASON TO GO&FURTHER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_343", "HELLO./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_349", "THE STATION OF&GREATERDOG./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_350", "\\E3HE LOOKS A BIT&LIKE A CERTAIN DOG&I DON'T LIKE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_351", "\\E0BUT GREATERDOG&DOESN'T COLLECT&ANYTHING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_352", "\\E2HE'S ONLY A&KLEPTOMANIAC&FOR AFFECTION!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_357", "HE'S AMASSED A&LARGE COLLECTION&OF HUGS AND PETS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_363", "THIS BRIDGE LOOKS&DANGEROUS^1, BUT&IT'S VERY STABLE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_364", "IN FACT^1, IT'S JUST&A ROCK FORMATION&I PAINTED OVER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_365", "I THINK IT LOOKS&MORE DRAMATIC&THAT WAY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_370", "I ADDED THE ROPE^1,&TOO./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_376", "SNOWDIN..^1.&HOME OF PAPYRUS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_377", "\\E3THAT'S THE SLOGAN^1,&RIGHT???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_382", "I'M PETITIONING TO&CHANGE THE SLOGAN./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_389", "THAT FURRY PERSON&THROWS ICE ALL&DAY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_390", "NOBODY KNOWS&WHERE IT GOES./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_394", "THAT FURRY PERSON&THROWS ICE ALL&DAY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_395", "NOBODY KNOWS&WHERE IT GOES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_397", "* Hey^1, I know^1!&* Alphys told me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_398", "* It goes to Hotland&  to cool down the&  CORE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_400", "WOW^1, UNDYNE!^1!&I DIDN'T KNOW YOU&LIKED NERDY STUFF!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_401", "\\E3JUST STRENGTH&AND FIGHTING.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_403", "\\E0* Are you kidding!?&* Why wouldn't I!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_404", "\\E6* The brain's the&  biggest muscle of&  all!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_410", "HYPNOTIZING^1, ISN'T&IT???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_416", "THE INN'S A&GREAT PLACE&TO STAY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_417", "THE LADY WHO&RUNS IT IS&REALLY NICE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_418", "\\E2SHE ALWAYS GIVES&ME A LOLLIPOP AND&A PAT ON THE HEAD./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_423", "WHY ARE YOU&CALLING ME?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_424", "\\E0ARE YOU TRYING&TO MAKE A&RESERVATION???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_430", "* Hey^1, I always stay&  there when I come&  to Snowdin!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_431", "\\E4* I used to stay&  at Papyrus's^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_432", "\\E1* His couch is like^1,&  lumpy and jangly?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_433", "\\E5* And his brother&  kept making 100's&  of midnight snacks./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_434", "\\E2* And Papyrus himself&  doesn't??^1?&* Know how to sleep?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_439", "* Yeah^1, just sleep&  here./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_448", "GRILLBY'S...&IT'S DARK AND FULL&OF GREASE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_449", "PURGATORY OF&FRIES..^1.&HAMBURGER ABYSS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_450", "ANYWAY^1, MY BROTHER&PRACTICALLY LIVES&HERE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_455", "I'M NOT COMING&TO GRILLBY'S./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_461", "GRILLBY'S^1? WE'RE TOO&REFINED FOR THAT&GREASEHOLE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_463", "* WOAH^1, if you go^1,&  you HAVE to try&  the cheese fries./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_464", "\\E6* They're AMAZINGLY&  bad for you!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_465", "\\E9* Oh^1, sorry^1, Papyrus^1,&  were you saying&  something?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_467", "JUST MONOLOGUING&ABOUT MY LOVE&FOR GREASE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_472", "OUR FEELINGS FOR&GREASE RUN DEEP&LIKE A RIVER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_474", "* Grease^1, I.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_475", "\\E8* I..^1.&* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_476", "\\E6* I want you in&  all my food!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_487", "I LOVE THE LIBRARY^1.&THE BOOKS ARE ALL&ARRANGED BY COLOR../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_488", "\\E4THIS SENSE OF&ORDER!!^1! IT FILLS&ME WITH POWER!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_493", "WHAT'S A LIBRARY&CARD?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_499", "* I couldn't get enough&  books when I was&  a kid./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_500", "\\E9* I tore through all&  sorts of 'em!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_501", "\\E1* I ripped through&  tons of 'em!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_502", "\\E6* I kicked 'em into&  shreds!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_507", "* But now I think&  reading's cool./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_516", "WOW^1! IT ONLY TOOK&YOU FOUR SECONDS&TO CALL ME!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_517", "YOU MUST BE VERY&DESPERATE FOR MY&HELP!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_518", "WELL^1! DO NOT FEAR^1!&THIS IS PAPYRUS'S&HOTFUL HELPLINE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_519", "JUST DESCRIBE YOUR&LOCATION^1, AND...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_520", "I WILL DESCRIBE&SOME HOT TIPS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_521", "\\E0SO^1, WHERE ARE&YOU?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_522", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_523", "\\E5... YOU'RE STILL&IN MY ROOM??/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_524", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_525", "\\E3HAVE YOU HEARD OF&SOMETHING CALLED&A..^1. DOOR?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_526", "\\E0WAIT^1! DON'T WORRY^1!&I'LL DRAW A&DIAGRAM FOR YOU!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_531", "HOLD UP^1!&I'M STILL DRAWING!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_537", "WHAT^1? I THOUGHT&YOU HAD GOTTEN OUT&OF MY ROOM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_538", "\\E1WE'RE GOING TO&HAVE TO START OVER&FROM SQUARE ONE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_539", "\\E0FIRST: DO YOU&KNOW WHO PAPYRUS&IS!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_544", "DO I KNOW WHO&PAPYRUS IS!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_554", "YOU'RE IN MY&HOUSE^1.&GOOD CHOICE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_555", "\\E3THOUGH I GUESS&IT'S TECHNICALLY&SANS'S HOUSE TOO./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_556", "\\E1BUT I PREFER NOT&TO DISCUSS HIS&PART OF IT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_557", "\\E3HIS ROOM IS..^1.&IT'S LIKE ANOTHER&WORLD!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_558", "\\E2A WORLD WHERE&THEY DON'T KNOW&HOW TO VACUUM./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_563", "YOU'RE BEST&STAYING AWAY FROM&THAT STRANGE PLACE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_572", "THIS IS WHERE&I TRIED TO&CAPTURE YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_573", "WHAT A TERRIBLE&MEMORY!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_578", ".../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_584", "* Yeah!^1! This is the&  best room for&  snow-wrestling!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_586", "SNOW WRESTLING IS&WHEN SHE SNEAKS UP&ON YOU FROM BEHIND,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_587", "THEN TACKLES YOU&AND YELLS&\"SNOW-WRESTLING!\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_588", "\\E5IT'S..^1.&NOT THE BEST&GAME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_590", "\\E9* Well^1, you know&  what I think?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_592", "WHAT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_594", "* Snow-wrestling!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_596", "NOOOOOOOOO!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_601", "* We'll have to play&  sometime!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_610", "WATERFALL..^1.&I BARELY KNOW&ANYTHING ABOUT IT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_611", "\\E0BUT I'LL DO MY&BEST TO INFORM&YOU!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_616", "UH^1, I DON'T HAVE&ANY FACTS ABOUT&THIS ROOM./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_622", "* If you're going to&  Snowdin^1, I won't&  have much to say./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_624", "BUT I WILL!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_626", "* There's the rub^1,&  right?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_628", "WHAT!^1?&THERE'S A RUB^1?&WHERE!?!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_630", "* In Snowdin^1, duh!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_635", "I'LL DO MY&BEST TO FIND&THE RUB./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_637", "* Hey^1, I think I&  found something!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_639", "OOH^1, WHERE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_640", "\\E5AND WHAT'S THIS&HORRIBLE NOOGIE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_642", "* It's the rub!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_660", "MY BROTHER HAS&A STATION HERE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_661", "\\E3YES^1, HE MANS&TWO STATIONS AT&ONCE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_662", "\\E0AMAZING^1, ISN'T&HE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_663", "HE SLACKS OFF&TWICE AS MUCH&AS NORMAL!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_668", "NORMAL FOLKS CAN&ONLY DREAM OF&SUCH SLOTH.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_674", "* This is Papyrus's&  brother's station./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_675", "\\E4* I'm always catching&  him slacking off^1,&  or sleeping.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_676", "\\E2* But his results are&  JUST good enough&  to not fire him./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_677", "\\E4* Well^1, except today./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_678", "\\E2* He didn't tell me&  ANYTHING about you./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_683", "\\E4* JUST scraping by&  the bare minimum&  every time.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_684", "\\E9* I guess it's kind&  of impressive...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_693", "ROCKS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_694", "\\E0IT MUST BE ONE&OF UNDYNE'S&INGENIOUS PUZZLES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_695", "\\E0YOU'D BETTER BE&CAREFUL!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_700", "BE WARY OF ROCKS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_706", "* God^1, I was supposed&  to build a puzzle&  for this room.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_707", "\\E2* But I HATE puzzles./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_708", "\\E6* So I just put a&  huge pile of&  rocks upstream./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_714", "* What??^1?&* Don't judge me!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_715", "\\E6* My lack of&  creativity's making&  your life easier!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_722", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_723", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_731", "WHERE'D YOU GO!?&I CAN'T SEE&YOU!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_732", "\\E0OH WAIT^1, THAT'S&BECAUSE YOU'RE&ON THE PHONE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_737", "ARE YOU STILL&ON THE PHONE?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_743", "* So you found the&  room behind the&  waterfall.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_744", "\\E0* When I feel like&  relaxing^1, I always&  take a break there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_745", "\\E1* That means NEVER!^1!&* I HATE RELAXING!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_750", "* I LOVE being&  ANGRY and STRESSED&  OUT!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_751", "\\E0* Nah^1, I'm joking./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_757", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_758", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_766", "WOWIE^1, I HAD AN&AWKWARD TIME IN&THIS ROOM EARLIER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_767", "\\E0GOOD HEAVENS&YOU WEREN'T AROUND&TO SEE IT!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_772", "YOU REALLY&DIDN'T SEE IT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_773", "I LOVE THAT&FACT^1, AND&REPEATING IT!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_779", "* This is the room&  where I first&  spotted you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_780", "\\E2* You have NO idea&  how many spears I&  wanted to throw!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_781", "\\E9* But^1, um^1, that sea-&  grass is under&  scientific protection./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_786", "* What!!!!^1!&* That's a real thing!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_792", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_793", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_801", "A BRIDGE GROWS&IF YOU ALIGN&FOUR BRIDGE SEEDS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_802", "\\E3BUT THAT'S SORT&OF LIMITED IN&USEFULNESS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_803", "\\E2WHY DON'T WE&HAVE AIRPLANE&SEEDS???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_808", "OR^1, PHONES THAT&CAN TURN INTO&JETPACKS???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_814", "* Wait^1, did you actually&  DO the puzzle!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_815", "\\E2* You can't just jump&  across!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_816", "\\E6* You can't do the&  jimpity jumpity&  joodle!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_821", "* The limpity loppity&  leap!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_830", "HMMM..^1. THIS PUZZLE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_831", "\\E0I'VE GOT IT!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_832", "TRY TO BUILD A&BRIDGE WITH THE&BRIDGE SEEDS!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_837", "I'M HELPING./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_843", "* Alphys helped measure&  out the mud tiles&  for this puzzle./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_844", "* It was a lot of work^1,&  but we got to make&  sand castles after./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_845", "\\E9* We're a good team^1.&* She's great at&  building them.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_846", "\\E6* And I'm great at&  wrecking them!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_851", "* There's barely even&  a trace of 'em&  now.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_861", "WHAT'S BETTER&THAN A BENCHFUL&OF QUICHE?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_866", "* What's better than&  a benchful of&  quiche?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_876", "\\E3THE WISHING ROOM^1.&DO YOU HAVE&A WISH...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_877", "\\E0NYEH HEH HEH!^1!&I HAVE ONE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_878", "\\E2I WISH I WAS&TALKING TO MY&COOL FRIEND!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_879", "\\E0LOOK!!^1!&IT'S COMING TRUE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_885", "WHAT WILL YOU&WISH FOR?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_891", "* Every day^1, people&  come here and wish&  to the stars.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_892", "\\E1* I won't let them&  down!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_893", "* I'll make everyone's&  wishes come true!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_895", "I WISH I HAD&EIGHT LEGS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_896", "\\E0SO I COULD WEAR&FOUR PAIRS OF&HOTPANTS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_898", "* I'll make most&  people's wishes&  come true!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_903", "* What^1, you have a&  wish?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_904", "\\E3* Add it to the pile^1,&  punk./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_915", "THERE ARE MANY&ANCIENT PLAQUES&HERE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_916", "WATERFALL IS&PRACTICALLY A&HISTORY MUSEUM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_917", "\\E3EXCEPT WITH&MUSCULAR&SEAHORSES./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_922", "HI?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_928", "* Along these walls&  lies our tragic&  history.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_929", "\\E1* Tragically BORING!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_930", "\\E2* Why can't our history&  be COOL ANIMATIONS&  like the humans'!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_931", "\\E6* Someone at LEAST&  engrave a plaque with&  swords and kissing!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_936", "* Come on^1, don't act&  like your history's&  not COOL!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_942", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_943", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_950", "ANOTHER HARMLESS&AND VERY SAFE&CORRIDOR.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_951", "\\E0ALL THANKS TO&ME!!^1!&NYEH HEH HEH!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_956", "HEH!!!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_962", "* This is where I&  threw all those&  spears at you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_963", "\\E6* That was fun!!^1!&* Let's do that&  again sometime!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_968", "* Come on^1!&* Don't fear the spear!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_974", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_975", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_982", "WATCH YOUR STEP!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_983", "\\E3UNDYNE REALLY CARES&ABOUT THIS GRASS&FOR SOME REASON./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_988", "ARE YOU WATCHING?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_994", "* If it wasn't for&  that grass^1, I'd&  have kicked your.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_995", "\\E9* Uh^1, if not for&  that grooty^1, I'd have&  kicked your booty./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1000", "* Don't ask me what&  a grooty is!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1006", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1007", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1014", "WHY ARE THERE SO&MANY TABLES LYING&AROUND HERE?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1019", "* Where are all&  these tables coming&  from?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1029", "HUH^1? SANS ISN'T&PLAYING WITH HIS&TELESCOPE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1030", "\\E0WOWIE!!^1! MAYBE HE&WENT TO WORK!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1031", "\\E2WOW!!^1! AM I&ALLOWED TO BE&PROUD???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1036", "HUH^1? MY BROTHER^1?&OF COURSE HE HAS&A TELESCOPE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1037", "\\E0SANS LOVES&OUTER SPACEY&SCI-FI STUFF./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1038", "\\E3HMM^1?&HE NEVER TOLD&YOU??/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1039", "\\E0YEAH^1, SANS NEVER&TELLS ANYBODY&ANYTHING!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1046", "THANKS FOR CALLING./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1052", "* Hey^1, here's a&  neat party trick./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1053", "\\E0* Try talking to&  the southern&  wall!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1054", "\\E4* First you have to&  throw a party&  though.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1055", "\\E0* Hey^1, you should&  make it a costume&  party!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1056", "\\E6* Then Papyrus can&  have someplace he&  seems normal!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1062", "* Oh^1!&* I should invite&  Alphys^1, too!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1071", "ICE CREAM^1?&THANKS^1, BUT I&LIVE IN SNOWDIN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1072", "\\E0THERE'S ICE CREAM&ALL OVER THE&GROUND!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1074", "* that's called snow./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1076", "SANS!!^1! I DIDN'T&ASK YOUR OPINION!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1081", "I'M FLATTERED HOW&MUCH YOU WANT TO&GIVE ME ICE CREAM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1083", "* me too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1085", "NO YOU AREN'T!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1097", "\\E1* Ugh^1, ice cream!^1?&* Sugary... COLD..^1.&* Talk about GROSS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1098", "\\E3* Now this chilly&  pink stuff that&  Alphys makes me.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1099", "\\E6* THAT rules!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1104", "* I'll also drink it&  if it's heated up./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1113", "SOMETIMES^1, PRIZES&ARE HIDDEN UNDER&THE GRASS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1114", "TREASURES LIKE&MUD^1, OR DIRT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1120", "DID YOU FIND&THE TREASURE?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1126", "* There's normally a&  pair of old shoes&  in that seagrass./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1127", "\\E4* Strangely^1, they're made&  for someone without&  fins or claws./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1128", "\\E7* What kind of monster&  is like that...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1129", "\\E2* Oh^1, wait!^1?&* What about a slime&  monster!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1130", "\\E6* Wait^1, those don't&  have feet at all!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1136", "* Well^1, if they fit&  you^1, you might as&  well take them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1137", "\\E6* Whoever wore them&  isn't coming back!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1146", "\\E3A BIRD MONSTER?^1?&TRY TALKING TO&IT!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1147", "\\E0OR YOU COULD&PUT ME ON THE&LINE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1148", "\\E2I'VE GOT SOME&PRETTY GOOD&TWEETS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1149", "\\E0(HORRIBLE&  BIRD IMITATIONS)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1155", "DID THE BIRD LIKE&MY TWEETS???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1161", "* That bird will carry&  anyone past the gap^1.&* It NEVER says no./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1162", "\\E7* When I was younger^1,&  it gave me a lift^1.&* It took an hour.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1163", "\\E2* But this bird NEVER&  once thought of&  giving up!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1164", "\\E7* Cherish this bird./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1170", "* Well??^1?&* Are you CHERISHING???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1171", "\\E1* CHERISH HARDER!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1180", "ONION?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1186", "HUM HUM HUM.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1192", "* Onion...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1198", "* ...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1206", "I'VE HEARD A SHY&MONSTER LIVES&AROUND HERE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1207", "\\E3WELL^1, IF YOU WANT&TO GET SOMEONE&TO OPEN UP.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1208", "\\E0YOU SHOULD ENGAGE&THEM IN COMBAT!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1214", "HUM HUM HUM.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1220", "* Oh yeah^1, Shyren&  lives around here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1221", "* I used to give her&  piano lessons./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1222", "\\E4* She was really&  talented..^1. \\E9for someone&  with no fingers./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1223", "\\E4* One day^1, she stopped&  coming to her lessons^1,&  though.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1229", "\\E7* How did her song&  go again...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1239", "HUH!^1?&ARE YOU SERENADING&ME!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1240", "\\E2OH NO!!^1!&YOU'RE MAKING ME&BLUSH!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1246", "LET'S WRITE A&MUSICAL ABOUT&OUR ADVENTURES!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1252", "\\E6* Yeah!^1! YEAH!!^1!&* I made this puzzle!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1253", "\\E0* Really^1, it was just&  an excuse to put&  a piano here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1254", "\\E2* I love FIGHTING THE&  IVORIES!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1259", "\\E9* Maybe I'll play you&  something sometime!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1269", "\\E3HMMM.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1270", "THERE'S SOMETHING&ANNOYING ABOUT&THIS ROOM./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1276", "BUT I CAN'T&QUITE PLACE MY&FINGER ON IT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1277", "THEN PLACE MY&WHOLE HAND ON&IT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1278", "THEN PET IT&AFFECTIONATELY.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1291", "\\E1* Huh!^1?&* Did you solve the&  puzzle!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1292", "\\E6* No one has ever..^1.&* I've been waiting so&  long for someone to.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1293", "\\E2* I mean^1, uhhh^1, big deal^1!&* Whatever!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1298", "* Guess I've gotta&  find a new mystic&  artifact./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1308", "\\E3A MYSTERIOUS&STATUE.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1313", "\\E3WHAT'S THAT MUSIC?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1314", "AM I ON HOLD???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1320", "\\E0* That statue's been&  here forever.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1321", "* No one knows where&  it came from./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1326", "* Hey^1, you figured out&  how to get the&  music to play...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1327", "\\E9* Nice^1, isn't it?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1336", "ALWAYS CARRY AN&UMBRELLA IN CASE&IT RAINS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1337", "YOU KNOW^1.&JUST KEEP A FEW&IN YOUR POCKETS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1342", "NOTHING LIKE A&HOT BUCKET OF&'BRELLAS.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1348", "* Those umbrellas were&  ASGORE's idea./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1349", "\\E9* He says he doesn't&  want anyone to&  catch a cold./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1350", "\\E0* Waterfall's underwater&  citizens couldn't care&  less^1, though./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1355", "* Did you get a 'brella?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1365", "YOU CAN SEE YOUR&REFLECTION IN A&PUDDLE^1, BUT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1366", "\\E1DON'T LET A BODY&OF WATER DETERMINE&YOUR SELF-WORTH!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1372", "HMMM^1? YOU'RE&HANGING OUT&WITH A FRIEND?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1373", "THEN MAYBE YOU&SHOULDN'T TALK&TO ME.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1374", "\\E0YOU'LL MAKE THEM&JEALOUS!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1380", "CALLING AGAIN...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1386", "* What!^1?&* You're at my&  FAVORITE SPOT!?!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1387", "\\E2* You'd better jump in&  at least 1000 puddles&  for me!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1392", "* Have you reached&  triple digits yet!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1402", "WHERE ARE YOU^1?&I HEAR WATER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1403", "ARE YOU IN THE&TOILET?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1409", "ALSO^1, WHAT'S A&TOILET?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1415", "* This whole area's&  like a little&  nature trail./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1416", "* It's nice to have&  a rainy spot away&  from civilization.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1417", "\\E7* Though^1, with the city&  filling up^1, who knows&  how long that'll last./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1422", "* Well?^1!&* Are you enjoying&  nature!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1431", "THAT'S THE KING'S&CASTLE.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1436", "SEEMS YOU CAN&FINALLY SEE THE&END./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1442", "* ASGORE's castle.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1443", "\\E7* Guess there's no&  stopping you^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1448", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1458", "SEEMS LIKE THE&PHONE CONNECTION'S&GETTING WEAK.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1463", "BETTER NOT GO&PAST THAT POINT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1469", "* The trail dead-ends&  here^1, unless you can&  jump./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1470", "\\E4* Honestly^1, I can't&  believe I expected&  you to go this way./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1471", "\\E6* What was I thinking???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1472", "\\E1* ... and how was I&  right???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1477", "* Don't explain it!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1488", "FLOWERS...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1489", "\\E0DO ANY OF THEM&TALK!^1?&SAY HI FOR ME!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1494", "FLOWERS ARE OUR&BEST FRIENDS!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1500", "* Those flowers.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1501", "* One day^1, they just&  started to grow&  there./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1502", "* I swear^1, it's like&  they have a mind&  of their own./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1507", "* That's ridiculous&  though!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1513", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1514", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1522", "GARBAGE^1, HUH^1?&BOY^1, DO I KNOW&GARBAGE!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1523", "\\E4AFTER ALL^1, I'M&HOUSEMATES WITH A&LAZY BAG OF TRASH!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1524", "\\E0HIS NAME'S TRASHY^1.&HE LIVES IN THE&GARBAGE CAN./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1529", "YOU DIDN'T THINK I&DIDN'T NAME MY&GARBAGE^1, DID YOU?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1535", "\\E1* That's where I&  met Alphys for the&  first time!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1536", "\\E0* I was looking for&  cool swords^1, when&  I saw her.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1537", "\\E1* Uh^1, standing there^1,&  staring into the&  abyss./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1538", "\\E4* She looked pretty..^1.&* Um..^1.&* ... contemplative./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1539", "\\E9* So I asked her&  where she thought&  the abyss led to!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1540", "\\E2* She looked up at&  me^1, shocked^1, and went&  red in the face./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1541", "\\E6* But I'm scary^1,&  so I'm used to&  that kinda stuff!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1542", "\\E1* Then she kept&  explaining all her&  different theories./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1543", "\\E9* She went on for&  hours^1!&* I was so captivated!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1544", "\\E1* After that^1, I kept&  running into her&  here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1545", "\\E6* And now we're&  friends^1!&* Yeeee hawww!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1550", "* Oh my GOD^1!&* Don't make me tell&  this story AGAIN!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1557", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1558", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1566", "I KNOW WHY YOU&CALLED ME./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1567", "\\E0I ALWAYS MAKE&PEOPLE FEEL&BETTER.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1568", "\\E2WHEN THEY'RE DOWN&IN THE DUMPS!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1569", "\\E0.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1570", "\\E3I'VE SPENT TOO&LONG WITH MY&BROTHER TODAY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1575", "FORGET I SAID&THAT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1581", "* The garbage dump!^1!&* So many great things&  come from there!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1582", "\\E0* The only reason we&  have modern&  technology.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1583", "* Is 'cause of all the&  human junk that flows&  from the surface!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1584", "\\E9* Plus^1, it's a GREAT&  place to meet&  girls./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1590", "* Wait^1!&* Don't quote me on&  that one!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1596", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1597", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1604", "HEY^1!&YOU'RE NEAR&UNDYNE'S HOUSE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1605", "THAT'S TO THE&LEFT-UPWARDS^1.&LUPWARDS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1606", "\\E3ALL THE OTHER&DIRECTIONS GO TO&THE WRONG HOUSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1607", "\\E0NORTH:&GHOST HOUSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1608", "EAST: TURTLE HOUSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1609", "SOUTH:&TRASH HOUSE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1614", "WEST: BIRD HOUSE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1620", "SOUNDS LIKE YOU'RE&NEAR UNDYNE'S&HOUSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1621", "HEY^1!&WE SHOULD GO&VISIT UNDYNE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1623", "* I'm right here!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1625", "I LOVE WHEN A PLAN&COMES TOGETHER^1!&NYEH HEH HEH!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1632", "* Well^1, I think we&  should hang out&  with Papyrus./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1634", "REALLY??^1?&CAN WE???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1641", "THAT'S UNDYNE'S&HOUSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1642", "LET'S GO THERE&AND HANG OUT&SOME DAY!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1647", "STILL WAITING&OUTSIDE HER&HOUSE...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1648", "\\E0YEAH^1, I DO THAT&SOMETIMES^1, TOO!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1653", "THAT'S UNDYNE'S&HOUSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1654", "YOU KNOW^1, THE&ONE WITH THE&SKELETON IN FRONT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1662", "THAT'S UNDYNE'S&HOUSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1663", "IT'S A GREAT&PLACE TO.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1664", "\\E5UHHH?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1666", "* Huff..^1. puff...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1667", "\\E6* YEAH!!^1!&* That's MY HOUSE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1669", "HI UNDYNE^1!&HOW'D YOU GET&HERE SO FAST?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1671", "\\E9* I ran./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1673", "WOWIE!!^1!&UNDYNE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1674", "SOMEDAY I WANT&TO BE AS STRONG&AND SWEATY AS YOU./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1680", "SO YOU RAN HERE&JUST TO BE ON&THE PHONE???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1682", "* Yep!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1684", "THEN YOU MUST&HAVE SOMETHING.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1685", "EXTREMELY COOL&TO SAY ABOUT&YOUR HOUSE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1687", "* Nope!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1694", "* That's my house./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1695", "\\E1* Or^1, it WAS my&  house^1, until we&  set it on fire./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1696", "\\E6* But hey^1, can't say&  I've never done&  that before!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1701", "* Hey^1, if you find&  any cool swords in&  the wreckage.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1702", "* You know where to&  find me./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1714", "OH^1, THAT'S THE&HOUSE OF... UM..^1.&UNDYNE'S NEIGHBOR./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1715", "\\E3WHAT WAS THEIR&NAME AGAIN?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1716", "\\E0SPOOKY BLOO BLOO?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1721", "NAPPER HOG...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1727", "* That's Napstablook's&  house./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1728", "\\E9* They kind of keep&  to theirself^1, but...&* That's a good ghost./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1729", "\\E4* I try to be a good&  neighbor^1, but I think&  they're scared of me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1730", "\\E2* C'mon^1, what's scary&  about a good-natured&  invite to wrestle!!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1736", "* They're incorporeal&  anyway!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1745", "SO YOU'RE FRIENDS&WITH A GHOST.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1746", "\\E5ISN'T THAT KIND&OF SPOOKY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1747", "\\E3I'D THINK YOU'D&LIKE YOUR FRIENDS&WARM AND CUDDLY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1748", "\\E0LIKE SKELETONS!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1754", "VERY SOFT^1, AND&FULL OF CALCIUM./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1760", "* Oh^1, you're hanging&  out with Napstablook!^1?&* That's great!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1761", "\\E9* I haven't seen them&  hanging out with&  anyone since.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1762", "\\E4* Well^1, their cousin./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1763", "\\E9* They would both watch&  TV at all hours of&  the day.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1764", "\\E0* Then they would&  practice these&  weird performances./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1765", "\\E4* Where'd they go...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1771", "* Don't feel like you&  have to live up&  to their cousin!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1772", "\\E6* Just be your lovable&  old garbage self!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1781", "THAT HOUSE USED&TO BE HAUNTED./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1782", "BECAUSE A GHOST&LIVED THERE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1783", "BUT THE GHOST&MOVED AWAY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1784", "IT'S AN&UN-HAUNTED HOUSE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1791", "BY THE BY^1,&BREAKING INTO&A HOUSE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1792", "\\E3THAT'S ILLEGAL^1,&RIGHT???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1793", "\\E5PLEASE STOP&COMMITTING GHOST&CRIMES./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1799", "* WHAT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1800", "* You broke into&  Napstablook's&  cousin's house!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1801", "\\E2* That's..^1.&* That's...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1802", "\\E9* Hey^1, what was&  their name^1, anyway?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1804", "HAPPSTABLOOK^1,&THE HAPPY&GHOST./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1806", "* Okay^1, that's&  DEFINITELY wrong./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1808", "IT'S NOT WRONG^1.&IT'S JUST MY&HEADCANON./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1815", "* Seriously^1, though^1,&  stop committing&  ghost crimes./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1825", "THESE SNAILS ARE&JUST LIKE MY&BROTHER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1826", "ROUND^1, SLOW.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1827", "\\E3AND CONSTANTLY&EMITTING SLIME???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1832", "EMITTING SLIME..^1.&THAT'S JUST WHAT&BROTHERS DO./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1838", "* Napstablook's family&  used to run this&  farm^1, but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1839", "\\E7* They've all..^1.&* Passed on.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1840", "\\E9* ... to different jobs^1,&  since there's not&  much business here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1841", "\\E0* Them and their cousin&  stayed behind to run&  the family farm./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1842", "\\E4* But no one's seen&  their cousin for a&  long time./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1843", "\\E7* Now Napstablook's&  all alone.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1844", "\\E1* Be nice to them^1,&  okay!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1850", "* Cherish this ghost!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1859", "IF YOU SEE A&SHOP^1, YOU SHOULD&STOP.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1860", "DROP^1, AND&ROLL.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1861", "INTO SOME&GREAT DEALS!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1862", "BECAUSE WE'RE&HAVING A FIRE&SALE!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1863", "AT MY IMAGINARY&STORE^1, WHICH&SELLS FLAMES./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1868", "YET ANOTHER DREAM&OF MINE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1874", "\\E1* Hey!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1875", "* That's the store of&  Gerson^1, the Hammer of&  Justice!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1876", "\\E9* The toughest monster&  that ever lived...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1877", "\\E4* He fought in the&  war between humans&  and monsters.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1878", "\\E6* And he survived^1!&* He's a real hero!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1883", "* Are you gonna buy&  something?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1892", "IS THE RIVER&PERSON THERE&TODAY?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1897", "ARE THEY?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1903", "* That river connects&  to Snowdin and&  Hotland./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1904", "* If you need to get&  from one place to&  another^1, jump in!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1905", "\\E2* Look^1, that's all we&  got for public&  transport^1, OK!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1910", "* So what?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1919", "WHAT'S THAT&STRANGE WHISPER?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1920", "\\E5I MIGHT HAVE&TO HANG UP./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1925", "PAPYRUS ISN'T&HOME RIGHT NOW!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1931", "* A field of echo&  flowers.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1932", "\\E4* They babble back and&  forth to each other.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1933", "* ... until their words&  become meaningless&  noise./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1934", "\\E5* Creepy^1, huh?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1939", "* Stop calling me&  from that creepy&  room!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1948", "WHAT^1?&MUSHROOMS^1?&CAN YOU EAT THEM?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1949", "\\E3ARE YOU SURE&YOU CAN'T EAT&THEM???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1954", "I'D TRY EATING&THEM./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1960", "* Once you get familiar&  with this room.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1961", "\\E9* You don't even need&  to light up the&  mushrooms!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1962", "\\E0* I mean^1, the path&  to Temmie Village is&  never lit up here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1963", "\\E6* But why would you&  wanna go there!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1968", "* It's down south if&  you want to avoid&  it./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1977", "LANTERNS^1?&UM^1, OKAY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1978", "\\E0CAN YOU EAT&THEM???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1979", "\\E3I'M SERIOUSLY OUT&OF IDEAS HERE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1984", "I'D TRY EATING&THEM./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1990", "* Once you get familiar&  with this room.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1991", "\\E9* You don't even need&  to light up the&  lanterns!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1992", "\\E0* ... yeah./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_1997", "* Whatever./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2007", "HMMM..^1.&A CORRIDOR FILLED&WITH WATER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2008", "\\E0THAT'S JUST A&GUESS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2013", "I HAVE NOTHING&TO SAY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2019", "* That's where I first&  talked to you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2020", "\\E3* Weren't you SUPER&  terrified?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2021", "\\E2* I practice that&  monologue ALL the&  time in the mirror!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2023", "UNDYNE???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2025", "* I mean!!^1!&* Uh!!^1!&* No I don't!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2027", "OH^1.&I WAS JUST GOING&TO ASK./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2028", "\\E0DO YOU WANT TO&PRACTICE MONOLOGUES&TOGETHER...?!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2030", "* UH!!^1!&* NO!!^1!&* I DON'T!!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2035", "ATTENTION EVERYONE^1!&I AM GOING TO&OPEN THE FRIDGE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2037", "* Do you have a&  monologue for&  EVERYTHING?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2051", "ECHO FLOWERS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2052", "\\E0THERE'S ONLY ONE&TALKING FLOWER&FOR ME!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2058", "* Fields of flowers^1,&  whispering everybody's&  hopes and dreams.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2059", "\\E1* NGAHHHH!!^1!&* IT FILLS ME WITH&  POWER!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2064", "* NGAHHHH!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2078", "EACH AREA HAS TO&HAVE A PRECARIOUS&BRIDGE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2079", "IT'S MANDATED BY&THE GOVERNMENT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2080", "OF COURSE^1, KING&FLUFFYBOY WANTS TO&UNMANDATE IT SAFER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2081", "\\E1WHY!!^1? WON'T HE&THINK OF THE&CHILDREN!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2088", "SPIKES^1. DANGER&BRIDGES^1. THE&PILLARS OF YOUTH./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2094", "* This room...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2095", "* Error?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2098", "\\E7* That sure was a&  tense scenario./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2099", "\\E4* I just wanted to&  help that poor kid^1,&  but.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2100", "\\E1* I thought if I tried^1,&  you'd attack me!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2101", "\\E9* Thankfully^1, you&  ended up saving&  them./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2105", "\\E7* I'd actually..^1.&* Forgotten what had&  happened here./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2106", "\\E4* You just let that&  poor kid drop to&  the floor./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2107", "* Maybe you were just&  afraid./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2108", "\\E7* But if I hadn't&  been around^1, then...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2112", "\\E2* That's when you ran&  away when your friend&  asked for help!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2113", "\\E9* Though^1, who can blame&  you for fleeing from&  certain death...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2114", "\\E6* ME!!!^1!&* I'm still TOTALLY&  disappointed!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2115", "\\E1* That's the WIMPIEST&  thing you've EVER&  done!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2116", "* Apologize to your&  poor friend^1, OK^1,&  buster!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2122", "* .../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2136", "THIS IS WHERE&ELDER PUZZLER&LIKES TO STAND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2137", "BLOCK-PUSHING^1.&KEY-GATHERING^1.&TEDIOUS AGONY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2138", "IT'S IMPORTANT TO&RESPECT OUR ROOTS!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2144", "THIS IS WHERE&ELDER PUZZLER&LIKES TO STAND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2145", "IT'S IMPORTANT TO&RESPECT OUR&PUZZLING ROOTS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2147", "* Yeah^1, someone else&  has to care so I&  don't have to!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2149", "BUT UNDYNE^1, DON'T&YOU LIKE TRADITION?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2151", "* I worked in an office&  pushing blocks for&  a month!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2152", "\\E9* My respect for block&  puzzles was depleted&  by corporate life./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2154", "WHAT!^1? YOU THREW&AWAY MY DREAM&LIFE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2155", "\\E2THE LIFE OF A&SIMPLE SALARYMAN.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2156", "COMMUTING EVERY&DAY ON A TRAIN&FULL OF SPIKES.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2158", "* (I won't tell him&  that's not how it&  works...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2163", "UNDYNE^1, DID YOU&REALLY HAVE AN&OFFICE JOB?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2165", "* Well^1, it was more&  of a^1, uh^1, community&  service thing./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2167", "THAT'S UNDYNE!^1!&ALWAYS HELPING OUT&THE COMMUNITY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2169", "* Uh^1, yep^1!&* Totally of my own&  volition there!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2185", "THAT'S UNDYNE'S&DRAMATIC CRAG./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2186", "\\E0SHE'S ALWAYS&POSING ATOP IT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2187", "\\E3MUMBLING SOMETHING&TO HERSELF.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2191", "I THINK IT'S&SOMETHING SHE&HAS TO MEMORIZE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2198", "* Oh my GOD!!^1!&* Wasn't this room&  the BEST!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2199", "\\E3* Like when I decided&  to NOT do that&  BORING monologue.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2200", "\\E6* And then went TOTALLY&  off-the-cuff!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2201", "\\E2* Or when I almost&  killed you with&  spears???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2202", "\\E3* Or when I almost&  killed you with&  MORE spears???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2203", "\\E9* Aw man^1.&* I should have taken&  photos./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2204", "\\E8* Think about how cute&  a little scrapbook&  would be.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2206", "NOW I WANT A&SCRAPBOOK OF&MY FIGHT TOO!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2208", "* Let's start a photo&  company for boss&  fights!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2210", "ONE WEEK LATER^1,&SAMPLE GLOSSIES&IN THE MAIL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2212", "* Relive the memories.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2217", "* Going off-the-cuff..^1.&* It helped that I...&* Uh./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2218", "\\E9* Completely forgot the&  words to my monologue^1,&  anyway.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2234", "HEY..^1. ISN'T THIS&WHERE I CALLED&YOU?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2235", "\\E2I HAVE A PHOTO-&GRAPHIC MEMORY&FOR PHONE CALLS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2236", "\\E3.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2237", "\\E5HEY^1, WHEN ARE&WE GONNA HANG&WITH UNDYNE?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2241", "\\E0HEY^1, WHEN ARE&WE GONNA HANG&WITH UNDYNE?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2248", "* This is where I&  was chasing you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2249", "\\E1* But you got a phone&  call^1, so I had to&  wait./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2251", "OH^1!&THAT WAS ME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2253", "* What!^1?&* What were you even&  calling about!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2255", "I WAS JUST&SAYING WE SHOULD&ALL HANG OUT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2257", "* As I was trying&  to kill them!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2259", "WELL!^1!&NOBODY STARTS AS&GREAT FRIENDS!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2265", "* Nobody starts as&  great friends^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2267", "THAT'S THE RULE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2269", "* Well^1, you're gonna&  END as my great&  friend!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2271", "N... NO!!^1!&NOT THE FLATTERY&SUPLEX!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2285", "OH!!!&YOU'RE IN HOTLAND&NOW!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2286", "\\E4... HEY SANS^1,&AREN'T YOU SUPPOSED&TO BE THERE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2288", "* don't worry^1.&* i am./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2290", "PHEW!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2295", "FINALLY^1, SANS IS&DOING HIS JOB./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2302", "\\E1* I can't believe&  Papyrus's brother was&  sleeping!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2303", "\\E2* I was counting on&  him to stop you!^1!&* UrrrrgHHHH!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2305", "HE'S GOTTEN REALLY&OUT OF SHAPE^1.&HE TIRES EASILY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2306", "LATELY HE'S BEEN&NAPPING OVER 7&HOURS A NIGHT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2307", "\\E1HE'S NAPPING&HIMSELF INTO AN&EARLY GRAVE!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2309", "* I agree!^1!&* Your brother needs&  to...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2310", "\\E9* ... wait^1, isn't that&  just called sleeping?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2312", "UNDYNE!^1! NO!!^1!&NOT YOU TOO!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2319", "* Wait^1. Papyrus..^1.&* When do YOU sleep?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2321", "\\E3I'M USUALLY TOO&BUSY TO SLEEP^1.&WHY???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2323", "* Well^1, I was just&  thinking.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2324", "\\E6* If you're not using&  that cool car bed^1,&  can I have it!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2339", "A WATER COOLER...^1?&IN HOTLAND???&THAT'S WEIRD./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2340", "\\E0SHOULDN'T IT BE&A FIRE COOLER&INSTEAD?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2345", "\\E3WHAT'S A WATER&COOLER DO^1,&ANYWAY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2346", "\\E3MAKE WATER..^1.&COOLER?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2347", "\\E0SO IT GIVES IT&SPIKES AND MAKES&IT GLOW?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2354", "* Thank God for that&  water cooler^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2355", "\\E4* Actually^1, you can&  thank Alphys.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2356", "\\E9* She put it there&  just for me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2357", "\\E0* Now I can take a&  drink on the way&  to her lab./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2358", "\\E1* Though^1, usually I'm&  not wearing 100&  pounds of armor...!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2363", "* Thanks for giving me&  that water^1, I guess./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2377", "A LAB??^1?&MY BROTHER&WOULD LOVE THAT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2378", "HE LOVES SCIENCE&FICTION!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2379", "ESPECIALLY&WHEN IT'S&REAL./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2384", "WAIT^1, THAT BAG OF&DOG FOOD LOOKS&FAMILIAR.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2385", "I REMEMBER SEEING&IT..^1.&IN SANS'S ROOM?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2386", "\\E1YEAH^1! I ASKED HIM&WHY HE HAD IT!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2387", "\\E0HE TOLD ME HE&WAS TRYING TO&EAT HEALTHIER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2393", "* You're at Alphys's&  lab^1?&* Is she there...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2394", "\\E1* Hey^1, tell her I&  said hi^1, okay!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2395", "\\E2* And^1, tell me how&  she's doing!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2396", "\\E9* And tell me if&  she needs anything^1,&  and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2397", "\\E1* Wait^1! No^1!&* Don't ask any of&  that!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2402", "* But she's fine^1,&  right!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2408", "* (There's some strange&  interference...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2416", "\\E2YOU'RE IN HER&ROOM^1, UNINVITED^1?&WOWIE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2417", "\\E3THAT'S EXTREMELY&CREEPY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2422", "MAYBE DON'T DO&THAT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2428", "* What!^1?&* You're in her room!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2429", "\\E2* Get out of there!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2430", "\\E9* Unless^1, um^1, she&  invited you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2431", "\\E2* No wayyyy!!^1!&* That did NOT happen!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2436", "* Stop that!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2445", "HOTLAND^1, HUH.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2446", "\\E2I KNOW IT LIKE&THE BACK OF&MY HAND.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2447", "\\E3WHICH^1, SINCE I'M&ALWAYS WEARING&GLOVES.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2448", "\\E0I DON'T KNOW&ANYTHING&ABOUT!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2453", "MY KNOWLEDGE&QUANTITY IS&STAGNANT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2459", "NEITHER OF US&KNOW ANYTHING&ABOUT HOTLAND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2461", "* So we'll just have&  to COMBINE OUR&  POWER!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2463", "ZERO PLUS ZERO&IS STILL ZERO./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2465", "* Yeah^1, but it's a&  BIG zero!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2470", "* THE BIGGEST ZERO!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2479", "HEY^1, YOU SHOULD&COME TO SNOWDIN&AND VISIT ME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2480", "\\E2I'VE BEEN WORKING&ON A FEW THINGS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2481", "\\E0A FEW SENTENCES&TO STAND AROUND&AND REPEAT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2486", "A FEW SENTENCES&TO STAND AROUND&AND REPEAT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2492", "HEY^1, YOU SHOULD&COME TO SNOWDIN&AND VISIT ME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2494", "* No WAY!!^1!&* Come to Snowdin&  and visit ME!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2496", "WHAT??^1?&WE'RE IN THE&SAME LOCATION!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2498", "* Wrong^1! I'm standing&  slightly to the&  right!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2503", "* Come on!!^1!&* Make your choice!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2512", "CONVEYOR BELTS&EVERYWHERE?^1?&ARE YOU SERIOUS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2513", "\\E3IMAGINE RIDING&ONE TO GET TO&WORK OR SCHOOL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2514", "RIDICULOUS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2515", "\\E0NOW ICE AND&SPIKES^1, THERE'S&CONVENIENCE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2520", "GLAD I DON'T&LIVE IN HOTLAND./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2526", "* I rode on a&  conveyor belt&  once./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2527", "\\E1* I learned pretty&  fast that they&  make me sick./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2529", "DID YOU HURL??/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2531", "* Yeah^1, like 9000&  times!^1!&* It was awesome!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2536", "STOP CALLING AND&MAKING HER SAY&GROSS THINGS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2546", "STEAM VENTS^1?&WOW..^1. THAT&SOUNDS AWFUL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2547", "\\E1WHAT IF YOU'RE&WEARING A&DRESS?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2552", "GLAD I DON'T&LIVE IN HOTLAND!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2558", "* Steam vents^1?&* I think Alphys told&  me about those./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2559", "* The CORE cools off&  by releasing steam&  through those.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2560", "\\E9* And at the same&  time^1, it doubles&  as transport!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2561", "\\E6* Pretty cool^1, if&  you aren't wearing&  a dress!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2566", "* Huh!^1?&* Did you put on&  a dress?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2576", "ORANGE AND BLUE&LASERS^1, HUH?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2577", "\\E3JUST KEEP IN&MIND WHAT THE&COLORS MEAN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2578", "\\E0BLUE MEANS&JUMP.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2579", "\\E3AND ORANGE MEANS&YOU'LL..^1. SMELL&LIKE ORANGES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2580", "\\E0THAT'S WHAT I&REMEMBER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2585", "HAVE FUN!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2591", "* What!^1?&* Why'd I call Alphys&  about the weather?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2592", "\\E3* Who CARES!?!^1?&* Isn't it natural&  to love meteorology!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2594", "ZOINKS!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2595", "\\E3I THOUGHT THAT WAS&JUST AN EXCUSE&TO TALK TO HER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2596", "I DIDN'T KNOW&THERE WAS WEATHER&DOWN HERE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2598", "\\E1* YEAH!?!^1!&* THERE IS?!!?!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2599", "\\E2* And I'm forecasting&  an incoming front&  of SHUT UP!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2601", "WOWIE!!^1!&WILL I NEED&AN UMBRELLA?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2607", "* What!^1?&* What ABOUT this&  room!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2614", "* Oh^1, Papyrus^1.&* I can't stay mad&  at you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2616", "IT'S OKAY^1, I&FORGIVE YOU!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2617", "\\E3(PSST^1, WHEN WAS&SHE MAD AT ME?)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2637", "IT'S IMPORTANT TO&STAY IN SCHOOL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2638", "\\E3A REAL TEACHER.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2639", "\\E0WOULD NEVER ACCEPT&DEADLY LASERS AS&AN EXCUSE!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2645", "GLAD!&I DON'T&LIVE IN HOTLAND!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2651", "* Huh^1?&* Those kids are&  skipping school?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2652", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2653", "\\E6* ... well^1, I can't&  blame them^1, school&  sucks!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2654", "\\E4* We need to find&  some way to make&  it cooler.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2655", "\\E2* Hey^1, what if I&  visited their&  school!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2656", "\\E6* Then I could beat&  up ALL the teachers!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2661", "* Okay^1, maybe I&  wouldn't beat up&  a teacher.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2671", "OH NO^1!&THE PUZZLES&REACTIVATING.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2672", "\\E3CAUSED THOSE&PEOPLE TO MISS&THEIR WORK!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2674", "* yep./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2675", "\\E1* that's why i'm&  missing work^1, too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2677", "OH MY GOD!!^1!&SANS^1, GO DO YOUR&JOB(S)!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2682", "GLAD^1,&I DON'T&LIVE IN HOTLAND./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2684", "* me too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2686", "THEN WHY ARE&YOU SKIPPING&WORK!?!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2697", "I HEARD YOU GOT&TO MEET METTATON!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2698", "\\E0IS THAT TRUE!^1?&CAN YOU GET ME&AN AUTOGRAPH!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2699", "\\E2HE'S MY FAVORITE&SEXY RECTANGLE!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2704", "I WISH I LIVED&IN HOTLAND!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2710", "I HEARD YOU GOT&TO MEET METTATON!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2712", "* Really^1? Careful^1, that&  dude gives me bad&  vibes./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2714", "WH-WHAT^1?&BUT HE'S SO&POPULAR.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2716", "* I don't care about&  people just because&  they're popular./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2718", "WELL^1, YOU CAN&SAY THAT BECAUSE&YOU'RE POPULAR./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2720", "* Pssshhht^1, what!^1?&* Popular with WHO?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2722", "YOU'RE POPULAR&WITH ME!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2724", "* Awww..^1.&* Papyrus^1, you're popular&  with me^1, too./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2726", "AWW^1, WOWIE!^1!&WAIT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2727", "\\E3DOES THAT MEAN&YOU DON'T CARE&ABOUT ME...?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2732", "* Let's not discuss&  this anymore./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2742", "WHAT^1? MY BROTHER'S&ACTUALLY AT HIS&STATION?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2743", "\\E1BUT SOMEHOW^1, HE'S&SELLING HOTDOGS&INSTEAD?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2744", "\\E3SLACKING OFF BY&DOING WORK.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2745", "TRULY MY BROTHER&IS A MASTER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2750", "NO FURTHER&COMMENT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2756", "WHAT^1? MY BROTHER'S&ACTUALLY AT HIS&STATION?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2758", "* What^1?&* I thought he only&  had three stations./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2760", "NO^1, HE HAS..^1.&AT LEAST FOUR?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2762", "* Who the heck keeps&  hiring this guy!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2767", "* Seriously!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2774", "MY BROTHER ISN'T&EVEN THERE???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2775", "\\E1WASN'T HE SLACKING&OFF BY SELLING&HOTDOGS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2776", "\\E3NOW HE'S SLACKING&OFF FROM SLACKING&OFF.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2777", "TRULY MY BROTHER&IS A MASTER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2782", "NO FURTHER&COMMENT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2796", "WHAT^1? YOU HAVE TO&SOLVE A PUZZLE&ON THE CONVEYORS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2797", "\\E3THAT GOES AGAINST&PUZZLE DESIGN&101.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2798", "\\E4CONVEYORS ARE&AWFUL AND SHOULD&NEVER BE USED!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2803", "GLAD I DON'T&LIVE ON CONVEYOR&PLANET!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2809", "WHAT^1? YOU HAVE TO&SOLVE A PUZZLE&ON THE CONVEYORS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2811", "* Oh MAN^1, did I ever&  tell you MY conveyor&  puzzle idea?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2813", "WHAT... IS IT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2815", "* Imagine four basketball&  hoops on the sides&  of a conveyor loop./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2816", "\\E2* The conveyor keeps&  speeding up^1, until&  you get sick.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2817", "\\E6* Then you have to&  puke in all four&  hoops in a row!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2819", "I HATE THIS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2821", "* You have to time&  the pukes!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2826", "* Oh man!!^1!&* You wanna hear more&  of my great idea!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2828", "I'M GONNA HANG&UP NOW!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2836", "SO THE ARROWS&FLIP WHEN YOU&DO WHAT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2837", "I CAN'T VISUALIZE&THIS PUZZLE AT&ALL./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2838", "\\E0CAN YOU DRAW&A PICTURE???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2839", "\\E3THEN HOLD IT UP&TO THE RECEIVER??/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2844", "DID YOU DRAW IT&YET?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2850", "WHAT^1? HOW'S THIS&PUZZLE WORK^1?&UMMM.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2851", "\\E0WHOOPS^1, I THINK&IT'S UNDYNE'S TURN&TO TALK!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2853", "\\E1* What!^1?&* No^1, I HATE puzzles^1!&* Papyrus^1, YOU do it!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2855", "WELL^1, ALPHYS MADE&THE PUZZLE^1,&RIGHT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2856", "\\E0YOU SHOULD JUST&CALL HER UP.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2857", "\\E2AND SAY IN A&HOT VOICE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2858", "ALPHYS..^1.&I NEED HELP WITH&A.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2859", "(AUDIBLE WINK)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2860", "\\E2PUZZLE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2862", "* Oh my GOD^1!&* NO^1!&* Shut up!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2864", "FINE!!^1!&GIVE ME HER&NUMBER!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2865", "\\E0I'LL DO THE HOT&VOICE!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2867", "* NO!!!^1!&* THAT'S EVEN WORSE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2872", "(AUDIBLE WINK).../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2873", "\\E3WAIT^1, WHOSE NUMBER&IS THIS???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2883", "THE ROYAL GUARD&PATROLS THAT&AREA./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2884", "YES^1, LIKE SNOWDIN^1,&HOTLAND HAS ROYAL&GUARD MEMBERS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2885", "WATERFALL DOESN'T&NEED THEM BECAUSE&IT'S GOT UNDYNE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2890", "DID YOU SEE&THEM?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2896", "* Careful^1, the Royal&  Guard patrols that&  area./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2897", "\\E4* I think it's RG01&  and RG02 today.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2898", "\\E0* It's funny^1, the bunny&  actually requested to be&  with the dragon guy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2899", "* It's nice when people&  are platonic friends&  like that!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2904", "* It's nice when people&  are platonic friends&  like that!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2912", "I LOVE THE NEWS^1!&IT'S SO&INFORMATIVE.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2913", "AND FULL OF CUT-&THROAT^1, EXPLOSIVE&ACTION!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2918", "KA-WOWIE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2924", "* Yeah^1! You totally&  kicked his butt&  on the news!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2925", "\\E9* And I bet Alphys&  was helping you^1,&  wasn't she?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2926", "\\E6* Oh my god!!^1!&* You guys becoming&  friends.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2927", "\\E8* It's kinda cute.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2928", "\\E1* ... I mean^1, uh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2929", "\\E2* I'm tough!!^1!&* I love to eat rocks!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2934", "* What!?!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2940", "* (There's some strange&  interference...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2948", "THE CORE..^1.&YOU'RE GETTING&CLOSE^1, HUH...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2949", "\\E6.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2954", ".../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2960", "THE CORE..^1.&YOU'RE GETTING&CLOSE^1, HUH...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2962", "* What!^1?&* No^1, we just&  became friends!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2963", "\\E4* You can't already&  be that close.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2968", "* What?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2980", "IT MIGHT SOUND&WEIRD THAT SPIDERS&NEED DONATIONS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2981", "\\E0BUT THINK ABOUT&IT^1, THEY HAVE&EIGHT FEET./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2982", "\\E3THAT'S FOUR PAIRS&OF SHOES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2983", "\\E0A SPIDER WEARING&FOUR PAIRS OF&PINK BOOTIES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2984", "MEDITATE ON&THIS IMAGE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2989", "OM.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2997", "THE ENTIRE ROOM&IS COVERED IN&STEAM THINGIES?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2998", "\\E1OH MY GOD^1, CAN'T&YOU JUST TAKE&A BUS!?!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_2999", "\\E3HOTLAND STINKS.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3004", "DON'T TELL ME&MORE OF THIS&GARBAGE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3010", "A WHOLE ROOM&COVERED IN VENTS^1?&OH NO.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3012", "* Hey^1, did I ever&  tell you about my&  puzzle idea?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3013", "* It's a maze full&  of steam vents.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3014", "\\E2* But the steam vents&  are on conveyor&  belts^1, and.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3016", "OH MY GOD!!^1!&I HATE THIS!?!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3021", "ITS BEST IF YOU&DON'T ENCOURAGE&HER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3030", "LASERS ON&CONVEYORS^1?&NO THANKS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3031", "SOUNDS LIKE MY&LEAST FAVORITE&NIGHTMARE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3036", "DON'T TELL ME&MORE OF THIS&GARBAGE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3042", "LASERS ON&CONVEYORS^1? ARE&YOU SERIOUS???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3044", "* Hey^1, this reminds&  me of a puzzle&  idea./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3046", "OH MY GOD??^1?&NO??^1?&WHY????/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3047", "I THOUGHT YOU&HATED MAKING&UP PUZZLES!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3049", "* Yeah^1, but I love&  driving you crazy!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3054", "PLEASE STOP&ENCOURAGING&HER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3063", "WHERE DID THAT&TABLE COME FROM?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3064", "\\E0DOES IT BELONG&TO THE MOUSE??/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3069", "EH???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3075", "* Where are all these&  tables coming from?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3077", "MAYBE THEY BELONG&TO THE MOUSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3079", "* What would a mouse&  need a table for?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3081", "TO PUT THE&CHEESE ON./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3083", "* But where's the&  cheese come from!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3085", "* doesn't it come&  from milk?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3087", "OH MY GOD!!^1!&GET OUT OF&HERE!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3092", "WAIT^1, DOES IT&COME FROM MILK??/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3102", "WOW!!^1!&THAT CHOREOGRAPHY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3103", "\\E2I CAN'T BELIEVE&I'M FRIENDS.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3104", "\\E0WITH A BONE-A-&FIDE OPERA&STAR!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3109", "WOWIE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3115", "I CAN'T BELIEVE&YOU GOT TO DANCE&WITH METTATON!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3117", "* Big deal.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3118", "\\E2* Earlier^1, the human&  and I danced with&  DEATH!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3120", "WOW!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3121", "IS DEATH COOL?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3123", "* Yeah^1, she's like&  super hot./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3128", "I WANT TO MEET&DEATH.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3135", "* (There's some strange&  interference...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3144", "WHAT?&I^1? SCREAM?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3145", "\\E0SURE^1!&I'LL TRY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3146", "A^1. A^1. A^1. A^1. A./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3147", "I'M SCREAMING VERY&SLOWLY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3152", "A./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3160", "* WHAT!^1?&* RG01 and RG02 are&  slacking off?!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3161", "\\E2* Come ON^1!&* They should be KILLING&  you right now!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3162", "\\E9* Not that I want&  them to^1, I mean./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3163", "\\E6* But they could at&  least TRY^1, y'know!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3169", "* Oh yeah^1, that&  reminds me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3170", "* I told RG01 and RG02&  that if they managed&  to nab you.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3171", "\\E9* I'd take them both&  out for ice cream./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3172", "\\E0* I hope you were able&  to avoid them./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3173", "\\E6* Cause I HATE ice&  cream!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3179", "I ALMOST CAPTURED&YOU.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3180", "WHERE'S MY ICE&CREAM./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3187", "A HOT-L.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3188", "\\E0THAT'S SHORT FOR&HOTLAND^1, RIGHT?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3194", "WOWIE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3200", "* A hotel?^1? Cool!^1!&* I've never stayed&  at a fancy hotel!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3202", "REALLY?^1?&ME NEITHER./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3204", "* Papyrus^1, we should&  go on vacation&  sometime!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3206", "YEAH!^1!&LET'S VACATION TO&A HOTEL!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3211", "* Well^1, maybe we would&  go someplace besides&  the hotel^1, too.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3213", "OH^1, I WAS BEING&SARCASTIC./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3214", "\\E0I WOULD NEVER&TAKE A VACATION&FOR ANY REASON./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3224", "A FANCY&SCHMANCY&RESTAURANT!?!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3225", "\\E2AFTER TASTING MY&COOKING^1, THAT SEEMS&POINTLESS^1, RIGHT?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3231", "I BET THEY CAN'T&EVEN MAKE&SPAGHETTI!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3237", "* Woah!^1!&* A fancy restaurant!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3238", "\\E6* Are you treating us^1?&* Do they have steak?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3240", "PSHHHHHHT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3241", "\\E0WHO NEEDS THAT!&YOUR FRIENDS ARE&GREAT CHEFS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3243", "* Well^1, maybe our cooking&  abilities aren't&  exactly perfect./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3244", "\\E6* Nah!!^1!&* They totally are!^1!&* Eat up^1, punk!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3245", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3246", "* (You hear spaghetti thwap&  against the receiver.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3251", "ISN'T FRIENDSHIP&DELICIOUS?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3261", "CAREFUL^1.&LOTS OF HOTELS ARE&INFESTED NOWADAYS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3262", "THEY CAN SLIDE&UNDER CLOSED DOOR&HOLES 1 INCH HIGH./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3263", "WHAT DO I MEAN^1?&YOU'LL KNOW IT&IF YOU SEE IT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3264", "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3265", "* (You hear a muffled bark&  behind one of the doors.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3270", "WHAT WAS THAT???/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3276", "CAREFUL^1. I'VE HEARD&THAT HOTEL HAS A&DOG PROBLEM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3278", "* Oh^1?&* No pets allowed^1, huh?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3280", "I'M NOT TALKING&ABOUT PETS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3282", "* What's the problem?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3284", "THE PROBLEM IS..^1.&DOG./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3286", "* What's wrong with&  dogs!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3288", "NOT ALL DOGS^1.&JUST THAT ONE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3290", "* What's WRONG with it!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3292", "EVERYTHING./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3297", "* So you hate this dog^1,&  but like weird&  talking flowers?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3299", "THE FLOWER IS MY&FRIEND!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3301", "* I mean^1, if having&  an imaginary friend&  makes you happy.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3303", "OH MY GOD!^1!&HE'S NOT IMAGINARY^1!&HE HAS A NAME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3305", "* What's his name./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3307", "FL.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3308", "\\E3FLOWERY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3310", "* Oh my GOD!!^1!&* You just made that&  up!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3312", "OK^1, I DID!^1!&BUT HE'S REAL!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3320", "YOU HAVE YOUR OWN&HOTEL ROOM!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3321", "\\E3... WHY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3322", "\\E0MY GARAGE IS&ALWAYS OPEN TO&YOU!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3327", "THE PRICE IS&RIGHT!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3333", "YOU HAVE YOUR OWN&HOTEL ROOM!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3335", "* Heyyy!^1!&* Let's throw a room&  party!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3336", "\\E9* We can order a pizza&  and stay up all night&  playing games!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3338", "PARTY \"GAMES\"^1?&LIKE THE SIX-&LEGGED RACE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3340", "* Nah^1, like \"pillow&  fight the skeleton!\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3342", "H-HEY!!^1!&NO PILLOWS FROM&THE COUCH!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3344", "* Aww^1, okay./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3346", "HEY!!^1!&NO ENTIRE COUCH!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3348", "* Too late!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3353", "HEY^1, YOU DIDN'T&HIT ME WITH MY&ENTIRE COUCH./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3355", "* Nah^1, why would I&  do that?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3356", "\\E6* I'm saving it for&  the party!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3364", "THE ELEVATOR&SAYS L1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3365", "\\E3BUT WHAT DOES THE&L STAND FOR^1?&LINGUINE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3366", "\\E0LINGUINE^1.&THE FLAT PASTA./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3367", "IT CAN ALSO BE&USED TO TIE UP&PRESENTS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3372", "THE FLATNESS&MAKES A NICE&RIBBON./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3378", "\\E0THE ELEVATOR&SAYS L1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3379", "\\E3BUT WHAT DOES THE&L STAND FOR?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3381", "\\E0* C'mon^1, Papyrus^1.&* Think about it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3383", "\\E3HMMM.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3385", "\\E6* It stands for&  L-evator^1, duh!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3390", "IS ELEVATOR&REALLY SPELLED&THAT WAY?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3392", "* Probably?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3401", "THE ELEVATOR&SAYS R1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3402", "\\E3BUT WHAT DOES THE&R STAND FOR^1?&RAVIOLI?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3403", "\\E0RAVIOLI..^1.&THE DUMPLING-TYPE&PASTA./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3404", "THE TREASURE CHEST&OF THE CULINARY&WORLD./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3409", "YOU CAN PUT GEMS&OR GOLD INSIDE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3415", "\\E0THE ELEVATOR&SAYS R1./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3416", "\\E3BUT WHAT DOES THE&R STAND FOR?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3418", "\\E0* C'mon^1, Papyrus^1.&* Think about it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3420", "\\E3HMMM.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3422", "\\E6* It stands for RED^1,&  'cause that's the&  color of the lights!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3427", "I GUESS THAT&MAKES SENSE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3434", "* (The phone won't turn on.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3441", "THE ELEVATOR&SAYS R2./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3442", "\\E3BUT WHAT DOES THE&R STAND FOR^1?&RIGATONI?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3443", "\\E0THE TUBE-SHAPED&PASTA./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3444", "IN A PINCH^1, IT&CAN BE USED AS&A STRAW./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3449", "IF YOU NEED TO&DRINK A CUP OF&SAUCE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3455", "\\E3WAIT^1, UNDYNE^1.&IF THE R STANDS&FOR RED.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3456", "\\E5WHAT COLOR DOES&THE L STAND FOR?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3458", "* Uhhhh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3459", "\\E9* Light green./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3461", "OH^1! OF COURSE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3462", "WAIT^1.&ISN'T THAT TWO&WORDS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3464", "* light sea green./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3466", "THREE DOESN'T&FIX THE ISSUE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3471", "* light sea foam&  green./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3473", "AREN'T YOU WORKING&IN THE VERY NEXT&ROOM!?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3482", "THE ELEVATOR&SAYS L2./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3483", "\\E3BUT WHAT DOES THE&L STAND FOR^1?&LASAGNA?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3484", "\\E3I HOPE NOT^1.&I DON'T MAKE&LASAGNA ANYMORE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3485", "\\E1THAT GLUTTONOUS&DOG ALWAYS EATS&IT FIRST!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3486", "\\E3FIRST MY BONES^1,&AND NOW THIS.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3491", "THEN IT RETREATS&INTO A SHALLOW&BLUE BOX./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3492", "COVERS ITSELF&WITH A BLANKET^1,&AND SLEEPS.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3499", "\\E2* OK^1, OK^1.&* I've got it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3500", "\\E9* The L stands for&  the color \"Lime.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3502", "\\E0REALLY!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3503", "\\E3I HATE LIMES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3505", "\\E1* What!^1? Limes rule!^1!&* I eat them whole&  all the time!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3507", "\\E3WELL^1, ONE TIME I&WAS GIVING MYSELF&THE SPA TREATMENT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3508", "\\E0I PUT THE LIME&SLICES IN MY&EYES^1, LIKE ON TV./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3509", "\\E1BUT IT STINGS!^1!&HOW DO THEY DO&IT!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3511", "\\E6* Oh my god^1!&* Those aren't LIMES^1!&* Those are CUCUMBERS!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3516", "\\E3I THOUGHT IT WAS&SUPPOSED TO BE&REJUVENATING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3517", "\\E1BUT IT WASN'T&WORKING!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3518", "\\E5SO I JUST STUCK&MORE LIMES INTO&MY EYES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3520", "\\E1* Gross!^1!&* Why did you even&  do that!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3522", "\\E2I JUST WANT TO&HAVE HANDSOME^1,&BISHONEN EYES./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3523", "LIKE METTATON..^1.&SIGH.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3525", "* (He doesn't even&  HAVE eyes!!!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3533", "* (The phone won't turn on.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3540", "THE ELEVATOR&SAYS L3./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3541", "\\E3BUT WHAT DOES THE&L STAND FOR^1?&LUMACONI?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3542", "\\E0THAT'S THE SNAIL-&SHAPED PASTA!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3543", "\\E3SANS BOUGHT SOME&RECENTLY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3544", "\\E2HE'LL PROBABLY&FILL THEM WITH&HOTDOGS AND SLIME./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3549", "HEY!^1!&MAYBE HE'LL SHARE&SOME WITH YOU!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3555", "\\E0MAYBE WE NEED TO&THINK MORE&ABSTRACTLY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3556", "\\E3MAYBE THE L&STANDS FOR.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3557", "\\E2LOVE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3559", "\\E2* But isn't love&  supposed to be&  FIERY RED!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3560", "\\E9* Like a cartoony&  human-heart?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3562", "\\E3BUT UNDYNE^1, DON'T&YOU TURN PEOPLE'S&HEARTS GREEN?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3564", "\\E9* You make it sound&  like I give people&  nausea./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3566", "\\E0WELL^1, IT WOULD BE&AN AFFECTIONATE&NAUSEA./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3568", "\\E6* Okay^1, yeah^1!&That's me!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3573", "IT'S DECIDED!^1!&L STANDS FOR!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3574", "\\E3A HEART THAT&UNDYNE HAS MADE&NAUSEOUS?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3582", "* (The phone won't turn on.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3589", "THE ELEVATOR&SAYS R3./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3590", "\\E3BUT WHAT DOES THE&R STAND FOR^1?&ROTINI?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3591", "THE SCREW-SHAPED&PASTA./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3592", "I USED IT TO HOLD&MY SENTRY STATION&TOGETHER./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3597", "MY WHOLE STATION&IS MADE OUT OF&CARDBOARDHYDRATES!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3603", "\\E3WAIT^1.&WHAT IF R AND L./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3604", "\\E0STAND FOR RIGHT&AND LEFT???/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3606", "\\E9* No WAY!&* That makes NO sense./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3607", "\\E6* Cause if you face&  the opposite way^1,&  they'd be wrong!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3612", "BUT IF YOU FACE&THE OTHER WAY.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3613", "HOW CAN YOU KNOW&THEY ARE REALLY&STILL WRONG?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3615", "* Let's not get&  philosophical&  over the alphabet./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3625", "\\E9PAPYRUS^1?&WHO IS THAT?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3626", "THIS IS..^1.&COOLSKELETON95./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3627", "SORRY^1. CAN'T TALK^1.&I'M BUSY BEING&POPULAR ON-LINE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3628", "\\E0NYEH HEH HEH^1!&ONLY KIDDING^1!&YOU HAVE BEEN HAD!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3629", "IT WAS PAPYRUS&PLAYING A SIMPLE&GENTLEMAN'S RUSE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3634", "WINK!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3635", "YOU CAN SEE&ME WINKING^1,&RIGHT./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3641", "\\E9* Papyrus..^1.&* Why are you&  wearing those?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3643", "\\E9PAPYRUS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3644", "EXCUSE ME^1?&I AM THE VERY&COOL ONLINE GUY,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3645", "COOLSKELETON95./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3647", "* What^1?&* No^1!&* You're Papyrus!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3649", "(UNDYNE!!!^1)&(SHHH!!!)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3650", "(YOU'RE GOING TO&REVEAL MY SECRET&ONLINE PERSONA!)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3655", "* FINE then^1!&* I'm not Undyne!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3656", "\\E2* The name's...&* StrongFish91!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3658", "WHAT!^1?&REALLY!^1?&OH NO!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3659", "STRONGFISH!^1!&PLEASE BRING BACK&MY FRIEND UNDYNE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3661", "* Uh^1, OK./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3671", "AN APRON LYING&IN HOTLAND^1?&THAT MAKES SENSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3672", "COOKING IS&DEFINITELY&FIRE-ELEMENTAL./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3677", "UNLESS YOU COOK&A POPSICLE./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3683", "AN APRON LYING&IN HOTLAND^1?&THAT MAKES SENSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3685", "\\E3* Yeah^1, cooking is&  definitely fire-&  elemental!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3687", "\\E3UNLESS YOU COOK&A POPSICLE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3689", "\\E9* Would you really&  call it \"cooking\"&  a popsicle...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3691", "\\E5THAT'S WHAT YOU&CALLED IT LAST&TIME WE^1, UH.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3693", "* Oh MAN^1, I almost&  forgot about that^1!&* What a mess!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3700", "* It took forever to&  hose everything off./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3710", "\\E0WOW^1! I SAW IT^1!&THE MULTICOLOR&TILE PUZZLE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3713", "\\E2YOU DID IT!^1!&MY DIRECTIONS&HELPED YOU!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3714", "I'M A GOOD&EXPLAINER!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3715", "NYEH HEH HEH!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3719", "\\E3SEEMS LIKE YOU&WEREN'T ABLE TO&COMPLETE IT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3720", "\\E0YOU'VE GOT TO&BE PREPARED NEXT&TIME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3721", "I'LL HAVE TO&EXPLAIN IT ALL&AGAIN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3722", "YOU SEE^1, RED&TILES ARE&IMPASSIBLE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3723", "PINK TILES&DON'T DO&ANYTHING./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3724", "GREEN TILES&ARE.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3730", "PLAID TILES&ARE.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3731", "NYEH HEH HEH!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3738", "\\E3HEADING INTO&THE CORE...^1?&HMMM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3739", "YOU MIGHT NOT&BE ABLE TO&CALL PAST THERE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3740", "\\E1I KNOW^1!&IT SOUNDS AWFUL!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3741", "\\E3HOW WILL YOU&GET BY WITHOUT&ME?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3742", "\\E0WELL^1, I HAVE&CONFIDENCE YOU&WILL FIND A WAY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3743", "I WILL TALK TO&YOU AGAIN^1, SO&DO NOT WORRY!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3744", "GOOD LUCK OUT&THERE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3749", "QUIT IT^1!&YOU DON'T HAVE&TO SAY GOODBYE!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3755", "\\E3HEADING INTO&THE CORE...^1?&HMMM./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3757", "\\E4* The CORE is a huge&  tower of electric&  energy./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3758", "* So I don't think&  your phone will&  work through it.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3760", "\\E1OH NO!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3761", "\\E3WHAT WILL YOU DO&WITHOUT US...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3763", "* You have something&  you have to do^1,&  right...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3764", "* Well.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3765", "\\E9* Even without words^1,&  we'll be with you&  in spirit^1, OK!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3767", "\\E0YEAH^1! YOU CAN'T&GET RID OF US!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3769", "\\E9* We're counting on&  you^1, so don't mess&  it up!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3775", "* We're not going to&  say goodbye to you&  just yet!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3785", "\\E0A POSTER FOR&METTATON'S SHOW?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3786", "THAT'S NEATO^1.&I WANT A POSTER&FOR MY PUZZLES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3787", "\\E3AND MAYBE A FEW&OPENING BANDS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3792", "THEY COULD PLAY&MY THEME SONG!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3793", "\\E3I JUST NEED TO&GET A THEME SONG./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3799", "\\E0A POSTER FOR&METTATON'S SHOW?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3800", "THAT'S NEATO^1.&I WANT A POSTER&FOR MY PUZZLES!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3802", "\\E1* Oh^1! And I want a&  poster for all of&  my big fights!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3804", "A REAL EVENT^1!&WE COULD HAVE A&LIVE BAND!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3806", "* And a barbeque!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3808", "AND FIREWORKS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3810", "* And a second&  barbeque!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3812", "WON'T YOU JUST&EAT BBQ INSTEAD&OF FIGHTING?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3814", "\\E6* Let's do it!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3820", "\\E2* We could use the&  spears as kabob&  skewers!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3822", "AND BONES AS&KABONE SKEWERS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3824", "* What's a kabone?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3826", "LIKE A KABOB BUT&WITH ONLY BONES./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3836", "\\E0DO SPIDERS HAVE&WEBBED FEET?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3837", "\\E3WAIT^1.&SPIDERS DON'T HAVE&FEET./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3838", "\\E0DO SPIDERS HAVE&WEBBED FINGERS?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3844", "JUST CURIOUS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3850", "\\E0HEY^1, UNDYNE^1.&DO SPIDERS HAVE&WEBBED FEET?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3852", "\\E9* No^1, ducks have&  webbed feet./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3854", "DUCKS CAN SPIN&WEBS!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3856", "* Yeah^1, haven't you&  seen a duck wrap&  up a loaf of bread?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3857", "\\E3* Then suck all of&  its guts out with&  its fangs?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3859", "BREAD HAS GUTS?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3861", "* Yeah^1. They just take&  'em all out before&  they sell it./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3863", "\\E0WOW!^1!&YOU'RE REALLY&SMART^1, UNDYNE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3865", "* (I thought he knew&  I was joking...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3872", "\\E9* Papyrus^1, wait^1, you&  know I'm joking^1,&  right...?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3874", "OF COURSE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3875", "\\E2EVERYONE KNOWS&SPIDERS HAVE&WEBBED FEET./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3880", "* (The signal is clogged with&  cobwebs...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3887", "I'VE HEARD THERE&ARE TWO GROUPS&OF SPIDERS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3888", "ONE IN HOTLAND^1,&AND ONE IN THE&RUINS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3889", "\\E3SINCE THE SPIDERS&CAN'T CROSS THE&COLD OF SNOWDIN./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3890", "THEY NEED SOME&KIND OF TRANSPORT./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3891", "\\E0LIKE A TANDEM&MOTORCYCLE WITH&EIGHT WHEELS./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3897", "OR A UNICYCLE&WITH EIGHT&WHEELS!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3903", "I WONDER IF ANY&OF MY ONLINE&FANS ARE SPIDERS./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3905", "* Do spiders even&  use the internet?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3907", "* are you kidding^1?&* spiders love to surf&  the web./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3909", "SANS!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3910", "\\E0YOU'RE RIGHT&ABOUT SOMETHING./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3918", "\\E3FANGS FOR VISITING&MY WEB-SITE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3919", "\\E0THAT'S WHAT SPIDERS&LIKE TO POST./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3924", "* (The signal is clogged with&  cobwebs...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3931", "HMMM..^1.&A MYSTERIOUS&SCIENCE HOUSE./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3933", "* the sign outside&  says \"lab.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3935", "LAB?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3937", "* like..^1. laboratory./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3939", "LABRADOR..^1. Y?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3940", "DOES THAT MEAN&THERE ARE DOGS&INSIDE?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3942", "* i mean./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3943", "\\E2* i wouldn't rule it&  out./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3948", "STRANGE DOG'S&HOUSE.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3956", "* That's Alphys's house./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3957", "\\E9* Hey^1, why don't we&  all go over and&  watch anime?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3959", "ANIME?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3960", "ISN'T THAT A KIND&OF CARTOON FOR&SMALL CHILDREN?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3962", "* Oh my GOD!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3963", "\\E6* Anime isn't just for&  kids^1! It's deep^1!&* It's EMOTIONAL!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3965", "IS (THE SOUND A&BABY MAKES) AN&EMOTION?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3967", "* YEah CAUSE It'S HoW&  I'M FEElinG RIGHT&  NOW!!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3972", "WAIT.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3973", "\\E5UNDYNE^1, DO YOU&LIKE ANIME?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3975", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3977", "UH OH!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3978", "\\E3I MEAN^1, I'VE&NEVER SEEN ANY./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3979", "\\E0MAYBE I ACTUALLY&DO LIKE ANIME!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3981", "* You don't have to&  say that^1, Papyrus./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3983", "MAYBE I'M A BABY&WHO LOVES CARTOONS&FOR CHILDREN!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3985", "* YOU DON'T HAVE TO&  SAY THAT^1, PAPYRUS!!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3993", "* What!^1?&* Royal Guards are&  blocking the way!?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3994", "\\E2* Then I'll tell them&  to...!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3995", "\\E4* Well^1, nothing^1, I&  guess./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3996", "\\E2* I already told them&  to seek out and&  destroy you!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3997", "\\E1* And I can't just&  tell them I've&  changed my mind./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3998", "\\E2* You see^1, Alphys&  showed me these&  animations about.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_3999", "\\E1* Uhhh^1, humans?&* So I can learn&  their weaknesses?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4000", "\\E2* And one of them&  is about this human&  that^1, uh.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4001", "\\E6* Well^1, suffice to say^1,&  they can control&  people's minds!!!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4002", "\\E3* Surprised^1?&* I know your kind's&  hidden power!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4003", "\\E1* Anyway^1, I told my&  crew that if I ever&  defended a human.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4004", "\\E2* I must be under&  some kind of mind&  control!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4005", "\\E6* And to disregard&  EVERYTHING that I&  tell them!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4006", "\\E7* So^1, sorry..^1.&* But my hands are&  tied./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4007", "\\E9* By the way^1, that&  animation is&  really good!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4013", "\\E6* I'm not going to&  tell them to let&  you by!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4019", "* (No response.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4026", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4033", "* Ring..^1. Ring.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4034", "* (There's no response...)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_papcall_4040", "I DON'T HAVE&ANYTHING ELSE TO&SAY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_7", "* (Noticed you received a&  text from Toriel.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_8", "* Dear Frisk,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_9", "* Sans and Alphys are teaching&  me how to text^1.&* I am learning so much./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_10", "* For example:&* Do you know what a&  \"smiley\" is?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_11", "* Please look at this:/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_12", "  ]: )/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_13", "* Now turn your head to the&  left./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_14", "* It is a picture of me&  smiling at you^1!&* Can you see it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_15", "* L-O-L^1!&* (That stands for Lots of&  Laughter.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_16", "* Sincerely^1, Toriel/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_17", "* (That's all for now.^1)&* (Maybe in the next room^1, you&  will receive another.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_22", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)&* Dear Frisk,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_23", "* How are you^1? You have been&  wandering around for&  quite some time now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_24", "* I hope you are not getting&  into trouble./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_25", "* Only kidding^1.&* L-O-L!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_26", "* Sincerly^1, Toriel/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_27", "* PS - Do not get into trouble./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_32", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)&* Excuse me,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_33", "* I did not mean to write&  \"sincerly.\"&* I meant to say \"sincerely.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_34", "* It is difficult to use this&  with large hands./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_35", "* Perhaps I should ask Sans&  to transcribe for me./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_40", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.^1)&* Sans will be typing from&  now on./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_45", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_46", "* hey frisk^1.&* it's torrrrrieellll/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_47", "* i just baked 1000000 pies.&* do you want any?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_48", "* make sure to brush your&  teeth before crossing&  the street^1, frisk/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_53", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_54", "* I did not say any of that./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_59", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_60", "* Greetings^1.&* This is Sans^1.&* I love my brother very much./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_61", "* help im being slandered/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_66", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_67", "* This is Sans^1.&* Frisk^1, did you know that I&  love to \"get owned?\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_68", "* I also think Toriel is very&  good and fhfjkehfeaufsisf/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_69", "* Excuse me/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_70", "* ./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_75", "* (TORIEL sent you a message&  titled \"Cat Video.\")/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_76", "* (Inside^1, she meticulously&  describes a video she saw&  of a small^1, white animal.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_77", "* (There is no link or&  attachment to watch it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_82", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_83", "* Fwd: send this 2 some1 u&  care about... or a skeleton&  will rattle his bones at u/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_88", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)&* Dear Frisk,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_89", "* Thought you might enjoy this^1.&* ]: )/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_90", "* (It's ASCII art of a snail.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_95", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)&* Dear Frisk,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_96", "* Undyne and Papyrus want to&  cook something together&  with me./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_97", "* Sans is telling me that they&  are excellent chefs./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_98", "* I am excited. ]: )&* Maybe if you are lucky^1, you&  can have some!/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_103", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)&* Dear Frisk,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_104", "* If Sans and I started a&  band^1, do you know what&  we could call it?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_105", "* \"Dreemurr\" and \"Femur.^1\"&* L-O-L!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_106", "* PS - That is only a joke^1.&* Do not refer to me as&  Dreemurr./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_111", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)&* Dear Frisk,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_112", "* Undyne is very strong./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_113", "* Papyrus made a bet with her&  that she could not lift&  everyone here up./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_114", "* She could./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_115", "* The only trouble is that&  she did not know how to&  put everyone down./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_120", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)&* Dear Frisk,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_121", "* Alphys is telling me many&  interesting facts about&  the human world./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_122", "* Quite a few of them are&  wrong^1, though./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_123", "* Frisk^1, you did not tell&  her anything funny^1, did you^1?&* ]: )/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_128", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)&* Dear Frisk,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_129", "* I heard that using the&  computer for too long&  is bad for you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_130", "* However^1, I have not seen&  you use the computer at all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_129_console", "* I heard that playing&  video games for too long&  is bad for you./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_130_console", "* However^1, I have not seen&  you playing video games&  at all./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_131", "* You must be very healthy^1!&* How nice./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_136", "* (TORIEL sent you a message.)&* Dear Frisk,/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_137", "* I think I may have to turn&  off the phone for now./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_138", "* Your friends are all very&  lovely people!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_139", "* I think I will spend this&  time getting to know&  them better./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_140", "* Be good^1, alright?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_141", "* Sincerely^1, Toriel./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_144", "* (Toriel has not sent any&  more messages.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "scr_torcall_146", "* (Toriel has not sent any&  more messages.)/%%");
