  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_basicmonster_act", "* Monster does an action.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_basicmonster_info", "* Smells like a monster.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_basicmonster_mercy", "* Monster seems satisfied.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_basicmonster_lowhp", "* Monster has low HP.");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_basicmonster_check", "* MONSTER - ATK \\[1] DEF \\[2]&* Mistakenly believes its lava&  is a monster./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_basicmonster_playeract", "* You execute some action./^");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_napstablook_189", "* YOU WON!&* You lost 1 experience point./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "obj_torielboss_240", "* YOU WON!&* You lost 1 experience point./%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2510", "* You..^1.&* You came from outside^1,&  didn't you?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2511", "* People like you are so&  rare.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2512", "* Please^1!* Stranger!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2513", "* Tell me about outside...?& &         Yes         No\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2514", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2535", "* Huh^1?&* \"SURFACE\"^1?&* What do you mean?/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2536", "* I just meant outside this&  room./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2537", "* If you haven't noticed^1, my&  mycelium have bound me&  to the ground./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2538", "* Please^1!&* Stranger!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2539", "* I'll make this simple./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2540", "* I've spent my whole life&  in the same spot^1,&  in the same room./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2541", "* But I've long wondered&  what lies inside the&  room to the right./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2542", "* Long I've fantasized&  about entering^1, and&  changing my scenery.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2543", "* No..^1.&* Changing my LIFE!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2544", "* Please^1.&* Go and tell me what's&  inside./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2553", "* Is everyone out there&  like you^1?&* How terrible./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2518", "* Well^1, what are you&  waiting for?/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2522", "* Oh^1!&* You're back!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2523", "* How's the room?& &         Different   Same\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2524", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2561", "* Oh^1, that's a relief^1!/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2562", "* That's all I need to&  continue my fantasies^1.&* Thank you^1, stranger./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2506", "* My mind is running wild^1!&* I haven't felt like this&  in a long time.../%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2567", "* So it's the same./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2568", "* The same.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2569", "* Same.../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2570", "* .../");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2571", "* OK./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2507", "* Please leave./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2780", "* (It's a horse stable.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2781", "* (Do you want to go&  inside?)&         Yes         No \\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2782", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2788", "* (You jostle the door.)&* (It's locked.)/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_2789", "* (Suddenly^1, from inside&  the [redacted], you hear a&/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3358", "* (It's a book labelled&  Monster History Part 6.)&         Read it     Do not\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3359", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3363", "* Unfortunately^1, monsters are&  not experienced with&  illness./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3364", "* However^1, when monsters are&  about to expire of age^1,&  they lie down^1, immobile./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3365", "* We call this state&  \"Fallen Down.\"/");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3366", "* A person who has Fallen&  Down will soon perish./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3367", "* In a way^1, this confusing&  situation was all too&  familiar./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_3370", "* (You decide not to read it.)/%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4551", "* \\YMETTATON has sent you a&  Mortal Enemy request.\\W /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4552", "* Accept the request?& &         Accept      Reject\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4553", " ");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4559", "* Congratulations^1!&* You are now Mortal Enemies&  with Mettaton./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4560", "* \\YCOOLSKELETON95\\W has posted&  a comment on this change./");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4561", "* CONGRATULATIONS^1, YOU TWO^1!&* WISH YOU A LONG AND&  HORRIBLE RIVALRY./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4565", "* You rejected the request./%%");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4571", "* \\YMETTATON has sent you an&  invitation to \"Die.\"\\W /");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4572", "* RSVP?& &         Respond     Ignore\\C");
  DH(QI.text_data_en, "SCR_TEXT_4573", " ");
